{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25595406",
      "title": "Analyzing a Standard React Project",
      "sourceHash": "46b0bef597f68f662412bfbf5f049dc37044598ad7b09b833de87963b4f2d86e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "Instructor: So let's now have a look",
          "zh": "講師：那麼我們現在來看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 6.133,
          "en": "at this src folder",
          "zh": "這個 src 資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.133,
          "end": 9.066,
          "en": "because that is where we will spend the majority",
          "zh": "因為我們大部分的時間都會花在"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.066,
          "end": 13.4,
          "en": "of our time, that is where we will write our React code.",
          "zh": "這裡，我們就是在這裡寫 React 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 16.5,
          "en": "And the first thing you'll notice here",
          "zh": "而在這裡，你首先會注意到"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.5,
          "end": 18.166,
          "en": "in this starting project,",
          "zh": "在這個起始專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.166,
          "end": 20.666,
          "en": "which I provided in the last lecture",
          "zh": "也就是我在上一堂課提供的專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.666,
          "end": 24.8,
          "en": "that we have two JavaScript and one CSS file.",
          "zh": "裡面有兩個 JavaScript 檔和一個 CSS 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.8,
          "end": 26.866,
          "en": "And the most important takeaway here,",
          "zh": "而這裡最重要的重點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.866,
          "end": 29.633,
          "en": "which I really wanna emphasize right away",
          "zh": "也是我現在就想立刻強調的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.633,
          "end": 34.433,
          "en": "is that React code is just JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "就是 React 程式碼其實就只是 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.433,
          "end": 37.733,
          "en": "We are just going to write some JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "我們就是要寫一些 JavaScript 程式碼而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.733,
          "end": 39.166,
          "en": "Throughout the entire course,",
          "zh": "在整門課程中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.166,
          "end": 41.433,
          "en": "we're going to use React features",
          "zh": "我們都會用到 React 的功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.433,
          "end": 44.766,
          "en": "and some special syntax introduced by React,",
          "zh": "以及一些由 React 引進的特殊語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.766,
          "end": 44.833,
          "en": "and some special syntax introduced by React,",
          "zh": "以及一些由 React 引進的特殊語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.833,
          "end": 49,
          "en": "but ultimately, it'll all be just JavaScript.",
          "zh": "但到頭來，這一切都只是 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49,
          "end": 52.266,
          "en": "Now, let's start with the index.js file.",
          "zh": "現在，我們從 index.js 檔開始看起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.266,
          "end": 54.766,
          "en": "You don't see it anywhere but I can tell you",
          "zh": "你在任何地方都看不到它，但我可以告訴你"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.766,
          "end": 57.766,
          "en": "that this is actually the first code file,",
          "zh": "這其實是第一個被執行的程式碼檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.766,
          "end": 59.633,
          "en": "which will be executed",
          "zh": "它會在每次"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.633,
          "end": 62.2,
          "en": "whenever this page is loaded.",
          "zh": "這個頁面被載入的時候被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.2,
          "end": 66.166,
          "en": "So whenever you visit localhost:3000 here at the moment,",
          "zh": "所以現在每當你造訪 localhost:3000 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.166,
          "end": 69.166,
          "en": "this index JavaScript file holds the code,",
          "zh": "這個 index 的 JavaScript 檔就裝著那段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.166,
          "end": 71.466,
          "en": "which is executed initially.",
          "zh": "它會在一開始被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.466,
          "end": 73.8,
          "en": "Though I will also say right away",
          "zh": "不過我也要先說"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.8,
          "end": 75.93299999999999,
          "en": "that it's not exactly that code",
          "zh": "實際上被執行的並不完全是那段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.93299999999999,
          "end": 79.333,
          "en": "but a transformed version of that code.",
          "zh": "而是那段程式碼經過轉換後的版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.333,
          "end": 79.4,
          "en": "but a transformed version of that code.",
          "zh": "而是那段程式碼經過轉換後的版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.4,
          "end": 83.366,
          "en": "Remember when I said that our project setup here involves",
          "zh": "記得我剛才說過，我們這裡的專案設定會用到"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.366,
          "end": 86.96600000000001,
          "en": "some scripts, which transform and optimize the code?",
          "zh": "一些指令碼，來轉換並最佳化程式碼嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.96600000000001,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "Yeah, that is happening behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "沒錯，這些事情都在背後默默進行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 90.233,
          "en": "Yeah, that is happening behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "沒錯，這些事情都在背後默默進行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.233,
          "end": 93.066,
          "en": "Basically, we will write the code",
          "zh": "基本上，我們會用"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.066,
          "end": 96.7,
          "en": "in a easy-to-read developer-friendly way",
          "zh": "易讀、對開發者友善的方式來寫程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.7,
          "end": 98.833,
          "en": "with some syntactic sugar,",
          "zh": "加上一些語法糖，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.833,
          "end": 101.866,
          "en": "which makes our life as a developer easier",
          "zh": "讓我們開發者的生活輕鬆一些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.866,
          "end": 104.566,
          "en": "but we'll write code which wouldn't run like this",
          "zh": "但我們寫的程式碼這樣子是沒辦法執行的"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.566,
          "end": 106.333,
          "en": "in the browser.",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.333,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "And especially not in all supported browsers.",
          "zh": "尤其是在所有支援的瀏覽器裡都跑不動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 113.6,
          "en": "Therefore, the npm start process,",
          "zh": "因此，npm start 這個行程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.6,
          "end": 114.7,
          "en": "which we started here,",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這裡啟動的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.7,
          "end": 116.733,
          "en": "which started this development server,",
          "zh": "它啟動了這個開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.733,
          "end": 118.533,
          "en": "which is watching our code,",
          "zh": "並且持續監看我們的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.533,
          "end": 121.433,
          "en": "this process will not just watch our code",
          "zh": "這個行程不只是監看我們的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.433,
          "end": 125.166,
          "en": "and then take it and deliver it to the browser,",
          "zh": "然後把它拿去、送到瀏覽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.166,
          "end": 125.266,
          "en": "and then take it and deliver it to the browser,",
          "zh": "然後把它拿去、送到瀏覽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.266,
          "end": 127.233,
          "en": "but before it delivers it,",
          "zh": "而是在送出之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 127.233,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "it will transform it.",
          "zh": "它會先把它轉換過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 129,
          "end": 131.833,
          "en": "So that certain extra features work",
          "zh": "好讓某些額外的功能可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.833,
          "end": 134.7,
          "en": "in the browser, even they wouldn't work",
          "zh": "瀏覽器裡運作，因為如果只是直接把"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.7,
          "end": 137.03300000000002,
          "en": "if just this code would be taken.",
          "zh": "這段程式碼拿過去，它們根本不會動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.03300000000002,
          "end": 137.36599999999999,
          "en": "if just this code would be taken.",
          "zh": "這段程式碼拿過去，它們根本不會動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 137.36599999999999,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "For example, this import here",
          "zh": "舉例來說，這裡這個 import"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 139.5,
          "end": 144.5,
          "en": "where we import a CSS file into a JavaScript file.",
          "zh": "我們把一個 CSS 檔匯入到一個 JavaScript 檔裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 144.5,
          "end": 148.233,
          "en": "That's not something which would work in regular JavaScript.",
          "zh": "這在一般 JavaScript 裡是行不通的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.233,
          "end": 151.466,
          "en": "That would be an invalid syntax.",
          "zh": "那會是無效的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.466,
          "end": 155.666,
          "en": "You can't import CSS into JavaScript.",
          "zh": "你不能把 CSS 匯入到 JavaScript 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.666,
          "end": 158.966,
          "en": "Well, here in this project setup, it does work.",
          "zh": "不過在這個專案設定裡，它就是可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 158.966,
          "end": 160.166,
          "en": "Here in the end,",
          "zh": "在這裡，到頭來"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 160.166,
          "end": 164.633,
          "en": "it tells this npm start process we could say",
          "zh": "可以說，它是在告訴 npm start 這個行程"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.633,
          "end": 168.833,
          "en": "that we simply want to include this index.css file",
          "zh": "我們單純想要把這個 index.css 檔納入"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.833,
          "end": 171.966,
          "en": "into our overall application.",
          "zh": "我們整個應用程式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 171.966,
          "end": 174.86599999999999,
          "en": "That the CSS code in there should be considered",
          "zh": "也就是裡面的 CSS 程式碼應該被納入考量，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 174.86599999999999,
          "end": 177.5,
          "en": "and should be injected into this page,",
          "zh": "而且應該被注入到這個頁面裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.5,
          "end": 180.033,
          "en": "which is shown here on the screen.",
          "zh": "也就是畫面上顯示的這個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 180.033,
          "end": 182.333,
          "en": "And that's why the styles defined in there,",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼裡面定義的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.333,
          "end": 183.7,
          "en": "like the font family",
          "zh": "像是字型家族"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.7,
          "end": 186.433,
          "en": "but also the background color of the body",
          "zh": "還有 body 的背景顏色"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.433,
          "end": 186.7,
          "en": "but also the background color of the body",
          "zh": "還有 body 的背景顏色"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 186.7,
          "end": 189.566,
          "en": "are picked up here on the screen,",
          "zh": "都會呈現在這裡的畫面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 189.566,
          "end": 192.433,
          "en": "on the page that we see.",
          "zh": "在我們看到的這個頁面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 192.433,
          "end": 194.666,
          "en": "Another example for syntax,",
          "zh": "另一個語法的例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 194.666,
          "end": 197.233,
          "en": "which is not regular JavaScript syntax",
          "zh": "它並不是一般的 JavaScript 語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 197.233,
          "end": 199.433,
          "en": "would be this here.",
          "zh": "就是這裡這個部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 199.433,
          "end": 202.5,
          "en": "It looks like some kind of HTML code",
          "zh": "它看起來像是某種 HTML 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 202.5,
          "end": 205.266,
          "en": "inside of a JavaScript file.",
          "zh": "放在一個 JavaScript 檔案裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 205.266,
          "end": 208.666,
          "en": "And normally, this also wouldn't work.",
          "zh": "而一般來說，這也同樣行不通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.666,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "Well, again, here it does work",
          "zh": "不過，同樣地，在這裡它就是能運作"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 214.36599999999999,
          "en": "but only because this is transformed",
          "zh": "但純粹是因為它被轉換過"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 214.36599999999999,
          "end": 217.5,
          "en": "before it's delivered to the browser.",
          "zh": "在被送到瀏覽器之前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 217.5,
          "end": 218.86599999999999,
          "en": "And for the moment, you just need",
          "zh": "而目前，你只需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 218.86599999999999,
          "end": 220.266,
          "en": "to be aware of that,",
          "zh": "知道這件事就好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 220.266,
          "end": 222.666,
          "en": "that those transformations happen,",
          "zh": "知道這些轉換會發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 222.666,
          "end": 224.86599999999999,
          "en": "and that the idea of that simply",
          "zh": "而這背後的想法單純就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 224.86599999999999,
          "end": 226.433,
          "en": "is that we can write code",
          "zh": "我們可以用"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 226.433,
          "end": 229.566,
          "en": "in a nice way, in a easy way",
          "zh": "漂亮、輕鬆的方式寫程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 229.566,
          "end": 231.433,
          "en": "and then still we have code in the end,",
          "zh": "而最後我們仍然會得到可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 231.433,
          "end": 234.1,
          "en": "which runs in all browsers.",
          "zh": "在所有瀏覽器上執行的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 234.1,
          "end": 236.1,
          "en": "Now, the fact that the index.js file",
          "zh": "那麼，index.js 檔"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 236.1,
          "end": 238.2,
          "en": "is the first file to be executed",
          "zh": "是第一個被執行的檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 238.2,
          "end": 240.533,
          "en": "is just something you have to know.",
          "zh": "這點你只要知道就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 240.533,
          "end": 242.4,
          "en": "I'm telling you that this is the case",
          "zh": "我跟你說事情就是這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 242.4,
          "end": 243.6,
          "en": "because indeed, it is.",
          "zh": "因為它確實就是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 243.6,
          "end": 246.633,
          "en": "And it's one of the few things you need to remember.",
          "zh": "而這是少數幾個你需要記住的事情之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 246.633,
          "end": 246.9,
          "en": "And it's one of the few things you need to remember.",
          "zh": "而這是少數幾個你需要記住的事情之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 246.9,
          "end": 250.666,
          "en": "Index.js here is the first file to execute.",
          "zh": "這裡的 index.js 是第一個被執行的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 250.666,
          "end": 252.266,
          "en": "Now, what's that file doing though?",
          "zh": "那麼，這個檔案到底在做什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 252.266,
          "end": 254.333,
          "en": "What's happening here?",
          "zh": "這裡發生了什麼事？"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 254.333,
          "end": 258.933,
          "en": "Well, we are importing ReactDOM from react-dom,",
          "zh": "我們從 react-dom 匯入 ReactDOM，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 258.933,
          "end": 259.233,
          "en": "Well, we are importing ReactDOM from react-dom,",
          "zh": "我們從 react-dom 匯入 ReactDOM，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 259.233,
          "end": 262.733,
          "en": "which in the end means we're importing something,",
          "zh": "這到頭來代表我們匯入了某個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 262.733,
          "end": 264.866,
          "en": "some ReactDOM object",
          "zh": "某個 ReactDOM 物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 264.866,
          "end": 267.83299999999997,
          "en": "from the react-dom third-party library,",
          "zh": "它來自 react-dom 這個第三方函式庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 267.83299999999997,
          "end": 269.866,
          "en": "which is one of our dependencies,",
          "zh": "它是我們的相依套件之一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 269.866,
          "end": 272.56600000000003,
          "en": "which is downloaded and installed locally.",
          "zh": "會被下載並安裝在本機。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 272.56600000000003,
          "end": 275.366,
          "en": "Now, in the package.json file,",
          "zh": "那麼，在 package.json 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 275.366,
          "end": 279.433,
          "en": "you actually see two React dependencies,",
          "zh": "你其實會看到兩個 React 相依套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 279.433,
          "end": 281.433,
          "en": "react just like that",
          "zh": "一個就是 react 本身"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 281.433,
          "end": 284.2,
          "en": "and then this react-dom thing.",
          "zh": "然後是這個 react-dom。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 284.2,
          "end": 287.133,
          "en": "And whilst this indeed technically",
          "zh": "雖然技術上來說，這確實"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 287.133,
          "end": 289.7,
          "en": "are two separate packages,",
          "zh": "是兩個各自獨立的套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 289.7,
          "end": 289.733,
          "en": "are two separate packages,",
          "zh": "是兩個各自獨立的套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 289.733,
          "end": 293.6,
          "en": "you can think of that as React, the library.",
          "zh": "但你可以把它們想成是同一個 React 函式庫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 293.6,
          "end": 295.966,
          "en": "It's split across two packages",
          "zh": "它被拆成兩個套件"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 295.966,
          "end": 298.3,
          "en": "with different responsibilities",
          "zh": "各自負責不同的任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 298.3,
          "end": 300.933,
          "en": "but in the end, ReactDOM and React,",
          "zh": "但到頭來，ReactDOM 和 React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 300.933,
          "end": 304.6,
          "en": "these two dependencies together form the React library,",
          "zh": "這兩個相依套件合起來就構成 React 函式庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 304.6,
          "end": 308.1,
          "en": "which we're going to learn all about in this course.",
          "zh": "也就是我們這門課要完整學習的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 308.1,
          "end": 311.066,
          "en": "So whenever we import something from React,",
          "zh": "所以每當我們從 React 匯入東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 311.066,
          "end": 313.066,
          "en": "or from ReactDOM,",
          "zh": "或是從 ReactDOM 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 313.066,
          "end": 313.233,
          "en": "or from ReactDOM,",
          "zh": "或是從 ReactDOM 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 313.233,
          "end": 315.6,
          "en": "it's basically both all about React,",
          "zh": "基本上兩者都跟 React 有關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 318.266,
          "en": "and we're using React features",
          "zh": "我們就是在使用 React 的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 318.266,
          "end": 320.966,
          "en": "as we're doing it here in index.js",
          "zh": "就像我們在 index.js 這裡做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 320.966,
          "end": 324.8,
          "en": "where we are importing from ReactDOM.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡從 ReactDOM 匯入東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 324.8,
          "end": 326.766,
          "en": "This simply makes a feature exposed",
          "zh": "這單純是讓那個函式庫所提供的一項功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 326.766,
          "end": 329,
          "en": "by that library available",
          "zh": "變得可以使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 329,
          "end": 331.933,
          "en": "inside of this index.js file",
          "zh": "在這個 index.js 檔案裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 331.933,
          "end": 335.4,
          "en": "because that's how modern JavaScript works in general.",
          "zh": "因為現代 JavaScript 基本上就是這樣運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 335.4,
          "end": 335.6,
          "en": "because that's how modern JavaScript works in general.",
          "zh": "因為現代 JavaScript 基本上就是這樣運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 335.6,
          "end": 337.7,
          "en": "If you define a feature,",
          "zh": "如果你定義了一個功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 337.7,
          "end": 341.233,
          "en": "let's say a function in file A,",
          "zh": "比如說在檔案 A 裡定義一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 341.233,
          "end": 344.233,
          "en": "and you wanna use it in file B",
          "zh": "而你想在檔案 B 裡使用它"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 344.233,
          "end": 344.33299999999997,
          "en": "and you wanna use it in file B",
          "zh": "而你想在檔案 B 裡使用它"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 344.33299999999997,
          "end": 346.9,
          "en": "to split your code across multiple files",
          "zh": "為了把程式碼分散到多個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 346.9,
          "end": 350.033,
          "en": "to keep every file small and manageable,",
          "zh": "讓每個檔案都保持小而好管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 350.033,
          "end": 352.733,
          "en": "then you have to export the feature,",
          "zh": "那你就必須把這個功能匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 352.733,
          "end": 354.733,
          "en": "which you wanna use in file B in file A,",
          "zh": "把你想要在檔案 B 使用的功能從檔案 A 匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 354.733,
          "end": 356.233,
          "en": "which you wanna use in file B in file A,",
          "zh": "把你想要在檔案 B 使用的功能從檔案 A 匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 356.233,
          "end": 359.1,
          "en": "and then import it in file B.",
          "zh": "然後在檔案 B 裡將它匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 359.1,
          "end": 360.866,
          "en": "And that's what we're doing here.",
          "zh": "而我們這裡做的就是這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 360.866,
          "end": 366.766,
          "en": "ReactDOM, this package, is exporting some React DOM object,",
          "zh": "ReactDOM 這個套件會匯出某個 ReactDOM 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 366.766,
          "end": 370.133,
          "en": "and we're importing it here into index.js.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡把它匯入到 index.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 370.133,
          "end": 370.466,
          "en": "and we're importing it here into index.js.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡把它匯入到 index.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 370.466,
          "end": 374,
          "en": "And we are importing ReactDOM into index.js",
          "zh": "我們把 ReactDOM 匯入到 index.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 374,
          "end": 378.2,
          "en": "to then call a method on it, the createRoot method.",
          "zh": "接著在它上面呼叫一個方法，也就是 createRoot 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 378.2,
          "end": 381.7,
          "en": "This creates basically the main entry point,",
          "zh": "這基本上會建立主要的進入點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 381.7,
          "end": 385.566,
          "en": "the main hook of the overall user interface you are",
          "zh": "也就是即將用 React 打造的整體使用者介面"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 385.566,
          "end": 388.533,
          "en": "about to build with React.",
          "zh": "的主要掛載點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 388.533,
          "end": 390.666,
          "en": "That's the idea behind createRoot,",
          "zh": "這就是 createRoot 背後的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 390.666,
          "end": 392.133,
          "en": "and what this does in the end",
          "zh": "而它到頭來所做的事情"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 392.133,
          "end": 398.366,
          "en": "is it tells React where this React application,",
          "zh": "就是告訴 React，這個 React 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 398.366,
          "end": 402.366,
          "en": "this user interface, which you build with React in the end",
          "zh": "也就是你最後用 React 打造出來的這個使用者介面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 402.366,
          "end": 407.4,
          "en": "should be placed in the web page that is loaded.",
          "zh": "應該被放到被載入的網頁中的哪個位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 407.4,
          "end": 410.166,
          "en": "And that leads us to one other file,",
          "zh": "而這就帶我們看到另一個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 410.166,
          "end": 415.466,
          "en": "the index.html file in that public folder.",
          "zh": "也就是 public 資料夾裡的 index.html 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 415.466,
          "end": 419.1,
          "en": "This folder is a folder in which we will rarely work",
          "zh": "這個資料夾是我們很少會去動的資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 419.1,
          "end": 421.366,
          "en": "but it holds one important file.",
          "zh": "但它裡面有一個很重要的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 421.366,
          "end": 424.333,
          "en": "This index.html file.",
          "zh": "就是這個 index.html 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 424.333,
          "end": 427.333,
          "en": "This is the single HTML file,",
          "zh": "這是唯一的一個 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 427.333,
          "end": 430.366,
          "en": "which is in the end loaded by the browser here.",
          "zh": "最後會被瀏覽器載入的就是它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 430.366,
          "end": 434.1,
          "en": "This is basically the only HTML file",
          "zh": "這基本上就是整個 React 應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 434.1,
          "end": 437.966,
          "en": "that is being used by this overall React application",
          "zh": "唯一會用到的 HTML 檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 437.966,
          "end": 441.533,
          "en": "because it's a so-called single page application.",
          "zh": "因為它是所謂的單頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 441.533,
          "end": 444.366,
          "en": "It has a single HTML file",
          "zh": "它只有一個 HTML 檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 444.366,
          "end": 448.666,
          "en": "and all subsequent changes on the user interface,",
          "zh": "而之後使用者介面上所有後續的變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 448.666,
          "end": 452.2,
          "en": "on the web page will be handled by React.",
          "zh": "也就是網頁上的變化，都會交由 React 處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 452.2,
          "end": 455.3,
          "en": "And it's this single HTML file",
          "zh": "而就是這唯一的 HTML 檔"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 455.3,
          "end": 457.133,
          "en": "that is the entry point,",
          "zh": "是整個進入點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 457.133,
          "end": 460.866,
          "en": "the place where the React-driven user interface",
          "zh": "也就是由 React 驅動的使用者介面"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 460.866,
          "end": 464.433,
          "en": "should be rendered into so to say.",
          "zh": "應該被渲染進去的地方，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 464.433,
          "end": 464.8,
          "en": "should be rendered into so to say.",
          "zh": "應該被渲染進去的地方，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 464.8,
          "end": 466.666,
          "en": "And in this index.html file,",
          "zh": "而在這個 index.html 檔裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 466.666,
          "end": 469.666,
          "en": "we've got a regular HTML document structure,",
          "zh": "我們有一個標準的 HTML 文件結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 469.666,
          "end": 471.56600000000003,
          "en": "and if we have a look at the body,",
          "zh": "如果我們看一下 body，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 471.56600000000003,
          "end": 471.666,
          "en": "and if we have a look at the body,",
          "zh": "如果我們看一下 body，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 471.666,
          "end": 475.433,
          "en": "you will find a div like this in here.",
          "zh": "你會在這裡面看到像這樣的一個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 475.433,
          "end": 478.9,
          "en": "A div with the id root in this case.",
          "zh": "在這裡是一個帶有 id root 的 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 478.9,
          "end": 480.4,
          "en": "That's a regular div,",
          "zh": "這是一般的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 480.4,
          "end": 484.2,
          "en": "which actually doesn't hold any content,",
          "zh": "它其實不包含任何內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 484.2,
          "end": 486.833,
          "en": "but that's the div where we want",
          "zh": "但這就是我們想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 486.833,
          "end": 493.666,
          "en": "to attach or inject our React-driven user interface.",
          "zh": "掛載或注入由 React 驅動的使用者介面的那個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 493.666,
          "end": 495.4,
          "en": "So the user interface,",
          "zh": "也就是使用者介面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 495.4,
          "end": 497.533,
          "en": "which we will build with React.",
          "zh": "我們將用 React 打造的那個介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 497.533,
          "end": 499.5,
          "en": "And you're going to learn how that works",
          "zh": "而你會學到這一切是如何運作的"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 499.5,
          "end": 501.7,
          "en": "throughout this course, of course.",
          "zh": "當然，是在整門課程中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 501.7,
          "end": 503.266,
          "en": "So it's this div",
          "zh": "所以就是這個 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 503.266,
          "end": 507.4,
          "en": "where the React-based user interface should be rendered into",
          "zh": "React 打造的使用者介面應該被渲染進去的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 507.4,
          "end": 507.5,
          "en": "where the React-based user interface should be rendered into",
          "zh": "React 打造的使用者介面應該被渲染進去的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 507.5,
          "end": 509.8,
          "en": "and therefore, in index.js,",
          "zh": "因此，在 index.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 509.8,
          "end": 512.6,
          "en": "it's this div with the id root,",
          "zh": "就是這個帶有 id root 的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 512.6,
          "end": 514.466,
          "en": "as you just saw.",
          "zh": "就像你剛剛看到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 514.466,
          "end": 518.066,
          "en": "Remember, we have the id root on that div,",
          "zh": "記得嗎，那個 div 上有 id root，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 518.066,
          "end": 523.333,
          "en": "which we select here with some regular JavaScript code,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡用一些一般的 JavaScript 程式碼選取它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 523.333,
          "end": 526.233,
          "en": "and then we use a method from the React library,",
          "zh": "然後我們使用 React 函式庫裡的一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 526.233,
          "end": 528.8,
          "en": "from the ReactDOM library to be precise,",
          "zh": "精確來說，是 ReactDOM 函式庫裡的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 528.8,
          "end": 531.3,
          "en": "which is part of the React library though",
          "zh": "不過它也算是 React 函式庫的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 531.3,
          "end": 531.8,
          "en": "which is part of the React library though",
          "zh": "不過它也算是 React 函式庫的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 531.8,
          "end": 534.266,
          "en": "to tell React that this should be the root",
          "zh": "來告訴 React，這裡應該是 root"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 534.266,
          "end": 536.133,
          "en": "of our React application,",
          "zh": "我們 React 應用程式的根，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 536.133,
          "end": 540.3,
          "en": "the main place where the React application gets rendered to",
          "zh": "也就是 React 應用程式主要被渲染到的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 540.3,
          "end": 541.7,
          "en": "so to say.",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 541.7,
          "end": 544.333,
          "en": "That's what createRoot does.",
          "zh": "這就是 createRoot 做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 544.333,
          "end": 549.466,
          "en": "Then we store this root object in a constant or variable,",
          "zh": "接著我們把這個 root 物件存到常數或變數裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 549.466,
          "end": 553.3,
          "en": "and then on that object, on that root object,",
          "zh": "然後在那個物件上，在那個 root 物件上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 553.3,
          "end": 555.433,
          "en": "we can call the render method",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫 render 方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 555.433,
          "end": 560.033,
          "en": "to tell React what should be rendered in that div",
          "zh": "來告訴 React，那個 div 裡應該渲染什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 560.033,
          "end": 561.966,
          "en": "that we selected here.",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這裡選取的那個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 561.966,
          "end": 563.333,
          "en": "And you could, by the way, of course,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，你當然也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 563.333,
          "end": 566.033,
          "en": "also select other elements like spans",
          "zh": "選取其他元素，像是 span"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 566.033,
          "end": 570.233,
          "en": "or paragraphs but a div is the most common root element",
          "zh": "或是段落，但 div 是最常見的根元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 570.233,
          "end": 572.633,
          "en": "that is selected.",
          "zh": "被選用的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 572.633,
          "end": 574.933,
          "en": "And we're in the end telling ReactDOM",
          "zh": "而我們到頭來就是在告訴 ReactDOM"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 574.933,
          "end": 577.533,
          "en": "that we wanna render something,",
          "zh": "我們想要渲染某個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 577.533,
          "end": 580.866,
          "en": "we'll have a look at that in a second in this place",
          "zh": "我們等一下就會看到那是什麼，就在這個地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 580.866,
          "end": 585.333,
          "en": "so that basically, the content of this div",
          "zh": "基本上就是讓這個 div 的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 585.333,
          "end": 587.266,
          "en": "and as you can tell, there is no content,",
          "zh": "而你可以看得出來，它沒有任何內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 587.266,
          "end": 589.233,
          "en": "so what's inside of this div",
          "zh": "所以這個 div 裡面的東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 589.233,
          "end": 593.7,
          "en": "should be replaced with that.",
          "zh": "應該被取代成那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 593.7,
          "end": 596.233,
          "en": "So, of course, that brings up another question.",
          "zh": "所以，這當然又帶出另一個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 596.233,
          "end": 600.333,
          "en": "What is that app thing here?",
          "zh": "這裡這個 app 是什麼東西？"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 600.333,
          "end": 601.4,
          "en": "Well, first of all,",
          "zh": "首先，"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 601.4,
          "end": 604.333,
          "en": "it's also something which we're importing.",
          "zh": "它也是我們匯入的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 604.333,
          "end": 608.1,
          "en": "We're importing App from the App file,",
          "zh": "我們從 App 檔案匯入 App，"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 608.1,
          "end": 609.966,
          "en": "and that's this App.js file.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 App.js 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 609.966,
          "end": 614.633,
          "en": "You just may omit and you should omit .js",
          "zh": "你可以省略，而且你應該省略 .js"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 614.633,
          "end": 617.5,
          "en": "as the extension in your imports here.",
          "zh": "也就是在這裡匯入時省略副檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 617.5,
          "end": 619.566,
          "en": "If it's another file, like a CSS file,",
          "zh": "如果它是別的檔案，像是 CSS 檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 619.566,
          "end": 620.733,
          "en": "you have to add it",
          "zh": "你就必須加上去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 620.733,
          "end": 622.733,
          "en": "but if it's a third-party library",
          "zh": "但如果是第三方函式庫"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 622.733,
          "end": 628.466,
          "en": "or one of your JS files, you omit the .js.",
          "zh": "或是你自己的 JS 檔，就省略 .js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 628.466,
          "end": 630.333,
          "en": "Now, we can tell that it's one of our files",
          "zh": "我們可以判斷它是我們自己的檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 630.333,
          "end": 632.733,
          "en": "because we have a relative import path here,",
          "zh": "因為這裡用的是相對匯入路徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 632.733,
          "end": 634.933,
          "en": "starting with ./",
          "zh": "以 ./ 開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 634.933,
          "end": 637.433,
          "en": "which means please look in the same folder",
          "zh": "意思是請到跟這個 index.js 檔"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 637.433,
          "end": 639.833,
          "en": "as this index.js file is in.",
          "zh": "相同的資料夾裡去找。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 639.833,
          "end": 642.5,
          "en": "And then use the App.js file.",
          "zh": "然後使用 App.js 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 642.5,
          "end": 644.8,
          "en": "So this file here.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡這個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 644.8,
          "end": 647.966,
          "en": "And from that file, we import App.",
          "zh": "我們從那個檔案匯入 App。"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 647.966,
          "end": 650,
          "en": "And then we do something with it",
          "zh": "然後我們用它做了某件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 650,
          "end": 650.033,
          "en": "And then we do something with it",
          "zh": "然後我們用它做了某件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 650.033,
          "end": 655.333,
          "en": "but that is definitely not regular JavaScript syntax here.",
          "zh": "但這裡這絕對不是一般的 JavaScript 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 655.333,
          "end": 656.8,
          "en": "Indeed, it isn't.",
          "zh": "確實不是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 656.8,
          "end": 659.2,
          "en": "This is a syntax called JSX",
          "zh": "這是一種叫做 JSX 的語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 659.2,
          "end": 661.666,
          "en": "and I'll come back to it in a second.",
          "zh": "我等一下會再回來談它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 661.666,
          "end": 663.733,
          "en": "But before I come back to that,",
          "zh": "但在我回頭談那個之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 663.733,
          "end": 666.266,
          "en": "there's one key thing you've gotta know about App.",
          "zh": "有一件關於 App 的關鍵事情你必須知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 666.266,
          "end": 669.733,
          "en": "App, in the end, is a component,",
          "zh": "App 到頭來是一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 669.733,
          "end": 670.933,
          "en": "and you might remember,",
          "zh": "你可能還記得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 670.933,
          "end": 673.233,
          "en": "components are important.",
          "zh": "元件非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 673.233,
          "end": 677.333,
          "en": "Here we see our first component in action.",
          "zh": "在這裡我們看到第一個元件實際運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 677.333,
          "end": 679.333,
          "en": "It's this App component,",
          "zh": "就是這個 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 679.333,
          "end": 682.1,
          "en": "which we, in the end, render in the place",
          "zh": "我們最後把它渲染在"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 682.1,
          "end": 685.133,
          "en": "of that element with an id of root.",
          "zh": "那個 id 為 root 的元素的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 685.133,
          "end": 687.2,
          "en": "So in place of that div",
          "zh": "所以在這個 div 的位置"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 687.2,
          "end": 690.8,
          "en": "or inside of that div to be precise.",
          "zh": "或者精確來說，是在這個 div 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 690.8,
          "end": 694.733,
          "en": "So therefore, let's now have a look at this App.js file.",
          "zh": "所以，我們現在來看看這個 App.js 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 694.733,
          "end": 697.9,
          "en": "And this is a fairly trivial file.",
          "zh": "這是個相當簡單的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 697.9,
          "end": 700.5,
          "en": "It holds a function named App",
          "zh": "它裡面有一個名為 App 的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 700.5,
          "end": 704,
          "en": "and we then export this function",
          "zh": "然後我們把這個函式匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 262,
          "start": 704,
          "end": 705.566,
          "en": "because as I mentioned,",
          "zh": "因為就像我提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 263,
          "start": 705.566,
          "end": 708.933,
          "en": "in modern JavaScript, if you have something,",
          "zh": "在現代 JavaScript 裡，如果你有個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 264,
          "start": 708.933,
          "end": 710.633,
          "en": "like a function or a class",
          "zh": "像是一個函式或一個類別"
        },
        {
          "id": 265,
          "start": 710.633,
          "end": 713.6659999999999,
          "en": "or an object defined in one file",
          "zh": "或是一個定義在某個檔案裡的物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 266,
          "start": 713.6659999999999,
          "end": 716.033,
          "en": "and you wanna use it in another file,",
          "zh": "而你想在另一個檔案裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 267,
          "start": 716.033,
          "end": 718.733,
          "en": "you have to export and import it.",
          "zh": "你就必須將它匯出和匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 268,
          "start": 718.733,
          "end": 721.5,
          "en": "So here in App.js where this function is defined,",
          "zh": "所以在 App.js 這裡，也就是這個函式被定義的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 269,
          "start": 721.5,
          "end": 725.833,
          "en": "we export it, and then we import it in index.js,",
          "zh": "我們將它匯出，然後在 index.js 裡匯入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 270,
          "start": 725.833,
          "end": 728.866,
          "en": "and that's how these two files are connected",
          "zh": "這就是這兩個檔案彼此連結的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 271,
          "start": 728.866,
          "end": 729,
          "en": "and that's how these two files are connected",
          "zh": "這就是這兩個檔案彼此連結的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 272,
          "start": 729,
          "end": 731.2,
          "en": "and how we can use a feature,",
          "zh": "也是我們如何使用某個功能的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 273,
          "start": 731.2,
          "end": 731.266,
          "en": "and how we can use a feature,",
          "zh": "也是我們如何使用某個功能的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 274,
          "start": 731.266,
          "end": 734.666,
          "en": "in this case, a function defined in App.js",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，就是在 App.js 裡定義的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 275,
          "start": 734.666,
          "end": 737.4,
          "en": "inside of index.js.",
          "zh": "在 index.js 裡面使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 276,
          "start": 737.4,
          "end": 740.833,
          "en": "Now, what's this App.js function doing though?",
          "zh": "那麼，這個 App.js 函式到底在做什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 277,
          "start": 740.833,
          "end": 742.8,
          "en": "Not much as you can tell.",
          "zh": "如你所見，沒做什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 278,
          "start": 742.8,
          "end": 744.8,
          "en": "It's a function named App.",
          "zh": "它是一個名為 App 的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 279,
          "start": 744.8,
          "end": 746.466,
          "en": "Starting with a capital character",
          "zh": "以大寫字母開頭"
        },
        {
          "id": 280,
          "start": 746.466,
          "end": 747.666,
          "en": "might be a bit strange",
          "zh": "可能有點奇怪"
        },
        {
          "id": 281,
          "start": 747.666,
          "end": 750.233,
          "en": "but it's valid JavaScript syntax.",
          "zh": "但這是合法的 JavaScript 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 282,
          "start": 750.233,
          "end": 753.933,
          "en": "And then all we do in here is we return something.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡做的，就只是回傳某個東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 283,
          "start": 753.933,
          "end": 757.433,
          "en": "But what we return again is strange.",
          "zh": "但我們回傳的東西同樣很奇怪。"
        },
        {
          "id": 284,
          "start": 757.433,
          "end": 761.566,
          "en": "It's HTML code inside of a JavaScript file.",
          "zh": "它是放在 JavaScript 檔裡的 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 285,
          "start": 761.566,
          "end": 766.366,
          "en": "And again, that's not something you regularly see.",
          "zh": "同樣地，這不是你平常會看到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 286,
          "start": 766.366,
          "end": 769.2,
          "en": "It's also not something we're used to.",
          "zh": "也不是我們習慣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 287,
          "start": 769.2,
          "end": 774.2,
          "en": "And it's also not valid JavaScript code normally.",
          "zh": "而且它通常也不是合法的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 288,
          "start": 774.2,
          "end": 777.6,
          "en": "Yet here, everything seems to work.",
          "zh": "但在這裡，一切似乎都能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 289,
          "start": 777.6,
          "end": 779,
          "en": "The reason for that",
          "zh": "背後的原因"
        },
        {
          "id": 290,
          "start": 779,
          "end": 782.5,
          "en": "is that this is a feature called JSX.",
          "zh": "就是這是一項叫做 JSX 的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 291,
          "start": 782.5,
          "end": 785.133,
          "en": "It's a special syntax invented",
          "zh": "這是一種特殊的語法，由 React 團隊"
        },
        {
          "id": 292,
          "start": 785.133,
          "end": 787.866,
          "en": "and introduced by the React team,",
          "zh": "發明並引進，"
        },
        {
          "id": 293,
          "start": 787.866,
          "end": 790.633,
          "en": "and it works in these JavaScript files",
          "zh": "它之所以能在這些 JavaScript 檔裡運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 294,
          "start": 790.633,
          "end": 793.333,
          "en": "because of our overall project setup",
          "zh": "是因為我們整體的專案設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 295,
          "start": 793.333,
          "end": 796.6,
          "en": "and again, because of these transformation steps,",
          "zh": "同樣地，也是因為這些轉換步驟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 296,
          "start": 796.6,
          "end": 798.466,
          "en": "which are running behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "它們在背後默默執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 297,
          "start": 798.466,
          "end": 798.866,
          "en": "which are running behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "它們在背後默默執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 298,
          "start": 798.866,
          "end": 801.633,
          "en": "But let's take a closer look at JSX,",
          "zh": "不過，我們更仔細來看看 JSX，"
        },
        {
          "id": 299,
          "start": 801.633,
          "end": 804.666,
          "en": "and what it is, and how it works in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "看看它是什麼、如何運作，就在下一堂課。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595410",
      "title": "Introducing JSX",
      "sourceHash": "e2d23ce432cd7bf88d8d049c9af0df825a59a6c2bc178485781bb1d7bde4b620",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.966,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "Maximilian: So we got this JSX code here",
          "zh": "Maximilian：所以我們這裡有這段 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 8.266,
          "en": "which is basically HTML code inside of JavaScript.",
          "zh": "它基本上就是 JavaScript 裡的 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.266,
          "end": 12.7,
          "en": "Indeed, JSX stands for JavaScript XML",
          "zh": "沒錯，JSX 代表的是 JavaScript XML，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 17.1,
          "en": "because HTML in the end is XML, you could say.",
          "zh": "因為可以說 HTML 最終就是 XML。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.1,
          "end": 20.266,
          "en": "So we got this HTML code in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "所以我們有這段在 JavaScript 裡的 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.266,
          "end": 22.7,
          "en": "And again, this is really important.",
          "zh": "再次強調，這真的非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.7,
          "end": 26.133,
          "en": "This only works because there are transformation steps",
          "zh": "這之所以能運作，是因為在背後"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.133,
          "end": 29.5,
          "en": "running behind the scenes because of this process",
          "zh": "有轉換步驟在執行，因為這個流程"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.5,
          "end": 31.9,
          "en": "does NPM start process which we started,",
          "zh": "也就是我們啟動的 npm start 流程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.9,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "which transformed as JavaScript code",
          "zh": "它會把 JavaScript 程式碼轉換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 36.733,
          "en": "to more browser friendly code",
          "zh": "更適合瀏覽器的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.733,
          "end": 39.766,
          "en": "before everything is being served here.",
          "zh": "在一切被提供到這裡之前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.766,
          "end": 41.933,
          "en": "And indeed you can see that transformed code",
          "zh": "而你的確可以看到那段轉換後的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.933,
          "end": 43.2,
          "en": "if you want to.",
          "zh": "如果你想要的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 46.033,
          "en": "Simply open up the developer tools",
          "zh": "只要打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.033,
          "end": 47.566,
          "en": "and here I'm using Chrome,",
          "zh": "我在這裡使用的是 Chrome，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.566,
          "end": 50.633,
          "en": "which is the browser I do recommend for development.",
          "zh": "這是我推薦用於開發的瀏覽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.633,
          "end": 54.2,
          "en": "Simply open up the developer tools in Chrome",
          "zh": "只要在 Chrome 中打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.2,
          "end": 57.633,
          "en": "by going to view developer developer tools,",
          "zh": "透過檢視、開發人員、開發人員工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.633,
          "end": 60.133,
          "en": "or by using that shortcut.",
          "zh": "或者使用那個快速鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.133,
          "end": 65.833,
          "en": "And in these developer tools here go to the sources tab.",
          "zh": "然後在這些開發者工具裡，前往 Sources 分頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.833,
          "end": 67.833,
          "en": "And this shows all the sources,",
          "zh": "這裡會顯示所有的來源，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.833,
          "end": 70.1,
          "en": "all the script files for example,",
          "zh": "例如所有的腳本檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.1,
          "end": 74.466,
          "en": "which were downloaded as part of this page.",
          "zh": "它們是作為這個頁面的一部分被下載的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.466,
          "end": 77.4,
          "en": "Now in here, you'll see a couple of folders",
          "zh": "在這裡，你會看到幾個資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.4,
          "end": 81.666,
          "en": "but you should see some static /JS folder or something",
          "zh": "但你應該會看到一些像是 static/JS 的資料夾之類的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.666,
          "end": 86.633,
          "en": "like that, which should hold a couple of JavaScript files.",
          "zh": "裡面應該會有幾個 JavaScript 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.633,
          "end": 90.7,
          "en": "Now the exact number and names of these files might differ.",
          "zh": "這些檔案的確切數量和名稱可能會不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.7,
          "end": 93.7,
          "en": "But ultimately, if you click through these files",
          "zh": "但最終，如果你點開這些檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.7,
          "end": 97.96600000000001,
          "en": "you should see some code which looks fairly cryptic.",
          "zh": "你應該會看到一些看起來相當隱晦難懂的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.96600000000001,
          "end": 100.93299999999999,
          "en": "And which is definitely not the code we wrote here.",
          "zh": "而且那絕對不是我們在這裡寫的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.93299999999999,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "Or we have here in these two simple JavaScript files.",
          "zh": "也不是我們這兩個簡單 JavaScript 檔案裡的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 109.13300000000001,
          "en": "Well, it turns out that this is this transformed code",
          "zh": "結果發現，這就是那段轉換後的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.13300000000001,
          "end": 112.066,
          "en": "and it's quite a complex code, as you can tell",
          "zh": "如你所見，這是相當複雜的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.066,
          "end": 115.166,
          "en": "because React supports many features.",
          "zh": "因為 React 支援許多功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.166,
          "end": 118.9,
          "en": "And this code does not just contain our source code",
          "zh": "而這段程式碼不只有我們的原始碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.9,
          "end": 122.5,
          "en": "but the whole react library source code",
          "zh": "還包含整個 React 函式庫的原始碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.5,
          "end": 126.533,
          "en": "and the whole react Dom library source code.",
          "zh": "以及整個 React DOM 函式庫的原始碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.533,
          "end": 129.466,
          "en": "So the code in these files is not just our code",
          "zh": "所以這些檔案裡的程式碼不只是我們的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.466,
          "end": 131.966,
          "en": "but the entire React package code.",
          "zh": "而是整個 React 套件的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.966,
          "end": 135.166,
          "en": "That's something to keep in mind.",
          "zh": "這是你要記住的一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.166,
          "end": 138.53300000000002,
          "en": "Now in these files and the main chunk JS file here",
          "zh": "現在，在這些檔案以及這裡主要的 chunk JS 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.53300000000002,
          "end": 139.833,
          "en": "for example,",
          "zh": "舉例來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.833,
          "end": 142.966,
          "en": "you see a function named app, somewhere in there.",
          "zh": "你會在某處看到一個叫做 app 的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.966,
          "end": 144.333,
          "en": "you see a function named app, somewhere in there.",
          "zh": "你會在某處看到一個叫做 app 的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.333,
          "end": 145.933,
          "en": "You might need to search for it",
          "zh": "你可能需要用"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.933,
          "end": 149.86599999999999,
          "en": "with control F but somewhere in there in these files",
          "zh": "control F 來搜尋它，但在這些檔案裡的某處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.86599999999999,
          "end": 153.633,
          "en": "you should find your app function.",
          "zh": "你應該會找到你的 app 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.633,
          "end": 157.433,
          "en": "But of course, this function looks quite different",
          "zh": "但當然，這個函式和"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.433,
          "end": 158.8,
          "en": "to the app function we have here.",
          "zh": "我們這裡的 app 函式看起來相當不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.8,
          "end": 160.833,
          "en": "That's a very lean function.",
          "zh": "那是一個非常精簡的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.833,
          "end": 164.53300000000002,
          "en": "This function is not so lean.",
          "zh": "這個函式就沒那麼精簡了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.53300000000002,
          "end": 169.733,
          "en": "Well in the end debts is transformed code.",
          "zh": "嗯，這最終就是轉換後的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.733,
          "end": 174.666,
          "en": "You could say that is that code, which runs in the browser",
          "zh": "你可以說那就是在瀏覽器中執行的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.666,
          "end": 176.166,
          "en": "which is not the code we wrote",
          "zh": "那不是我們寫的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.166,
          "end": 179.233,
          "en": "but that's what this code is transformed to.",
          "zh": "但那就是這段程式碼被轉換成的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.233,
          "end": 180.033,
          "en": "And if you have",
          "zh": "而如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.033,
          "end": 183.366,
          "en": "a look at this transformed code and even look might change",
          "zh": "看看這段轉換後的程式碼，它的樣子甚至可能改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.366,
          "end": 186.233,
          "en": "over time, but it will definitely not look like this.",
          "zh": "但它絕對不會長得像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.233,
          "end": 189.6,
          "en": "If you have a look at this transformed code that probably",
          "zh": "如果你看看這段轉換後的程式碼，那大概"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.6,
          "end": 192.533,
          "en": "is not code we would like to write.",
          "zh": "不是我們會想寫的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.533,
          "end": 195.733,
          "en": "And that's why we have these transformation steps",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們要有這些轉換步驟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.733,
          "end": 199.333,
          "en": "because we can use this special JSX Syntex,",
          "zh": "因為我們可以使用這種特殊的 JSX 語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.333,
          "end": 202.86599999999999,
          "en": "which is not normally supported in the browser",
          "zh": "這在瀏覽器中通常並不支援，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.86599999999999,
          "end": 204.86599999999999,
          "en": "whilst we're writing our code",
          "zh": "在我們寫程式碼的時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.86599999999999,
          "end": 208.2,
          "en": "and still it'll automatically be transformed to code",
          "zh": "但它仍然會自動被轉換成程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.2,
          "end": 210.833,
          "en": "which does run in the browser so that we have the best",
          "zh": "那種能在瀏覽器中執行的程式碼，讓我們擁有最好的"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.833,
          "end": 212.066,
          "en": "which does run in the browser so that we have the best",
          "zh": "那種能在瀏覽器中執行的程式碼，讓我們擁有最好的"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.066,
          "end": 215.233,
          "en": "of both worlds code, which works in the browser",
          "zh": "兩個世界：能在瀏覽器中運作的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.233,
          "end": 218.166,
          "en": "which obviously is important and code, which is easy to",
          "zh": "這顯然很重要，以及容易"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.166,
          "end": 220.36599999999999,
          "en": "write for us as a developer.",
          "zh": "讓我們開發者撰寫的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.36599999999999,
          "end": 222.666,
          "en": "And I'm just putting so much emphasis on this",
          "zh": "我之所以這麼強調這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.666,
          "end": 225.2,
          "en": "because that can be super confusing.",
          "zh": "是因為這可能會讓人非常困惑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.2,
          "end": 227,
          "en": "If you're new to React,",
          "zh": "如果你是 React 新手，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227,
          "end": 230.5,
          "en": "you do know some basic JavaScript at least you should.",
          "zh": "你確實懂一些基本的 JavaScript，至少你應該要懂。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.5,
          "end": 232.8,
          "en": "And all of a sudden you see code like this",
          "zh": "然後突然間你看到像這樣的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.8,
          "end": 234.8,
          "en": "which is not regular JavaScript.",
          "zh": "這不是一般的 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.8,
          "end": 238.03300000000002,
          "en": "Well, this is just developer friendly code",
          "zh": "嗯，這只是對開發者友善的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.03300000000002,
          "end": 241.166,
          "en": "which we can write, which is transformed behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "我們可以這樣寫，它在背後會被轉換。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595416",
      "title": "How React Works",
      "sourceHash": "d880de048102ac6059e7afae624e466592705aa10e4b1900a17b412cc8711449",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2,
          "end": 5.466,
          "en": "Maximilian: Okay, so enough about JSX and all of that.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：好的，JSX 和那些東西就講到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.466,
          "end": 8.166,
          "en": "Let's now really get our hands dirty.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們真正動手做吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.166,
          "end": 14.333,
          "en": "We have this HTML-ish code here in this App function.",
          "zh": "我們在這個 App 函式裡有這段類似 HTML 的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.333,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "And we have that code here because with React,",
          "zh": "我們之所以把這段程式碼放在這裡，是因為使用 React 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 22.1,
          "en": "we ultimately built our own custom HTML elements",
          "zh": "我們最終會建立自己的自訂 HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.1,
          "end": 23.333,
          "en": "as you learned.",
          "zh": "就像你學到的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.333,
          "end": 25.6,
          "en": "We built those components",
          "zh": "我們建立了那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.6,
          "end": 30.533,
          "en": "and a component is basically just a custom HTML element.",
          "zh": "而一個元件基本上就只是一個自訂 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.533,
          "end": 33.533,
          "en": "And we do that with this declarative approach,",
          "zh": "而我們是用這種宣告式的做法來完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.533,
          "end": 34.833,
          "en": "as I mentioned, which means with React",
          "zh": "就像我提到的，這代表使用 React 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.833,
          "end": 36.166,
          "en": "as I mentioned, which means with React",
          "zh": "就像我提到的，這代表使用 React 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.166,
          "end": 39.1,
          "en": "we defined the desired target state",
          "zh": "我們定義了想要的目標狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.1,
          "end": 41.166,
          "en": "and React is then responsible",
          "zh": "接著由 React 負責"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.166,
          "end": 45.2,
          "en": "for generating and running the actual DOM instructions",
          "zh": "產生並執行實際的 DOM 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.2,
          "end": 48.866,
          "en": "which update what's visible on the screen.",
          "zh": "這些指令會更新螢幕上顯示的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.866,
          "end": 50.566,
          "en": "And we can see this here.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡看到這一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.566,
          "end": 50.666,
          "en": "And we can see this here.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡看到這一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.666,
          "end": 54.333,
          "en": "This here is our desired target state.",
          "zh": "這裡這個就是我們想要的目標狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.333,
          "end": 58.733,
          "en": "We want to render a div with an h2 tag",
          "zh": "我們想要 render 一個帶有 h2 標籤的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.733,
          "end": 62.6,
          "en": "with this text inside of it on our screen.",
          "zh": "在裡面放著這段文字，並顯示在我們的畫面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.6,
          "end": 66.166,
          "en": "Because in index.js, we rendered as App component,",
          "zh": "因為在 index.js 中，我們 render 了 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.166,
          "end": 66.233,
          "en": "Because in index.js, we rendered as App component,",
          "zh": "因為在 index.js 中，我們 render 了 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.233,
          "end": 69.833,
          "en": "this custom App HTML element, you could say,",
          "zh": "可以說就是這個自訂的 App HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.833,
          "end": 71.866,
          "en": "and inside of this custom element,",
          "zh": "而在這個自訂元素裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.866,
          "end": 73.766,
          "en": "which turns out just to be a function,",
          "zh": "結果它其實只是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.766,
          "end": 76.3,
          "en": "more on that in a second, inside of that,",
          "zh": "這點我等一下會再說明，在這個元素裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.3,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "we in the end just return this HTML code.",
          "zh": "我們最後只是回傳這段 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 80.866,
          "en": "So therefore ultimately,",
          "zh": "所以最終來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.866,
          "end": 85.26599999999999,
          "en": "it's this HTML code which is rendered on the screen",
          "zh": "真正被 render 到畫面上的就是這段 HTML 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.26599999999999,
          "end": 88.233,
          "en": "and that's indeed what we're seeing here.",
          "zh": "而這正是我們在這裡看到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.233,
          "end": 90.666,
          "en": "Now let's tweak this code a little bit.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們稍微調整一下這段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.666,
          "end": 90.8,
          "en": "Now let's tweak this code a little bit.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們稍微調整一下這段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.8,
          "end": 94.833,
          "en": "And here in App.js, in this function, in this returned",
          "zh": "在 App.js 這裡，在這個函式裡，在這個回傳的"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.833,
          "end": 99,
          "en": "HTML block here, let's add a paragraph,",
          "zh": "HTML 區塊中，讓我們加一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99,
          "end": 103.733,
          "en": "where we maybe just say, \"This is also visible\".",
          "zh": "裡面也許就寫：「This is also visible」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.733,
          "end": 106.46600000000001,
          "en": "If you add this and save this file",
          "zh": "如果你加上這段並儲存這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.46600000000001,
          "end": 108.4,
          "en": "and you have this development server running,",
          "zh": "而且你的 development server 正在執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.4,
          "end": 111.666,
          "en": "which you should, it'll automatically pick up this change,",
          "zh": "這應該是有在跑的，它會自動抓到這個變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.666,
          "end": 114.43299999999999,
          "en": "it'll notice when this file changes,",
          "zh": "它會注意到這個檔案何時改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.43299999999999,
          "end": 114.5,
          "en": "it'll notice when this file changes,",
          "zh": "它會注意到這個檔案何時改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.5,
          "end": 118.2,
          "en": "and it will automatically update what you see on the page.",
          "zh": "並自動更新你在頁面上看到的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.2,
          "end": 118.233,
          "en": "and it will automatically update what you see on the page.",
          "zh": "並自動更新你在頁面上看到的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.233,
          "end": 120.9,
          "en": "And therefore, we now also see this text here,",
          "zh": "因此，我們現在也會在這裡看到這段文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.9,
          "end": 122.43299999999999,
          "en": "this paragraph.",
          "zh": "也就是這個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.43299999999999,
          "end": 124.93299999999999,
          "en": "So that's how we can work with that.",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們操作它的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.93299999999999,
          "end": 125,
          "en": "So that's how we can work with that.",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們操作它的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125,
          "end": 126.43299999999999,
          "en": "And we can, just to find it,",
          "zh": "而我們可以，只是為了確認一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.43299999999999,
          "end": 128.633,
          "en": "we wanna have a paragraph here.",
          "zh": "我們想要在這裡有一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 128.633,
          "end": 128.86599999999999,
          "en": "we wanna have a paragraph here.",
          "zh": "我們想要在這裡有一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.86599999999999,
          "end": 132.266,
          "en": "Now keep in mind, in regular JavaScript,",
          "zh": "現在請記住，在一般的 JavaScript 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.266,
          "end": 135.166,
          "en": "you would kind of select the element on the page.",
          "zh": "你會先去選取頁面上的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.166,
          "end": 138.766,
          "en": "For example, with document.getElementByID('root'),",
          "zh": "例如用 document.getElementById('root')，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138.766,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "as we we're doing it here, but then you would not be done.",
          "zh": "就像我們在這裡做的一樣，但這樣還沒結束。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 142.666,
          "en": "as we we're doing it here, but then you would not be done.",
          "zh": "就像我們在這裡做的一樣，但這樣還沒結束。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.666,
          "end": 144.9,
          "en": "If you then want to add a paragraph,",
          "zh": "如果你接著想加入一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 144.9,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "you either set the inner HTML content to something,",
          "zh": "你要嘛把 innerHTML 內容設成某個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 152.1,
          "en": "or you, first of all, create a new element",
          "zh": "要嘛先建立一個新元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 155.6,
          "en": "with document.createElement, creating a paragraph.",
          "zh": "用 document.createElement 建立一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.6,
          "end": 162.03300000000002,
          "en": "And then you got your paragraph here like this.",
          "zh": "然後你就會像這樣得到一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.03300000000002,
          "end": 162.3,
          "en": "And then you got your paragraph here like this.",
          "zh": "然後你就會像這樣得到一個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 162.3,
          "end": 167.733,
          "en": "And you would set the textContent to \"This is also visible\".",
          "zh": "接著你會把 textContent 設成「This is also visible」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.733,
          "end": 171.433,
          "en": "And then you would reach out to some place in the DOM",
          "zh": "然後你會去觸及 DOM 中的某個位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.433,
          "end": 171.566,
          "en": "And then you would reach out to some place in the DOM",
          "zh": "然後你會去觸及 DOM 中的某個位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 171.566,
          "end": 175.6,
          "en": "and then simply call append or appendChild",
          "zh": "接著就單純呼叫 append 或 appendChild，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.6,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "and add this created paragraph.",
          "zh": "把這個建立好的段落加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 178.666,
          "en": "and add this created paragraph.",
          "zh": "把這個建立好的段落加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.666,
          "end": 182.5,
          "en": "That is how you would do it in regular JavaScript.",
          "zh": "這就是你在一般 JavaScript 中會用的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.5,
          "end": 182.766,
          "en": "That is how you would do it in regular JavaScript.",
          "zh": "這就是你在一般 JavaScript 中會用的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 182.766,
          "end": 185.36599999999999,
          "en": "And this is called imperative.",
          "zh": "而這就叫做命令式（imperative）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 185.36599999999999,
          "end": 188.666,
          "en": "This is following an imperative approach.",
          "zh": "這是遵循命令式的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 188.666,
          "end": 188.966,
          "en": "This is following an imperative approach.",
          "zh": "這是遵循命令式的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 188.966,
          "end": 191.9,
          "en": "Because you are giving clear instructions,",
          "zh": "因為你下達了明確的指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 191.9,
          "end": 194.433,
          "en": "clear step-by-step instructions,",
          "zh": "明確的逐步指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 194.433,
          "end": 198.333,
          "en": "what JavaScript and the browser should be doing.",
          "zh": "告訴 JavaScript 和瀏覽器該做什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.333,
          "end": 201.9,
          "en": "Now, this works, but it can get cumbersome,",
          "zh": "這樣做可行，但可能會變得很繁瑣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 201.9,
          "end": 204.966,
          "en": "or complex user interfaces with dozens",
          "zh": "對於有數十個"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.966,
          "end": 206.966,
          "en": "or hundreds of elements, which also might be changing",
          "zh": "或數百個元素的複雜使用者介面來說，而這些元素還可能不斷變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 206.966,
          "end": 208.36599999999999,
          "en": "or hundreds of elements, which also might be changing",
          "zh": "或數百個元素的複雜使用者介面來說，而這些元素還可能不斷變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.36599999999999,
          "end": 211.133,
          "en": "and appearing and disappearing all the time,",
          "zh": "不停出現又消失，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 211.133,
          "end": 215.733,
          "en": "having to write all these instructions is very cumbersome.",
          "zh": "必須寫下所有這些指令是非常繁瑣的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 215.733,
          "end": 219.733,
          "en": "With React instead, we just define the desired end state,",
          "zh": "改用 React 的話，我們只要定義想要的最終狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 219.733,
          "end": 222.833,
          "en": "that we want a div, an h2 tag, and a paragraph,",
          "zh": "也就是我們想要一個 div、一個 h2 標籤和一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 222.833,
          "end": 225.8,
          "en": "and React will then generate these instructions",
          "zh": "接著 React 就會產生這些指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.8,
          "end": 229.6,
          "en": "behind the scenes to bring that onto the screen.",
          "zh": "在背後運作，把這些內容帶到螢幕上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 229.6,
          "end": 232.733,
          "en": "That's how this works behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "這就是它在背後運作的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 232.733,
          "end": 235.7,
          "en": "Now I did mention, of course, that for all of that,",
          "zh": "當然，我先前也提過，為了做到這些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 235.7,
          "end": 239.166,
          "en": "React embraces this concept of components.",
          "zh": "React 採用了元件（component）這個概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 239.166,
          "end": 239.36599999999999,
          "en": "React embraces this concept of components.",
          "zh": "React 採用了元件（component）這個概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 239.36599999999999,
          "end": 241.166,
          "en": "And as I also already mentioned,",
          "zh": "而就像我也已經提過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 241.166,
          "end": 244.533,
          "en": "we do have our first component here, App.",
          "zh": "我們這裡確實有我們的第一個元件，也就是 App。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244.533,
          "end": 248.666,
          "en": "So this function in the end as it seems, in App.js,",
          "zh": "所以這個函式，看起來最終在 App.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 248.666,
          "end": 253.233,
          "en": "is a component which is used like a custom HTML element here",
          "zh": "就是一個元件，它在這裡被當成自訂 HTML 元素使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 253.233,
          "end": 255.466,
          "en": "in index.js.",
          "zh": "也就是在 index.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 255.466,
          "end": 255.733,
          "en": "in index.js.",
          "zh": "也就是在 index.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 255.733,
          "end": 257.2,
          "en": "Let's now build up on that",
          "zh": "現在讓我們以此為基礎繼續發展，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 257.2,
          "end": 260.8,
          "en": "and let's build our first custom component.",
          "zh": "來建立我們的第一個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 260.8,
          "end": 260.9,
          "en": "and let's build our first custom component.",
          "zh": "來建立我們的第一個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 260.9,
          "end": 264.6,
          "en": "And since we ultimately want to build that expense tracker,",
          "zh": "既然我們最終想建立那個 expense tracker，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 264.6,
          "end": 267.166,
          "en": "let's also build our first component",
          "zh": "也讓我們建立我們的第一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 267.166,
          "end": 269.8,
          "en": "in the context of this expense tracker.",
          "zh": "而且是在這個 expense tracker 的情境下。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595420",
      "title": "Building a First Custom Component",
      "sourceHash": "4c68068eb235268786d706b6a0bad6fbb0d28a2e3d80d385e39a989993e88385",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 5.833,
          "en": "Maximilian: Now to work towards this expense tracker,",
          "zh": "Maximilian：現在，為了朝這個 expense tracker 前進，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.833,
          "end": 10.433,
          "en": "let's again think about the kind of components we got there.",
          "zh": "讓我們再次想想我們在那裡有哪些種類的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.433,
          "end": 10.7,
          "en": "let's again think about the kind of components we got there.",
          "zh": "讓我們再次想想我們在那裡有哪些種類的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.7,
          "end": 12.833,
          "en": "And you might remember that in the end,",
          "zh": "你可能還記得，到最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.833,
          "end": 16.9,
          "en": "we were able to split up this simple looking application",
          "zh": "我們能把這個看起來很簡單的應用程式拆分成"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.9,
          "end": 19.233,
          "en": "into a bunch of Components.",
          "zh": "一堆元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.233,
          "end": 19.4,
          "en": "into a bunch of Components.",
          "zh": "一堆元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.4,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "In the chart, we had the individual chart bars,",
          "zh": "在圖表中，我們有各個圖表長條，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "we had the individual expense items,",
          "zh": "我們有各個支出項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 24.966,
          "en": "we had the individual expense items,",
          "zh": "我們有各個支出項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.966,
          "end": 27.766,
          "en": "we had the form for adding a new expense",
          "zh": "我們有新增支出的表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.766,
          "end": 30.1,
          "en": "and therefore we get a bunch of Components",
          "zh": "因此我們得到一堆元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.1,
          "end": 33.366,
          "en": "and a bunch of Components we could get started with.",
          "zh": "以及一堆我們可以開始著手的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.366,
          "end": 36.666,
          "en": "Now, I don't we get started with the expense item though.",
          "zh": "不過，我想我們就先從 expense item 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.666,
          "end": 39.7,
          "en": "So this row where we have the title and the amount",
          "zh": "也就是這一列，我們有標題、金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.7,
          "end": 39.933,
          "en": "and the date of an expense.",
          "zh": "以及支出的日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.933,
          "end": 42.133,
          "en": "and the date of an expense.",
          "zh": "以及支出的日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.133,
          "end": 45.9,
          "en": "And therefore we now wanna build our first own Component.",
          "zh": "因此我們現在要建立我們第一個自己的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.9,
          "end": 48.433,
          "en": "Now we could add it here in App JS,",
          "zh": "我們可以把它加在這裡的 App.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.433,
          "end": 48.533,
          "en": "Now we could add it here in App JS,",
          "zh": "我們可以把它加在這裡的 App.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.533,
          "end": 51.833,
          "en": "but it is considered a good and best practice",
          "zh": "但這被認為是良好且最佳的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.833,
          "end": 56.233,
          "en": "to actually put new Components into new files,",
          "zh": "也就是真的把新的元件放進新檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.233,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "so that you have one file per Component.",
          "zh": "這樣每個元件就有一個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 59.3,
          "en": "so that you have one file per Component.",
          "zh": "這樣每個元件就有一個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.3,
          "end": 61.966,
          "en": "And that will mean that in a React project",
          "zh": "這也代表在一個 React 專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.966,
          "end": 65,
          "en": "you will end up with dozens or hundreds of files",
          "zh": "你最後會有數十個或數百個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65,
          "end": 67.233,
          "en": "because on React project you'll have dozens",
          "zh": "因為在 React 專案中，你會有數十個"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.233,
          "end": 69.133,
          "en": "or hundreds of Components in the end",
          "zh": "或數百個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 69.133,
          "end": 71.466,
          "en": "and that's absolutely normal.",
          "zh": "而這完全正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 71.466,
          "end": 71.93299999999999,
          "en": "and that's absolutely normal.",
          "zh": "而這完全正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 71.93299999999999,
          "end": 74.166,
          "en": "Now to organize our source code a little bit",
          "zh": "現在，為了稍微整理一下我們的原始碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.166,
          "end": 78.43299999999999,
          "en": "here in the source folder, I'll add a Components folder,",
          "zh": "在這裡的 source 資料夾中，我會新增一個 Components 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 78.43299999999999,
          "end": 82.033,
          "en": "which will hold all these Components source files.",
          "zh": "它會存放所有這些元件的原始碼檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 82.033,
          "end": 82.366,
          "en": "which will hold all these Components source files.",
          "zh": "它會存放所有這些元件的原始碼檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 82.366,
          "end": 85.066,
          "en": "Now I will not move App JS in there",
          "zh": "我不會把 App.js 移進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 85.066,
          "end": 88.033,
          "en": "because this app Component will be a special",
          "zh": "因為這個 App 元件會是一個特別的"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.033,
          "end": 89.7,
          "en": "kind of Component.",
          "zh": "元件種類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 89.93299999999999,
          "en": "kind of Component.",
          "zh": "元件種類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 89.93299999999999,
          "end": 93.26599999999999,
          "en": "Not regarding its code, that will be the same code",
          "zh": "不是就它的程式碼而言，那會是相同的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 93.26599999999999,
          "end": 95.5,
          "en": "as you see it in all the other Components,",
          "zh": "就像你在其他所有元件中看到的一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 95.5,
          "end": 98.76599999999999,
          "en": "but regarding its role in the application.",
          "zh": "而是就它在應用程式中的角色而言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 98.76599999999999,
          "end": 101.96600000000001,
          "en": "It will be our so-called, root Component,",
          "zh": "它會是我們所謂的 root 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 101.96600000000001,
          "end": 104.8,
          "en": "which means it's the main Component being rendered here",
          "zh": "意思是它是這裡被 render 的主要元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 104.8,
          "end": 108.066,
          "en": "in our starting file in index JS.",
          "zh": "在我們的起始檔案 index.js 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.066,
          "end": 108.233,
          "en": "in our starting file in index JS.",
          "zh": "在我們的起始檔案 index.js 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 108.233,
          "end": 111.8,
          "en": "And all our Components will be either nested",
          "zh": "而我們所有的元件要不是被嵌套"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 111.8,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "inside of App JS or nested inside of our Components",
          "zh": "在 App.js 裡面，就是嵌套在我們的元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 119.3,
          "en": "which then in turn again, are nested somewhere else.",
          "zh": "而這些元件又會再嵌套在其他地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 119.3,
          "end": 119.63300000000001,
          "en": "which then in turn again, are nested somewhere else.",
          "zh": "而這些元件又會再嵌套在其他地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 119.63300000000001,
          "end": 122.5,
          "en": "Because ultimately with React,",
          "zh": "因為最終使用 React 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 122.5,
          "end": 125.766,
          "en": "we build a Component Tree, you could say.",
          "zh": "可以說我們建立的是一棵元件樹（Component Tree）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.766,
          "end": 126.066,
          "en": "we build a Component Tree, you could say.",
          "zh": "可以說我們建立的是一棵元件樹（Component Tree）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 126.066,
          "end": 128.933,
          "en": "You have two main app Component at the top,",
          "zh": "最上面是你的主要 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 128.933,
          "end": 131,
          "en": "and then below that, you could have any other",
          "zh": "而在它下面，你可以有各種其他的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 131,
          "end": 134,
          "en": "kinds of custom HTML elements.",
          "zh": "自訂 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 134,
          "end": 134.033,
          "en": "kinds of custom HTML elements.",
          "zh": "自訂 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 134.033,
          "end": 136.966,
          "en": "So, other kinds of Components, which in the end",
          "zh": "也就是其他種類的元件，它們最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 136.966,
          "end": 140,
          "en": "hold other pieces of the user interface.",
          "zh": "乘載使用者介面的其他部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 140,
          "end": 140.266,
          "en": "hold other pieces of the user interface.",
          "zh": "乘載使用者介面的其他部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 140.266,
          "end": 142.833,
          "en": "And big application stare for, of course",
          "zh": "而大型應用程式因此當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 142.833,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "can result in quite big Component Trees",
          "zh": "可能導致相當大的元件樹，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 146.03300000000002,
          "en": "can result in quite big Component Trees",
          "zh": "可能導致相當大的元件樹，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 146.03300000000002,
          "end": 149.9,
          "en": "where only the top most Component is rendered directly",
          "zh": "其中只有最上層的元件會直接被 render"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 149.9,
          "end": 151.666,
          "en": "into the HTML page,",
          "zh": "到 HTML 頁面中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 151.666,
          "end": 156.733,
          "en": "with help of that React dom render instruction.",
          "zh": "借助那條 React DOM render 指令。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 156.733,
          "end": 159.03300000000002,
          "en": "All the other Components will not be rendered",
          "zh": "所有其他元件不會被 render"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 159.03300000000002,
          "end": 162.066,
          "en": "with this instruction but instead will be used",
          "zh": "用這條指令，而是會被當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 162.066,
          "end": 166.733,
          "en": "as regular HTML elements inside of our HTML code,",
          "zh": "一般 HTML 元素使用，在我們的 HTML 程式碼中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 166.733,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "inside of our Components.",
          "zh": "在我們的元件裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 171.86599999999999,
          "en": "But you'll see that all in action in a second.",
          "zh": "但你馬上就會看到這一切實際運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 171.86599999999999,
          "end": 175.233,
          "en": "So instead of the Components folder, I'll add a new file,",
          "zh": "所以在 Components 資料夾裡，我會新增一個新檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 175.233,
          "end": 175.53300000000002,
          "en": "So instead of the Components folder, I'll add a new file,",
          "zh": "所以在 Components 資料夾裡，我會新增一個新檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 175.53300000000002,
          "end": 176.933,
          "en": "and I'm using shortcuts here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡用的是快速鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 176.933,
          "end": 178.733,
          "en": "you can also use these buttons, of course,",
          "zh": "你當然也可以使用這些按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 178.733,
          "end": 180.933,
          "en": "for adding folders and files.",
          "zh": "來新增資料夾和檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 180.933,
          "end": 184.166,
          "en": "And I'll add a new file here, which I will name,",
          "zh": "我會在這裡新增一個新檔案，我要把它命名為"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 184.166,
          "end": 187.933,
          "en": "expense item dot JS, because this will hold",
          "zh": "expense-item.js，因為它會存放"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 187.933,
          "end": 190.633,
          "en": "my expense item Component.",
          "zh": "我的 expense item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 190.633,
          "end": 192.966,
          "en": "Now, one word about the fall name.",
          "zh": "現在，關於檔名說幾句話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 192.966,
          "end": 195.86599999999999,
          "en": "Here again, you are generally free",
          "zh": "這裡同樣，你基本上可以自由"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 195.86599999999999,
          "end": 199.3,
          "en": "to name this however you want, but it's a common convention",
          "zh": "隨意命名，但常見的慣例"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 199.3,
          "end": 202.933,
          "en": "in React applications to name it like this.",
          "zh": "在 React 應用程式中就是這樣命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 202.933,
          "end": 203.166,
          "en": "in React applications to name it like this.",
          "zh": "在 React 應用程式中就是這樣命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 203.166,
          "end": 206.86599999999999,
          "en": "Starting with a capital character, one word,",
          "zh": "以大寫字母開頭，一個單字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 206.86599999999999,
          "end": 210.333,
          "en": "where if you combine multiple words in one word,",
          "zh": "如果你把多個單字組合成一個單字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 210.333,
          "end": 210.36599999999999,
          "en": "where if you combine multiple words in one word,",
          "zh": "如果你把多個單字組合成一個單字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 210.36599999999999,
          "end": 213.066,
          "en": "every sub word, so to say,",
          "zh": "可以說每個子單字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 213.066,
          "end": 218.1,
          "en": "starts with a new capital character like the I here in item.",
          "zh": "都會以大寫字母開頭，就像 item 裡的 I 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 218.1,
          "end": 218.4,
          "en": "starts with a new capital character like the I here in item.",
          "zh": "都會以大寫字母開頭，就像 item 裡的 I 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 218.4,
          "end": 221,
          "en": "And then inside of this Component,",
          "zh": "然後在這個元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 221,
          "end": 222.666,
          "en": "if the file is named like this,",
          "zh": "如果檔案是這樣命名的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 222.666,
          "end": 225.1,
          "en": "you'll of course should have a Component",
          "zh": "你當然應該要有一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 225.1,
          "end": 229.266,
          "en": "that is dealing with rendering expense item data.",
          "zh": "負責 render 支出項目的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 229.266,
          "end": 229.466,
          "en": "that is dealing with rendering expense item data.",
          "zh": "負責 render 支出項目的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 229.466,
          "end": 233.466,
          "en": "So that the file name tells us which kind of logic",
          "zh": "這樣檔名就會告訴我們，什麼樣的邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 233.466,
          "end": 238.733,
          "en": "and HTML code will live inside of that file.",
          "zh": "和 HTML 程式碼會放在那個檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 238.733,
          "end": 241.466,
          "en": "So now let's write the concrete Component code",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們在這個新檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 241.466,
          "end": 242.9,
          "en": "in that new file.",
          "zh": "寫下具體的元件程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 242.9,
          "end": 243.366,
          "en": "in that new file.",
          "zh": "寫下具體的元件程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 243.366,
          "end": 246.066,
          "en": "And of course that means that we now finally",
          "zh": "而這當然代表我們現在終於"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 246.066,
          "end": 250.2,
          "en": "have to understand what Component code is.",
          "zh": "得了解元件程式碼是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 250.2,
          "end": 253.033,
          "en": "How is a Component written in React?",
          "zh": "在 React 中，元件是怎麼寫的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 253.033,
          "end": 255.2,
          "en": "Well, we already saw it in App JS.",
          "zh": "我們已經在 App.js 中看過了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 255.2,
          "end": 257.7,
          "en": "It's just a function.",
          "zh": "它就只是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 257.7,
          "end": 261.866,
          "en": "And that is a key takeaway, that is super important,",
          "zh": "而這是一個關鍵重點，非常重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 261.866,
          "end": 263.9,
          "en": "definitely keep that in mind.",
          "zh": "請務必記住這一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 263.9,
          "end": 264.33299999999997,
          "en": "definitely keep that in mind.",
          "zh": "請務必記住這一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 264.33299999999997,
          "end": 270.233,
          "en": "A Component in React is just a JavaScript function.",
          "zh": "在 React 中，一個元件就只是一個 JavaScript 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 270.233,
          "end": 270.966,
          "en": "A Component in React is just a JavaScript function.",
          "zh": "在 React 中，一個元件就只是一個 JavaScript 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 270.966,
          "end": 275.5,
          "en": "A special kind of function special regarding what it returns",
          "zh": "一種特別的函式，特別之處在於它回傳什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 275.5,
          "end": 280.033,
          "en": "that it does return this JSX code, but other than that,",
          "zh": "它確實會回傳 JSX 程式碼，但除此之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 280.033,
          "end": 284.6,
          "en": "it's just a Java script function.",
          "zh": "它就只是一個 JavaScript 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 284.6,
          "end": 286.06600000000003,
          "en": "Therefore, if we wanna create",
          "zh": "因此，如果我們想建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 286.06600000000003,
          "end": 290.133,
          "en": "an expense item Component here, we add the function keyword,",
          "zh": "一個 expense item 元件，我們加上 function 關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 290.133,
          "end": 292.666,
          "en": "give it any name of our choice, though again,",
          "zh": "給它任何我們選擇的名稱，但同樣地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 292.666,
          "end": 295.433,
          "en": "the convention is to repeat the file name here",
          "zh": "慣例是這裡重複使用檔名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 295.433,
          "end": 299.366,
          "en": "just without the extension, so expense item.",
          "zh": "只是不加副檔名，所以是 expense item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 299.366,
          "end": 299.633,
          "en": "just without the extension, so expense item.",
          "zh": "只是不加副檔名，所以是 expense item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 299.633,
          "end": 306.133,
          "en": "And then in here we return the HTML code, the JSX code,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡我們回傳 HTML 程式碼，也就是 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 306.133,
          "end": 310.866,
          "en": "which should be brought onto the screen by this Component.",
          "zh": "這些程式碼應該由這個元件帶到螢幕上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 310.866,
          "end": 313.9,
          "en": "So for the moment I'll add an h2 tag here",
          "zh": "所以目前我會在這裡加一個 h2 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 313.9,
          "end": 318.1,
          "en": "and say expense item in there.",
          "zh": "在裡面寫上 expense item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 318.1,
          "end": 324.1,
          "en": "Now that's our first very basic custom made Component.",
          "zh": "這就是我們第一個非常基本的自製元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 324.1,
          "end": 326.9,
          "en": "And of course it's quite similar to the app Component",
          "zh": "它當然和 App 元件相當類似，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 326.9,
          "end": 330.133,
          "en": "which I gave to you, because in the end,",
          "zh": "也就是我給你的那個，因為最終來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 330.133,
          "end": 332.4,
          "en": "all Components are similar.",
          "zh": "所有元件都很類似。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 332.4,
          "end": 332.6,
          "en": "all Components are similar.",
          "zh": "所有元件都很類似。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 332.6,
          "end": 337.6,
          "en": "Components are just functions which then return HTML code.",
          "zh": "元件就只是函式，然後回傳 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 337.6,
          "end": 341.233,
          "en": "And of course the HTML code do you do return in a Component",
          "zh": "當然，你在元件中會回傳的 HTML 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 341.233,
          "end": 345.1,
          "en": "depends on what the Components should render on the screen.",
          "zh": "取決於這個元件應該在螢幕上 render 什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 345.1,
          "end": 345.3,
          "en": "depends on what the Components should render on the screen.",
          "zh": "取決於這個元件應該在螢幕上 render 什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 345.3,
          "end": 348.733,
          "en": "Of course, that's not our final HTML code",
          "zh": "當然，這不是我們最後的 HTML 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 348.733,
          "end": 351.166,
          "en": "for this kind of Component.",
          "zh": "這種元件的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 351.166,
          "end": 354.733,
          "en": "Now to use this Component, we need to export it.",
          "zh": "現在，要使用這個元件，我們需要 export 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 354.733,
          "end": 354.966,
          "en": "Now to use this Component, we need to export it.",
          "zh": "現在，要使用這個元件，我們需要 export 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 354.966,
          "end": 357.5,
          "en": "Otherwise it's only usable inside of that file",
          "zh": "否則它只能在該檔案內使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 357.5,
          "end": 359.666,
          "en": "and that's not helpful to us.",
          "zh": "這對我們沒有幫助。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 359.666,
          "end": 363.066,
          "en": "So, we add an export statement which in JavaScript",
          "zh": "所以我們加上一個 export 陳述式，在 JavaScript 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 363.066,
          "end": 364.866,
          "en": "simply looks like this.",
          "zh": "就長這個樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 364.866,
          "end": 365.233,
          "en": "simply looks like this.",
          "zh": "就長這個樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 365.233,
          "end": 371.433,
          "en": "We export this function as the default for this file.",
          "zh": "我們把這個函式作為這個檔案的預設匯出（default export）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 371.433,
          "end": 374.2,
          "en": "Now we can import it in another file.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在另一個檔案中 import 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 374.2,
          "end": 376.83299999999997,
          "en": "And as I mentioned, we're not going to import it",
          "zh": "而就像我提到的，我們不會把它 import"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 376.83299999999997,
          "end": 380.566,
          "en": "in index JS, and we're not going to render it like this,",
          "zh": "到 index.js 裡，也不會像這樣 render 它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 380.566,
          "end": 384.366,
          "en": "because we only do this once for our root Component.",
          "zh": "因為我們只會為 root 元件做一次這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 384.366,
          "end": 387.666,
          "en": "Instead, I now wanna use my custom Component here",
          "zh": "相反地，我現在想在這裡使用我的自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 387.666,
          "end": 392.266,
          "en": "like a regular HTML element, so like h2 element,",
          "zh": "就像一般 HTML 元素一樣，比如像 h2 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 392.266,
          "end": 397.233,
          "en": "inside of the HTML code written in the app Component here.",
          "zh": "在 App 元件這裡所寫的 HTML 程式碼裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 397.233,
          "end": 400.266,
          "en": "Hence at the top of the app JS file,",
          "zh": "因此在 App.js 檔案的頂部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 400.266,
          "end": 403.766,
          "en": "we should now import our accustomed Component.",
          "zh": "我們現在應該 import 我們的自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 403.766,
          "end": 404.1,
          "en": "we should now import our accustomed Component.",
          "zh": "我們現在應該 import 我們的自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 404.1,
          "end": 411.366,
          "en": "So we simply import expense item from dot slash Components,",
          "zh": "所以我們就 import expense item from './Components/'，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 411.366,
          "end": 413.433,
          "en": "we need to go into this Components folder,",
          "zh": "我們需要進到這個 Components 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 413.433,
          "end": 417.633,
          "en": "because that's where the file lives, slash expense item,",
          "zh": "因為檔案就在那裡，/expense item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 417.633,
          "end": 420.766,
          "en": "and then without the extension.",
          "zh": "然後不加副檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 420.766,
          "end": 424.133,
          "en": "This path in the end tells JavaScript",
          "zh": "這個路徑最終告訴 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 424.133,
          "end": 426.566,
          "en": "that we're looking for expense item file",
          "zh": "我們要找的是 expense item 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 426.566,
          "end": 431.2,
          "en": "in a Components folder which sits next to this app JS file",
          "zh": "它位於與這個 App.js 檔案同層的 Components 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 431.2,
          "end": 434.933,
          "en": "in which we have does import statement.",
          "zh": "而我們就是在這個檔案裡寫下這個 import 陳述式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 434.933,
          "end": 437.83299999999997,
          "en": "Now that this is imported, the cool thing is",
          "zh": "現在既然它被 import 進來了，最棒的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 437.83299999999997,
          "end": 441.9,
          "en": "that we can just use this like an HTML element.",
          "zh": "我們可以直接把它當成 HTML 元素使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 441.9,
          "end": 442.1,
          "en": "that we can just use this like an HTML element.",
          "zh": "我們可以直接把它當成 HTML 元素使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 442.1,
          "end": 445.166,
          "en": "So we can, for example, replace this paragraph",
          "zh": "所以我們可以，例如，把這個段落換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 445.166,
          "end": 449.4,
          "en": "with expense item like this opening and closing",
          "zh": "expense item，像這樣開頭和結尾"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 449.4,
          "end": 451.433,
          "en": "written like this.",
          "zh": "寫成這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 451.433,
          "end": 455.1,
          "en": "The key difference to the built in HTML elements",
          "zh": "與內建 HTML 元素的主要差別"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 455.1,
          "end": 458.633,
          "en": "just is that it's not starting with a lowercase character,",
          "zh": "就只是它不是以小寫字母開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 458.633,
          "end": 461.06600000000003,
          "en": "but with an uppercase character.",
          "zh": "而是以大寫字母開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 461.06600000000003,
          "end": 461.4,
          "en": "but with an uppercase character.",
          "zh": "而是以大寫字母開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 461.4,
          "end": 464.06600000000003,
          "en": "And indeed your own custom Components",
          "zh": "而確實，你自己的自訂元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 464.06600000000003,
          "end": 467.4,
          "en": "must start with an uppercase character",
          "zh": "必須以大寫字母開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 467.4,
          "end": 469.83299999999997,
          "en": "when you're using DOM JSX code like this,",
          "zh": "當你像這樣使用 JSX 程式碼時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 469.83299999999997,
          "end": 472.06600000000003,
          "en": "so that React is able to detect",
          "zh": "這樣 React 才能偵測到"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 472.06600000000003,
          "end": 474.4,
          "en": "that this is a custom Component.",
          "zh": "這是一個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 474.4,
          "end": 474.9,
          "en": "that this is a custom Component.",
          "zh": "這是一個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 474.9,
          "end": 477.733,
          "en": "Because the simple rule which React applies",
          "zh": "因為 React 套用的簡單規則"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 477.733,
          "end": 483.966,
          "en": "is that lowercase elements are built in HTML elements.",
          "zh": "就是小寫的元素是內建 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 483.966,
          "end": 484.033,
          "en": "is that lowercase elements are built in HTML elements.",
          "zh": "就是小寫的元素是內建 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 484.033,
          "end": 487.333,
          "en": "So it will look for them as built in elements.",
          "zh": "所以它會把它們當成內建元素來尋找。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 487.333,
          "end": 491.1,
          "en": "Whereas elements starting with an uppercase character",
          "zh": "而大寫字母開頭的元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 491.1,
          "end": 495.3,
          "en": "are elements defined by you or some other developer.",
          "zh": "則是由你或其他開發者定義的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 495.3,
          "end": 497.6,
          "en": "So this is a custom made Component",
          "zh": "所以這是自製的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 497.6,
          "end": 501.066,
          "en": "and we have to use the name which we use here in the import",
          "zh": "我們必須把在 import 這裡所用的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 501.066,
          "end": 502.966,
          "en": "as a name here, because that's how this connection",
          "zh": "當作這裡的名稱使用，因為這就是這個連結"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 502.966,
          "end": 504.766,
          "en": "as a name here, because that's how this connection",
          "zh": "當作這裡的名稱使用，因為這就是這個連結"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 504.766,
          "end": 505.866,
          "en": "is established.",
          "zh": "建立起來的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 505.866,
          "end": 508.6,
          "en": "This tells React that we want to use this Component",
          "zh": "這告訴 React 我們想使用這個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 508.6,
          "end": 510.8,
          "en": "which is imported under this name",
          "zh": "它以這個名稱被 import 進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 510.8,
          "end": 513.6659999999999,
          "en": "from the expense item file.",
          "zh": "來自 expense item 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 513.6659999999999,
          "end": 516.366,
          "en": "If we now save everything, all the files,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存全部，所有檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 516.366,
          "end": 518.6,
          "en": "and we go back to the browser,",
          "zh": "然後回到瀏覽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 518.6,
          "end": 522.466,
          "en": "we see expense items showing up here,",
          "zh": "我們會看到 expense items 出現在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 522.466,
          "end": 524.833,
          "en": "which of course is the H two tag rendered",
          "zh": "這當然就是那個 h2 標籤，由"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 524.833,
          "end": 527.566,
          "en": "by our own custom Component.",
          "zh": "我們自己的自訂元件 render 出來的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 527.566,
          "end": 530.8,
          "en": "Because we now created and imported",
          "zh": "因為我們現在建立、import 了"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 530.8,
          "end": 533.566,
          "en": "used this custom Component.",
          "zh": "並使用了這個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 533.566,
          "end": 533.7,
          "en": "used this custom Component.",
          "zh": "並使用了這個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 533.7,
          "end": 536.1,
          "en": "And it's always these steps.",
          "zh": "而流程永遠都是這些步驟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 536.1,
          "end": 539.3,
          "en": "You create a Component, which is in the end, just a function",
          "zh": "你建立一個元件，它最終就只是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 539.3,
          "end": 543.2,
          "en": "of returning some HTML code, you then export it.",
          "zh": "會回傳一些 HTML 程式碼，然後你把它 export。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 543.2,
          "end": 546.166,
          "en": "And then ultimately you import it in the file",
          "zh": "最後你在想使用它的檔案中 import 它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 546.166,
          "end": 549.633,
          "en": "where you wanna use it so that they're in the JSX code,",
          "zh": "這樣在 JSX 程式碼中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 549.633,
          "end": 553.133,
          "en": "you can use it like an HTML element,",
          "zh": "你就可以像 HTML 元素一樣使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 553.133,
          "end": 556.3,
          "en": "just starting with this uppercase character.",
          "zh": "只要以大寫字母開頭就行。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595422",
      "title": "Writing More Complex JSX Code",
      "sourceHash": "d8ad8c2d6108c4f7b7dcccaa60645264bc09dd30b809d50bfb70c49edc69c1e6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.266,
          "end": 3.566,
          "en": "Maximilian: Okay.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：好的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.566,
          "end": 7.1,
          "en": "So we created our first custom component.",
          "zh": "所以我們建立了第一個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.1,
          "end": 9.433,
          "en": "It's definitely not too exciting,",
          "zh": "它確實不太令人興奮，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.433,
          "end": 11.766,
          "en": "but it is a custom component",
          "zh": "但它是個自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.766,
          "end": 13.9,
          "en": "and we're using it in app JS.",
          "zh": "而且我們在 App.js 裡使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.9,
          "end": 16.833,
          "en": "Now let's make it a bit more exciting at least.",
          "zh": "現在，我們至少讓它有趣一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.833,
          "end": 17.533,
          "en": "Now let's make it a bit more exciting at least.",
          "zh": "現在，我們至少讓它有趣一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.533,
          "end": 18.366,
          "en": "And for that",
          "zh": "而要這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.366,
          "end": 20.233,
          "en": "and the expense item JS file.",
          "zh": "我們來看 ExpenseItem.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.233,
          "end": 22.333,
          "en": "I wanna tweak the HTML code,",
          "zh": "我想調整一下 HTML 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.333,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "which is being returned here.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡回傳的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "Let's say I expense items should not just be, some title,",
          "zh": "假設支出項目不該只有一個標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 31.533,
          "en": "but we all wanna display the amount",
          "zh": "而是還想顯示這筆支出"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.533,
          "end": 32.733,
          "en": "of this expense.",
          "zh": "的金額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.733,
          "end": 34.966,
          "en": "And then also the date.",
          "zh": "然後還要顯示日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.966,
          "end": 37.4,
          "en": "So therefore we wanna write HTML code,",
          "zh": "所以我們想寫 HTML 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.4,
          "end": 39.566,
          "en": "which nicely displays",
          "zh": "能好好顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.566,
          "end": 44.3,
          "en": "and structures these three pieces of information.",
          "zh": "並組織這三項資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.3,
          "end": 45.566,
          "en": "Hence here, we could say",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們可以說"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.566,
          "end": 48.833,
          "en": "that we wanted to have a div HTML element,",
          "zh": "我們想要一個 div HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.833,
          "end": 51.933,
          "en": "which displays the date, later.",
          "zh": "之後用來顯示日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.933,
          "end": 54.166,
          "en": "And for the moment I'll just put date here,",
          "zh": "而目前我就先在這裡放上 date，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.166,
          "end": 55.833,
          "en": "as a placeholder.",
          "zh": "當作佔位符。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 55.833,
          "end": 57.866,
          "en": "And then next to that div,",
          "zh": "然後在那個 div 旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 57.866,
          "end": 60.866,
          "en": "I'll have, let's say another div,",
          "zh": "我會放，比如說，另一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 60.866,
          "end": 64.166,
          "en": "which actually should display, the title.",
          "zh": "它實際上應該顯示標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.166,
          "end": 66.9,
          "en": "Let's say inside of a H two tag title,",
          "zh": "比如說，把標題放在 h2 標籤裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.9,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "Let's say inside of a H two tag title,",
          "zh": "比如說，把標題放在 h2 標籤裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 71.466,
          "en": "and then also,",
          "zh": "然後還有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 71.466,
          "end": 74.2,
          "en": "another div, next to the title,",
          "zh": "標題旁邊再加一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 74.2,
          "end": 75.766,
          "en": "with the amount.",
          "zh": "裡面放金額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.766,
          "end": 78.5,
          "en": "Now you can see this is getting unreadable,",
          "zh": "現在你可以看到，這變得難以閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 78.5,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "but even worse.",
          "zh": "但更糟的是，"
