        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 305.5,
          "end": 309.2,
          "en": "They should not just have some HTML code which is ugly.",
          "zh": "它們不應該只有一些醜醜的 HTML 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 309.2,
          "end": 310.566,
          "en": "So let's now have a look at,",
          "zh": "所以我們現在來看看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 310.566,
          "end": 313.133,
          "en": "how we can add some basic styling here.",
          "zh": "如何在這裡加上一些基本的樣式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595426",
      "title": "Adding Basic CSS Styling",
      "sourceHash": "63c2593f77de78243c8425649d2844f271cee81d6ef7513e758589104eb0e106",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 3.366,
          "en": "Instructor: Now regarding the styling",
          "zh": "講師：現在來談樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.366,
          "end": 7.866,
          "en": "of our components, we still use CSS,",
          "zh": "對我們的元件來說，我們依然使用 CSS，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.866,
          "end": 10.533,
          "en": "but there is nothing too React specific",
          "zh": "但並沒有太多 React 特有的東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.533,
          "end": 13.2,
          "en": "when it comes to that CSS code.",
          "zh": "就那份 CSS 程式碼而言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.2,
          "end": 13.633,
          "en": "when it comes to that CSS code.",
          "zh": "就那份 CSS 程式碼而言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.633,
          "end": 16.433,
          "en": "In the end, we can just add a new CSS file.",
          "zh": "到頭來，我們只要新增一個 CSS 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.433,
          "end": 20.266,
          "en": "And typically for the CSS code of a given component",
          "zh": "而通常，針對某個元件的 CSS 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.266,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "you add that file next to the component JavaScript file",
          "zh": "你會把那個檔案放在元件 JavaScript 檔案旁邊"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 29.866,
          "en": "and that would be the ExpenseItem.CSS file here.",
          "zh": "而在這裡就會是 ExpenseItem.CSS 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.866,
          "end": 32.8,
          "en": "Then you want to write your CSS code in there",
          "zh": "接著你會想在裡面寫你的 CSS 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.8,
          "end": 35.033,
          "en": "but since this is no CSS course,",
          "zh": "但因為這不是 CSS 課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.033,
          "end": 38.266,
          "en": "I don't want to bore you with writing a lot of CSS code",
          "zh": "我不想寫一大堆 CSS 程式碼讓你覺得無聊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.266,
          "end": 40.733,
          "en": "and hence you attached find a finished",
          "zh": "因此，附件中你可以找到一份完成的"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.733,
          "end": 43.4,
          "en": "ExpenseItem.CSS file, which you can simply download",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem.CSS 檔案，你可以直接下載"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.4,
          "end": 44.566,
          "en": "ExpenseItem.CSS file, which you can simply download",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem.CSS 檔案，你可以直接下載"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.566,
          "end": 45.766,
          "en": "and use or simply download it, open it,",
          "zh": "並使用，或直接下載它、打開它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.766,
          "end": 48.2,
          "en": "and use or simply download it, open it,",
          "zh": "並使用，或直接下載它、打開它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.2,
          "end": 50.533,
          "en": "and copy the code you find in there",
          "zh": "然後複製你在裡面找到的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.533,
          "end": 55.866,
          "en": "into your ExpenseItem.CSS file.",
          "zh": "到你的 ExpenseItem.CSS 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.866,
          "end": 58.733,
          "en": "Now back in ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "現在回到 ExpenseItem.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.733,
          "end": 61.3,
          "en": "we need to do one important thing.",
          "zh": "我們需要做一件重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.3,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "we need to do one important thing.",
          "zh": "我們需要做一件重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 64.5,
          "en": "We need to make this overall build process",
          "zh": "我們需要讓整個建置流程"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 66.666,
          "en": "aware of that CSS file and tell it",
          "zh": "知道那個 CSS 檔案，並告訴它"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.666,
          "end": 67.766,
          "en": "aware of that CSS file and tell it",
          "zh": "知道那個 CSS 檔案，並告訴它"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.766,
          "end": 71.166,
          "en": "that the CSS code in there should be considered",
          "zh": "裡面的 CSS 程式碼應該被納入考量"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.166,
          "end": 74.9,
          "en": "and should be injected in the finished application",
          "zh": "並且應該被注入到最終的應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.9,
          "end": 75.266,
          "en": "and should be injected in the finished application",
          "zh": "並且應該被注入到最終的應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.266,
          "end": 80.2,
          "en": "because it's not by default browsing all your files",
          "zh": "因為它預設不會瀏覽你所有的檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.2,
          "end": 82.8,
          "en": "and automatically including everything,",
          "zh": "並自動把所有東西都包含進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 83.033,
          "en": "and automatically including everything,",
          "zh": "並自動把所有東西都包含進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.033,
          "end": 86.533,
          "en": "you explicitly have to tell React, you could say,",
          "zh": "你必須明確告訴 React，可以這麼說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.533,
          "end": 89.43299999999999,
          "en": "or that build process that a certain file",
          "zh": "或告訴那個建置流程，某個檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.43299999999999,
          "end": 90.93299999999999,
          "en": "should be considered.",
          "zh": "應該被納入考量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.93299999999999,
          "end": 93.1,
          "en": "For ExpenseItem.js, we did this",
          "zh": "對 ExpenseItem.js 來說，我們是透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.1,
          "end": 95.6,
          "en": "with this import and app JS.",
          "zh": "App.js 裡的這個 import 做到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.6,
          "end": 95.96600000000001,
          "en": "with this import and app JS.",
          "zh": "App.js 裡的這個 import 做到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.96600000000001,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "For expenseItem.CSS, we need to do that",
          "zh": "而對 ExpenseItem.CSS，我們得在"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 101.5,
          "en": "instead of ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem.js 檔案裡做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 101.5,
          "end": 101.833,
          "en": "instead of ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem.js 檔案裡做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 101.833,
          "end": 107.9,
          "en": "there we simply import ./ExpenseItem.CSS",
          "zh": "在那裡我們直接 import ./ExpenseItem.CSS，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 107.9,
          "end": 109.866,
          "en": "just like that.",
          "zh": "就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.866,
          "end": 112,
          "en": "This simply tells the build process",
          "zh": "這只是告訴建置流程"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 112,
          "end": 115.333,
          "en": "that the CSS files should be considered.",
          "zh": "這些 CSS 檔案應該被納入考量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.333,
          "end": 117.833,
          "en": "Now instead that CSS file, I in the end,",
          "zh": "而在那個 CSS 檔案裡，我最後"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.833,
          "end": 120.666,
          "en": "just prepared a bunch of CSS classes",
          "zh": "就準備了一些 CSS class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.666,
          "end": 120.733,
          "en": "just prepared a bunch of CSS classes",
          "zh": "就準備了一些 CSS class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 120.733,
          "end": 124.666,
          "en": "which can be added to elements to apply a certain look",
          "zh": "這些 class 可以加到元素上，套用特定的外觀"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.666,
          "end": 127.033,
          "en": "and they are, for now, on this HTML code",
          "zh": "而目前，它們要用在這份 HTML 程式碼上"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.033,
          "end": 129.633,
          "en": "in ExpenseItem in our component",
          "zh": "也就是我們元件裡的 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 129.633,
          "end": 133.233,
          "en": "we need to add these classes.",
          "zh": "我們需要加上這些 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.233,
          "end": 137.53300000000002,
          "en": "For example, on the wrapping div here.",
          "zh": "例如，就在這個包覆用的 div 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.53300000000002,
          "end": 139.6,
          "en": "Now there's one special thing here.",
          "zh": "這裡有一件特別的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 139.6,
          "end": 139.933,
          "en": "Now there's one special thing here.",
          "zh": "這裡有一件特別的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 139.933,
          "end": 145.466,
          "en": "We don't type class here as we would do in regular HTML,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡不寫 class，不像一般 HTML 那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.466,
          "end": 148.066,
          "en": "but instead className.",
          "zh": "而是寫 className。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.066,
          "end": 151.633,
          "en": "And this can be strange, but you have to keep in mind",
          "zh": "這可能有點奇怪，但你必須記住"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.633,
          "end": 155.933,
          "en": "that this here is not really HTML.",
          "zh": "這裡的東西其實不是真正的 HTML。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.933,
          "end": 156.066,
          "en": "that this here is not really HTML.",
          "zh": "這裡的東西其實不是真正的 HTML。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.066,
          "end": 159.066,
          "en": "It looks like HTML, but it's this special",
          "zh": "它看起來像 HTML，但其實是這種特別的"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 159.066,
          "end": 162.433,
          "en": "JSX syntex invented by the React team.",
          "zh": "由 React 團隊發明的 JSX 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.433,
          "end": 168.666,
          "en": "And in the end under the hood, it's still JavaScript code,",
          "zh": "而說到底，在底層它仍然是 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.666,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "that's why most attributes are the same, but not all.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼大多數屬性都一樣，但不是全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "that's why most attributes are the same, but not all.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼大多數屬性都一樣，但不是全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 177.333,
          "en": "And here the class attribute was renamed to className",
          "zh": "而在這裡，class 屬性被重新命名為 className"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.333,
          "end": 181.3,
          "en": "because class is a reserved word in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "因為 class 在 JavaScript 中是保留字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 181.3,
          "end": 182.733,
          "en": "Technically it would still work",
          "zh": "嚴格來說，它還是能運作"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.733,
          "end": 187,
          "en": "if you would use class here, but should use className.",
          "zh": "如果你在這裡寫 class，但你應該用 className。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187,
          "end": 191.1,
          "en": "Now here on this overall div, which wraps everything,",
          "zh": "現在，在這個包覆一切的整體 div 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.1,
          "end": 196,
          "en": "we then add the expense-item class here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡加上 expense-item 這個 class"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196,
          "end": 200.333,
          "en": "On this div, which holds our title and our amount,",
          "zh": "在這個裝著標題和金額的 div 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.333,
          "end": 200.733,
          "en": "On this div, which holds our title and our amount,",
          "zh": "在這個裝著標題和金額的 div 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.733,
          "end": 202.233,
          "en": "we add another of className,",
          "zh": "我們再加上一個 className，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.233,
          "end": 206.166,
          "en": "which is expense-item__.",
          "zh": "也就是 expense-item__。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 206.166,
          "end": 206.36599999999999,
          "en": "which is expense-item__.",
          "zh": "也就是 expense-item__。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 206.36599999999999,
          "end": 208.53300000000002,
          "en": "So here we got two underscores.",
          "zh": "這裡有兩個底線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 208.53300000000002,
          "end": 210.933,
          "en": "Description.",
          "zh": "Description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 210.933,
          "end": 213.86599999999999,
          "en": "And then here on that div with the amount",
          "zh": "然後，在這個有金額的 div 上"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 213.86599999999999,
          "end": 223.9,
          "en": "we simply add className and then expense-item__price.",
          "zh": "我們直接加上 className，然後是 expense-item__price。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.9,
          "end": 226.066,
          "en": "And if you now save everything,",
          "zh": "如果你現在全部儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.066,
          "end": 230.433,
          "en": "it should look like this, which is definitely nicer.",
          "zh": "它應該看起來像這樣，肯定好看多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.433,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "it should look like this, which is definitely nicer.",
          "zh": "它應該看起來像這樣，肯定好看多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 232.7,
          "en": "Still not the final look you want,",
          "zh": "還不是你想要的最終外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 232.7,
          "end": 234.6,
          "en": "but definitely nicer.",
          "zh": "但肯定好看多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.6,
          "end": 234.766,
          "en": "but definitely nicer.",
          "zh": "但肯定好看多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 234.766,
          "end": 237.066,
          "en": "By the way, I'm super zoomed in here",
          "zh": "順帶一提，我這裡放得很大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 237.066,
          "end": 238.53300000000002,
          "en": "to make this easier to read,",
          "zh": "讓它更容易閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 238.53300000000002,
          "end": 241.066,
          "en": "otherwise it would look something like this",
          "zh": "否則它會看起來像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 241.066,
          "end": 241.5,
          "en": "otherwise it would look something like this",
          "zh": "否則它會看起來像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 241.5,
          "end": 243.4,
          "en": "and that's definitely also not great,",
          "zh": "而那肯定也不太好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 243.4,
          "end": 245.766,
          "en": "but again, it's not the final look.",
          "zh": "但再次強調，這不是最終的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 245.766,
          "end": 247.2,
          "en": "Again, let me zoom in closer",
          "zh": "來，讓我再放大一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 247.2,
          "end": 250,
          "en": "so that we can better see that though.",
          "zh": "這樣我們可以看得更清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 250,
          "end": 252.7,
          "en": "Now that is how easy it is to add styling",
          "zh": "看吧，就是這麼簡單就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 252.7,
          "end": 254.566,
          "en": "to your React components though.",
          "zh": "為你的 React 元件加上樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 254.566,
          "end": 257.466,
          "en": "It's really not too fancy.",
          "zh": "其實真的沒什麼特別的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 257.466,
          "end": 257.733,
          "en": "It's really not too fancy.",
          "zh": "其實真的沒什麼特別的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 257.733,
          "end": 259.466,
          "en": "You have to be aware of the fact",
          "zh": "你必須意識到一件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 259.466,
          "end": 261.7,
          "en": "that it's className instead of class,",
          "zh": "這裡用的是 className 而不是 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 261.7,
          "end": 265.33299999999997,
          "en": "but other than that, it's really just standard",
          "zh": "但除此之外，真的就只是標準的"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 265.33299999999997,
          "end": 270.5,
          "en": "CSS code, which then is added to your elements.",
          "zh": "CSS 程式碼，然後加到你的元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 270.5,
          "end": 270.633,
          "en": "CSS code, which then is added to your elements.",
          "zh": "CSS 程式碼，然後加到你的元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 270.633,
          "end": 273,
          "en": "And in that CSS code, you can use",
          "zh": "而在那份 CSS 程式碼裡，你可以使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 273,
          "end": 275.233,
          "en": "all the selectors you might know,",
          "zh": "所有你可能知道的選擇器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 275.233,
          "end": 277.9,
          "en": "you're not limited to classes, but again,",
          "zh": "你不受限於 class，但還是那句，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 277.9,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "I don't want to turn that into a CSS course,",
          "zh": "我不想把它變成 CSS 課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 283.7,
          "en": "so we'll keep that fairly simple.",
          "zh": "所以我們會保持得相當簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 283.7,
          "end": 287.033,
          "en": "This import might be the strangest thing in the end",
          "zh": "說到底，這個 import 可能是最奇怪的部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 287.033,
          "end": 289,
          "en": "because that is needed to make",
          "zh": "因為它才能讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 289,
          "end": 292.33299999999997,
          "en": "this entire project aware of that CSS file.",
          "zh": "整個專案知道那個 CSS 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 292.33299999999997,
          "end": 295.5,
          "en": "And that's how we can style our components.",
          "zh": "這就是我們為元件加上樣式的方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595432",
      "title": "Outputting Dynamic Data & Working with Expressions in JSX",
      "sourceHash": "8eacb1634aaff11a2abbf7514f03d009405d5366c7256408c8a8c5fe6a1f49f9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.266,
          "end": 5.4,
          "en": "Maximilian: So now we know how to style our components.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：現在我們知道如何為元件加上樣式了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.4,
          "end": 7.433,
          "en": "And again, we're definitely not done here,",
          "zh": "再說一次，我們在這裡絕對還沒完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.433,
          "end": 11.5,
          "en": "this is not the final look I wanna have.",
          "zh": "這不是我想要的最終外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.5,
          "end": 15.5,
          "en": "But before we dig deeper into tweaking the final look",
          "zh": "但在我們更深入調整最終外觀"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.5,
          "end": 17.933,
          "en": "and adding more UI elements,",
          "zh": "並加入更多 UI 元素之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.933,
          "end": 21.8,
          "en": "let's think about one maybe obvious problem.",
          "zh": "讓我們想想一個或許很明顯的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.8,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "We will probably not just have one expense",
          "zh": "我們可能不會只有一筆支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 26.866,
          "en": "and definitely not an expense",
          "zh": "而且絕對不會是一筆"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.866,
          "end": 29.6,
          "en": "where the data is just hard coded",
          "zh": "資料只是寫死的支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.6,
          "end": 32.4,
          "en": "into the component as it is here.",
          "zh": "就寫在元件裡，像這裡這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 32.566,
          "en": "into the component as it is here.",
          "zh": "就寫在元件裡，像這裡這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.566,
          "end": 34.666,
          "en": "The date is hard coded here,",
          "zh": "日期在這裡是寫死的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.666,
          "end": 36.333,
          "en": "the title is hard coded, the amount is hard coded",
          "zh": "標題是寫死的，金額也是寫死的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.333,
          "end": 37.833,
          "en": "the title is hard coded, the amount is hard coded",
          "zh": "標題是寫死的，金額也是寫死的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.833,
          "end": 39.966,
          "en": "and it's the only expense we have.",
          "zh": "而且這是我們唯一的一筆支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.966,
          "end": 42.866,
          "en": "In our final tracker we wanna have",
          "zh": "在我們最終的追蹤器裡，我們希望有"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.866,
          "end": 46.266,
          "en": "an unlimited amount of expenses if we want to.",
          "zh": "如果我們想要的話，可以有無限多筆支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.266,
          "end": 46.433,
          "en": "an unlimited amount of expenses if we want to.",
          "zh": "如果我們想要的話，可以有無限多筆支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.433,
          "end": 50.766,
          "en": "We want to have multiple expense item components in action.",
          "zh": "我們希望有多個 expense item 元件一起運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.766,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "We want to have multiple expense item components in action.",
          "zh": "我們希望有多個 expense item 元件一起運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 51.866,
          "en": "And after all",
          "zh": "而且畢竟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.866,
          "end": 56.7,
          "en": "that is one of the core ideas behind components.",
          "zh": "這正是元件背後的核心概念之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 59.166,
          "en": "It's not just a separation of concerns,",
          "zh": "這不只是關注點的分離，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.166,
          "end": 62.5,
          "en": "it's also there reusability.",
          "zh": "它也在於可重複使用性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.5,
          "end": 64.566,
          "en": "We wanna define a component",
          "zh": "我們想要只定義一次元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.566,
          "end": 67.233,
          "en": "and its HTML code once",
          "zh": "和它的 HTML 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.233,
          "end": 70.766,
          "en": "and then we want to be able to reuse it.",
          "zh": "然後就能重複使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.766,
          "end": 72.266,
          "en": "And at the moment",
          "zh": "而目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.266,
          "end": 75.566,
          "en": "we're not able to do that.",
          "zh": "我們還做不到這一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.566,
          "end": 78.76599999999999,
          "en": "Therefore, that will be the next problem we'll work on.",
          "zh": "因此，那會是我們接下來要處理的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.76599999999999,
          "end": 80.9,
          "en": "But before we work on that",
          "zh": "但在我們處理那件事之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.9,
          "end": 84.1,
          "en": "there's another problem which we have to solve first.",
          "zh": "還有另一個問題我們必須先解決。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.1,
          "end": 86.066,
          "en": "And that's something I just mentioned,",
          "zh": "而那正是我剛剛提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.066,
          "end": 86.233,
          "en": "And that's something I just mentioned,",
          "zh": "而那正是我剛剛提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.233,
          "end": 91.93299999999999,
          "en": "that all that data is hard coded here in this JSX code.",
          "zh": "所有那些資料都寫死在這裡的這份 JSX 程式碼中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.93299999999999,
          "end": 92.1,
          "en": "that all that data is hard coded here in this JSX code.",
          "zh": "所有那些資料都寫死在這裡的這份 JSX 程式碼中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 92.1,
          "end": 97.13300000000001,
          "en": "This is unrealistic, some data may be hard coded sometimes",
          "zh": "這並不實際，有時候有些資料確實可能是寫死的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.13300000000001,
          "end": 99.3,
          "en": "but here for an expense item,",
          "zh": "但在這裡，對一筆支出項目來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 99.43299999999999,
          "en": "but here for an expense item,",
          "zh": "但在這裡，對一筆支出項目來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 99.43299999999999,
          "end": 101.5,
          "en": "something like the date and the title",
          "zh": "像日期、標題"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 101.5,
          "end": 105.5,
          "en": "and the amount would typically be dynamic,",
          "zh": "和金額這類的東西通常會是動態的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 105.5,
          "end": 108.366,
          "en": "which means it's not hard coded in the HTML code.",
          "zh": "意思是它並不是寫死在 HTML 程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 108.366,
          "end": 111.566,
          "en": "Instead we receive that data from somewhere,",
          "zh": "而是我們從某個地方接收這些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 111.566,
          "end": 112,
          "en": "Instead we receive that data from somewhere,",
          "zh": "而是我們從某個地方接收這些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112,
          "end": 115.9,
          "en": "for example from the user who entered it into a form",
          "zh": "例如來自使用者在表單裡輸入的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 115.9,
          "end": 119.2,
          "en": "and we then output it dynamically.",
          "zh": "然後我們再把它動態輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 119.2,
          "end": 122.866,
          "en": "Now for the moment we don't have the capabilities yet",
          "zh": "目前我們還沒有能力"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 122.866,
          "end": 124.666,
          "en": "to receive it from the user,",
          "zh": "從使用者那裡接收資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.666,
          "end": 127.466,
          "en": "but we can fake dynamic data",
          "zh": "但我們可以模擬動態資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.466,
          "end": 129.4,
          "en": "by at least adding more",
          "zh": "做法是至少加入更多"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 129.4,
          "end": 133.8,
          "en": "than just HTML code to this component.",
          "zh": "不只是 HTML 程式碼的東西到這個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.8,
          "end": 134,
          "en": "than just HTML code to this component.",
          "zh": "不只是 HTML 程式碼的東西到這個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 134,
          "end": 136.53300000000002,
          "en": "Because after all, we must not forget",
          "zh": "因為畢竟，我們不能忘記"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 136.53300000000002,
          "end": 140.03300000000002,
          "en": "that a component in React is just a function.",
          "zh": "React 裡的元件就只是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.03300000000002,
          "end": 142.6,
          "en": "And that earlier I mentioned",
          "zh": "而我先前提到過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 142.6,
          "end": 146.36599999999999,
          "en": "that components are the combination of HTML,",
          "zh": "元件是 HTML、"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 146.36599999999999,
          "end": 151.566,
          "en": "to some extent CSS and also JavaScript.",
          "zh": "某種程度上的 CSS，以及 JavaScript 的組合。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.566,
          "end": 154.266,
          "en": "Now we definitely see HTML in action.",
          "zh": "現在我們確實看到 HTML 在運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.266,
          "end": 157.03300000000002,
          "en": "We also saw some CSS being added",
          "zh": "我們也看到一些 CSS 被加入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 157.03300000000002,
          "end": 158.833,
          "en": "but where's the JavaScript?",
          "zh": "但 JavaScript 在哪裡呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 158.833,
          "end": 159.03300000000002,
          "en": "but where's the JavaScript?",
          "zh": "但 JavaScript 在哪裡呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 159.03300000000002,
          "end": 161.666,
          "en": "Other than that being a function.",
          "zh": "除了它是個函式這一點之外。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 161.666,
          "end": 164.7,
          "en": "Well, let's add some JavaScript code in that function",
          "zh": "那麼，讓我們在那個函式裡加入一些 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 164.7,
          "end": 166.433,
          "en": "before we return.",
          "zh": "在我們 return 之前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 166.433,
          "end": 169.066,
          "en": "For example, let's add a constant,",
          "zh": "例如，讓我們加入一個常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 169.066,
          "end": 169.233,
          "en": "For example, let's add a constant,",
          "zh": "例如，讓我們加入一個常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.233,
          "end": 172.266,
          "en": "so a variable which may never change",
          "zh": "也就是一個永遠不會改變的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 172.266,
          "end": 175.766,
          "en": "and in there let's store a date",
          "zh": "然後在裡面存一個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 175.766,
          "end": 175.9,
          "en": "and in there let's store a date",
          "zh": "然後在裡面存一個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 175.9,
          "end": 178.53300000000002,
          "en": "by using the built in date constructor",
          "zh": "使用內建的 date 建構函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 178.53300000000002,
          "end": 181.433,
          "en": "which comes with JavaScript.",
          "zh": "這是 JavaScript 內建的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 181.433,
          "end": 183.266,
          "en": "Let's give this constant a name,",
          "zh": "讓我們給這個常數一個名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 183.266,
          "end": 187.633,
          "en": "for example expense date, sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": "例如 expense date，聽起來是個很合適的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 187.633,
          "end": 187.933,
          "en": "for example expense date, sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": "例如 expense date，聽起來是個很合適的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 187.933,
          "end": 192.633,
          "en": "And then let's maybe set an initial date value here",
          "zh": "然後我們也許在這裡設定一個初始日期值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.633,
          "end": 196.36599999999999,
          "en": "which is the year 2021,",
          "zh": "也就是 2021 年，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 196.36599999999999,
          "end": 197.933,
          "en": "March as a month.",
          "zh": "月份是三月。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 197.933,
          "end": 200.9,
          "en": "And since the month field here starts at zero,",
          "zh": "而因為這裡的月份欄位是從零開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 200.9,
          "end": 202.933,
          "en": "March has the number two",
          "zh": "所以三月是數字 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 202.933,
          "end": 210.86599999999999,
          "en": "and then there the 28th.",
          "zh": "然後是 28 日。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.86599999999999,
          "end": 213.36599999999999,
          "en": "This is how we can create such a date object",
          "zh": "這就是我們建立這種 date 物件的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 213.36599999999999,
          "end": 216.1,
          "en": "and this, and that's really important to me",
          "zh": "而這一點，這點對我來說真的很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 216.1,
          "end": 219.233,
          "en": "is just regular JavaScript,",
          "zh": "這只是一般的 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 219.233,
          "end": 222.6,
          "en": "has nothing to do with React.",
          "zh": "和 React 完全沒有關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 224.9,
          "en": "And we can and we typically do",
          "zh": "我們可以、也通常會"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 224.9,
          "end": 229.066,
          "en": "have JavaScript code like this in our components",
          "zh": "在我們的元件裡有像這樣的 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 229.066,
          "end": 229.133,
          "en": "have JavaScript code like this in our components",
          "zh": "在我們的元件裡有像這樣的 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 229.133,
          "end": 233.466,
          "en": "here just to create some dummy data later in the course",
          "zh": "在這裡只是為了建立一些假資料，在課程後續"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 233.466,
          "end": 235.733,
          "en": "and in your React applications",
          "zh": "而在你的 React 應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 235.733,
          "end": 237.766,
          "en": "that could be any kind of code.",
          "zh": "那可以是任何形式的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 237.766,
          "end": 237.86599999999999,
          "en": "that could be any kind of code.",
          "zh": "那可以是任何形式的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 237.86599999999999,
          "end": 240.933,
          "en": "For example to send a HTTP request",
          "zh": "例如發送一個 HTTP 請求、"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 240.933,
          "end": 242.933,
          "en": "and fetch data from a database, to validate user input",
          "zh": "並從資料庫取得資料、驗證使用者的輸入，"
