          "zh": "這裡的 HTML 程式碼中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 279.733,
          "end": 282.033,
          "en": "And that is a typical task,",
          "zh": "而這是一個很典型的工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 282.033,
          "end": 282.2,
          "en": "And that is a typical task,",
          "zh": "而這是一個很典型的工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 282.2,
          "end": 286.166,
          "en": "typically you don't have data hard coded in HTML.",
          "zh": "通常你不會把資料寫死在 HTML 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 286.166,
          "end": 289.033,
          "en": "Instead to output dynamic data",
          "zh": "而是要輸出動態資料時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 289.033,
          "end": 292.2,
          "en": "you use a special syntax React gives you",
