          "id": 148,
          "start": 380.266,
          "end": 381.866,
          "en": "stored in this constant",
          "zh": "儲存在這個常數裡的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 381.866,
          "end": 384.2,
          "en": "and basically inject it here",
          "zh": "並基本上把它注入到這裡，"
