          "zh": "它就直接壞掉了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 436.633,
          "end": 439.1,
          "en": "Because this being a date object",
          "zh": "因為它是個 date 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 439.1,
          "end": 442.1,
          "en": "it can't be output as texts like this.",
          "zh": "它沒辦法像這樣被當成文字輸出。"
        },
        {
