          "start": 442.1,
          "end": 442.433,
          "en": "it can't be output as texts like this.",
          "zh": "它沒辦法像這樣被當成文字輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 442.433,
          "end": 446.83299999999997,
          "en": "However, we can call to ISO string for example,",
          "zh": "不過，我們可以例如呼叫 toISOString，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 446.83299999999997,
          "end": 447,
          "en": "However, we can call to ISO string for example,",
          "zh": "不過，我們可以例如呼叫 toISOString，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 447,
          "end": 450.533,
          "en": "a built in method available on all date objects",
          "zh": "這是所有 date 物件都有的內建方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 450.533,
          "end": 451.83299999999997,
          "en": "to output it as a string",
          "zh": "用來把它輸出成字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 451.83299999999997,
          "end": 454.233,
          "en": "and now we see this at least.",
          "zh": "現在我們至少能看到這個了。"
        },
        {
