          "en": "which we're outputting.",
          "zh": "就不會永遠是同一筆資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 505.033,
          "end": 508,
          "en": "And so that we can have multiple expense items",
          "zh": "而且這樣我們就能有多筆支出項目，"
