          "start": 508,
          "end": 512.333,
          "en": "based on one of the same component with different data.",
          "zh": "都是基於同一個元件，但帶有不同的資料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595438",
      "title": "Passing Data via \"props\"",
      "sourceHash": "d15c52215c13ef0bd9c6b1ed65584c26a751737a3570481d1e938281528261ea",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 4.966,
          "en": "Maximilian: How can we make this component reusable?",
          "zh": "Maximilian：我們要怎麼讓這個元件可以重複使用？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.966,
          "end": 8.966,
          "en": "Well, the good news is we can already reuse it.",
          "zh": "嗯，好消息是，我們其實已經可以重複使用它了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.966,
          "end": 11.366,
          "en": "In App.js, where I'm using it,",
          "zh": "在 App.js 裡，也就是我使用它的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.366,
          "end": 14.933,
          "en": "we can simply copy that line and paste it in.",
          "zh": "我們只要把那行複製並貼上就行了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.933,
          "end": 15.133,
          "en": "we can simply copy that line and paste it in.",
          "zh": "我們只要把那行複製並貼上就行了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.133,
          "end": 16.333,
          "en": "And if we save everything,",
          "zh": "而如果我們把一切存檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.333,
          "end": 19.033,
          "en": "we got the two ExpenseItems already.",
          "zh": "就會看到已經有兩個 ExpenseItem 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.033,
          "end": 22.9,
          "en": "So that was easy. It's super easy to reuse a component.",
          "zh": "所以那很簡單。要重複使用一個元件超級容易。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.9,
          "end": 23,
          "en": "So that was easy. It's super easy to reuse a component.",
          "zh": "所以那很簡單。要重複使用一個元件超級容易。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "You can use it as often as you want.",
          "zh": "你想用幾次就可以用幾次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.366,
          "en": "You can add it two more times",
          "zh": "你可以再多加它兩次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.366,
          "end": 30.466,
          "en": "and have four ExpenseItems overall.",
          "zh": "總共就會有四個 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.466,
          "end": 30.633,
          "en": "and have four ExpenseItems overall.",
          "zh": "總共就會有四個 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.633,
          "end": 32.7,
          "en": "That will work.",
          "zh": "這樣是可行的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.7,
          "end": 36.533,
          "en": "But, of course, at the moment it's not really reusable.",
          "zh": "但當然，目前它其實算不上真的能重複使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.533,
          "end": 38.666,
          "en": "Yes, it's technically more than once,",
          "zh": "沒錯，技術上它被用了不只一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 38.666,
          "end": 41.833,
          "en": "but it's always displaying the same data.",
          "zh": "但它永遠都顯示同樣的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.833,
          "end": 42.7,
          "en": "And the reason for that",
          "zh": "而造成這種情況的原因"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.7,
          "end": 46.766,
          "en": "is that the data is baked into this component.",
          "zh": "是資料被寫死在這個元件裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.766,
          "end": 47.333,
          "en": "is that the data is baked into this component.",
          "zh": "是資料被寫死在這個元件裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 47.333,
          "end": 50.666,
          "en": "Now, think about regular JavaScript",
          "zh": "現在，先想一下一般的 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.666,
          "end": 53.433,
          "en": "without React for a second.",
          "zh": "暫時不要考慮 React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 53.433,
          "end": 57.966,
          "en": "There, I mentioned early already, we also use functions",
          "zh": "我先前提過，我們也會使用函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.966,
          "end": 63.033,
          "en": "to split functionality across multiple smaller codebases",
          "zh": "把功能拆分成多個較小的程式碼庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.033,
          "end": 66.133,
          "en": "and also to have reusable functions",
          "zh": "同時也讓我們擁有可重複使用的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.133,
          "end": 69.033,
          "en": "which we can call multiple times.",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫它們好幾次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.033,
          "end": 69.43299999999999,
          "en": "which we can call multiple times.",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫它們好幾次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.43299999999999,
          "end": 73,
          "en": "Now, when we write functions in JavaScript,",
          "zh": "當我們在 JavaScript 中寫函式時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73,
          "end": 75.866,
          "en": "then we make these functions reusable",
          "zh": "我們會讓這些函式可以重複使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.866,
          "end": 78.43299999999999,
          "en": "by accepting parameters.",
          "zh": "做法就是接受參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.43299999999999,
          "end": 82.333,
          "en": "And that allows us to call one of the same function",
          "zh": "這讓我們可以呼叫同一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.333,
          "end": 85.633,
          "en": "with different parameter values.",
          "zh": "並傳入不同的參數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.633,
          "end": 85.76599999999999,
          "en": "with different parameter values.",
          "zh": "並傳入不同的參數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.76599999999999,
          "end": 89.666,
          "en": "And, therefore, the function may and typically will produce",
          "zh": "因此，這個函式可能會、而且通常會產生"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.666,
          "end": 92.866,
          "en": "different results for different input values,",
          "zh": "不同的結果，對應不同的輸入值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.866,
          "end": 96.76599999999999,
          "en": "but it's still always the same function being called.",
          "zh": "但被呼叫的始終還是同一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.76599999999999,
          "end": 100.233,
          "en": "And React basically has the same concept built in.",
          "zh": "而 React 基本上內建了同樣的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.233,
          "end": 103.066,
          "en": "We can make our components reusable",
          "zh": "我們可以讓元件變得可重複使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.066,
          "end": 109.5,
          "en": "by using parameters and a concept called props in React.",
          "zh": "做法是使用參數，以及 React 中一個叫做 props 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.5,
          "end": 112.533,
          "en": "Let's say in your App component,",
          "zh": "假設在你的 App 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.533,
          "end": 117.26599999999999,
          "en": "you have a goalItem variable or constant defined",
          "zh": "你定義了一個 goalItem 變數或常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.26599999999999,
          "end": 120.333,
          "en": "which holds a string of Finish!",
          "zh": "裡面存著一個「Finish!」字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.333,
          "end": 122.866,
          "en": "And then let's say you have a custom component,",
          "zh": "然後假設你有一個自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.866,
          "end": 125.266,
          "en": "the CourseGoalItem component,",
          "zh": "也就是 CourseGoalItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.266,
          "end": 127.666,
          "en": "which has a list item inside of it",
          "zh": "它裡面有一個 list item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.666,
          "end": 130.7,
          "en": "where this goalItem should be output.",
          "zh": "這個 goalItem 應該要輸出在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.7,
          "end": 132.166,
          "en": "That's just another example,",
          "zh": "這只是另一個例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.166,
          "end": 133.666,
          "en": "not the code we've been working on,",
          "zh": "不是我們一直在寫的那段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.666,
          "end": 135.733,
          "en": "but it's another example.",
          "zh": "但它是另一個例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.733,
          "end": 135.966,
          "en": "but it's another example.",
          "zh": "但它是另一個例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.966,
          "end": 137.466,
          "en": "We can have a custom component",
          "zh": "我們可以有一個自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 137.466,
          "end": 139.333,
          "en": "which should output a list item",
          "zh": "它應該要輸出一個 list item，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.333,
          "end": 143.133,
          "en": "where the goalItem should be output dynamically.",
          "zh": "在那裡，goalItem 應該被動態地輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.133,
          "end": 147.2,
          "en": "The problem is that the goalItem variable lives",
          "zh": "問題在於，goalItem 這個變數存在於"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.2,
          "end": 151.6,
          "en": "in the App component, not in the CourseGoalItem component.",
          "zh": "App 元件裡，而不是在 CourseGoalItem 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.6,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "in the App component, not in the CourseGoalItem component.",
          "zh": "App 元件裡，而不是在 CourseGoalItem 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 153.766,
          "en": "And to a certain extent, that is good",
          "zh": "在某種程度上，這是件好事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.766,
          "end": 156.933,
          "en": "because it makes the CourseGoalItem independent",
          "zh": "因為這讓 CourseGoalItem 保持獨立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 156.933,
          "end": 160.53300000000002,
          "en": "if it doesn't store the concrete value internally.",
          "zh": "只要它不在內部儲存具體的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 160.53300000000002,
          "end": 161.933,
          "en": "But, of course, we wanna define",
          "zh": "但當然，我們會想定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.933,
          "end": 164.333,
          "en": "what's being output by CourseGoalItem",
          "zh": "CourseGoalItem 要輸出什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.333,
          "end": 167.3,
          "en": "with help of the variable managed in App.",
          "zh": "並借助在 App 中管理的那個變數來達成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 167.3,
          "end": 171.666,
          "en": "And we don't have direct access to the HTML code output",
          "zh": "而我們無法直接存取 HTML 程式碼的輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 171.666,
          "end": 175.433,
          "en": "by some component in other components.",
          "zh": "也就是某個元件在其他元件裡輸出的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.433,
          "end": 175.566,
          "en": "by some component in other components.",
          "zh": "也就是某個元件在其他元件裡輸出的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175.566,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "We can't just send our stored data there,",
          "zh": "我們不能直接把儲存的資料送到那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 182.433,
          "en": "but, instead, we can utilize a concept called props.",
          "zh": "而是可以使用一個叫做 props 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.433,
          "end": 182.7,
          "en": "but, instead, we can utilize a concept called props.",
          "zh": "而是可以使用一個叫做 props 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 182.7,
          "end": 187,
          "en": "We can pass data to the custom component",
          "zh": "我們可以把資料傳給自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 187,
          "end": 189.4,
          "en": "by adding a attribute.",
          "zh": "做法是加上一個 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 189.4,
          "end": 191.466,
          "en": "And inside of that component,",
          "zh": "而在那個元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 191.466,
          "end": 194.633,
          "en": "we can then get access to all these attributes",
          "zh": "我們就能存取所有這些 attribute，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.633,
          "end": 198.666,
          "en": "which might have been set on our custom component.",
          "zh": "也就是可能被設定在我們自訂元件上的 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 198.666,
          "end": 198.9,
          "en": "which might have been set on our custom component.",
          "zh": "也就是可能被設定在我們自訂元件上的 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.9,
          "end": 200.6,
          "en": "Again, we're basically building",
          "zh": "再次強調，我們基本上是在打造"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 200.6,
          "end": 203.733,
          "en": "our own custom HTML elements.",
          "zh": "我們自己的自訂 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 203.733,
          "end": 203.8,
          "en": "our own custom HTML elements.",
          "zh": "我們自己的自訂 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 203.8,
          "end": 208.566,
          "en": "And just as HTML elements can have attributes,",
          "zh": "就像 HTML 元素可以有 attribute 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.566,
          "end": 211.066,
          "en": "it turns out that with React,",
          "zh": "事實證明，在 React 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 211.066,
          "end": 214.53300000000002,
          "en": "our own custom components can also have attributes.",
          "zh": "我們自己的自訂元件也可以有 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 214.53300000000002,
          "end": 214.766,
          "en": "our own custom components can also have attributes.",
          "zh": "我們自己的自訂元件也可以有 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 214.766,
          "end": 218.066,
          "en": "There, this concept is just called props",
          "zh": "而在那裡，這個概念就叫做 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 218.066,
          "end": 219.933,
          "en": "instead of attributes.",
          "zh": "而不是 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 219.933,
          "end": 220.133,
          "en": "instead of attributes.",
          "zh": "而不是 attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 220.133,
          "end": 223.566,
          "en": "And props simply stands for properties.",
          "zh": "而 props 其實就是 properties 的簡稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 223.566,
          "end": 228.6,
          "en": "We can set properties of our own custom components.",
          "zh": "我們可以設定自己自訂元件的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 228.6,
          "end": 232.133,
          "en": "Now, how does this props concept work though?",
          "zh": "那麼，這個 props 概念實際上是怎麼運作的呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 232.133,
          "end": 232.53300000000002,
          "en": "Now, how does this props concept work though?",
          "zh": "那麼，這個 props 概念實際上是怎麼運作的呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 232.53300000000002,
          "end": 236.1,
          "en": "In ExpenseItem, we have the date, the title, and the amount,",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseItem 裡，我們有日期、標題和金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 236.1,
          "end": 236.133,
          "en": "In ExpenseItem, we have the date, the title, and the amount,",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseItem 裡，我們有日期、標題和金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 236.133,
          "end": 238.466,
          "en": "and we'd like to output this here,",
          "zh": "而我們想在這裡輸出這些內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 238.466,
          "end": 238.8,
          "en": "and we'd like to output this here,",
          "zh": "而我們想在這裡輸出這些內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 238.8,
          "end": 244.166,
          "en": "but it shouldn't be stored in here but instead in App.js.",
          "zh": "但它不應該存在這裡，而是應該存在 App.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 244.166,
          "end": 244.733,
          "en": "but it shouldn't be stored in here but instead in App.js.",
          "zh": "但它不應該存在這裡，而是應該存在 App.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 244.733,
          "end": 248,
          "en": "There, indeed, in this App component,",
          "zh": "在那裡，也就是在這個 App 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 248,
          "end": 251.166,
          "en": "we could have another constant or variable,",
          "zh": "我們可以有另一個常數或變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 251.166,
          "end": 256.4,
          "en": "expenses, which is an array, so multiple expense items.",
          "zh": "叫做 expenses，它是一個陣列，所以裡面有多筆支出項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 256.4,
          "end": 257.866,
          "en": "And let's say every expense here",
          "zh": "假設這裡每一筆支出"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 257.866,
          "end": 260.166,
          "en": "is a simple JavaScript object",
          "zh": "都是一個簡單的 JavaScript 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 260.166,
          "end": 264.866,
          "en": "which now has a title like Car Insurance,",
          "zh": "它有像 Car Insurance 這樣的標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 264.866,
          "end": 265.2,
          "en": "which now has a title like Car Insurance,",
          "zh": "它有像 Car Insurance 這樣的標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 265.2,
          "end": 272.8,
          "en": "which also has an amount like the 294.67,",
          "zh": "也有像 294.67 這樣的金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 272.8,
          "end": 272.83299999999997,
          "en": "which also has an amount like the 294.67,",
          "zh": "也有像 294.67 這樣的金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 272.83299999999997,
          "end": 275.266,
          "en": "and where we have a date",
          "zh": "而且有一個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 275.266,
          "end": 280.56600000000003,
          "en": "like this new Date we created here in ExpenseItem before.",
          "zh": "就像我們之前在 ExpenseItem 裡建立的這個 new Date 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 280.56600000000003,
          "end": 282.033,
          "en": "Now, again, we don't just have one,",
          "zh": "再說一次，我們並不只有一筆，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 282.033,
          "end": 286.433,
          "en": "but we have, let's say, three such expenses here,",
          "zh": "而是假設這裡有三筆這樣的支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 286.433,
          "end": 288.266,
          "en": "or maybe four.",
          "zh": "或者也許四筆。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 288.266,
          "end": 291.166,
          "en": "Now, to make sure we don't have to type these all by hand,",
          "zh": "為了確保我們不用全部手動輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 291.166,
          "end": 293.466,
          "en": "attached you find a simple text file,",
          "zh": "附件裡有一個簡單的文字檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 293.466,
          "end": 297.166,
          "en": "which contains four dummy expense items,",
          "zh": "裡面包含四筆範例支出項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 297.166,
          "end": 301.433,
          "en": "which you can just wrap and copy into your expenses array.",
          "zh": "你可以直接複製並貼進你的 expenses 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 301.433,
          "end": 301.7,
          "en": "which you can just wrap and copy into your expenses array.",
          "zh": "你可以直接複製並貼進你的 expenses 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 301.7,
          "end": 305.2,
          "en": "These objects also have an extra id field",
          "zh": "這些物件還多了一個 id 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 305.2,
          "end": 308.6,
          "en": "which we don't need at the moment though.",
          "zh": "不過我們目前還不需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 308.6,
          "end": 311.833,
          "en": "Nonetheless, now you will have four objects",
          "zh": "總之，現在你會有四個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 311.833,
          "end": 313.833,
          "en": "inside of this expenses array.",
          "zh": "在這個 expenses 陣列裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 313.833,
          "end": 318.3,
          "en": "And now we want to pass the data of these different objects",
          "zh": "而現在我們想把這些不同物件的資料傳給"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 318.3,
          "end": 321.433,
          "en": "to these different ExpenseItems.",
          "zh": "這些不同的 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 321.433,
          "end": 325.566,
          "en": "That means we wanna make these ExpenseItems configurable",
          "zh": "這表示我們想讓這些 ExpenseItem 可以被設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 325.566,
          "end": 328.566,
          "en": "from outside, you could say.",
          "zh": "可以說是由外部來設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 328.566,
          "end": 328.866,
          "en": "from outside, you could say.",
          "zh": "可以說是由外部來設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 328.866,
          "end": 331.4,
          "en": "The data should not be stored inside of them",
          "zh": "資料不應該儲存在它們內部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 331.4,
          "end": 333.8,
          "en": "but instead received from outside.",
          "zh": "而是從外部接收進來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 333.8,
          "end": 338.633,
          "en": "And that works with this props concept I just mentioned.",
          "zh": "而這就要靠我剛剛提到的這個 props 概念來達成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 338.633,
          "end": 342.666,
          "en": "In App.js, we can simply add attributes",
          "zh": "在 App.js 裡，我們只要加上 attribute，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 342.666,
          "end": 347.06600000000003,
          "en": "to these custom HTML elements, so to these components.",
          "zh": "加在這些自訂 HTML 元素上，也就是這些元件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 347.06600000000003,
          "end": 349.933,
          "en": "I'm using these terms interchangeably here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡把這些詞當作同義詞交替使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 349.933,
          "end": 350.233,
          "en": "I'm using these terms interchangeably here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡把這些詞當作同義詞交替使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 350.233,
          "end": 353.733,
          "en": "And, for example, we could add a title attribute",
          "zh": "舉例來說，我們可以加上一個 title attribute，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 353.733,
          "end": 356.233,
          "en": "here to ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "加在這裡的 ExpenseItem 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 356.233,
          "end": 362,
          "en": "and set this to a value of Toilet Paper.",
          "zh": "並把它設成 Toilet Paper 這個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 362,
          "end": 365.666,
          "en": "So we can just type Toilet Paper here.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以直接在這裡打上 Toilet Paper。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 365.666,
          "end": 368.866,
          "en": "But now I wouldn't yet again be hard-coding some data",
          "zh": "但這樣我又會把一些資料寫死，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 368.866,
          "end": 370.866,
          "en": "in this JSX code.",
          "zh": "寫死在這段 JSX 程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 370.866,
          "end": 373.5,
          "en": "Since we already have this expenses array here,",
          "zh": "既然我們這裡已經有這個 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 373.5,
          "end": 375.833,
          "en": "I also can dynamically retrieve",
          "zh": "我也能動態取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 375.833,
          "end": 378.83299999999997,
          "en": "the title stored in this first ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "存在這第一筆支出裡的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 378.83299999999997,
          "end": 381.83299999999997,
          "en": "for this first ExpenseItem here.",
          "zh": "用在這裡的第一個 ExpenseItem 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 381.83299999999997,
          "end": 382.133,
          "en": "for this first ExpenseItem here.",
          "zh": "用在這裡的第一個 ExpenseItem 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 382.133,
          "end": 382.933,
          "en": "And we can do this",
          "zh": "我們可以這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 382.933,
          "end": 386.933,
          "en": "by, again, using this single-curly-brace syntax.",
          "zh": "做法同樣是使用這個單一大括號的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 386.933,
          "end": 387.166,
          "en": "by, again, using this single-curly-brace syntax.",
          "zh": "做法同樣是使用這個單一大括號的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 387.166,
          "end": 388.566,
          "en": "We cannot just use this",
          "zh": "我們不只能把這個用在"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 388.566,
          "end": 391.5,
          "en": "between opening and closing tags of elements,",
          "zh": "元素的開啟與關閉標籤之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 391.5,
          "end": 395.5,
          "en": "we can also use it for assigning values to attributes.",
          "zh": "也可以用來指定 attribute 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 395.5,
          "end": 399.633,
          "en": "And here I can then access expenses, which is this array,",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我就可以存取 expenses，也就是這個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 399.633,
          "end": 399.9,
          "en": "And here I can then access expenses, which is this array,",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我就可以存取 expenses，也就是這個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 399.9,
          "end": 403.4,
          "en": "there the first item with index zero,",
          "zh": "在那裡取索引為零的第一筆項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 403.4,
          "end": 407.56600000000003,
          "en": "and there, this first item, like all items, is an object",
          "zh": "而這第一筆項目，就像所有項目一樣，是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 407.56600000000003,
          "end": 410.466,
          "en": "which has a title property, for example.",
          "zh": "比方說，它有一個 title 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 410.466,
          "end": 415.933,
          "en": "So we can access .title here.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡存取 .title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 415.933,
          "end": 420.833,
          "en": "And now this title is being passed to this ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "而現在，這個 title 就被傳給這個 ExpenseItem 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 420.833,
          "end": 423.033,
          "en": "Now, we can do the same for the amount.",
          "zh": "現在，我們可以用同樣的方式處理金額。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 423.033,
          "end": 426.2,
          "en": "We set, let's say, an amount attribute.",
          "zh": "我們設定一個，比如說，amount attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 426.2,
          "end": 428.166,
          "en": "And these attribute names, by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這些 attribute 的名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 428.166,
          "end": 430.2,
          "en": "are totally up to you.",
          "zh": "完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 430.2,
          "end": 430.366,
          "en": "are totally up to you.",
          "zh": "完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 430.366,
          "end": 432.5,
          "en": "I'm going with title and amount here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡用的是 title 和 amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 432.5,
          "end": 434.833,
          "en": "but you could pick different things.",
          "zh": "但你可以選不同的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 434.833,
          "end": 436.466,
          "en": "And as a value for amount,",
          "zh": "而 amount 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 436.466,
          "end": 439.6,
          "en": "I, again, access expenses and the first expense there",
          "zh": "我同樣是存取 expenses，並取出那裡的第一筆支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 439.6,
          "end": 442.8,
          "en": "and then the amount field.",
          "zh": "然後再取它的 amount 欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 442.8,
          "end": 446.066,
          "en": "And last but not least, we can add a date attribute",
          "zh": "最後同樣重要的是，我們可以加上一個 date attribute，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 446.066,
          "end": 450.766,
          "en": "and access expenses and there the first expense .date.",
          "zh": "並存取 expenses，然後取那裡第一筆支出的 .date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 450.766,
          "end": 451.233,
          "en": "and access expenses and there the first expense .date.",
          "zh": "並存取 expenses，然後取那裡第一筆支出的 .date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 451.233,
          "end": 454.1,
          "en": "You just have to make sure that the part after the dot",
          "zh": "你只要確保點之後的那個部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 454.1,
          "end": 456.266,
          "en": "matches the property names here",
          "zh": "和這裡的屬性名稱相符，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 456.266,
          "end": 460.2,
          "en": "because we are accessing these objects.",
          "zh": "因為我們是在存取這些物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 460.2,
          "end": 462.033,
          "en": "Now, I'll hit the auto-format code",
          "zh": "現在，我會按下自動格式化程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 462.033,
          "end": 463.533,
          "en": "to make this easier to read",
          "zh": "讓它更容易閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 463.533,
          "end": 466.466,
          "en": "by splitting these across multiple lines.",
          "zh": "把它們拆成好幾行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 466.466,
          "end": 466.8,
          "en": "by splitting these across multiple lines.",
          "zh": "把它們拆成好幾行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 466.8,
          "end": 471.2,
          "en": "We can now do the same for the other ExpenseItems.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以對其他 ExpenseItem 做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 471.2,
          "end": 473.06600000000003,
          "en": "So I'll just repeat this",
          "zh": "所以我就把這段重複一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 473.06600000000003,
          "end": 479.33299999999997,
          "en": "but then access the, oops, the second expense here",
          "zh": "但改成存取，哎呀，這裡的第二筆支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 479.33299999999997,
          "end": 483.466,
          "en": "and the third expense with index two",
          "zh": "以及索引為二的第三筆支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 483.466,
          "end": 483.566,
          "en": "and the third expense with index two",
          "zh": "以及索引為二的第三筆支出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 483.566,
          "end": 489.733,
          "en": "and the fourth expense with index three.",
          "zh": "還有索引為三的第四筆支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 489.733,
          "end": 493.166,
          "en": "Now, if we save that, we see no change, though,",
          "zh": "現在，如果我們存檔，卻看不到任何變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 493.166,
          "end": 496.5,
          "en": "because we only did the first half",
          "zh": "因為我們只完成了"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 496.5,
          "end": 498.366,
          "en": "of the work we need to do.",
          "zh": "我們需要做的工作的前一半。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 498.366,
          "end": 501.066,
          "en": "We added these attributes with any names of our choice here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡加上了這些 attribute，名稱都隨我們自己選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 501.066,
          "end": 503,
          "en": "We added these attributes with any names of our choice here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡加上了這些 attribute，名稱都隨我們自己選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 503,
          "end": 505.966,
          "en": "because these are our custom elements,",
          "zh": "因為這些是我們的自訂元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 505.966,
          "end": 509.233,
          "en": "hence these attribute names are up to us.",
          "zh": "所以這些 attribute 名稱由我們決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 509.233,
          "end": 511.566,
          "en": "But inside of that component code,",
          "zh": "但在那個元件的程式碼裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 511.566,
          "end": 514,
          "en": "so inside of ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "也就是在 ExpenseItem.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 514,
          "end": 514.233,
          "en": "so inside of ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "也就是在 ExpenseItem.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 514.233,
          "end": 516.266,
          "en": "we also now need to do something",
          "zh": "我們現在也需要做點事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 516.266,
          "end": 519.066,
          "en": "with these received attribute values,",
          "zh": "來處理這些接收到的 attribute 值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 519.066,
          "end": 522,
          "en": "and that's the half which is missing.",
          "zh": "而這就是還缺少的那一半。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 522,
          "end": 522.266,
          "en": "and that's the half which is missing.",
          "zh": "而這就是還缺少的那一半。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 522.266,
          "end": 525.6659999999999,
          "en": "Now, the question is how do we get access to the values",
          "zh": "現在的問題是，我們要如何存取那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 525.6659999999999,
          "end": 530.533,
          "en": "defined in the place where we use our custom components?",
          "zh": "在我們使用自訂元件的地方所定義的值？"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 530.533,
          "end": 533.266,
          "en": "And the answer is parameters.",
          "zh": "答案就是參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 533.266,
          "end": 536,
          "en": "I mentioned that in regular JavaScript,",
          "zh": "我提過，在一般的 JavaScript 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 536,
          "end": 539.233,
          "en": "we use parameters for passing data into functions,",
          "zh": "我們用參數把資料傳進函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 539.233,
          "end": 542.5,
          "en": "and it's kind of similar for React.",
          "zh": "而在 React 裡也蠻類似的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 542.5,
          "end": 545.266,
          "en": "However, we're now not getting a title",
          "zh": "不過，我們現在拿到的並不是一個 title"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 545.266,
          "end": 549,
          "en": "and an amount and a date parameter, as you might think,",
          "zh": "加上一個 amount 和一個 date 參數，像你可能以為的那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 549,
          "end": 551.7,
          "en": "but, instead, we get one parameter.",
          "zh": "而是只會拿到一個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 551.7,
          "end": 551.8,
          "en": "but, instead, we get one parameter.",
          "zh": "而是只會拿到一個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 551.8,
          "end": 555.3,
          "en": "React will ensure that we get one parameter",
          "zh": "React 會確保我們拿到一個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 555.3,
          "end": 558.5,
          "en": "in every component which we use as a component,",
          "zh": "在每個我們當作元件使用的元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 558.5,
          "end": 561.266,
          "en": "like we're doing it here for ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "就像我們這裡對 ExpenseItem 所做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 561.266,
          "end": 561.8,
          "en": "like we're doing it here for ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "就像我們這裡對 ExpenseItem 所做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 561.8,
          "end": 564.933,
          "en": "And that one parameter will be an object",
          "zh": "而那個參數會是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 564.933,
          "end": 569.333,
          "en": "which holds all the received attributes as properties,",
          "zh": "它會把所有接收到的 attribute 都存成屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 569.333,
          "end": 573.466,
          "en": "hence the name props for the overall concept.",
          "zh": "因此整個概念就叫做 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 573.466,
          "end": 575.5,
          "en": "Therefore, we get one parameter,",
          "zh": "所以我們會拿到一個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 575.5,
          "end": 578.133,
          "en": "and you can name this parameter whatever you want.",
          "zh": "而這個參數你想取什麼名字都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 578.133,
          "end": 581.433,
          "en": "It's your function. You could name it data.",
          "zh": "這是你的函式。你可以把它命名為 data。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 581.433,
          "end": 583.533,
          "en": "But, typically, it's named props",
          "zh": "但通常它會被命名為 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 583.533,
          "end": 586.1,
          "en": "to make it clear that this is this object",
          "zh": "以清楚表明這就是那個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 586.1,
          "end": 589.7,
          "en": "which holds all the values we get",
          "zh": "它存放著我們取得的所有值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 589.7,
          "end": 593.6659999999999,
          "en": "for the attributes on our custom element.",
          "zh": "也就是我們自訂元素上 attribute 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 593.6659999999999,
          "end": 594,
          "en": "for the attributes on our custom element.",
          "zh": "也就是我們自訂元素上 attribute 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 594,
          "end": 595.033,
          "en": "And to be precise,",
          "zh": "確切來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 595.033,
          "end": 599.5,
          "en": "we get key-value pairs in this props object here",
          "zh": "我們會在這個 props 物件裡拿到一組組鍵值對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 599.5,
          "end": 602.966,
          "en": "which is passed in by React automatically.",
          "zh": "這個物件是由 React 自動傳進來的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 602.966,
          "end": 606.533,
          "en": "The keys will be the attribute names defined here,",
          "zh": "鍵值對的鍵會是這裡定義的 attribute 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 606.533,
          "end": 609.766,
          "en": "so title, amount, and date in my case.",
          "zh": "以我的情況來說就是 title、amount 和 date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 609.766,
          "end": 609.9,
          "en": "so title, amount, and date in my case.",
          "zh": "以我的情況來說就是 title、amount 和 date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 609.9,
          "end": 614.566,
          "en": "And the values, of course, will be the values set here.",
          "zh": "而這些值，當然就是這裡設定的那些值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 614.566,
          "end": 618.3,
          "en": "So if I now wanna output the title received",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在想輸出接收到的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 618.3,
          "end": 620.5,
          "en": "here in this h2 tag,",
          "zh": "輸出在這裡的這個 h2 標籤裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 620.5,
          "end": 626.6,
          "en": "I can now access props.title like this,",
          "zh": "我現在就可以像這樣存取 props.title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 626.6,
          "end": 629.3,
          "en": "getting access to this props parameter",
          "zh": "先取得這個 props 參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 629.3,
          "end": 629.433,
          "en": "getting access to this props parameter",
          "zh": "先取得這個 props 參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 629.433,
          "end": 632.033,
          "en": "and then there to the title property",
          "zh": "再從那裡取到 title 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 632.033,
          "end": 637.966,
          "en": "which will exist because we set a title attribute.",
          "zh": "這個屬性會存在，因為我們設定了 title attribute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 637.966,
          "end": 641.566,
          "en": "Now, if you chose a different name than title here,",
          "zh": "現在，如果你在這裡選的名稱不是 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 641.566,
          "end": 644.3,
          "en": "like, for example, name,",
          "zh": "比如說叫 name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 644.3,
          "end": 644.4,
          "en": "like, for example, name,",
          "zh": "比如說叫 name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 644.4,
          "end": 647.066,
          "en": "if you chose that as a name, for example,",
          "zh": "如果你選了那個當名稱，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 647.066,
          "end": 651.333,
          "en": "then you have to access props.name here.",
          "zh": "那你就必須在這裡存取 props.name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 651.333,
          "end": 651.7,
          "en": "then you have to access props.name here.",
          "zh": "那你就必須在這裡存取 props.name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 651.7,
          "end": 655.866,
          "en": "So the key which you access on your props object",
          "zh": "所以你在 props 物件上存取的那個鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 655.866,
          "end": 660.033,
          "en": "has to be the name you picked for your attribute.",
          "zh": "必須是你為 attribute 挑選的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 660.033,
          "end": 661.6,
          "en": "Now, here I'll go back to title",
          "zh": "好，我在這裡會改回 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 661.6,
          "end": 664.2,
          "en": "and therefore adjust it here in both places again,",
          "zh": "因此要再次把兩個地方都調整回來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 664.2,
          "end": 667.4,
          "en": "but you have to make sure that this matches.",
          "zh": "但你必須確保這兩者是相符的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 667.4,
          "end": 669.966,
          "en": "Otherwise, it will not work.",
          "zh": "否則它就不會運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 669.966,
          "end": 670.666,
          "en": "Otherwise, it will not work.",
          "zh": "否則它就不會運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 670.666,
          "end": 672.366,
          "en": "Now, which names you choose,",
          "zh": "至於你要選哪些名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 672.366,
          "end": 676.366,
          "en": "if that's title or name or text or whatever,",
          "zh": "無論是 title、name、text 還是其他什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 676.366,
          "end": 678.866,
          "en": "that's up to you, it's your component.",
          "zh": "那都由你決定，因為這是你的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 678.866,
          "end": 682.4,
          "en": "But, of course, you typically wanna choose prop names",
          "zh": "但當然，你通常會想選一些 prop 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 682.4,
          "end": 684.633,
          "en": "and therefore attribute names",
          "zh": "也就是 attribute 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 684.633,
          "end": 688.666,
          "en": "which are self-explanatory and which makes sense.",
          "zh": "它們要能望文生義、而且合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 688.666,
          "end": 691.066,
          "en": "So since we're passing in the amount here,",
          "zh": "所以既然我們這裡傳入的是金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 691.066,
          "end": 693.3,
          "en": "amount makes sense.",
          "zh": "用 amount 就很合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 693.3,
          "end": 697.2,
          "en": "Something like someNumber would be valid",
          "zh": "像 someNumber 這樣的命名雖然也行得通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 697.2,
          "end": 700.533,
          "en": "but wouldn't make a lot of sense, I guess,",
          "zh": "但我想不太合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 700.533,
          "end": 702.866,
          "en": "so I'll revert that.",
          "zh": "所以我會把它改回來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 702.866,
          "end": 705.233,
          "en": "Now, therefore, in ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "所以現在，在 ExpenseItem 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 705.233,
          "end": 710.333,
          "en": "we can not just output props.title but also props.amount,",
          "zh": "我們不只可以輸出 props.title，也可以輸出 props.amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 710.333,
          "end": 710.566,
          "en": "we can not just output props.title but also props.amount,",
          "zh": "我們不只可以輸出 props.title，也可以輸出 props.amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 710.566,
          "end": 716.466,
          "en": "and here for the date, props.date.toISOString.",
          "zh": "而在日期這裡，用 props.date.toISOString。"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 716.466,
          "end": 718,
          "en": "And that means we can now get rid",
          "zh": "而這也表示我們現在可以省去"
        },
        {
          "id": 262,
          "start": 718,
          "end": 719.7,
          "en": "of these three constants here",
          "zh": "這裡這三個常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 263,
          "start": 719.7,
          "end": 722.133,
          "en": "since we now get all the data we need",
          "zh": "因為我們現在所需的全部資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 264,
          "start": 722.133,
          "end": 725.833,
          "en": "from outside this component.",
          "zh": "都是從這個元件外部取得的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 265,
          "start": 725.833,
          "end": 729.666,
          "en": "We're not defining it inside of the ExpenseItem component,",
          "zh": "我們不是在 ExpenseItem 元件內部定義它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 266,
          "start": 729.666,
          "end": 731.066,
          "en": "inside of this function,",
          "zh": "不是在這個函式裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 267,
          "start": 731.066,
          "end": 733.633,
          "en": "but, instead, it's in the end defined in App.js",
          "zh": "而是最終定義在 App.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 268,
          "start": 733.633,
          "end": 736.066,
          "en": "and passed into ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "並傳入 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 269,
          "start": 736.066,
          "end": 741.633,
          "en": "for the different usages of ExpenseItem through attributes.",
          "zh": "透過 attribute 傳給 ExpenseItem 的不同使用處。"
        },
        {
          "id": 270,
          "start": 741.633,
          "end": 744.966,
          "en": "And that's how you share data between React components.",
          "zh": "這就是你在 React 元件之間共享資料的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 271,
          "start": 744.966,
          "end": 750,
          "en": "You can make your components truly reusable and configurable",
          "zh": "你可以讓你的元件真正可重複使用、可設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 272,
          "start": 750,
          "end": 752.6,
          "en": "by using this props concept,",
          "zh": "做法就是使用這個 props 概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 273,
          "start": 752.6,
          "end": 757.6,
          "en": "which is one of the key concepts React has to offer.",
          "zh": "這是 React 提供的關鍵概念之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 274,
          "start": 757.6,
          "end": 761.5,
          "en": "You'll use props all the time, so keep it in mind.",
          "zh": "你會不斷用到 props，所以要記住它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 275,
          "start": 761.5,
          "end": 762.733,
          "en": "It's super important.",
          "zh": "它非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 276,
          "start": 762.733,
          "end": 764.966,
          "en": "Props is a super important concept",
          "zh": "Props 是一個非常重要的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 277,
          "start": 764.966,
          "end": 767.833,
          "en": "because it allows you to make your components reusable,",
          "zh": "因為它能讓你的元件可重複使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 278,
          "start": 767.833,
          "end": 769.9,
          "en": "and it allows you to pass data",
          "zh": "也讓你能把資料傳遞"
        },
        {
          "id": 279,
          "start": 769.9,
          "end": 773.033,
          "en": "from another component to this component.",
          "zh": "從另一個元件傳到這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 280,
          "start": 773.033,
          "end": 774.6,
          "en": "And hence if we now have a look,",
          "zh": "因此，如果我們現在看一看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 281,
          "start": 774.6,
          "end": 778.066,
          "en": "we see these different expenses are rendered",
          "zh": "就會看到這些不同的支出被 render 出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 282,
          "start": 778.066,
          "end": 780.966,
          "en": "with different titles, different dates,",
          "zh": "有著不同的標題、不同的日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 283,
          "start": 780.966,
          "end": 782.5,
          "en": "and different amounts.",
          "zh": "以及不同的金額。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38345440",
      "title": "Alternative Ways of Passing & Receiving / Handling \"props\"",
      "sourceHash": "24112db405e22522fb2f379a587d2ac83133630849be3d04c71e281a805b8155",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.653,
          "end": 5.402,
          "en": "So props are a crucial React concept.",
          "zh": "所以 props 是一個很關鍵的 React 概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.402,
          "end": 8.39,
          "en": "Components would not be very useful",
          "zh": "如果元件不能藉助 props 來設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.39,
          "end": 12.395,
          "en": "if they weren't configurable with help of props.",
          "zh": "它們就不會那麼實用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.395,
          "end": 15.248,
          "en": "And therefore, when working with React",
          "zh": "因此，在使用 React 的時候"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.248,
          "end": 17.253,
          "en": "and when writing React code,",
          "zh": "以及撰寫 React 程式碼的時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.253,
          "end": 20.388,
          "en": "you will often set props on components",
          "zh": "你會經常在元件上設定 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.388,
          "end": 23.988,
          "en": "and accept props as input.",
          "zh": "並把 props 接收為輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.988,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "Now, there are two things I wanna mention here,",
          "zh": "好，這裡有兩件事我想提一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 29.497,
          "en": "two alternative ways of accepting",
          "zh": "兩種接收的替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.497,
          "end": 32.755,
          "en": "or setting props you should be aware of.",
          "zh": "或設定 props 的方式，你應該要知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.755,
          "end": 34.507,
          "en": "And I'll start with an alternative way",
          "zh": "我會先從一種替代的方式開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.507,
          "end": 37.277,
          "en": "of setting props",
          "zh": "也就是設定 props 的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.277,
          "end": 39.74,
          "en": "because the use case we have here",
          "zh": "因為我們這裡遇到的使用情境"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.74,
          "end": 41.769,
          "en": "where we have a component",
          "zh": "是我們有一個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.769,
          "end": 44.491,
          "en": "that needs almost all the data",
          "zh": "它需要幾乎所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.491,
          "end": 47.141,
          "en": "we are working with in this app,",
          "zh": "我們在這個應用程式裡用到的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.141,
          "end": 48.878,
          "en": "so that needs almost all fields",
          "zh": "所以它需要幾乎所有欄位"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.878,
          "end": 50.633,
          "en": "of that raw data.",
          "zh": "也就是那份原始資料的欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.633,
          "end": 53.623,
          "en": "That use case is quite common.",
          "zh": "這種使用情境相當常見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.623,
          "end": 56.244,
          "en": "And you can then absolutely set up",
          "zh": "你當然可以設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.244,
          "end": 59.616,
          "en": "multiple prop key value pairs.",
          "zh": "多組 prop 鍵值對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.616,
          "end": 62.512,
          "en": "So define multiple props of different names",
          "zh": "也就是定義多個不同名稱的 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.512,
          "end": 66.76,
          "en": "and pass your different values through those props.",
          "zh": "並透過這些 props 傳入不同的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.76,
          "end": 70.265,
          "en": "But an alternative would be",
          "zh": "但另一種做法是"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.265,
          "end": 73.148,
          "en": "to instead create an expense item",
          "zh": "改成建立一個 expense item"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.148,
          "end": 75.731,
          "en": "where you just pass one prop",
          "zh": "你只傳入一個 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.731,
          "end": 78.64699999999999,
          "en": "that could be titled expense, for example,",
          "zh": "例如它可以命名為 expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.64699999999999,
          "end": 81.523,
          "en": "though the name as you learned is up to you.",
          "zh": "不過就像你學到的，名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.523,
          "end": 84.78,
          "en": "And instead of passing the individual values",
          "zh": "而且與其傳入個別的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.78,
          "end": 86.014,
          "en": "through multiple props,",
          "zh": "透過多個 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.014,
          "end": 89.518,
          "en": "you could then pass the entire data point.",
          "zh": "你可以改為傳入整筆資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.518,
          "end": 91.24,
          "en": "So the entire object in this array",
          "zh": "也就是這個陣列裡的整個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.24,
          "end": 94.87700000000001,
          "en": "in this case here as one single prop.",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡，當成單一個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.87700000000001,
          "end": 97.38900000000001,
          "en": "So as a value for one single prop,",
          "zh": "也就是作為單一個 prop 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.38900000000001,
          "end": 99.75999999999999,
          "en": "the expense prop in this case here,",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡就是 expense 這個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.75999999999999,
          "end": 102.003,
          "en": "two expense item.",
          "zh": "傳給 expense item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.003,
          "end": 103.747,
          "en": "You could do that as well",
          "zh": "你也可以這麼做"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.747,
          "end": 107.632,
          "en": "instead of passing those individual props.",
          "zh": "而不是傳入那些個別的 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.632,
          "end": 110.378,
          "en": "If you would use this approach here",
          "zh": "如果你採用這裡這種做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.378,
          "end": 112.251,
          "en": "where you pass one single prop",
          "zh": "也就是傳入單一個 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.251,
          "end": 114.378,
          "en": "instead of multiple props,",
          "zh": "而不是多個 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.378,
          "end": 116.493,
          "en": "you, of course, also would have to change",
          "zh": "你當然也必須修改"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.493,
          "end": 119.519,
          "en": "the code inside of the component because now,",
          "zh": "元件內部的程式碼，因為現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.519,
          "end": 122.646,
          "en": "you no longer get the title as a prop.",
          "zh": "你不再是以 prop 的形式取得 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.646,
          "end": 125.256,
          "en": "Instead, you only get the expense prop",
          "zh": "而是只會取得 expense 這個 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.256,
          "end": 128.499,
          "en": "or whichever name you chose for the prop.",
          "zh": "或你為這個 prop 選的任何名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.499,
          "end": 130.901,
          "en": "So then here in the receiving component,",
          "zh": "所以在接收端的元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.901,
          "end": 135.03,
          "en": "you would have to write props.expense.title,",
          "zh": "你就必須寫成 props.expense.title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.03,
          "end": 139.143,
          "en": "props.expense.date and props.expense.amount.",
          "zh": "props.expense.date 和 props.expense.amount。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.249,
          "end": 141.507,
          "en": "And of course, now, we would have",
          "zh": "當然，這麼一來我們就得"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.507,
          "end": 144.239,
          "en": "to migrate all expense items",
          "zh": "把所有 expense items 都改成"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.239,
          "end": 146.381,
          "en": "to this alternative way of passing data",
          "zh": "這種傳遞資料的替代方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.381,
          "end": 148.753,
          "en": "to the expense item.",
          "zh": "傳給 expense item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.753,
          "end": 150.38,
          "en": "Now, I wanna emphasize",
          "zh": "好，我想強調"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.38,
          "end": 153.5,
          "en": "that both approaches are fine.",
          "zh": "這兩種做法都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.5,
          "end": 155.005,
          "en": "You can pass a single prop,",
          "zh": "你可以傳入單一個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.005,
          "end": 157.006,
          "en": "which contains the entire object",
          "zh": "裡面包含整個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.006,
          "end": 158.274,
          "en": "or a multiple props,",
          "zh": "或者傳入多個 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 158.274,
          "end": 160.996,
          "en": "which contain the individual values.",
          "zh": "裡面包含個別的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 160.996,
          "end": 162.50900000000001,
          "en": "This is entirely up to you",
          "zh": "這完全取決於你"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 162.50900000000001,
          "end": 164.385,
          "en": "because it's your component",
          "zh": "因為這是你的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.385,
          "end": 165.755,
          "en": "but I definitely wanted",
          "zh": "但我一定要"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 165.755,
          "end": 168.383,
          "en": "to mention this alternative.",
          "zh": "提到這個替代做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.383,
          "end": 170.984,
          "en": "With that, I'll delete this example though",
          "zh": "話雖如此，我還是會把這個範例刪掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 170.984,
          "end": 172.508,
          "en": "and switch back to the approach",
          "zh": "並切換回"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 172.508,
          "end": 173.89,
          "en": "I showed you before",
          "zh": "我之前示範給你看的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 173.89,
          "end": 175.88400000000001,
          "en": "because I think it's a bit easier",
          "zh": "因為我覺得它稍微容易"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 175.88400000000001,
          "end": 177.394,
          "en": "to understand and read,",
          "zh": "理解和閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 177.394,
          "end": 180.66,
          "en": "especially when you're just getting started with React.",
          "zh": "尤其是當你才剛開始學 React 的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 182.497,
          "en": "But you could also pass everything",
          "zh": "不過你也可以把所有東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 182.497,
          "end": 185.487,
          "en": "in one data object.",
          "zh": "放在一個資料物件裡傳入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 185.487,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "When working with props,",
          "zh": "在處理 props 的時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 189.39,
          "en": "both approaches are fine.",
          "zh": "兩種做法都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 189.39,
          "end": 190.415,
          "en": "So with that, I'm of course",
          "zh": "所以，我當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 190.415,
          "end": 192.77100000000002,
          "en": "also updating expense item again",
          "zh": "也再次更新 expense item"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.77100000000002,
          "end": 196.382,
          "en": "and I'm moving back to the individual props.",
          "zh": "並改回使用個別的 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 196.382,
          "end": 199.137,
          "en": "Another alternative syntax you could use",
          "zh": "另一種你可以使用的替代語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 199.137,
          "end": 201.632,
          "en": "when working with props is exclusive",
          "zh": "在處理 props 時，是專門"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 201.632,
          "end": 204.39,
          "en": "to the receiving component.",
          "zh": "用在接收端元件的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 204.39,
          "end": 206.508,
          "en": "There, we're getting this props object",
          "zh": "在那裡，我們會取得這個 props 物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 206.508,
          "end": 209.74,
          "en": "where we're then accessing the different properties.",
          "zh": "然後再存取不同的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 209.74,
          "end": 213.006,
          "en": "In this case, date, title, and amount.",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡是 date、title 和 amount。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 213.006,
          "end": 214.747,
          "en": "Instead of using this approach,",
          "zh": "除了用這種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 214.747,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "we could also use a feature built-in to JavaScript",
          "zh": "我們也可以使用 JavaScript 內建的功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 221.625,
          "en": "and use object destructuring right here",
          "zh": "在這裡直接使用物件解構"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 221.625,
          "end": 223.745,
          "en": "in the parameter list.",
          "zh": "在參數列表裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 223.745,
          "end": 224.737,
          "en": "This might look strange",
          "zh": "這看起來可能有點奇怪"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 224.737,
          "end": 227.749,
          "en": "but it's regular JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "但這是普通的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 227.749,
          "end": 231.149,
          "en": "You can use the object destructuring syntax here",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡使用物件解構語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 231.149,
          "end": 232.249,
          "en": "where you add opening",
          "zh": "也就是加上開頭"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 232.249,
          "end": 235.007,
          "en": "and closing curly braces",
          "zh": "和結尾的大括號"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 235.007,
          "end": 236.39,
          "en": "and where you then refer",
          "zh": "然後你在裡面引用"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 236.39,
          "end": 238.263,
          "en": "to the different properties",
          "zh": "不同的屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 238.263,
          "end": 240.894,
          "en": "of the object you are receiving here,",
          "zh": "也就是你在這裡接收到的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 240.894,
          "end": 243.894,
          "en": "so of the props object in this case,",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡就是 props 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 243.894,
          "end": 248.24099999999999,
          "en": "to pull these values, buy those keys here",
          "zh": "透過這裡的這些鍵把這些值提取出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 248.24099999999999,
          "end": 250.381,
          "en": "out of that incoming object",
          "zh": "從那個傳入的物件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 250.381,
          "end": 253.74099999999999,
          "en": "and store them in locally available variables",
          "zh": "並把它們存到區域可用的變數裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 253.74099999999999,
          "end": 257.253,
          "en": "of these titles, of these names here.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡這些名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 258.506,
          "end": 260.737,
          "en": "With that, the date prop",
          "zh": "這樣一來，date 這個 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 260.737,
          "end": 262.874,
          "en": "would be accessed with just date",
          "zh": "就可以直接用 date 來存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 262.874,
          "end": 265.502,
          "en": "since we're pulling it out here.",
          "zh": "因為我們在這裡把它提取出來了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 265.502,
          "end": 267.741,
          "en": "Title would be accessed under just title",
          "zh": "title 則直接用 title 來存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 267.741,
          "end": 271.379,
          "en": "and amount would be accessed under just amount.",
          "zh": "而 amount 也直接用 amount 來存取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 271.379,
          "end": 274.24,
          "en": "So here, we're using object destructuring.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們用的是物件解構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 274.24,
          "end": 277.126,
          "en": "This is not some special React syntax",
          "zh": "這不是什麼特別的 React 語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 277.126,
          "end": 278.993,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": "或之類的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 278.993,
          "end": 282.162,
          "en": "Instead, it's standard JavaScript syntax",
          "zh": "而是標準的 JavaScript 語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 282.162,
          "end": 284.73199999999997,
          "en": "for using object destructuring",
          "zh": "用來使用物件解構"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 284.73199999999997,
          "end": 287.989,
          "en": "right in the function parameter list.",
          "zh": "就寫在函式參數列表裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 287.989,
          "end": 290.5,
          "en": "Now, again, I will actually switch back",
          "zh": "好，同樣地，我其實會切換回"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 290.5,
          "end": 294.03,
          "en": "to the old approach which we had before",
          "zh": "我們之前用的舊做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 294.03,
          "end": 296.67,
          "en": "where we instead use the .notation",
          "zh": "也就是改用 . 符號"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 296.67,
          "end": 299.04,
          "en": "for accessing the different properties.",
          "zh": "來存取不同的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 299.04,
          "end": 301.138,
          "en": "But I wanted to share this alternative",
          "zh": "但我想分享這個替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 301.138,
          "end": 302.512,
          "en": "since you'll also see that",
          "zh": "因為你也會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 302.512,
          "end": 304.02,
          "en": "in many React projects",
          "zh": "很多 React 專案裡看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 304.02,
          "end": 307.803,
          "en": "and since you personally also might prefer it.",
          "zh": "而且你個人也可能比較喜歡它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595444",
      "title": "Adding \"normal\" JavaScript Logic to Components",
      "sourceHash": "294ec0b78f6b2201e67aab147e500d75a9c0ddd2702b99a17213b013dede6294",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.7,
          "en": "Instructor: Now that we learned about props,",
          "zh": "講師：現在我們學了 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.7,
          "end": 9.466,
          "en": "we're basically done with our first custom component.",
          "zh": "我們的第一個自訂元件基本上完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.466,
          "end": 12.933,
          "en": "This expense item component is now reusable",
          "zh": "這個 expense item 元件現在可以重複使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.933,
          "end": 16.066,
          "en": "and we can use this props concept to configure it",
          "zh": "我們可以用 props 這個概念來設定它"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.066,
          "end": 19.033,
          "en": "differently every time that we're using it.",
          "zh": "每次使用時都能有不同的設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.033,
          "end": 19.333,
          "en": "differently every time that we're using it.",
          "zh": "每次使用時都能有不同的設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.333,
          "end": 22.833,
          "en": "So that the four times we're using ExpenseItem here",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡使用 ExpenseItem 四次"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.833,
          "end": 26.766,
          "en": "we're also getting a different output four times.",
          "zh": "也就會得到四種不同的輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.766,
          "end": 27.166,
          "en": "we're also getting a different output four times.",
          "zh": "也就會得到四種不同的輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.166,
          "end": 29.033,
          "en": "I also just wanna emphasize again,",
          "zh": "我還想再次強調，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.033,
          "end": 32.9,
          "en": "that here we are indeed setting the values",
          "zh": "在這裡我們確實是在設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.9,
          "end": 34.666,
          "en": "for the props dynamically",
          "zh": "props 的值，而且是動態的"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.666,
          "end": 37.866,
          "en": "with this single curly brace syntax",
          "zh": "用這個單一大括號的語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.866,
          "end": 38.166,
          "en": "with this single curly brace syntax",
          "zh": "用這個單一大括號的語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.166,
          "end": 41.2,
          "en": "but we could also just have a hard coded value",
          "zh": "但我們也可以直接用寫死的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.2,
          "end": 42.733,
          "en": "like this here if that is what we needed.",
          "zh": "像這裡這樣，如果這是我們需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.733,
          "end": 44.466,
          "en": "like this here if that is what we needed.",
          "zh": "像這裡這樣，如果這是我們需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.466,
          "end": 48.566,
          "en": "So props are not limited to dynamically set values.",
          "zh": "所以 props 並不限於動態設定的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.566,
          "end": 49.6,
          "en": "We can do that,",
          "zh": "我們可以那樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.6,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "but we don't have to.",
          "zh": "但並非一定要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 54.333,
          "en": "The main idea behind props is always the same though.",
          "zh": "不過 props 背後的主要概念始終相同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.333,
          "end": 58.1,
          "en": "We wanna make sure that we can pass data into our components",
          "zh": "我們想確保可以把資料傳進元件"
        },
