          "start": 58.1,
          "end": 62.366,
          "en": "to make them configurable and reusable.",
          "zh": "讓它們可以設定、可以重複使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.366,
          "end": 65.833,
          "en": "Now let's continue working on that expense item component",
