        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.833,
          "end": 68.43299999999999,
          "en": "and let's continue working on that date.",
          "zh": "也繼續處理那個日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.43299999999999,
          "end": 72.266,
          "en": "Because at the moment this is clearly not too pretty,",
          "zh": "因為目前它顯然不太美觀，"
