          "start": 257.7,
          "end": 260.1,
          "en": "but it is considered a better practice,",
          "zh": "但一般認為更好的做法是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 262.266,
          "en": "and it leads to cleaner code.",
          "zh": "而且會讓程式碼更簡潔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 262.266,
          "end": 264.366,
          "en": "If you extract logic like that,",
          "zh": "如果你把這樣的邏輯抽出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 264.366,
          "end": 267.166,
          "en": "and don't put it into your JSX code,",
          "zh": "不要放在你的 JSX 程式碼裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 267.166,
          "end": 270.5,
          "en": "but instead you create a separate helper variable",
          "zh": "而是建立一個另外的輔助變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 270.5,
          "end": 272.533,
          "en": "or a constant.",
          "zh": "或常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 272.533,
          "end": 272.7,
          "en": "or a constant.",
          "zh": "或常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 272.7,
          "end": 274.366,
          "en": "Something like month here",
          "zh": "例如這裡的 month"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 274.366,
          "end": 276.7,
          "en": "which simply holds that value.",
          "zh": "它就用來保存那個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 276.7,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "And then here between your curly braces in the JSX code",
          "zh": "然後在你的 JSX 程式碼的大括號之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 285.166,
          "en": "you just point at that helper variable or a constant.",
          "zh": "你只要指向那個輔助變數或常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 285.166,
          "end": 285.6,
          "en": "you just point at that helper variable or a constant.",
          "zh": "你只要指向那個輔助變數或常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 285.6,
          "end": 288.866,
          "en": "By doing it like this you keep your JSX code lean",
          "zh": "這樣做可以讓你的 JSX 程式碼保持精簡"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 288.866,
          "end": 292.83299999999997,
          "en": "and you have your more complex logic in the rest",
          "zh": "並把你比較複雜的邏輯放在這個函式"
