        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 345.266,
          "end": 348.1,
          "en": "And if we do that and save that file,",
          "zh": "如果我們這麼做並儲存那個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 348.1,
          "end": 350.633,
          "en": "now we see the month,",
          "zh": "現在我們會看到月份、"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 350.633,
          "end": 354.433,
          "en": "the year and also the day in the month.",
          "zh": "年份，以及月份中的日。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 354.433,
          "end": 354.933,
          "en": "the year and also the day in the month.",
          "zh": "年份，以及月份中的日。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 354.933,
          "end": 358.366,
          "en": "And that's the raw data which I wanna have here.",
          "zh": "這就是我想在這裡呈現的原始資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 358.366,
          "end": 361.766,
          "en": "Now, of course, one crucial thing is missing",
          "zh": "當然，現在還缺了一個關鍵的東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 361.766,
          "end": 363.8,
          "en": "and that would be the styling.",
          "zh": "那就是樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 363.8,
          "end": 363.866,
          "en": "and that would be the styling.",
          "zh": "那就是樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 363.866,
          "end": 365.766,
          "en": "But before we add that,",
          "zh": "但在我們加上之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 365.766,
          "end": 368.466,
          "en": "let's talk about splitting components.",
          "zh": "我們先來談談拆分元件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595448",
      "title": "Splitting Components Into Multiple Components",
      "sourceHash": "53463f31d48a82a7f65cbf6a2ff1874c29e0ed1b83df4a717adc92ffcfd67618",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.666,
          "en": "-: As you work on your React application",
          "zh": "-: 當你在開發你的 React 應用程式時"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.666,
          "end": 8.6,
          "en": "and on your React components,",
          "zh": "以及你的 React 元件時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.6,
          "end": 11.466,
          "en": "you will notice in any project",
          "zh": "你會在任何專案中發現，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.466,
          "end": 15.8,
          "en": "that your components eventually become bigger and bigger.",
          "zh": "你的元件最後都會變得越來越大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.8,
          "end": 20.233,
          "en": "As you have more and more logic and JSX code in them.",
          "zh": "因為裡面的邏輯和 JSX 程式碼只會越來越多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.233,
          "end": 23.766,
          "en": "This is something which will naturally happen.",
          "zh": "這是自然而然會發生的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.766,
          "end": 24.2,
          "en": "This is something which will naturally happen.",
          "zh": "這是自然而然會發生的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.2,
          "end": 28.266,
          "en": "That is why React has this component concept.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼 React 會有元件這個概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.266,
          "end": 30.733,
          "en": "This allows you to split your application",
          "zh": "它讓你可以把應用程式拆解成"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.733,
          "end": 33.466,
          "en": "into smaller building blocks,",
          "zh": "更小的建構區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.466,
          "end": 36.533,
          "en": "where every building block, every component",
          "zh": "而每個建構區塊、每個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.533,
          "end": 40.033,
          "en": "is focused on one core task, you could say.",
          "zh": "都可以說只專注在一個核心任務上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.033,
          "end": 40.266,
          "en": "is focused on one core task, you could say.",
          "zh": "都可以說只專注在一個核心任務上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.266,
          "end": 43.366,
          "en": "And then you build your overall user interface,",
          "zh": "然後你再打造出整體的使用者介面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.366,
          "end": 45.9,
          "en": "by combining these building blocks.",
          "zh": "靠的就是把這些建構區塊組合起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.9,
          "end": 49.066,
          "en": "By doing that, you keep every component on its own",
          "zh": "這樣一來，你就能讓每個元件各自保持在"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.066,
          "end": 51.766,
          "en": "relatively small and manageable,",
          "zh": "相對小巧且易於管理的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.766,
          "end": 55.266,
          "en": "and you keep its code base small and manageable",
          "zh": "也讓它的程式碼庫保持小巧且易於管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.266,
          "end": 59.9,
          "en": "and you still can build a complex user interface.",
          "zh": "同時你依然可以打造出複雜的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.9,
          "end": 64.9,
          "en": "Now, there is no hard rule when to build a new component,",
          "zh": "現在，關於什麼時候該建立新元件，並沒有硬性規定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.9,
          "end": 68.333,
          "en": "whereas as adding more to an existing component.",
          "zh": "或是什麼時候該往現有元件裡繼續加東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.333,
          "end": 68.766,
          "en": "whereas as adding more to an existing component.",
          "zh": "或是什麼時候該往現有元件裡繼續加東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.766,
          "end": 72.5,
          "en": "But in this component here, in this ExpenseItem component,",
          "zh": "但在這裡這個元件、這個 ExpenseItem 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.5,
          "end": 74.033,
          "en": "we could already argue",
          "zh": "我們已經可以說"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.033,
          "end": 76.633,
          "en": "that it's getting a little bit too big,",
          "zh": "它變得有點太大了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.633,
          "end": 80.133,
          "en": "though, I will say that this is definitely still all right.",
          "zh": "不過，我要說的是，這絕對還是沒問題的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.133,
          "end": 85.93299999999999,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we could argue that this date object here,",
          "zh": "話雖如此，我們可以說這裡這個日期物件、"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.93299999999999,
          "end": 90.46600000000001,
          "en": "this calendar item which we wanna show on the user interface",
          "zh": "這個我們想在介面上顯示的日曆項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.46600000000001,
          "end": 94.2,
          "en": "could be treated as a separate component.",
          "zh": "可以被視為一個獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.2,
          "end": 94.43299999999999,
          "en": "could be treated as a separate component.",
          "zh": "可以被視為一個獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.43299999999999,
          "end": 97.6,
          "en": "Of course, the same case could be made for the title",
          "zh": "當然，同樣的道理也可以套用在標題上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.6,
          "end": 98.8,
          "en": "or the amount, or a title and amount combined.",
          "zh": "或是金額上，或是標題和金額合併起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.8,
          "end": 100.866,
          "en": "or the amount, or a title and amount combined.",
          "zh": "或是金額上，或是標題和金額合併起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.866,
          "end": 103.93299999999999,
          "en": "As I said, there is no hard rule.",
          "zh": "就像我說的，沒有硬性規定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.93299999999999,
          "end": 105.733,
          "en": "But since for this calendar,",
          "zh": "但由於對這個日曆來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.733,
          "end": 108.43299999999999,
          "en": "we'll have a couple of helper constants",
          "zh": "我們會用到幾個輔助常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.43299999999999,
          "end": 111.166,
          "en": "and we'll have extra styles.",
          "zh": "而且我們還會有額外的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.166,
          "end": 111.233,
          "en": "and we'll have extra styles.",
          "zh": "而且我們還會有額外的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.233,
          "end": 115.566,
          "en": "I personally like to split this ExpenseItem component here",
          "zh": "我個人喜歡把這裡的 ExpenseItem 元件拆成"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.566,
          "end": 117.5,
          "en": "into two components, the ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "兩個元件，也就是 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.5,
          "end": 119.233,
          "en": "into two components, the ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "兩個元件，也就是 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.233,
          "end": 120.633,
          "en": "which we already have,",
          "zh": "它是我們已經有的那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.633,
          "end": 125.233,
          "en": "and then a new component for rendering this date",
          "zh": "然後再加上一個新元件，用來渲染這個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.233,
          "end": 128.433,
          "en": "in this calendar item look.",
          "zh": "以呈現出這種日曆項目的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.433,
          "end": 130.733,
          "en": "And therefore, we're now going to create",
          "zh": "因此，我們現在要來建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.733,
          "end": 133.733,
          "en": "our second custom component.",
          "zh": "我們的第二個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.733,
          "end": 134.066,
          "en": "our second custom component.",
          "zh": "我們的第二個自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.066,
          "end": 136.4,
          "en": "And for that, I'll create a new file",
          "zh": "為此，我會建立一個新的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.4,
          "end": 142.133,
          "en": "in the components folder and I'll name it, ExpenseDate.js.",
          "zh": "放在 components 資料夾裡，並把它命名為 ExpenseDate.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.133,
          "end": 142.666,
          "en": "in the components folder and I'll name it, ExpenseDate.js.",
          "zh": "放在 components 資料夾裡，並把它命名為 ExpenseDate.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.666,
          "end": 145.03300000000002,
          "en": "Now as always, the file name is up to you",
          "zh": "一如往常，檔名由你自己決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.03300000000002,
          "end": 148.03300000000002,
          "en": "but I recommend that you follow this convention",
          "zh": "但我建議你遵循這個慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.03300000000002,
          "end": 149.4,
          "en": "of naming it like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣來命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.4,
          "end": 152.6,
          "en": "starting with a capital character, one word,",
          "zh": "以大寫字母開頭、是一個單字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.6,
          "end": 154.233,
          "en": "with every extra word",
          "zh": "而後面每個額外的單字"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.233,
          "end": 156.433,
          "en": "also starting with a capital character.",
          "zh": "也以大寫字母開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.433,
          "end": 158.9,
          "en": "And again, it should also express",
          "zh": "另外，它也應該表達出"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.9,
          "end": 161.066,
          "en": "what's happening inside of that file.",
          "zh": "那個檔案裡在發生什麼事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.066,
          "end": 164,
          "en": "What that component will be about.",
          "zh": "這個元件會是關於什麼的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164,
          "end": 165.666,
          "en": "And this component will be",
          "zh": "而這個元件將會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.666,
          "end": 168.7,
          "en": "about rendering the date of an expense.",
          "zh": "負責渲染一筆支出的日期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.7,
          "end": 172.333,
          "en": "Hence this sounds like a fitting name to me.",
          "zh": "因此我覺得這個名字聽起來很合適。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.333,
          "end": 174.466,
          "en": "Now in there, we create a new component",
          "zh": "接著在裡面，我們建立一個新元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 174.466,
          "end": 177.36599999999999,
          "en": "and that still is a function.",
          "zh": "而那仍然是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.36599999999999,
          "end": 177.466,
          "en": "and that still is a function.",
          "zh": "而那仍然是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.466,
          "end": 181.066,
          "en": "Components and React are just regular functions",
          "zh": "React 裡的元件就只是普通的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 181.066,
          "end": 186.233,
          "en": "with the extra twist of returning this JSX code.",
          "zh": "只是多了一個會回傳 JSX 程式碼的特點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.233,
          "end": 188.466,
          "en": "Now I'll name it ExpenseDate, again,",
          "zh": "現在我把它的名字取為 ExpenseDate，同樣地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.466,
          "end": 192.7,
          "en": "following this convention that we repeat the file name here.",
          "zh": "遵循這個慣例，也就是在這裡重複使用檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 192.7,
          "end": 192.86599999999999,
          "en": "following this convention that we repeat the file name here.",
          "zh": "遵循這個慣例，也就是在這裡重複使用檔名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 192.86599999999999,
          "end": 196.433,
          "en": "And I'll then export it to make it reusable",
          "zh": "然後我會把它 export 出去，讓它可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 196.433,
          "end": 200,
          "en": "outside of this file, like this.",
          "zh": "這個檔案之外被重複使用，就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200,
          "end": 204.233,
          "en": "Now in here, I wanna calculate month, day and year.",
          "zh": "現在在這裡，我想計算出月份、日和年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 204.233,
          "end": 205.8,
          "en": "Now in here, I wanna calculate month, day and year.",
          "zh": "現在在這裡，我想計算出月份、日和年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.8,
          "end": 208.833,
          "en": "So I'll cut this logic from ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "所以我會把這段邏輯從 ExpenseItem 剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 208.833,
          "end": 211.766,
          "en": "and move it to ExpenseDate.",
          "zh": "並把它移到 ExpenseDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 211.766,
          "end": 212,
          "en": "and move it to ExpenseDate.",
          "zh": "並把它移到 ExpenseDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212,
          "end": 213.266,
          "en": "And therefore, of course,",
          "zh": "因此，當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 213.266,
          "end": 217.3,
          "en": "I need to accept props as a parameter here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡需要接收 props 當作參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.3,
          "end": 220.433,
          "en": "And I do now expect that this component will be used",
          "zh": "而我現在預期這個元件會被這樣使用："
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 220.433,
          "end": 224.566,
          "en": "such that a date prop is set.",
          "zh": "也就是會設定一個 date prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 224.566,
          "end": 228.733,
          "en": "Now in ExpenseItem, I wanna use this new component.",
          "zh": "現在在 ExpenseItem 裡，我想使用這個新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 228.733,
          "end": 228.966,
          "en": "Now in ExpenseItem, I wanna use this new component.",
          "zh": "現在在 ExpenseItem 裡，我想使用這個新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 228.966,
          "end": 230.333,
          "en": "But before we do that,",
          "zh": "但在我們這麼做之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.333,
          "end": 233.3,
          "en": "I will actually grab this div with the month,",
          "zh": "我其實會把這個裝著月份的 div 取出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 233.3,
          "end": 234.433,
          "en": "I will actually grab this div with the month,",
          "zh": "我其實會把這個裝著月份的 div 取出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 234.433,
          "end": 237.2,
          "en": "year and day inside of it and cut it as well,",
          "zh": "也就是裡面有年份和日的 div，並把它一起剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 237.2,
          "end": 240.533,
          "en": "and return that as JSX code inside of ExpenseDate.js.",
          "zh": "然後在 ExpenseDate.js 裡把它當作 JSX 程式碼回傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 240.533,
          "end": 243.733,
          "en": "and return that as JSX code inside of ExpenseDate.js.",
          "zh": "然後在 ExpenseDate.js 裡把它當作 JSX 程式碼回傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 243.733,
          "end": 244.466,
          "en": "and return that as JSX code inside of ExpenseDate.js.",
          "zh": "然後在 ExpenseDate.js 裡把它當作 JSX 程式碼回傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244.466,
          "end": 249.86599999999999,
          "en": "And now in ExpenseItem, at the top we can add a import.",
          "zh": "接著在 ExpenseItem 中，最上方我們可以加上一個 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 249.86599999999999,
          "end": 256.133,
          "en": "And import ExpenseDate from ./ExpenseDate, like this.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣 import ExpenseDate from ./ExpenseDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 256.133,
          "end": 259.766,
          "en": "./ExpenseDate because we're looking in the same folder",
          "zh": "./ExpenseDate 是因為我們是在同一個資料夾裡尋找，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 259.766,
          "end": 263.2,
          "en": "as the ExpenseItem.js file lives in.",
          "zh": "也就是 ExpenseItem.js 這個檔案所在的資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 263.2,
          "end": 264.666,
          "en": "And now here,",
          "zh": "而現在在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 264.666,
          "end": 268.933,
          "en": "where we previously had our JSX code for the date,",
          "zh": "也就是我們之前放日期 JSX 程式碼的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 268.933,
          "end": 274.6,
          "en": "we instead output this ExpenseDate component.",
          "zh": "我們改成輸出這個 ExpenseDate 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 274.6,
          "end": 275.933,
          "en": "And as a side note,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 275.933,
          "end": 278.433,
          "en": "if you have a component that has no content",
          "zh": "如果你的某個元件在開頭和結尾標籤之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 278.433,
          "end": 280.5,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags,",
          "zh": "沒有任何內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 280.5,
          "end": 280.83299999999997,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags,",
          "zh": "沒有任何內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 280.83299999999997,
          "end": 283.366,
          "en": "you can also write it a little bit differently.",
          "zh": "你也可以用稍微不同的方式來寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 283.366,
          "end": 287.2,
          "en": "You can write it as a self-closing element like this.",
          "zh": "你可以像這樣把它寫成自我閉合的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 287.2,
          "end": 289.6,
          "en": "This is then also, okay.",
          "zh": "這樣寫也是可以的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 289.6,
          "end": 289.9,
          "en": "This is then also, okay.",
          "zh": "這樣寫也是可以的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 289.9,
          "end": 293.1,
          "en": "And we could do the same here in App.js",
          "zh": "我們在 App.js 裡也可以做同樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 293.1,
          "end": 297.1,
          "en": "with the ExpenseItem, since this also has no content",
          "zh": "對 ExpenseItem 也這麼做，因為它同樣在開頭和結尾標籤之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 297.1,
          "end": 299.866,
          "en": "between opening and closing tag.",
          "zh": "也沒有任何內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 299.866,
          "end": 300.166,
          "en": "between opening and closing tag.",
          "zh": "也沒有任何內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 300.166,
          "end": 303.966,
          "en": "This is totally optional but it is quite common to do that,",
          "zh": "這完全是選擇性的，但其實很常這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 303.966,
          "end": 309,
          "en": "if there is no content between the opening and closing tag.",
          "zh": "只要開頭和結尾標籤之間沒有內容就可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 309,
          "end": 314.833,
          "en": "So now we're using ExpenseDate in the ExpenseItem component.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們在 ExpenseItem 元件裡使用了 ExpenseDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.833,
          "end": 316.166,
          "en": "And we're doing this",
          "zh": "而我們這麼做"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 316.166,
          "end": 320.133,
          "en": "to move some of the JSX code and JavaScript logic",
          "zh": "是為了把一些 JSX 程式碼和 JavaScript 邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 320.133,
          "end": 324.33299999999997,
          "en": "out of the ExpenseItem into a separate component.",
          "zh": "從 ExpenseItem 移到一個獨立的元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 324.33299999999997,
          "end": 324.633,
          "en": "out of the ExpenseItem into a separate component.",
          "zh": "從 ExpenseItem 移到一個獨立的元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 324.633,
          "end": 327.9,
          "en": "This component is now again, also reusable",
          "zh": "這個元件現在同樣也是可重複使用的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 327.9,
          "end": 331.533,
          "en": "and we can use it anywhere in this React application,",
          "zh": "我們可以在這個 React 應用程式的任何地方使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 331.533,
          "end": 331.733,
          "en": "and we can use it anywhere in this React application,",
          "zh": "我們可以在這個 React 應用程式的任何地方使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 331.733,
          "end": 333.633,
          "en": "not just at ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "而不只是在 ExpenseItem 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 333.633,
          "end": 336.733,
          "en": "We could use it elsewhere as well, if we wanted to.",
          "zh": "如果我們想的話，也可以把它用在其他地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 336.733,
          "end": 341.133,
          "en": "And it now also helps us with keeping ExpenseItem lean.",
          "zh": "而它現在也幫助我們讓 ExpenseItem 保持精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 341.133,
          "end": 342.8,
          "en": "This is now again, shorter",
          "zh": "它現在又變得更簡短了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 342.8,
          "end": 346.56600000000003,
          "en": "and therefore maybe a bit easier to maintain and manage.",
          "zh": "因此可能也更容易維護和管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 346.56600000000003,
          "end": 346.733,
          "en": "and therefore maybe a bit easier to maintain and manage.",
          "zh": "因此可能也更容易維護和管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 346.733,
          "end": 349.33299999999997,
          "en": "And the bigger your application gets",
          "zh": "而當你的應用程式變得越大、"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 349.33299999999997,
          "end": 351.233,
          "en": "and your components become,",
          "zh": "你的元件也變得越大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 351.233,
          "end": 354.366,
          "en": "the more you wanna look into splitting them up.",
          "zh": "你就越會想研究怎麼把它們拆開來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 354.366,
          "end": 354.633,
          "en": "the more you wanna look into splitting them up.",
          "zh": "你就越會想研究怎麼把它們拆開來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 354.633,
          "end": 358.06600000000003,
          "en": "Though, again, just to really emphasize this,",
          "zh": "不過，再一次強調，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 358.06600000000003,
          "end": 361.3,
          "en": "there is no hard rule on when to split.",
          "zh": "什麼時候該拆分並沒有硬性規定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 361.3,
          "end": 364.066,
          "en": "This is something which will come with experience",
          "zh": "這種事會隨著經驗慢慢累積，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 364.066,
          "end": 366.333,
          "en": "and you'll also see plenty of examples",
          "zh": "而且你也會看到很多例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 366.333,
          "end": 368.5,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": "在整門課程中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 368.5,
          "end": 370.266,
          "en": "Now we must not forget though,",
          "zh": "不過我們千萬不能忘記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 370.266,
          "end": 374.566,
          "en": "that our new ExpenseDate component needs a prop.",
          "zh": "我們新的 ExpenseDate 元件需要一個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 374.566,
          "end": 374.966,
          "en": "that our new ExpenseDate component needs a prop.",
          "zh": "我們新的 ExpenseDate 元件需要一個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 374.966,
          "end": 376.566,
          "en": "It needs the date prop,",
          "zh": "它需要 date 這個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 376.566,
          "end": 378.966,
          "en": "at least that's the name I'm referring to here",
          "zh": "至少我在這裡提到的名字是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 378.966,
          "end": 382.933,
          "en": "inside of ExpenseDate, to well, extract that date",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseDate 裡，好把那個日期取出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 382.933,
          "end": 386.966,
          "en": "and format it and extract the month, day and year.",
          "zh": "加以格式化，並取出月份、日和年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 386.966,
          "end": 390.2,
          "en": "Hence on ExpenseItem or in ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "因此，在使用 ExpenseItem 時，或在 ExpenseItem 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 390.2,
          "end": 392.233,
          "en": "when we use ExpenseDate, we should set the date prop.",
          "zh": "當我們使用 ExpenseDate 時，我們應該設定 date 這個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 392.233,
          "end": 394.666,
          "en": "when we use ExpenseDate, we should set the date prop.",
          "zh": "當我們使用 ExpenseDate 時，我們應該設定 date 這個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 394.666,
          "end": 395.033,
          "en": "when we use ExpenseDate, we should set the date prop.",
          "zh": "當我們使用 ExpenseDate 時，我們應該設定 date 這個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 395.033,
          "end": 398.1,
          "en": "And if you use the different name here in ExpenseDate,",
          "zh": "而如果你在 ExpenseDate 這裡用了不同的名字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 398.1,
          "end": 398.133,
          "en": "And if you use the different name here in ExpenseDate,",
          "zh": "而如果你在 ExpenseDate 這裡用了不同的名字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 398.133,
          "end": 400.766,
          "en": "you, of course, wanna use a different name here",
          "zh": "你當然在這裡也要用不同的名字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 400.766,
          "end": 403.466,
          "en": "instead of date as well.",
          "zh": "而不是用 date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 403.466,
          "end": 408.766,
          "en": "Now, the value which I pass here will just be props.date.",
          "zh": "現在，我在這裡傳入的值就只是 props.date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 408.766,
          "end": 408.866,
          "en": "Now, the value which I pass here will just be props.date.",
          "zh": "現在，我在這裡傳入的值就只是 props.date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 408.866,
          "end": 411.433,
          "en": "And I know that this is now the point",
          "zh": "而我知道，現在正是那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 411.433,
          "end": 414.266,
          "en": "where it can get confusing,",
          "zh": "可能開始讓人混淆的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 414.266,
          "end": 414.433,
          "en": "where it can get confusing,",
          "zh": "可能開始讓人混淆的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 414.433,
          "end": 418.4,
          "en": "because now we're basically funneling some data",
          "zh": "因為我們現在基本上是把一些資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 418.4,
          "end": 422.133,
          "en": "through multiple levels of components.",
          "zh": "穿過一層又一層的元件往下傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 422.133,
          "end": 426.533,
          "en": "In the end, we can see this component tree come to life now,",
          "zh": "到最後，我們現在可以看到這棵元件樹真的活了起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 426.533,
          "end": 426.666,
          "en": "In the end, we can see this component tree come to life now,",
          "zh": "到最後，我們現在可以看到這棵元件樹真的活了起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 426.666,
          "end": 429.533,
          "en": "because now we don't just have the App component",
          "zh": "因為現在我們不只有 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 429.533,
          "end": 432.1,
          "en": "and then one other custom component,",
          "zh": "然後就只有一個其他的自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 432.1,
          "end": 434.3,
          "en": "but we have multiple custom components",
          "zh": "而是我們有多個自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 434.3,
          "end": 437.233,
          "en": "and they are nested inside of each other.",
          "zh": "而且它們彼此巢狀在對方裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 437.233,
          "end": 437.866,
          "en": "and they are nested inside of each other.",
          "zh": "而且它們彼此巢狀在對方裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 437.866,
          "end": 439.733,
          "en": "Just to make this really clear again,",
          "zh": "為了再次把這件事說清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 439.733,
          "end": 443.5,
          "en": "in the App component, we're using the ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "在 App 元件中，我們使用了 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 443.5,
          "end": 443.933,
          "en": "in the App component, we're using the ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "在 App 元件中，我們使用了 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 443.933,
          "end": 444.166,
          "en": "in the App component, we're using the ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "在 App 元件中，我們使用了 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 444.166,
          "end": 446.633,
          "en": "and inside of the ExpenseItem component,",
          "zh": "而在 ExpenseItem 元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 446.633,
          "end": 446.666,
          "en": "and inside of the ExpenseItem component,",
          "zh": "而在 ExpenseItem 元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 446.666,
          "end": 449.033,
          "en": "we're using the ExpenseDate component.",
          "zh": "我們使用了 ExpenseDate 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 449.033,
          "end": 449.266,
          "en": "we're using the ExpenseDate component.",
          "zh": "我們使用了 ExpenseDate 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 449.266,
          "end": 453.33299999999997,
          "en": "And not just that, we're also forwarding our data",
          "zh": "不只如此，我們還把資料繼續往下傳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 453.33299999999997,
          "end": 457.433,
          "en": "with the help of props through multiple components.",
          "zh": "透過 props 的幫助，穿過多個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 457.433,
          "end": 457.733,
          "en": "with the help of props through multiple components.",
          "zh": "透過 props 的幫助，穿過多個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 457.733,
          "end": 462.6,
          "en": "We're passing data from the App component into ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "我們把資料從 App 元件傳進 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 462.6,
          "end": 462.933,
          "en": "We're passing data from the App component into ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "我們把資料從 App 元件傳進 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 462.933,
          "end": 466.366,
          "en": "and in ExpenseItem, were outputting some of the data.",
          "zh": "而在 ExpenseItem 裡，我們輸出其中一部分的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 466.366,
          "end": 470.166,
          "en": "But other parts of the data to be precise, the date,",
          "zh": "但其他部分的資料，具體來說是日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 470.166,
          "end": 470.233,
          "en": "But other parts of the data to be precise, the date,",
          "zh": "但其他部分的資料，具體來說是日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 470.233,
          "end": 473.5,
          "en": "which we here, also already received through props,",
          "zh": "這份資料我們在這裡也已經透過 props 收到了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 473.5,
          "end": 473.6,
          "en": "which we here, also already received through props,",
          "zh": "這份資料我們在這裡也已經透過 props 收到了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 473.6,
          "end": 476.366,
          "en": "it's then forwarded even further",
          "zh": "它接著會被再進一步往前轉送，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 476.366,
          "end": 480.7,
          "en": "into the ExpenseDate component, again, by using props.",
          "zh": "傳進 ExpenseDate 元件，同樣是透過 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 480.7,
          "end": 484.266,
          "en": "Because props are our way of passing data",
          "zh": "因為 props 就是我們傳遞資料的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 484.266,
          "end": 486.066,
          "en": "from component A to B.",
          "zh": "從 A 元件傳到 B 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 486.066,
          "end": 489.733,
          "en": "And it's also totally fine to have a component",
          "zh": "而一個元件只是負責把資料繼續往下傳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 489.733,
          "end": 492.833,
          "en": "which just passes data on.",
          "zh": "這也是完全沒問題的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 492.833,
          "end": 492.933,
          "en": "which just passes data on.",
          "zh": "這也是完全沒問題的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 492.933,
          "end": 494.633,
          "en": "So in the end you could say,",
          "zh": "所以到最後你可以說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 494.633,
          "end": 497.5,
          "en": "we pass data from App to ExpenseDate,",
          "zh": "我們把資料從 App 傳到 ExpenseDate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 497.5,
          "end": 499.433,
          "en": "the date, to be precise, is passed on.",
          "zh": "更精確地說，是日期被傳遞下去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 499.433,
          "end": 503.3,
          "en": "And we passed it on through ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "而我們是透過 ExpenseItem 把它傳下去的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 503.3,
          "end": 503.5,
          "en": "And we passed it on through ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "而我們是透過 ExpenseItem 把它傳下去的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 503.5,
          "end": 505.8,
          "en": "because that's how props work.",
          "zh": "因為 props 就是這樣運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 505.8,
          "end": 511.3,
          "en": "We pass data from a component to a direct child component.",
          "zh": "我們把資料從一個元件傳給它直接的子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 511.3,
          "end": 511.366,
          "en": "We pass data from a component to a direct child component.",
          "zh": "我們把資料從一個元件傳給它直接的子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 511.366,
          "end": 513.066,
          "en": "So to a component which is used",
          "zh": "也就是傳給一個被使用在"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 513.066,
          "end": 515.766,
          "en": "in that other components JSX code",
          "zh": "另一個元件的 JSX 程式碼裡的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 515.766,
          "end": 518.733,
          "en": "and we can't skip such a component.",
          "zh": "而我們不能跳過這樣一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 518.733,
          "end": 518.933,
          "en": "and we can't skip such a component.",
          "zh": "而我們不能跳過這樣一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 518.933,
          "end": 522.1659999999999,
          "en": "So if the date should be passed to ExpenseDate in the end.",
          "zh": "所以如果日期最終應該被傳到 ExpenseDate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 522.1659999999999,
          "end": 525.366,
          "en": "Here, in this case, since we use ExpenseDate",
          "zh": "在這裡，在這個情況下，因為我們是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 525.366,
          "end": 526.933,
          "en": "inside of ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem 裡面使用 ExpenseDate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 526.933,
          "end": 530.4,
          "en": "we first of all have to pass that data to ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "我們首先必須把那份資料傳給 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 530.4,
          "end": 533.933,
          "en": "and then forward it to ExpenseDate.",
          "zh": "然後再把它轉送到 ExpenseDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 533.933,
          "end": 537.333,
          "en": "I hope this is clear, if it's not entirely clear yet,",
          "zh": "我希望這有講清楚，如果還不完全清楚的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 537.333,
          "end": 540.833,
          "en": "that's also something you're going to see in great detail",
          "zh": "那也是你接下來會看到非常詳細解說的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 540.833,
          "end": 544.933,
          "en": "and in many examples throughout the course.",
          "zh": "以及在整門課程中很多例子裡都會看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 544.933,
          "end": 547.3,
          "en": "But with that, we are forwarding the date",
          "zh": "但這樣一來，我們就把日期轉送下去了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 547.3,
          "end": 549.6,
          "en": "and we get this separate component now.",
          "zh": "而現在我們得到了這個獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 549.6,
          "end": 551.466,
          "en": "If we now saved that all,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在把這些全都儲存起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 551.466,
          "end": 555.166,
          "en": "we again see our date data being output here.",
          "zh": "我們就會再次看到我們的日期資料被輸出在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 555.166,
          "end": 555.6,
          "en": "we again see our date data being output here.",
          "zh": "我們就會再次看到我們的日期資料被輸出在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 555.6,
          "end": 557.566,
          "en": "Now we also wanna have some styling",
          "zh": "現在我們也想要有一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 557.566,
          "end": 562.9,
          "en": "and therefore I'll add a new file, the ExpenseDate.css file.",
          "zh": "因此我會新增一個新的檔案，也就是 ExpenseDate.css 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 562.9,
          "end": 563.066,
          "en": "and therefore I'll add a new file, the ExpenseDate.css file.",
          "zh": "因此我會新增一個新的檔案，也就是 ExpenseDate.css 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 563.066,
          "end": 566.1,
          "en": "And you, again, find that file attached.",
          "zh": "而你同樣可以在附件裡找到那個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 566.1,
          "end": 568.566,
          "en": "You can just replace yours with it",
          "zh": "你可以直接用它取代你自己的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 568.566,
          "end": 572.3,
          "en": "or open it and copy everything you find in the attached file",
          "zh": "或是打開它，把你在附件檔案裡找到的所有內容複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 572.3,
          "end": 576.1,
          "en": "into your ExpenseDate.css file.",
          "zh": "到你的 ExpenseDate.css 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 576.1,
          "end": 576.366,
          "en": "into your ExpenseDate.css file.",
          "zh": "到你的 ExpenseDate.css 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 576.366,
          "end": 578.066,
          "en": "And once you did that,",
          "zh": "而當你做完這些之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 578.066,
          "end": 581.4,
          "en": "you can go to the ExpenseDate.js file.",
          "zh": "你可以前往 ExpenseDate.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 581.4,
          "end": 583.4,
          "en": "And at the very top of that file,",
          "zh": "然後在那個檔案的最上方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 583.4,
          "end": 588.533,
          "en": "import ./ExpenseDate.css",
          "zh": "import ./ExpenseDate.css"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 588.533,
          "end": 588.6659999999999,
          "en": "import ./ExpenseDate.css",
          "zh": "import ./ExpenseDate.css"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 588.6659999999999,
          "end": 592.933,
          "en": "to make the entire project set up aware of that CSS file.",
          "zh": "好讓整個專案設定都能知道這個 CSS 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 592.933,
          "end": 596.033,
          "en": "And then add a couple of CSS classes here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡加上幾個 CSS class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 596.033,
          "end": 596.4,
          "en": "And then add a couple of CSS classes here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡加上幾個 CSS class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 596.4,
          "end": 599.9,
          "en": "On the surrounding div, we add a class name",
          "zh": "在外層包住的 div 上，我們加上一個 class name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 599.9,
          "end": 603.2,
          "en": "of expense-date, for example.",
          "zh": "例如 expense-date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 603.2,
          "end": 611,
          "en": "On that month div, we add expense-date__month.",
          "zh": "在那個月份的 div 上，我們加上 expense-date__month。"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 611,
          "end": 611.566,
          "en": "On that month div, we add expense-date__month.",
          "zh": "在那個月份的 div 上，我們加上 expense-date__month。"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 611.566,
          "end": 618.2,
          "en": "For the year div, we add expense-date__year.",
          "zh": "在年份的 div 上，我們加上 expense-date__year。"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 618.2,
          "end": 618.566,
          "en": "For the year div, we add expense-date__year.",
          "zh": "在年份的 div 上，我們加上 expense-date__year。"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 618.566,
          "end": 624.633,
          "en": "And for the day, we add expense-date__day.",
          "zh": "而在日的 div 上，我們加上 expense-date__day。"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 624.633,
          "end": 627.066,
          "en": "And here I imported the wrong file.",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我 import 錯了檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 627.066,
          "end": 630.7,
          "en": "This should of course be ExpenseDate.css.",
          "zh": "這當然應該是 ExpenseDate.css。"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 630.7,
          "end": 631.3,
          "en": "This should of course be ExpenseDate.css.",
          "zh": "這當然應該是 ExpenseDate.css。"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 631.3,
          "end": 633.3,
          "en": "And with all of that done, if we saved this.",
          "zh": "做完這一切之後，如果我們把這些儲存起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 633.3,
          "end": 638.433,
          "en": "Now, we got this nice look here for our dates.",
          "zh": "現在，我們的日期就有了這裡這個漂亮的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 638.433,
          "end": 638.566,
          "en": "Now, we got this nice look here for our dates.",
          "zh": "現在，我們的日期就有了這裡這個漂亮的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 638.566,
          "end": 640.3,
          "en": "And this looks much nicer.",
          "zh": "而這看起來好看多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 640.3,
          "end": 644.333,
          "en": "And we also practiced how we can add yet another component.",
          "zh": "而我們也練習了如何再新增另一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 644.333,
          "end": 646.866,
          "en": "And adding this component was optional,",
          "zh": "而新增這個元件是選擇性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 646.866,
          "end": 649.633,
          "en": "we could have put everything into ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "我們本來可以把所有東西都放進 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 649.633,
          "end": 649.6659999999999,
          "en": "we could have put everything into ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "我們本來可以把所有東西都放進 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 649.6659999999999,
          "end": 651.133,
          "en": "The entire JSX code",
          "zh": "整個 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 651.133,
          "end": 653.1659999999999,
          "en": "which we have in a separate component now,",
          "zh": "也就是我們現在放在獨立元件裡的那些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 653.1659999999999,
          "end": 654.6659999999999,
          "en": "the helper constants,",
          "zh": "還有那些輔助常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 654.6659999999999,
          "end": 657.266,
          "en": "we could have added this all into one component.",
          "zh": "我們本來可以把它們全部放進同一個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 657.266,
          "end": 657.5,
          "en": "we could have added this all into one component.",
          "zh": "我們本來可以把它們全部放進同一個元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 657.5,
          "end": 659.8,
          "en": "We could have also added the CSS code here",
          "zh": "我們本來也可以把 CSS 程式碼加在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 659.8,
          "end": 662.5,
          "en": "in the ExpenseItem.css code.",
          "zh": "加在 ExpenseItem.css 的程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 662.5,
          "end": 664.5,
          "en": "But then this ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "但那樣一來，這個 ExpenseItem 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 664.5,
          "end": 666.333,
          "en": "would become bigger and bigger.",
          "zh": "就會變得越來越大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 666.333,
          "end": 666.633,
          "en": "would become bigger and bigger.",
          "zh": "就會變得越來越大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 666.633,
          "end": 669.533,
          "en": "And whilst in this case, it would have still been fine.",
          "zh": "而在這個情況下，這樣做其實也還過得去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 669.533,
          "end": 671.566,
          "en": "It is generally a good practice",
          "zh": "但一般來說，這是個好做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 671.566,
          "end": 674.3,
          "en": "to keep your components small and focused,",
          "zh": "也就是讓你的元件保持小巧而專注，"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 674.3,
          "end": 677.833,
          "en": "and that is why we did extract this extra component here.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這裡拆出這個額外元件的原因。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595454",
      "title": "The Concept of \"Composition\" (\"children props\")",
      "sourceHash": "41a601ff67c42a155e1b58aceb4a8a213784f0bf6bfd537d4c936f7d8a5b722d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 5.166,
          "en": "Maximilian: So by now we got components everywhere.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：到目前為止，我們到處都在用元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.166,
          "end": 6.766,
          "en": "We got the Expenses component,",
          "zh": "我們有 Expenses 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.766,
          "end": 10.166,
          "en": "ExpenseItem, ExpenseDate, app, yeah.",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem、ExpenseDate、App，沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.166,
          "end": 11.766,
          "en": "A lot of components.",
          "zh": "很多元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.766,
          "end": 15.4,
          "en": "But that really is what React is all about.",
          "zh": "但這正是 React 的核心所在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.4,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "But that really is what React is all about.",
          "zh": "但這正是 React 的核心所在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.6,
          "end": 17.2,
          "en": "Now, obviously throughout this course",
          "zh": "現在，很明顯地，在這門課程中"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.2,
          "end": 19.233,
          "en": "we're going to learn about more features,",
          "zh": "我們會學到更多功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.233,
          "end": 20.966,
          "en": "which we can add to these components",
          "zh": "我們可以把這些功能加到元件上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.966,
          "end": 23.066,
          "en": "to make them more interactive, to improve their performance,",
          "zh": "讓它們更具互動性、提升它們的效能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.066,
          "end": 25.1,
          "en": "to make them more interactive, to improve their performance,",
          "zh": "讓它們更具互動性、提升它們的效能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.1,
          "end": 28.533,
          "en": "to send Http requests and much more,",
          "zh": "發送 Http 請求以及更多其他事情，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.533,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "but in a nutshell, and that's really important,",
          "zh": "但總而言之，而這點非常重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 34.266,
          "en": "it's all about components",
          "zh": "一切都在於元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.266,
          "end": 34.4,
          "en": "it's all about components",
          "zh": "一切都在於元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.4,
          "end": 37.9,
          "en": "and it's about props for configuring these components",
          "zh": "以及用來設定這些元件的 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.9,
          "end": 40,
          "en": "for passing data into them.",
          "zh": "用來把資料傳進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40,
          "end": 40.166,
          "en": "for passing data into them.",
          "zh": "用來把資料傳進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 40.166,
          "end": 45.133,
          "en": "And components really just are these custom HTML elements",
          "zh": "而元件其實就是這些自訂的 HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.133,
          "end": 48.433,
          "en": "where you combine HTML code,",
          "zh": "你在裡面結合 HTML 程式碼、"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.433,
          "end": 51.466,
          "en": "JSX code to be precise and styling",
          "zh": "精確來說是 JSX 程式碼，還有樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.466,
          "end": 51.733,
          "en": "JSX code to be precise and styling",
          "zh": "精確來說是 JSX 程式碼，還有樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.733,
          "end": 56.033,
          "en": "and if you want to, also extra JavaScript logic,",
          "zh": "如果你想要的話，也能加上額外的 JavaScript 邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.033,
          "end": 58.733,
          "en": "as we're doing it in ExpenseDate.",
          "zh": "就像我們在 ExpenseDate 裡做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 58.733,
          "end": 63.1,
          "en": "That is really what components are about.",
          "zh": "這就是元件的真正意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.1,
          "end": 65.9,
          "en": "Now I did mention it multiple times already.",
          "zh": "我已經提過很多次了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.9,
          "end": 67.666,
          "en": "We build all these components",
          "zh": "我們建立所有這些元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.666,
          "end": 70.4,
          "en": "to then build a user interface",
          "zh": "然後用來建立使用者介面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.4,
          "end": 70.566,
          "en": "to then build a user interface",
          "zh": "然後用來建立使用者介面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.566,
          "end": 72.666,
          "en": "and we are already doing that.",
          "zh": "而我們已經在這麼做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.666,
          "end": 75.466,
          "en": "In App.js we're using Expenses,",
          "zh": "在 App.js 裡我們使用了 Expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.466,
          "end": 75.766,
          "en": "In App.js we're using Expenses,",
          "zh": "在 App.js 裡我們使用了 Expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 75.766,
          "end": 78.1,
          "en": "in there we are using ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "在那裡面我們使用了 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.1,
          "end": 80.96600000000001,
          "en": "in there we're using ExpenseDate.",
          "zh": "在那裡面我們使用了 ExpenseDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 80.96600000000001,
          "end": 84.46600000000001,
          "en": "Generally, this approach of building a user interface",
          "zh": "一般來說，這種建立使用者介面的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.46600000000001,
          "end": 88.733,
          "en": "from smaller building blocks is called composition.",
          "zh": "用較小的積木來組成，就叫做組合（composition）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.733,
          "end": 89.2,
          "en": "from smaller building blocks is called composition.",
          "zh": "用較小的積木來組成，就叫做組合（composition）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.2,
          "end": 92.033,
          "en": "Now there's one specifically interesting aspect",
          "zh": "現在，組合有一個特別有趣的面向，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 92.033,
          "end": 96.93299999999999,
          "en": "of composition, which we haven't seen thus far though.",
          "zh": "是我們到目前為止還沒看過的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 96.93299999999999,
          "end": 100.26599999999999,
          "en": "What if we wanted to create a component",
          "zh": "如果我們想建立一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 100.26599999999999,
          "end": 103.63300000000001,
          "en": "which actually just serves as a shell",
          "zh": "它其實只是作為一個外殼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 103.63300000000001,
          "end": 107.2,
          "en": "around any kind of other content.",
          "zh": "包住任何其他類型的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 107.2,
          "end": 107.46600000000001,
          "en": "around any kind of other content.",
          "zh": "包住任何其他類型的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 107.46600000000001,
          "end": 110.666,
          "en": "At the moment, we have highly specific components.",
          "zh": "目前我們有的是非常特定的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.666,
          "end": 114.26599999999999,
          "en": "The ExpenseDate component is about outputting a date",
          "zh": "ExpenseDate 元件就是為了輸出日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 114.26599999999999,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "The ExpenseDate component is about outputting a date",
          "zh": "ExpenseDate 元件就是為了輸出日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 114.3,
          "end": 119,
          "en": "in exactly that format and in exactly that look.",
          "zh": "以完全固定的格式和完全固定的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 119,
          "end": 120.966,
          "en": "The ExpenseItem component is just",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem 元件就只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 120.966,
          "end": 123.233,
          "en": "about outputting an expense item.",
          "zh": "用來輸出一筆支出項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 123.233,
          "end": 123.533,
          "en": "about outputting an expense item.",
          "zh": "用來輸出一筆支出項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 123.533,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "And in your React application,",
          "zh": "而在你的 React 應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.1,
          "en": "you will always have a lot of these",
          "zh": "你永遠會有很多這種"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 128.1,
          "end": 130.9,
          "en": "very specific components.",
          "zh": "非常特定的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 130.9,
          "end": 135.766,
          "en": "All these components are also just configured through props,",
          "zh": "這些元件也都只是透過 prop 來設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 135.766,
          "end": 138.933,
          "en": "through the date prop, the title prop, the amount prop",
          "zh": "透過 date prop、title prop、amount prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 138.933,
          "end": 141.966,
          "en": "in the case of ExpenseItem, for example.",
          "zh": "以 ExpenseItem 為例的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 141.966,
          "end": 142.233,
          "en": "in the case of ExpenseItem, for example.",
          "zh": "以 ExpenseItem 為例的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 142.233,
          "end": 144.333,
          "en": "And again, that is fairly standard.",
          "zh": "再次強調，這相當標準。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 144.333,
          "end": 146.4,
          "en": "You'll have a lot of these components",
          "zh": "你的 React 應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 149.333,
          "en": "in your React applications.",
          "zh": "會有很多這樣的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 149.333,
          "end": 152,
          "en": "Sometimes however, you wanna have a component",
          "zh": "不過有時候，你會想要一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 152,
          "end": 155.933,
          "en": "where you don't configure everything through props",
          "zh": "它不是所有東西都透過 prop 來設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 155.933,
          "end": 159.03300000000002,
          "en": "but where instead you're able to pass content",
          "zh": "而是你能夠傳入內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 159.03300000000002,
          "end": 164,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags of that component.",
          "zh": "放在那個元件的開頭與結尾標籤之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 164,
          "end": 164.233,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags of that component.",
          "zh": "放在那個元件的開頭與結尾標籤之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 164.233,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "And here's an example where this would make sense.",
          "zh": "這裡有個例子可以說明這什麼時候合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 171.6,
          "en": "If we have a look at our current output,",
          "zh": "如果我們看看目前的輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 171.6,
          "end": 173.066,
          "en": "then we see",
          "zh": "就會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 173.066,
          "end": 174.7,
          "en": "two kind of",
          "zh": "兩種"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 174.7,
          "end": 177.733,
          "en": "boxes or containers.",
          "zh": "方框或容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 177.733,
          "end": 178.166,
          "en": "boxes or containers.",
          "zh": "方框或容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 178.166,
          "end": 181.666,
          "en": "We got a container around all the expense items.",
          "zh": "我們有一個容器包住所有支出項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 181.666,
          "end": 185.6,
          "en": "It has a light gray background, and rounded corners,",
          "zh": "它有淺灰色的背景、圓角，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 185.6,
          "end": 189.833,
          "en": "and a slight drop shadow, which might be hard to see.",
          "zh": "還有一點點陰影，可能不太好看出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 189.833,
          "end": 193.766,
          "en": "And we have a container around the overall expenses list,",
          "zh": "而我們有一個容器包住整個支出清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 193.766,
          "end": 193.966,
          "en": "And we have a container around the overall expenses list,",
          "zh": "而我們有一個容器包住整個支出清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 193.966,
          "end": 196.36599999999999,
          "en": "with a darker gray background",
          "zh": "帶有較深的灰色背景，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 196.36599999999999,
          "end": 201.566,
          "en": "but also rounded corners and a slight drop shadow.",
          "zh": "但同樣有圓角和一點點陰影。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 201.566,
          "end": 203.566,
          "en": "Now, the idea behind all of these components",
          "zh": "這些元件背後的想法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 203.566,
          "end": 206.1,
          "en": "is to have reusable building blocks",
          "zh": "就是要擁有可重複使用的積木，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 206.1,
          "end": 209.9,
          "en": "also to avoid code duplication.",
          "zh": "同時避免程式碼重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 209.9,
          "end": 211.066,
          "en": "And here at the moment",
          "zh": "而目前在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 211.066,
          "end": 214.633,
          "en": "we at least have some style duplication,",
          "zh": "我們至少有一些樣式重複，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 214.633,
          "end": 219.8,
          "en": "also maybe some HTML structure duplication.",
          "zh": "或許也有一些 HTML 結構重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 219.8,
          "end": 220.03300000000002,
          "en": "also maybe some HTML structure duplication.",
          "zh": "或許也有一些 HTML 結構重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 220.03300000000002,
          "end": 223.8,
          "en": "Expenses has a div which surrounds our expenses",
          "zh": "Expenses 有一個 div 包住我們的支出內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 223.8,
          "end": 226.9,
          "en": "which applies certain styles, thanks to this class.",
          "zh": "它透過這個 class 套用某些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 226.9,
          "end": 230.2,
          "en": "And the same is true for ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem 也是一樣的情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 230.2,
          "end": 233.766,
          "en": "Now, of course not all divs have the same look though.",
          "zh": "當然，並不是所有 div 的外觀都一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 233.766,
          "end": 233.9,
          "en": "Now, of course not all divs have the same look though.",
          "zh": "當然，並不是所有 div 的外觀都一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 233.9,
          "end": 235.86599999999999,
          "en": "Inside of our expense items we also got divs like this one",
          "zh": "在我們的支出項目裡面也有像這樣的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 235.86599999999999,
          "end": 237.933,
          "en": "Inside of our expense items we also got divs like this one",
          "zh": "在我們的支出項目裡面也有像這樣的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 237.933,
          "end": 240.2,
          "en": "which have a totally different look.",
          "zh": "它們的外觀完全不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 240.2,
          "end": 244.966,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we could extract this surrounding container div",
          "zh": "儘管如此，我們可以把這個外圍的容器 div 抽出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 244.966,
          "end": 248.8,
          "en": "which we have both in ExpenseItem and Expenses.js",
          "zh": "它在 ExpenseItem 和 Expenses.js 裡都有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 248.8,
          "end": 249.2,
          "en": "which we have both in ExpenseItem and Expenses.js",
          "zh": "它在 ExpenseItem 和 Expenses.js 裡都有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 249.2,
          "end": 252.033,
          "en": "and extract the styles they have in common,",
          "zh": "並把它們共有的樣式抽出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 252.033,
          "end": 254.633,
          "en": "like rounded corners and a drop shadow,",
          "zh": "例如圓角和陰影，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 254.633,
          "end": 257.666,
          "en": "into a separate component.",
          "zh": "放進一個獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 257.666,
          "end": 260.633,
          "en": "And we could name such a component card",
          "zh": "我們可以把這樣的元件命名為 card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 260.633,
          "end": 260.666,
          "en": "And we could name such a component card",
          "zh": "我們可以把這樣的元件命名為 card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 260.666,
          "end": 264,
          "en": "because this is a specific card look.",
          "zh": "因為這是一種特定的卡片外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 264,
          "end": 264.133,
          "en": "because this is a specific card look.",
          "zh": "因為這是一種特定的卡片外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 264.133,
          "end": 266.266,
          "en": "And this is not a term I came up with.",
          "zh": "而這不是我自創的詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 266.266,
          "end": 269.2,
          "en": "Instead in general, in web development,",
          "zh": "相反地，一般在網頁開發中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 269.2,
          "end": 271,
          "en": "when you hear the term card,",
          "zh": "當你聽到 card 這個詞，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 271,
          "end": 274.033,
          "en": "it's typically means some kind of container look",
          "zh": "它通常指的是某種容器的外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 274.033,
          "end": 277.5,
          "en": "with rounded corners, drop shadows, and elements like these.",
          "zh": "有圓角、陰影，以及這類的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 277.5,
          "end": 281.33299999999997,
          "en": "So that's why I'm picking card as a name here.",
          "zh": "所以我才在這裡選擇 card 這個名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 281.33299999999997,
          "end": 283.6,
          "en": "Now, such a card component",
          "zh": "現在，這樣的 card 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 283.6,
          "end": 286.06600000000003,
          "en": "is still a regular component here.",
          "zh": "在這裡仍然是一個一般的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 286.06600000000003,
          "end": 289.533,
          "en": "So let's create it as such",
          "zh": "所以我們就照一般方式建立它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 289.533,
          "end": 289.83299999999997,
          "en": "So let's create it as such",
          "zh": "所以我們就照一般方式建立它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 289.83299999999997,
          "end": 293.733,
          "en": "but such a card component could now do one main thing.",
          "zh": "但這樣的 card 元件現在可以做一件主要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 293.733,
          "end": 295.3,
          "en": "It could return a div",
          "zh": "它可以回傳一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 295.3,
          "end": 299.56600000000003,
          "en": "or any other kind of container HTML element",
          "zh": "或任何其他種類的容器 HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 299.56600000000003,
          "end": 301.433,
          "en": "with a class name",
          "zh": "帶有一個 class 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 301.433,
          "end": 303.366,
          "en": "of let's say,",
          "zh": "比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 303.366,
          "end": 305.2,
          "en": "Card.",
          "zh": "Card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 305.2,
          "end": 305.666,
          "en": "Card.",
          "zh": "Card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 305.666,
          "end": 309.3,
          "en": "And then we could add a Card.css file",
          "zh": "然後我們可以新增一個 Card.css 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 309.3,
          "end": 309.366,
          "en": "And then we could add a Card.css file",
          "zh": "然後我們可以新增一個 Card.css 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 309.366,
          "end": 312.466,
          "en": "and import that into that card component.",
          "zh": "並把它 import 到那個 card 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 312.466,
          "end": 317.033,
          "en": "So import Card.css,",
          "zh": "所以 import Card.css，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 317.033,
          "end": 321.366,
          "en": "and now in the Card.css file we could have, let's say,",
          "zh": "現在在 Card.css 檔案裡我們可以有，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 321.366,
          "end": 322.7,
          "en": "the box-shadow and the border-radius from Expenses.css.",
          "zh": "從 Expenses.css 來的 box-shadow 和 border-radius。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 322.7,
          "end": 327.466,
          "en": "the box-shadow and the border-radius from Expenses.css.",
          "zh": "從 Expenses.css 來的 box-shadow 和 border-radius。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 327.466,
          "end": 330.166,
          "en": "Maybe we would be able to extract more styles",
          "zh": "也許我們還能抽出更多樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 330.166,
          "end": 332.166,
          "en": "but I'll go with these two.",
          "zh": "但我就先用這兩個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 332.166,
          "end": 337.533,
          "en": "I'll cut them from Expenses.css and add them to Card.css",
          "zh": "我會把它們從 Expenses.css 剪下並加到 Card.css，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 337.533,
          "end": 344.4,
          "en": "inside of a card CSS class selector, which I added there.",
          "zh": "放進我在那裡新增的 card CSS class 選擇器裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 344.4,
          "end": 347.966,
          "en": "I will also go to ExpenseItem.css",
          "zh": "我也會到 ExpenseItem.css，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 347.966,
          "end": 350.6,
          "en": "and here in ExpenseItem in this class selector,",
          "zh": "而在這裡的 ExpenseItem，在這個 class 選擇器裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 350.6,
          "end": 354.866,
          "en": "we all defined a box-shadow and a border-radius.",
          "zh": "我們也定義了 box-shadow 和 border-radius。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 354.866,
          "end": 354.933,
          "en": "we all defined a box-shadow and a border-radius.",
          "zh": "我們也定義了 box-shadow 和 border-radius。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 354.933,
          "end": 359.3,
          "en": "So I will remove these styles from there as well.",
          "zh": "所以我會把這些樣式從那裡也移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 359.3,
          "end": 360.733,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing that?",
          "zh": "那麼，我為什麼要這麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 360.733,
          "end": 361.1,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing that?",
          "zh": "那麼，我為什麼要這麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 361.1,
          "end": 365.233,
          "en": "Just to show this kind of component.",
          "zh": "只是為了展示這類元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 365.233,
          "end": 365.533,
          "en": "Just to show this kind of component.",
          "zh": "只是為了展示這類元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 365.533,
          "end": 370.666,
          "en": "Now we got this card container component you could say,",
          "zh": "現在我們有了這個可以說是 card 容器的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 370.666,
          "end": 373.933,
          "en": "which should act as a shell around",
          "zh": "它應該作為一個外殼，包住"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 373.933,
          "end": 379.83299999999997,
          "en": "either our ExpenseItem content or our Expenses content.",
          "zh": "我們的 ExpenseItem 內容或 Expenses 內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 379.83299999999997,
          "end": 381.1,
          "en": "And that's the key.",
          "zh": "而這就是關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 381.1,
          "end": 381.4,
          "en": "And that's the key.",
          "zh": "而這就是關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 381.4,
          "end": 384.766,
          "en": "This card component will now not be configured",
          "zh": "這個 card 元件現在不會是透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 384.766,
          "end": 386.9,
          "en": "through some attributes.",
          "zh": "某些屬性來設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 386.9,
          "end": 391.066,
          "en": "Instead, my idea would be that,",
          "zh": "相反地，我的想法是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 391.066,
          "end": 393.3,
          "en": "let's say in ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "比如說在 ExpenseItem 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 393.3,
          "end": 396.466,
          "en": "we can simply replace this built-in div",
          "zh": "我們可以直接把這個內建的 div 換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 396.466,
          "end": 396.633,
          "en": "we can simply replace this built-in div",
          "zh": "我們可以直接把這個內建的 div 換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 396.633,
          "end": 400.233,
          "en": "with our custom card component.",
          "zh": "我們自訂的 card 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 400.233,
          "end": 400.7,
          "en": "with our custom card component.",
          "zh": "我們自訂的 card 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 400.7,
          "end": 403.2,
          "en": "And then we get these predefined styles",
          "zh": "然後我們就會得到這些預先定義好的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 403.2,
          "end": 406.166,
          "en": "for the card automatically.",
          "zh": "自動套用在 card 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 406.166,
          "end": 408.4,
          "en": "Maybe we then just want to make them extensible",
          "zh": "也許我們之後只是想讓它們可以擴充，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 408.4,
          "end": 412.33299999999997,
          "en": "but we get these predefined styles automatically.",
          "zh": "但我們會自動得到這些預先定義好的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 412.33299999999997,
          "end": 413.33299999999997,
          "en": "And for that of course,",
          "zh": "當然，為了做到這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 413.33299999999997,
          "end": 420.3,
          "en": "we wanna import Card from ./Card inside of ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "我們想在 ExpenseItem 裡 import Card from ./Card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 420.3,
          "end": 423.133,
          "en": "The thing just is if I save that,",
          "zh": "問題是，如果我儲存它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 423.133,
          "end": 426.766,
          "en": "you will see that all the expense items are lost.",
          "zh": "你會看到所有支出項目都不見了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 426.766,
          "end": 427.566,
          "en": "you will see that all the expense items are lost.",
          "zh": "你會看到所有支出項目都不見了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 427.566,
          "end": 430.766,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that out of the box,",
          "zh": "原因是，在預設情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 430.766,
          "end": 431.966,
          "en": "just like that,",
          "zh": "就這樣直接用的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 431.966,
          "end": 435.933,
          "en": "you can't use your custom components as wrappers",
          "zh": "你不能把自訂元件當作外殼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 435.933,
          "end": 438.466,
          "en": "around other kind of content.",
          "zh": "包住其他類型的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 438.466,
          "end": 441.6,
          "en": "Having content between opening and closing tags",
          "zh": "在開頭和結尾標籤之間放入內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 441.6,
          "end": 444.1,
          "en": "doesn't work just like that.",
          "zh": "不能就這樣直接運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 444.1,
          "end": 444.33299999999997,
          "en": "doesn't work just like that.",
          "zh": "不能就這樣直接運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 444.33299999999997,
          "end": 447.5,
          "en": "But of course it does work for built-in HTML elements,",
          "zh": "但當然，它對內建的 HTML 元素是可行的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 447.5,
          "end": 450.233,
          "en": "like the div or the h2 tag.",
          "zh": "像是 div 或 h2 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 450.233,
          "end": 452.83299999999997,
          "en": "So it would be nice if we could also make it work",
          "zh": "所以如果我們也能讓它"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 452.83299999999997,
          "end": 454.733,
          "en": "for our custom components",
          "zh": "對我們的自訂元件運作，那就太好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 454.733,
          "end": 458,
          "en": "to build such reusable wrapper components",
          "zh": "用來建立這種可重複使用的外殼元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 458,
          "end": 460.433,
          "en": "like this, for example.",
          "zh": "就像這個例子一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 460.433,
          "end": 463.33299999999997,
          "en": "And of course, React has a solution here.",
          "zh": "而當然，React 對此有解決方案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 463.33299999999997,
          "end": 467.1,
          "en": "We can build such wrapper components.",
          "zh": "我們可以建立這樣的外殼元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 467.1,
          "end": 471.2,
          "en": "In Card.js we again, when I accept props.",
          "zh": "在 Card.js 裡，我們同樣地，當我接收 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 471.2,
          "end": 471.5,
          "en": "In Card.js we again, when I accept props.",
          "zh": "在 Card.js 裡，我們同樣地，當我接收 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 471.5,
          "end": 475.466,
          "en": "But now, as I mentioned we'll not work with some attributes",
          "zh": "但現在，如我所提到的，我們不會使用某些屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 475.466,
          "end": 478.8,
          "en": "but instead we will use one special prop",
          "zh": "而是會使用一個特別的 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 478.8,
          "end": 482.733,
          "en": "which is built into React, which every component receives,",
          "zh": "它內建於 React，每個元件都會收到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 482.733,
          "end": 486,
          "en": "even if you're never setting it explicitly.",
          "zh": "即使你從來沒有明確設定它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 486,
          "end": 488.9,
          "en": "And that's a prop which value I wanna output",
          "zh": "而那就是我想要把它的值輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 488.9,
          "end": 492.3,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tag of this div,",
          "zh": "在這個 div 的開頭與結尾標籤之間的那個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 492.3,
          "end": 494.7,
          "en": "inside of the card component function.",
          "zh": "在 card 元件的函式裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 494.7,
          "end": 496.966,
          "en": "It's the props",
          "zh": "它就是 props 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 496.966,
          "end": 499.866,
          "en": "children prop.",
          "zh": "children prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 499.866,
          "end": 503,
          "en": "Children is a reserved name.",
          "zh": "children 是一個保留名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 503,
          "end": 506.6,
          "en": "We don't set a children prop on this card.",
          "zh": "我們不會在這個 card 上設定 children prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 506.6,
          "end": 508.166,
          "en": "I'm setting a class named prop",
          "zh": "我設定的是 class name prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 508.166,
          "end": 511.233,
          "en": "and actually at the moment, this won't do anything.",
          "zh": "而實際上目前這不會有任何效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 511.233,
          "end": 514.2,
          "en": "But I'm not setting a children prop.",
          "zh": "但我並沒有設定 children prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 514.2,
          "end": 514.7,
          "en": "But I'm not setting a children prop.",
          "zh": "但我並沒有設定 children prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 514.7,
          "end": 517.233,
          "en": "Children, as I said, is a reserved name",
          "zh": "children，如我所說，是一個保留名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 517.233,
          "end": 520.833,
          "en": "and the value of this special children prop",
          "zh": "而這個特別的 children prop 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 520.833,
          "end": 523.133,
          "en": "will always be the content",
          "zh": "永遠會是內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 523.133,
          "end": 525.7,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags",
          "zh": "介於開頭與結尾標籤之間的"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 525.7,
          "end": 528.066,
          "en": "of your custom component.",
          "zh": "你的自訂元件的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 528.066,
          "end": 528.2,
          "en": "of your custom component.",
          "zh": "你的自訂元件的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 528.2,
          "end": 529.566,
          "en": "So in this case,",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 529.566,
          "end": 534.233,
          "en": "this content between the opening and closing card tag,",
          "zh": "這個介於 card 開頭與結尾標籤之間的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 534.233,
          "end": 538.566,
          "en": "that is what will be available on props children",
          "zh": "就是會出現在 props children 上的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 538.566,
          "end": 541.233,
          "en": "inside of that card.",
          "zh": "在那個 card 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 541.233,
          "end": 546.033,
          "en": "And therefore, if I now save this, we got some content back.",
          "zh": "因此，如果我現在儲存，就會重新看到一些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 546.033,
          "end": 546.533,
          "en": "And therefore, if I now save this, we got some content back.",
          "zh": "因此，如果我現在儲存，就會重新看到一些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 546.533,
          "end": 549.7,
          "en": "However it's also a bit broken.",
          "zh": "不過它也有點壞掉了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 549.7,
          "end": 554.066,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that I extracted some styles",
          "zh": "原因是，我抽出了某些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 554.066,
          "end": 557.866,
          "en": "which ExpenseItem and Expenses had in common,",
          "zh": "是 ExpenseItem 和 Expenses 共有的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 557.866,
          "end": 560.866,
          "en": "but I had more styles to find for expense items",
          "zh": "但我還有更多樣式是定義在支出項目上的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 560.866,
          "end": 564.166,
          "en": "and these styles are important.",
          "zh": "而這些樣式很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 564.166,
          "end": 564.6,
          "en": "and these styles are important.",
          "zh": "而這些樣式很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 564.6,
          "end": 566.466,
          "en": "But they're missing now.",
          "zh": "但它們現在不見了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 566.466,
          "end": 570,
          "en": "I am setting a class name prop on card here",
          "zh": "我在這裡對 card 設定了 class name prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 570,
          "end": 570.166,
          "en": "I am setting a class name prop on card here",
          "zh": "我在這裡對 card 設定了 class name prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 570.166,
          "end": 572.866,
          "en": "but you must not forget that card",
          "zh": "但你不能忘記，card"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 572.866,
          "end": 576.366,
          "en": "is now a custom component defined by you.",
          "zh": "現在是由你定義的自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 576.366,
          "end": 578.833,
          "en": "All the default HTML components",
          "zh": "所有預設的 HTML 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 578.833,
          "end": 583.1,
          "en": "out of the box supports class name for adding CSS classes",
          "zh": "在預設情況下都支援 class name 來加入 CSS class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 583.1,
          "end": 585.566,
          "en": "to the rendered HTML elements.",
          "zh": "到渲染出來的 HTML 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 585.566,
          "end": 585.866,
          "en": "to the rendered HTML elements.",
          "zh": "到渲染出來的 HTML 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 585.866,
          "end": 589.533,
          "en": "But your custom components only support what you tell them",
          "zh": "但你的自訂元件只支援你告訴它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 589.533,
          "end": 591.1659999999999,
          "en": "to support.",
          "zh": "要支援的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 591.1659999999999,
          "end": 595.6,
          "en": "So if you wanna make sure that a class name can be set",
          "zh": "所以如果你想確保 class name 可以被設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 595.6,
          "end": 599.033,
          "en": "on your card component and then has an effect,",
          "zh": "在你的 card 元件上而且會產生效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 599.033,
          "end": 599.6,
          "en": "on your card component and then has an effect,",
          "zh": "在你的 card 元件上而且會產生效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 599.6,
          "end": 602.6,
          "en": "we have to tweak the code in the card component.",
          "zh": "我們必須調整 card 元件裡的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 602.6,
          "end": 604.8,
          "en": "And here we would probably wanna tweak it",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們大概會想把它調整成"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 604.8,
          "end": 610.233,
          "en": "such that we add whatever is set as a class name on card",
          "zh": "讓我們把任何設定在 card 上的 class name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 610.233,
          "end": 610.566,
          "en": "such that we add whatever is set as a class name on card",
          "zh": "讓我們把任何設定在 card 上的 class name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 610.566,
          "end": 614.2,
          "en": "to this class name string, we're setting as a class name",
          "zh": "加到我們設定為 class name 的這個 class name 字串上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 614.2,
          "end": 616.033,
          "en": "on that div.",
          "zh": "在那個 div 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 616.033,
          "end": 616.533,
          "en": "on that div.",
          "zh": "在那個 div 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 616.533,
          "end": 619.733,
          "en": "So here we could add a classes constant",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們可以新增一個 classes 常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 619.733,
          "end": 621.066,
          "en": "which is",
          "zh": "它的值是"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 621.066,
          "end": 623.433,
          "en": "card as a default class",
          "zh": "card 作為預設 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 623.433,
          "end": 625.533,
          "en": "which is always applied,",
          "zh": "它永遠會被套用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 625.533,
          "end": 626.9,
          "en": "white space",
          "zh": "空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 626.9,
          "end": 628.4,
          "en": "plus",
          "zh": "加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 628.4,
          "end": 631.166,
          "en": "props.className.",
          "zh": "props.className。"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 631.166,
          "end": 635.1,
          "en": "So now anything we receive as a class name from outside",
          "zh": "所以現在我們從外部收到的任何 class name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 635.1,
          "end": 637.633,
          "en": "is added to that string.",
          "zh": "都會被加到那個字串上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 637.633,
          "end": 639.966,
          "en": "And here we can then dynamically point",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們就可以動態地指向"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 639.966,
          "end": 644.466,
          "en": "at this class, this constant.",
          "zh": "這個 class、這個常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 644.466,
          "end": 646.366,
          "en": "So with that, we're now making sure",
          "zh": "所以這樣一來，我們現在確保了"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 646.366,
          "end": 649.566,
          "en": "that any value set on the class named prop",
          "zh": "任何設定在 class name prop 上的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 649.566,
          "end": 652.566,
          "en": "is added to this long string of class names",
          "zh": "都會被加到這串長長的 class 名稱裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 652.566,
          "end": 656.933,
          "en": "which is then finally set on the div inside of the card.",
          "zh": "最後它會被設定在 card 裡面的那個 div 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 656.933,
          "end": 659.2,
          "en": "And with that all, if we saved it,",
          "zh": "有了這一切之後，如果我們儲存它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 659.2,
          "end": 661.9,
          "en": "we get the same look as before,",
          "zh": "我們就會得到和之前一樣的外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 661.9,
          "end": 665.166,
          "en": "not yet for expenses, but for the expense items",
          "zh": "目前還不是用在 expenses 上，但對支出項目來說已經是如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 665.166,
          "end": 670.5,
          "en": "but now we have this reusable wrapper component.",
          "zh": "但現在我們有了這個可重複使用的外殼元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 670.5,
          "end": 673.3,
          "en": "And we can also use that in Expenses now.",
          "zh": "而我們現在也可以在 Expenses 裡使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 673.3,
          "end": 676.033,
          "en": "Here, instead of using a div,",
          "zh": "在這裡，與其使用 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 676.033,
          "end": 678.333,
          "en": "we can also use our card component.",
          "zh": "我們也可以使用我們的 card 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 678.333,
          "end": 683.033,
          "en": "We can import Card from ./Card",
          "zh": "我們可以 import Card from ./Card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 683.033,
          "end": 683.366,
          "en": "We can import Card from ./Card",
          "zh": "我們可以 import Card from ./Card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 683.366,
          "end": 687.466,
          "en": "and replace this div here with that card.",
          "zh": "並把這裡的這個 div 換成那個 card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 687.466,
          "end": 687.633,
          "en": "and replace this div here with that card.",
          "zh": "並把這裡的這個 div 換成那個 card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 687.633,
          "end": 691.2,
          "en": "Still setting a extra class name here as well.",
          "zh": "這裡也同樣額外設定了一個 class name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 691.2,
          "end": 694.766,
          "en": "And also replace the closing tag.",
          "zh": "並且也替換結尾標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 262,
          "start": 694.766,
          "end": 698.033,
          "en": "And if we do that, now we get the rounded corners back",
          "zh": "如果我們這麼做，圓角就會回來了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 263,
          "start": 698.033,
          "end": 702,
          "en": "on that expenses container as well.",
          "zh": "在那個 expenses 容器上也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 264,
          "start": 702,
          "end": 703.6,
          "en": "Now, why would we do that?",
          "zh": "那麼，我們為什麼要這麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 265,
          "start": 703.6,
          "end": 706.266,
          "en": "What did we gain by doing that?",
          "zh": "這樣做我們得到了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 266,
          "start": 706.266,
          "end": 709.2,
          "en": "Well, in this case, of course, not a whole lot",
          "zh": "嗯，在這個情況下，當然不算太多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 267,
          "start": 709.2,
          "end": 713.4,
          "en": "but we were able to extract some code duplication",
          "zh": "但我們得以抽出一些重複的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 268,
          "start": 713.4,
          "end": 715.733,
          "en": "from inside our CSS files",
          "zh": "從我們的 CSS 檔案裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 269,
          "start": 715.733,
          "end": 718.8,
          "en": "into this separate wrapper component.",
          "zh": "放進這個獨立的外殼元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 270,
          "start": 718.8,
          "end": 721.466,
          "en": "And it's not just a duplicate CSS code.",
          "zh": "而且這不只是重複的 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 271,
          "start": 721.466,
          "end": 724.666,
          "en": "We also were able to extract this HTML code,",
          "zh": "我們也得以抽出這段 HTML 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 272,
          "start": 724.666,
          "end": 727.166,
          "en": "this JSX code, this div here.",
          "zh": "這段 JSX 程式碼，這裡的這個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 273,
          "start": 727.166,
          "end": 729.266,
          "en": "In this case, it's just one div",
          "zh": "在這個情況下，它只是一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 274,
          "start": 729.266,
          "end": 730.366,
          "en": "but throughout the course",
          "zh": "但在整門課程中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 275,
          "start": 730.366,
          "end": 733.833,
          "en": "you will also see more complex wrapper components",
          "zh": "你也會看到更複雜的外殼元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 276,
          "start": 733.833,
          "end": 737.4,
          "en": "which might have a more complex JSX structure.",
          "zh": "它們可能有更複雜的 JSX 結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 277,
          "start": 737.4,
          "end": 740.366,
          "en": "Things like modals and alerts.",
          "zh": "像是 modal 和 alert 這類的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 278,
          "start": 740.366,
          "end": 743.966,
          "en": "And in such cases, being able to extract that",
          "zh": "而在這類情況下，能夠抽出那個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 279,
          "start": 743.966,
          "end": 747.666,
          "en": "often allows you to save a lot of code duplication",
          "zh": "往往能讓你省下大量重複的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 280,
          "start": 747.666,
          "end": 751.9,
          "en": "and it often allows you to keep your other components clean.",
          "zh": "而且往往能讓你的其他元件保持乾淨。"
        },
        {
          "id": 281,
          "start": 751.9,
          "end": 755.266,
          "en": "And this is another aspect of composition.",
          "zh": "而這是組合的另一個面向。"
        },
        {
          "id": 282,
          "start": 755.266,
          "end": 758.2,
          "en": "We compose our ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "我們組合我們的 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 283,
          "start": 758.2,
          "end": 760.2,
          "en": "by using card as a wrapper,",
          "zh": "透過使用 card 當作外殼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 284,
          "start": 760.2,
          "end": 763,
          "en": "by using some built-in HTML elements,",
          "zh": "透過使用一些內建的 HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 285,
          "start": 763,
          "end": 766.266,
          "en": "and by then all the putting in the ExpenseDate.",
          "zh": "然後再把 ExpenseDate 放進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 286,
          "start": 766.266,
          "end": 770.033,
          "en": "And all these components and elements are composed together",
          "zh": "而所有這些元件和元素被組合在一起，"
        },
        {
          "id": 287,
          "start": 770.033,
          "end": 773.133,
          "en": "to form the overall ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "形成整體的 ExpenseItem 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 288,
          "start": 773.133,
          "end": 776.3,
          "en": "which then again, is used in other components",
          "zh": "而它又會被用在其他元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 289,
          "start": 776.3,
          "end": 780.7,
          "en": "to in the end overall, build the overall user interface.",
          "zh": "最終建構出整體的使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 290,
          "start": 780.7,
          "end": 782.8,
          "en": "So composition is important.",
          "zh": "所以組合很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 291,
          "start": 782.8,
          "end": 785.866,
          "en": "You use it all the time when working with React.",
          "zh": "你在使用 React 時一直都在用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 292,
          "start": 785.866,
          "end": 790.266,
          "en": "Whenever you combine components, you are using composition.",
          "zh": "每當你組合元件時，你就是在使用組合。"
        },
        {
          "id": 293,
          "start": 790.266,
          "end": 793.333,
          "en": "And an especially important part of composition",
          "zh": "而組合中一個特別重要的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 294,
          "start": 793.333,
          "end": 795.566,
          "en": "is this props children feature",
          "zh": "就是這個 props children 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 295,
          "start": 795.566,
          "end": 798.866,
          "en": "which allows you to also create wrapper components",
          "zh": "它讓你能夠建立外殼元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 296,
          "start": 798.866,
          "end": 802.066,
          "en": "which is a special type of component, you could say,",
          "zh": "你可以說它是一種特別類型的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 297,
          "start": 802.066,
          "end": 804.6,
          "en": "which you also sometimes need.",
          "zh": "你偶爾也會需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 298,
          "start": 804.6,
          "end": 807.166,
          "en": "Now again, as with all these things,",
          "zh": "再次強調，就像所有這些東西一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 299,
          "start": 807.166,
          "end": 809.333,
          "en": "you are, of course, going to see many more examples",
          "zh": "當然，你會看到更多範例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 300,
          "start": 809.333,
          "end": 811.033,
          "en": "throughout the course.",
          "zh": "在整門課程中。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595460",
      "title": "A First Summary",
      "sourceHash": "b302afb2e22907f8f41418da9a917aeb901120184d2974e8f04f5b690ce0f1c2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.533,
          "en": "Maximilian: Remember, this section was about components.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：記住，這一節是關於元件的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.533,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "It was about understanding the most important concept",
          "zh": "它是在於理解最重要的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 12.866,
          "en": "of React that you build user interfaces",
          "zh": "也就是 React 中，你透過建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.866,
          "end": 17.066,
          "en": "by building and combining components.",
          "zh": "並組合元件來打造使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.066,
          "end": 18.4,
          "en": "And for that, we had a look",
          "zh": "為此，我們看過了"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.4,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "at the React Core Syntax and JSX.",
          "zh": "React 核心語法和 JSX。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 22.733,
          "en": "at the React Core Syntax and JSX.",
          "zh": "React 核心語法和 JSX。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.733,
          "end": 24.933,
          "en": "We, of course, had a very detailed look",
          "zh": "我們當然也非常仔細地看過"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.933,
          "end": 28.9,
          "en": "at building and using and working with components and props.",
          "zh": "如何建立、使用和操作元件與 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.9,
          "end": 32.633,
          "en": "And that already leads to the last part, data.",
          "zh": "這就帶到了最後一部分：資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.633,
          "end": 32.833,
          "en": "And that already leads to the last part, data.",
          "zh": "這就帶到了最後一部分：資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.833,
          "end": 36.033,
          "en": "We learned how to share data across components",
          "zh": "我們學會了如何跨元件共享資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.033,
          "end": 39.066,
          "en": "through that props concept.",
          "zh": "透過 props 這個概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.066,
          "end": 43.133,
          "en": "Now, maybe you already noticed one important thing,",
          "zh": "現在，也許你已經注意到一件重要的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.133,
          "end": 46.466,
          "en": "with all these components, which we are building,",
          "zh": "有了我們正在建立的這些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.466,
          "end": 49.3,
          "en": "in the end we're just splitting up our code",
          "zh": "最終我們只是把程式碼拆分成"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.3,
          "end": 52.866,
          "en": "across multiple files and building blocks",
          "zh": "多個檔案和積木般的區塊"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.866,
          "end": 53.133,
          "en": "across multiple files and building blocks",
          "zh": "多個檔案和積木般的區塊"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.133,
          "end": 56.533,
          "en": "so that if we want to have more than one expense item,",
          "zh": "這樣如果我們想要有一個以上的費用項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.533,
          "end": 59.966,
          "en": "we can just use our custom ExpenseItem component",
          "zh": "我們就可以直接使用我們自訂的 ExpenseItem 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.966,
          "end": 61.7,
          "en": "multiple times instead of repeating all",
          "zh": "多次，而不用重複所有的"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.7,
          "end": 63.2,
          "en": "multiple times instead of repeating all",
          "zh": "多次，而不用重複所有的"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.2,
          "end": 66.2,
          "en": "that code multiple times, that's the idea behind components.",
          "zh": "那段程式碼多次，這就是元件背後的想法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.2,
          "end": 68.866,
          "en": "that code multiple times, that's the idea behind components.",
          "zh": "那段程式碼多次，這就是元件背後的想法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.866,
          "end": 72.43299999999999,
          "en": "In the end, what ends up on the screen",
          "zh": "最終，出現在畫面上的"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.43299999999999,
          "end": 76.533,
          "en": "are just default HTML elements, though.",
          "zh": "仍然只是預設的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.533,
          "end": 76.833,
          "en": "are just default HTML elements, though.",
          "zh": "仍然只是預設的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.833,
          "end": 81.166,
          "en": "If you inspect your page with the developer tools, here,",
          "zh": "如果你用開發者工具檢視你的頁面，這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.166,
          "end": 84.666,
          "en": "in the Chrome developer tools with the Elements tab,",
          "zh": "在 Chrome 開發者工具的元素（Elements）分頁中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.666,
          "end": 86.5,
          "en": "you will notice that you don't see",
          "zh": "你會注意到你看不到"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.5,
          "end": 90.333,
          "en": "your custom components here, there is no card",
          "zh": "你的自訂元件，這裡沒有 card"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.333,
          "end": 93.733,
          "en": "or ExpenseItem component, you just see divs",
          "zh": "或 ExpenseItem 元件，你只會看到 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.733,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "and H2 elements, and so on.",
          "zh": "和 h2 元素等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 102.333,
          "en": "And that is how the web works and how React works.",
          "zh": "這就是網頁的運作方式，也是 React 的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.333,
          "end": 107.43299999999999,
          "en": "These custom components are not really HTML elements,",
          "zh": "這些自訂元件並不是真正的 HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.43299999999999,
          "end": 111.2,
          "en": "which end up on the screen, you just use them in your code",
          "zh": "不會出現在畫面上，你只是在你的程式碼中"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.2,
          "end": 114.666,
          "en": "in your React code, in your JSX code.",
          "zh": "在你的 React 程式碼、JSX 程式碼中使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.666,
          "end": 114.833,
          "en": "in your React code, in your JSX code.",
          "zh": "在你的 React 程式碼、JSX 程式碼中使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.833,
          "end": 119.066,
          "en": "What ends up on the screen are just the HTML elements",
          "zh": "出現在畫面上的就只是 HTML 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.066,
          "end": 122.733,
          "en": "because, ultimately, every custom component you build",
          "zh": "因為最終，你建立的每個自訂元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.733,
          "end": 126.766,
          "en": "either uses these built in HTML elements",
          "zh": "不是使用這些內建的 HTML 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.766,
          "end": 129.933,
          "en": "or it uses another of component which, at some point,",
          "zh": "就是使用另一個元件，而那個元件在某個時候"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.933,
          "end": 133.266,
          "en": "if you drill into your components deeply enough",
          "zh": "如果你往元件內部挖掘得夠深"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.266,
          "end": 137,
          "en": "will end up using these built in elements.",
          "zh": "最終會使用這些內建元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137,
          "end": 138.833,
          "en": "And that's an important takeaway,",
          "zh": "而那是一個重要的重點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.833,
          "end": 142.166,
          "en": "and something important to keep in mind.",
          "zh": "也是要牢記在心的重要事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.166,
          "end": 145.333,
          "en": "Now, the application we built thus far is great",
          "zh": "目前為止我們建立的應用程式很棒"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.333,
          "end": 147.3,
          "en": "because we had the chance of learning",
          "zh": "因為我們有機會透過它學習"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.3,
          "end": 150.03300000000002,
          "en": "about components and props with it.",
          "zh": "元件和 props 的相關知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.03300000000002,
          "end": 150.066,
          "en": "about components and props with it.",
          "zh": "元件和 props 的相關知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.066,
          "end": 153.233,
          "en": "And these are two of the most important concepts",
          "zh": "而這是兩個最重要的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.233,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "you got to know when working with React.",
          "zh": "你在使用 React 時必須了解的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 158.133,
          "en": "I'm not sure if I mentioned it already.",
          "zh": "我不確定我是否已經提過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.133,
          "end": 160.566,
          "en": "But, of course, this application as we built",
          "zh": "但當然，我們目前建立的這個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.566,
          "end": 163.666,
          "en": "it thus far also has a downside.",
          "zh": "到目前為止也有個缺點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.666,
          "end": 166.733,
          "en": "In the end, it's still static.",
          "zh": "最終，它仍然是靜態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.733,
          "end": 166.833,
          "en": "In the end, it's still static.",
          "zh": "最終，它仍然是靜態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.833,
          "end": 170.36599999999999,
          "en": "Yes, we have reusable components, which can be configured",
          "zh": "是的，我們有可重複使用的元件，可以透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.36599999999999,
          "end": 174.36599999999999,
          "en": "with props but, ultimately, we have this expenses array",
          "zh": "props 來設定，但最終我們有這個 expenses 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.36599999999999,
          "end": 178.6,
          "en": "in the App.js file and the this array never changes.",
          "zh": "在 App.js 檔案中，而這個陣列永遠不會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.6,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "in the App.js file and the this array never changes.",
          "zh": "在 App.js 檔案中，而這個陣列永遠不會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 181.366,
          "en": "The data here is set in stone.",
          "zh": "這裡的資料是固定不變的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.366,
          "end": 184.86599999999999,
          "en": "It's still a static application in the end.",
          "zh": "最終它仍然是個靜態的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.86599999999999,
          "end": 187.8,
          "en": "Nothing is changing here, as a user,",
          "zh": "這裡什麼都不會改變，身為使用者，"
