          "en": "we have no chance of interacting with this application.",
          "zh": "我們沒有機會與這個應用程式互動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.066,
          "end": 194.333,
          "en": "And that's therefore what we're going",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們接下來"
