          "en": "when we're going to bring this to life.",
          "zh": "屆時我們會讓它活起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.53300000000002,
          "end": 200.9,
          "en": "And when we're going to learn",
          "zh": "而且我們將會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.9,
          "end": 204.3,
          "en": "about another concept called state.",
          "zh": "另一個叫做 state 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.3,
          "end": 208.3,
          "en": "Now, before we go there though, I just got three",
          "zh": "不過在我們進入那裡之前，我還有三"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.3,
          "end": 210.7,
          "en": "other things, which I want to cover here.",
          "zh": "件其他事情想在這裡說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.7,
          "end": 210.86599999999999,
          "en": "other things, which I want to cover here.",
          "zh": "件其他事情想在這裡說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.86599999999999,
          "end": 215.4,
          "en": "The first thing, the first concept is JSX.",
          "zh": "第一件事、第一個概念是 JSX。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 215.4,
          "end": 215.566,
          "en": "The first thing, the first concept is JSX.",
          "zh": "第一件事、第一個概念是 JSX。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.566,
          "end": 218.3,
          "en": "I mentioned that we'll take a closer look at that",
          "zh": "我提過我們會更仔細地看看它"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.3,
          "end": 220.53300000000002,
          "en": "and we're going to do that in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "而我們會在下一個講座中這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.53300000000002,
          "end": 220.8,
          "en": "and we're going to do that in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "而我們會在下一個講座中這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.8,
          "end": 223.4,
          "en": "You could skip that lecture but, at some point,",
          "zh": "你可以跳過那個講座，但在某個時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.4,
