        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.266,
          "end": 230.066,
          "en": "what JSX really is under the hood and how it works.",
          "zh": "JSX 在底層究竟是什麼，以及它如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.066,
          "end": 232.03300000000002,
          "en": "So I recommend that you don't skip it,",
          "zh": "所以我建議你不要跳過它，"
