          "en": "even though you could do that, if you're in a hurry.",
          "zh": "即使如果你很趕的話可以這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.566,
          "end": 237.8,
          "en": "Now, the other two things I want to have a look at",
