    {
      "id": "25595464",
      "title": "A Closer Look At JSX",
      "sourceHash": "7acb5f3376d014c8abcda311bb8fcd948282ff3a4abefcc525658a0f5b39ca61",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.566,
          "en": "Instructor: Let's have a closer look at the JSX.",
          "zh": "講師：讓我們更仔細地看一下 JSX。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.566,
          "end": 8.9,
          "en": "Now I mentioned before, earlier in this module,",
          "zh": "我先前在這個單元前面有提到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.9,
          "end": 11.033,
          "en": "you can open up your developer tools",
          "zh": "你可以打開你的開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.033,
          "end": 13.6,
          "en": "and there you'll find the JavaScript code",
          "zh": "在那裡你會找到 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.6,
          "end": 17.333,
          "en": "which is responsible for what you're seeing on the page.",
          "zh": "它負責產生你在頁面上看到的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.333,
          "end": 17.866,
          "en": "which is responsible for what you're seeing on the page.",
          "zh": "它負責產生你在頁面上看到的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.866,
          "end": 20.133,
          "en": "And in there, you will also find",
          "zh": "而在那裡，你也會找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.133,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "all your component functions,",
          "zh": "你所有的元件函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 24.766,
          "en": "like this app function here.",
          "zh": "像是這裡這個 app 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.766,
          "end": 25.033,
          "en": "like this app function here.",
          "zh": "像是這裡這個 app 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.033,
          "end": 27.2,
          "en": "Now it will look totally different in the end,",
          "zh": "不過它最後看起來會完全不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.2,
          "end": 29.733,
          "en": "because there you have no JSX code,",
          "zh": "因為在那裡你不會看到 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.733,
          "end": 33.266,
          "en": "because JSX code isn't supported by the browser.",
          "zh": "因為瀏覽器並不支援 JSX 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.266,
          "end": 37.133,
          "en": "This, in the end, is just syntactic sugar, which works here",
          "zh": "這說到底只是語法糖，它之所以能在這裡運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.133,
          "end": 40.566,
          "en": "thanks to the behind-the-scenes transformations.",
          "zh": "要歸功於背後進行的轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.566,
          "end": 40.933,
          "en": "thanks to the behind-the-scenes transformations.",
          "zh": "要歸功於背後進行的轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.933,
          "end": 42.433,
          "en": "Now we can see that the code",
          "zh": "現在我們可以看到，這段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.433,
          "end": 44.633,
          "en": "to which it is transformed in the end",
          "zh": "最後被轉換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.633,
          "end": 47.433,
          "en": "looks like this here, right?",
          "zh": "就是這裡這個樣子，對嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.433,
          "end": 50.033,
          "en": "This here is the code to which it is transformed.",
          "zh": "這裡這段就是它被轉換後的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.1,
          "end": 55.233,
          "en": "Now this is a code which still is fairly cryptic,",
          "zh": "這段程式碼其實還是相當晦澀難懂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.233,
          "end": 57.766,
          "en": "because this actually is the final step",
          "zh": "因為這其實是轉換過程的"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.766,
          "end": 59.6,
          "en": "of the transformation.",
          "zh": "最後一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.6,
          "end": 65.3,
          "en": "We could also write code instead of this JSX code",
          "zh": "我們也可以不寫這種 JSX 程式碼，而是改寫另一種程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.3,
          "end": 65.733,
          "en": "We could also write code instead of this JSX code",
          "zh": "我們也可以不寫這種 JSX 程式碼，而是改寫另一種程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.733,
          "end": 70.066,
          "en": "which is a bit more readable to us humans than this,",
          "zh": "它對我們人類來說比這個稍微好讀一些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.066,
          "end": 73.333,
          "en": "but not as readable as the JSX code.",
          "zh": "但仍不如 JSX 程式碼那麼易讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.333,
          "end": 73.466,
          "en": "but not as readable as the JSX code.",
          "zh": "但仍不如 JSX 程式碼那麼易讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73.466,
          "end": 75.466,
          "en": "I still want to show it to you",
          "zh": "我還是想讓你看一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.466,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "because this shows you what this JSX code",
          "zh": "因為這能讓你看到這段 JSX 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.5,
          "end": 83.233,
          "en": "actually represents behind-the-scenes.",
          "zh": "在背後實際上代表什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.233,
          "end": 84.76599999999999,
          "en": "So here we go.",
          "zh": "那麼我們開始吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.76599999999999,
          "end": 85.133,
          "en": "So here we go.",
          "zh": "那麼我們開始吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.133,
          "end": 86.333,
          "en": "Maybe",
          "zh": "也許"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.333,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "you already wondered about one other thing.",
          "zh": "你之前還對另一件事感到疑惑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 91.76599999999999,
          "en": "In package.json, we've got a bunch of dependencies,",
          "zh": "在 package.json 裡，我們有一堆相依套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 91.76599999999999,
          "end": 93.76599999999999,
          "en": "and most of them are just dealing with",
          "zh": "而它們大多數只是在處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.76599999999999,
          "end": 96.533,
          "en": "the behind-the-scenes transformations.",
          "zh": "背後進行的轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 96.533,
          "end": 97.166,
          "en": "the behind-the-scenes transformations.",
          "zh": "背後進行的轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 97.166,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "But we've got two dependencies which are related to React.",
          "zh": "但我們有兩個跟 React 相關的相依套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 105.93299999999999,
          "en": "React and React-dom.",
          "zh": "React 和 react-dom。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 105.93299999999999,
          "end": 109.96600000000001,
          "en": "Now we are using React-dom in the index.js file,",
          "zh": "我們在 index.js 檔案裡使用了 react-dom，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.96600000000001,
          "end": 110.333,
          "en": "Now we are using React-dom in the index.js file,",
          "zh": "我們在 index.js 檔案裡使用了 react-dom，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.333,
          "end": 113.066,
          "en": "but we are never using React anywhere.",
          "zh": "但我們在任何地方都沒有用到 React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 113.066,
          "end": 116.6,
          "en": "We're never importing React anywhere.",
          "zh": "我們在任何地方都沒有 import React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 116.6,
          "end": 122.2,
          "en": "And this actually just works in this kind of project setup",
          "zh": "而這其實只在這類專案設定中行得通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 122.2,
          "end": 125.266,
          "en": "and in all modern React project setups",
          "zh": "在所有現代 React 專案設定中也是如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.266,
          "end": 129.133,
          "en": "which are created by create-react-app.",
          "zh": "也就是由 create-react-app 建立的專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.133,
          "end": 129.733,
          "en": "which are created by create-react-app.",
          "zh": "也就是由 create-react-app 建立的專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 129.733,
          "end": 132.5,
          "en": "In a lot of other React projects,",
          "zh": "在許多其他的 React 專案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.5,
          "end": 134.733,
          "en": "which you'll find out there in the wild,",
          "zh": "也就是你在外面真實世界會看到的那些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.733,
          "end": 137.86599999999999,
          "en": "you will actually see React imports,",
          "zh": "你其實會看到有 import React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.86599999999999,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "even though we don't have them here.",
          "zh": "即使我們這裡並沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 144.4,
          "en": "Because in the past, in older React projects,",
          "zh": "因為在過去、在較舊的 React 專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.4,
          "end": 147.066,
          "en": "you actually needed to",
          "zh": "你其實必須"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.066,
          "end": 153.633,
          "en": "import React from React in all your React component files.",
          "zh": "在所有的 React 元件檔案裡寫 import React from React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.633,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "To be precise, in all files where you used JSX.",
          "zh": "精確一點說，是在所有你用到 JSX 的檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 160.633,
          "en": "To be precise, in all files where you used JSX.",
          "zh": "精確一點說，是在所有你用到 JSX 的檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.633,
          "end": 165.03300000000002,
          "en": "You needed to always import React from React in the past.",
          "zh": "在過去，你總是需要寫 import React from React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.03300000000002,
          "end": 167.633,
          "en": "And you'll still see a lot of React projects out there",
          "zh": "而你在外面還是會看到很多 React 專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.633,
          "end": 170.166,
          "en": "which have these imports therefore.",
          "zh": "因此帶有這些 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 170.166,
          "end": 170.86599999999999,
          "en": "which have these imports therefore.",
          "zh": "因此帶有這些 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.86599999999999,
          "end": 173,
          "en": "That we can emit this import now,",
          "zh": "我們現在可以省略這個 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173,
          "end": 175.233,
          "en": "is really just some magic being done",
          "zh": "其實只是現代 React 專案設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.233,
          "end": 178.466,
          "en": "by modern React project setups.",
          "zh": "所施展的一點魔法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.466,
          "end": 178.833,
          "en": "by modern React project setups.",
          "zh": "所施展的一點魔法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.833,
          "end": 181.266,
          "en": "We needed this import in the past",
          "zh": "我們在過去需要這個 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 181.266,
          "end": 183.466,
          "en": "because this JSX code, as I mentioned,",
          "zh": "因為正如我提到的，這段 JSX 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.466,
          "end": 185.5,
          "en": "is just syntactic sugar.",
          "zh": "就只是語法糖。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 185.5,
          "end": 188.5,
          "en": "And under the hood, it has actually transformed",
          "zh": "而在底層，它其實被轉換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 188.5,
          "end": 193.166,
          "en": "two methods called on this React object,",
          "zh": "兩個在這個 React 物件上呼叫的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 193.166,
          "end": 193.3,
          "en": "two methods called on this React object,",
          "zh": "兩個在這個 React 物件上呼叫的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 193.3,
          "end": 197.53300000000002,
          "en": "which is why we needed to import React in the past.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們過去需要 import React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 197.53300000000002,
          "end": 200.6,
          "en": "Now, let me show you what this code would look like",
          "zh": "現在，讓我示範一下這段程式碼會長什麼樣子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 200.6,
          "end": 204.466,
          "en": "if we wouldn't use this JSX syntax.",
          "zh": "如果我們不使用這種 JSX 語法的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 204.466,
          "end": 204.7,
          "en": "if we wouldn't use this JSX syntax.",
          "zh": "如果我們不使用這種 JSX 語法的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.7,
          "end": 206.86599999999999,
          "en": "And therefore I'll comment this out",
          "zh": "因此我會把這段註解掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 206.86599999999999,
          "end": 210.133,
          "en": "and return it as alternative.",
          "zh": "並改為回傳替代的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 210.133,
          "end": 213.03300000000002,
          "en": "Because on this imported React object,",
          "zh": "因為在這個 import 進來的 React 物件上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 213.03300000000002,
          "end": 217.466,
          "en": "there is a createElement method, which we can call.",
          "zh": "有一個 createElement 方法，我們可以呼叫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 217.466,
          "end": 222.03300000000002,
          "en": "And when you use JSX, it's near this method which is called.",
          "zh": "而當你使用 JSX 時，被呼叫的就是這個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 222.03300000000002,
          "end": 222.833,
          "en": "And when you use JSX, it's near this method which is called.",
          "zh": "而當你使用 JSX 時，被呼叫的就是這個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 222.833,
          "end": 226,
          "en": "CreateElement takes three arguments.",
          "zh": "createElement 接受三個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 226,
          "end": 226.433,
          "en": "CreateElement takes three arguments.",
          "zh": "createElement 接受三個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 226.433,
          "end": 229.8,
          "en": "The first argument is the element which should be created.",
          "zh": "第一個參數是要建立的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 229.8,
          "end": 231.9,
          "en": "For example, a div.",
          "zh": "例如，一個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 231.9,
          "end": 234.4,
          "en": "And if it's a built-in HTML element,",
          "zh": "如果它是內建的 HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 234.4,
          "end": 236.7,
          "en": "you just pass in a string",
          "zh": "你只要傳入一個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 236.7,
          "end": 240.5,
          "en": "with the name of that element, like div.",
          "zh": "內容是該元素的名稱，像是 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 240.5,
          "end": 243.633,
          "en": "The second argument is an object",
          "zh": "第二個參數是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 243.633,
          "end": 245.86599999999999,
          "en": "that configures this element.",
          "zh": "用來設定這個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 245.86599999999999,
          "end": 246.066,
          "en": "that configures this element.",
          "zh": "用來設定這個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 246.066,
          "end": 250.466,
          "en": "Specifically, an object which sets all the attributes",
          "zh": "具體來說，是一個用來設定所有屬性的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 250.466,
          "end": 251.9,
          "en": "of this element.",
          "zh": "也就是這個元素的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 251.9,
          "end": 253.766,
          "en": "This div has no attributes,",
          "zh": "這個 div 沒有任何屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 253.766,
          "end": 257.3,
          "en": "so here we can pass in an empty object.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們可以傳入一個空物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 257.3,
          "end": 259.533,
          "en": "The third argument now is the content",
          "zh": "而第三個參數是內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 259.533,
          "end": 262.83299999999997,
          "en": "between the opening and closing div tags.",
          "zh": "也就是開頭與結尾 div 標籤之間的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 262.83299999999997,
          "end": 262.966,
          "en": "between the opening and closing div tags.",
          "zh": "也就是開頭與結尾 div 標籤之間的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 262.966,
          "end": 265.366,
          "en": "And actually it's not just a third argument.",
          "zh": "而且其實不只是第三個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 265.366,
          "end": 268.83299999999997,
          "en": "You can now have an infinitely long list of arguments,",
          "zh": "你可以有無限多個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 268.83299999999997,
          "end": 271.233,
          "en": "which are the different content pieces",
          "zh": "它們是開頭與結尾標籤之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 271.233,
          "end": 274.466,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags.",
          "zh": "不同的內容片段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 274.466,
          "end": 276.666,
          "en": "So here we have two elements, so we would have",
          "zh": "這裡我們有兩個元素，所以我們會有"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 276.666,
          "end": 278.8,
          "en": "two extra arguments.",
          "zh": "兩個額外的參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 278.8,
          "end": 281.466,
          "en": "The third argument would be our H2 element.",
          "zh": "第三個參數會是我們的 H2 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 281.466,
          "end": 284.233,
          "en": "So the first child in that div.",
          "zh": "也就是那個 div 裡的第一個子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 284.233,
          "end": 284.56600000000003,
          "en": "So the first child in that div.",
          "zh": "也就是那個 div 裡的第一個子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 284.56600000000003,
          "end": 288.233,
          "en": "And therefore here, again, we would call React",
          "zh": "因此這裡我們同樣會呼叫 React"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 288.233,
          "end": 289.766,
          "en": "createElement",
          "zh": "createElement"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 289.766,
          "end": 292.533,
          "en": "and create an H2 element here.",
          "zh": "來在這裡建立一個 H2 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 292.533,
          "end": 295.233,
          "en": "And that H2 element, again, has no attributes,",
          "zh": "而這個 H2 元素同樣沒有屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 295.233,
          "end": 298.366,
          "en": "so the second argument of this second createElement call",
          "zh": "所以這第二次 createElement 呼叫的第二個參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 298.366,
          "end": 300.4,
          "en": "would be an empty object.",
          "zh": "會是一個空物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 300.4,
          "end": 300.966,
          "en": "would be an empty object.",
          "zh": "會是一個空物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 300.966,
          "end": 303.466,
          "en": "And the third argument of this createElement call",
          "zh": "而這次 createElement 呼叫的第三個參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 303.466,
          "end": 306,
          "en": "would be the content in this H2 tag,",
          "zh": "會是這個 H2 標籤裡的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 306,
          "end": 306.133,
          "en": "would be the content in this H2 tag,",
          "zh": "會是這個 H2 標籤裡的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 306.133,
          "end": 308.433,
          "en": "so this string, in this case.",
          "zh": "在這個情況下，就是這個字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 308.433,
          "end": 311.2,
          "en": "So we would pass this string here,",
          "zh": "所以我們會在這裡傳入這個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 311.2,
          "end": 314,
          "en": "and escape this single quote.",
          "zh": "並把這個單引號跳脫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 314,
          "end": 314.5,
          "en": "and escape this single quote.",
          "zh": "並把這個單引號跳脫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 314.5,
          "end": 319.3,
          "en": "And if we now format it, it would look like this.",
          "zh": "如果我們現在把它排版一下，就會長這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 319.3,
          "end": 324.966,
          "en": "Now next to this second createElement call,",
          "zh": "接著，在這第二次 createElement 呼叫旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 324.966,
          "end": 327.33299999999997,
          "en": "We could have a third createElement call,",
          "zh": "我們可以有第三次的 createElement 呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 327.33299999999997,
          "end": 330.4,
          "en": "which is the neighbor element to this H2 element,",
          "zh": "它是這個 H2 元素的相鄰元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 330.4,
          "end": 333.266,
          "en": "so this expenses component.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 Expenses 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 333.266,
          "end": 334.9,
          "en": "Again, we create an element here,",
          "zh": "這裡我們同樣建立一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 334.9,
          "end": 337.866,
          "en": "but now we're working with a custom component",
          "zh": "但這次我們用的是自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 337.866,
          "end": 339.766,
          "en": "instead of a built-in one.",
          "zh": "而不是內建元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 339.766,
          "end": 342.6,
          "en": "In such cases, you don't use a string here,",
          "zh": "在這種情況下，你這裡不用字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 342.6,
          "end": 342.83299999999997,
          "en": "In such cases, you don't use a string here,",
          "zh": "在這種情況下，你這裡不用字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 342.83299999999997,
          "end": 346.433,
          "en": "but you just point at your imported function,",
          "zh": "而是直接指向你 import 進來的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 346.433,
          "end": 347.766,
          "en": "which it in the end is,",
          "zh": "因為它到頭來就是個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 347.766,
          "end": 351.633,
          "en": "because your components are just functions, right?",
          "zh": "因為你的元件就只是函式，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 351.633,
          "end": 354.06600000000003,
          "en": "So here we set Expenses.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們放入 Expenses。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 354.06600000000003,
          "end": 358.06600000000003,
          "en": "We point at Expenses as an element here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡把 Expenses 當作元素指向它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 358.06600000000003,
          "end": 361.366,
          "en": "The second argument is an object of properties",
          "zh": "第二個參數是一個屬性的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 361.366,
          "end": 364.366,
          "en": "that should be set, of attributes that should be set,",
          "zh": "也就是應該設定的屬性、應該設定的特性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 364.366,
          "end": 364.5,
          "en": "that should be set, of attributes that should be set,",
          "zh": "也就是應該設定的屬性、應該設定的特性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 364.5,
          "end": 368.4,
          "en": "and here we have the items prop, the items attribute,",
          "zh": "而這裡我們有 items prop，也就是 items 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 368.4,
          "end": 371.133,
          "en": "so we would add an items key here.",
          "zh": "所以我們會在這裡加上一個 items 鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 371.133,
          "end": 371.366,
          "en": "so we would add an items key here.",
          "zh": "所以我們會在這裡加上一個 items 鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 371.366,
          "end": 373.566,
          "en": "Keep in mind, this is just a JavaScript object,",
          "zh": "請記住，這只是一個 JavaScript 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 373.566,
          "end": 376.6,
          "en": "so we have the property name, and then a colon,",
          "zh": "所以我們有屬性名稱，然後一個冒號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 376.6,
          "end": 381.8,
          "en": "and then the value, which here would be expenses.",
          "zh": "接著是值，這裡會是 expenses。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 381.8,
          "end": 384.3,
          "en": "And then as a third argument,",
          "zh": "然後作為第三個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 384.3,
          "end": 387.033,
          "en": "we have to content between the opening and closing tags.",
          "zh": "我們要放入開頭與結尾標籤之間的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 387.033,
          "end": 388.933,
          "en": "And in this case, there is no such contents,",
          "zh": "而在這個情況下，並沒有這樣的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 388.933,
          "end": 391.066,
          "en": "so we omit it.",
          "zh": "所以我們省略它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 391.066,
          "end": 393.3,
          "en": "And this here",
          "zh": "而這裡這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 393.3,
          "end": 396.7,
          "en": "would be the alternative to this JSX code",
          "zh": "就是這段 JSX 程式碼的替代寫法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 396.7,
          "end": 399.633,
          "en": "using this React object.",
          "zh": "使用的是這個 React 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 399.633,
          "end": 400,
          "en": "using this React object.",
          "zh": "使用的是這個 React 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 400,
          "end": 402,
          "en": "And therefore, if I saved that,",
          "zh": "因此，如果我把它存檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 402,
          "end": 403.366,
          "en": "we go back to the screen,",
          "zh": "我們回到畫面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 403.366,
          "end": 406.933,
          "en": "we see exactly the same as before.",
          "zh": "會看到和之前完全一樣的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 406.933,
          "end": 410.166,
          "en": "Now, you could write your entire React app like this.",
          "zh": "現在，你可以用這種方式寫你整個 React 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 410.166,
          "end": 410.466,
          "en": "Now, you could write your entire React app like this.",
          "zh": "現在，你可以用這種方式寫你整個 React 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 410.466,
          "end": 413.3,
          "en": "It just turns out that this is a bit harder to read",
          "zh": "只是結果證明，這樣寫比較不容易閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 413.3,
          "end": 417.666,
          "en": "and a bit more cumbersome than using this JSX code.",
          "zh": "也比使用 JSX 程式碼來得麻煩一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 417.666,
          "end": 420.833,
          "en": "But that's why you needed to import React from React",
          "zh": "但這就是為什麼過去你必須 import React from React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 420.833,
          "end": 423.233,
          "en": "in all your component files in the past,",
          "zh": "在過去所有的元件檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 423.233,
          "end": 423.666,
          "en": "in all your component files in the past,",
          "zh": "在過去所有的元件檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 423.666,
          "end": 426.6,
          "en": "because this is the under-the-hood code",
          "zh": "因為這就是底層的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 426.6,
          "end": 431.366,
          "en": "which kind of gets created automatically when you use JSX.",
          "zh": "當你使用 JSX 時，它會自動被建立出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 431.366,
          "end": 433.5,
          "en": "Now in more modern project setups,",
          "zh": "而在更現代的專案設定中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 433.5,
          "end": 436.5,
          "en": "you can omit this React import because",
          "zh": "你可以省略這個 React import，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 436.5,
          "end": 439.366,
          "en": "the project setup is able to make that transformation",
          "zh": "專案設定能夠完成那樣的轉換，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 439.366,
          "end": 441.3,
          "en": "without the import being added.",
          "zh": "而不需要加上 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 441.3,
          "end": 443.166,
          "en": "But if you see component functions",
          "zh": "但如果你看到元件函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 443.166,
          "end": 445.133,
          "en": "where this import is there,",
          "zh": "裡面有這個 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 445.133,
          "end": 446.83299999999997,
          "en": "it is there because, in the past,",
          "zh": "它會在那裡，是因為在過去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 446.83299999999997,
          "end": 449.933,
          "en": "you always did need to add it.",
          "zh": "你總是需要加上它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 449.933,
          "end": 452.9,
          "en": "And therefore, because of that reason,",
          "zh": "因此，基於這個原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 452.9,
          "end": 455.633,
          "en": "I will now also import it and add it",
          "zh": "我現在也會把它 import 進來並加上去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 455.633,
          "end": 459.733,
          "en": "to all components where I use some JSX code.",
          "zh": "加到我所有用到 JSX 程式碼的元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 459.733,
          "end": 459.933,
          "en": "to all components where I use some JSX code.",
          "zh": "加到我所有用到 JSX 程式碼的元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 459.933,
          "end": 462.033,
          "en": "Like here, index.js,",
          "zh": "像是這裡的 index.js、"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 462.033,
          "end": 464.3,
          "en": "Expenses.js,",
          "zh": "Expenses.js、"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 464.3,
          "end": 466.933,
          "en": "ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem.js、"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 466.933,
          "end": 467.4,
          "en": "ExpenseItem.js,",
          "zh": "ExpenseItem.js、"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 467.4,
          "end": 469.733,
          "en": "ExpenseDate.js,",
          "zh": "ExpenseDate.js、"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 469.733,
          "end": 471.33299999999997,
          "en": "and Card.js.",
          "zh": "以及 Card.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 471.33299999999997,
          "end": 473.966,
          "en": "Again, you technically don't need to do that,",
          "zh": "再次強調，技術上你並不需要這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 473.966,
          "end": 476.533,
          "en": "but I'm doing it to really emphasize",
          "zh": "但我這麼做是為了真正強調"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 476.533,
          "end": 480.333,
          "en": "that React is still being used under the hood here",
          "zh": "在這裡，React 其實仍在底層被使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 480.333,
          "end": 480.5,
          "en": "that React is still being used under the hood here",
          "zh": "在這裡，React 其實仍在底層被使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 480.5,
          "end": 484.366,
          "en": "when you use JSX code, because that code",
          "zh": "當你使用 JSX 程式碼時，因為那段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 484.366,
          "end": 487.433,
          "en": "under the hood is transformed to something like this",
          "zh": "在底層會被轉換成類似這樣的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 487.433,
          "end": 489.433,
          "en": "before it's then transformed even more",
          "zh": "接著再被進一步轉換，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 489.433,
          "end": 492.4,
          "en": "to what we saw in the browser earlier.",
          "zh": "變成我們稍早在瀏覽器中看到的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 492.4,
          "end": 494,
          "en": "That's important.",
          "zh": "這很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 494,
          "end": 495.6,
          "en": "And if you have a look at this code,",
          "zh": "而如果你看一下這段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 495.6,
          "end": 500.466,
          "en": "it should also be clear why you need some wrapping element",
          "zh": "應該也能清楚明白為什麼你需要一個外層包裝元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 500.466,
          "end": 502.633,
          "en": "as a root JSX element.",
          "zh": "作為根 JSX 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 502.633,
          "end": 506.666,
          "en": "Why you can't have just these two side-by-side elements",
          "zh": "為什麼你不能只讓這兩個並排的元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 506.666,
          "end": 508.266,
          "en": "being returned.",
          "zh": "被回傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 508.266,
          "end": 511.366,
          "en": "Because how will you write this in the React",
          "zh": "因為你要怎麼在 React"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 511.366,
          "end": 512.866,
          "en": "createElement world?",
          "zh": "createElement 的世界裡寫這個？"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 512.866,
          "end": 516.833,
          "en": "You, in the end, would be trying to return this,",
          "zh": "你到頭來會試著回傳這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 516.833,
          "end": 518.233,
          "en": "and that doesn't work.",
          "zh": "而那是行不通的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 518.233,
          "end": 521.433,
          "en": "You can't return more than one thing.",
          "zh": "你不能回傳超過一個東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 521.433,
          "end": 521.733,
          "en": "You can't return more than one thing.",
          "zh": "你不能回傳超過一個東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 521.733,
          "end": 524.366,
          "en": "You could return an array, sure,",
          "zh": "你可以回傳一個陣列，沒錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 524.366,
          "end": 526.266,
          "en": "but this is not an array of elements.",
          "zh": "但這並不是一個元素陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 526.266,
          "end": 529.4,
          "en": "This is two separate elements side by side.",
          "zh": "這是兩個各自獨立、並排的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 529.4,
          "end": 531.933,
          "en": "That's why you always need such a wrapper,",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼你總是需要這樣的外層包裝，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 531.933,
          "end": 534.033,
          "en": "because in createElement world,",
          "zh": "因為在 createElement 的世界裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 534.033,
          "end": 535.866,
          "en": "you always create one element",
          "zh": "你總是建立一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 535.866,
          "end": 539.733,
          "en": "which then may have more child elements.",
          "zh": "而它可以再擁有更多子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 539.733,
          "end": 544.266,
          "en": "So that's why we have this one wrapper root JSX element",
          "zh": "所以這就是為什麼我們需要這個單一的包裝根 JSX 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 544.266,
          "end": 546.066,
          "en": "which we always need.",
          "zh": "這是我們始終需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 546.066,
          "end": 547.433,
          "en": "This is why we need that.",
          "zh": "這就是我們需要它的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 547.433,
          "end": 550.6,
          "en": "That's the under-the-hood, behind-the-scenes stuff",
          "zh": "這就是底層、背後運作的"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 550.6,
          "end": 552.666,
          "en": "that is going on.",
          "zh": "那些機制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 552.666,
          "end": 553.8,
          "en": "Now, I will comment this out",
          "zh": "現在，我會把這段註解掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 553.8,
          "end": 556.033,
          "en": "and go back to the JSX solution,",
          "zh": "並回到 JSX 的寫法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 556.033,
          "end": 558.166,
          "en": "because, of course, we're going to write JSX code",
          "zh": "因為我們當然會在課程中"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 558.166,
          "end": 559.033,
          "en": "in the course.",
          "zh": "撰寫 JSX 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 559.033,
          "end": 561.433,
          "en": "After all, this is way more convenient.",
          "zh": "畢竟這樣方便多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 561.433,
          "end": 564,
          "en": "But it is important to understand what is happening",
          "zh": "但重要的是要了解在底層發生了什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 564,
          "end": 566.7,
          "en": "under the hood and how React works.",
          "zh": "以及 React 是如何運作的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595468",
      "title": "Organizing Component Files",
      "sourceHash": "df4c8e7a10bda94251023f7bba6e0f6c484ecc4043e1b0e0a4511027162f52d4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.033,
          "end": 4,
          "en": "Maximilian: So, now, in the last lecture we learned",
          "zh": "Maximilian：好，現在，在上一堂課裡我們學到了"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4,
          "end": 6.9,
          "en": "about JSX and how it looks like under the hood,",
          "zh": "關於 JSX，以及它在底層看起來是什麼樣子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.9,
          "end": 10.5,
          "en": "and why we therefore could add all these React imports",
          "zh": "還有為什麼我們因此可以在所有這些檔案裡加上這些 React import"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 14.4,
          "en": "to all these files, which hold JSX code.",
          "zh": "也就是所有包含 JSX 程式碼的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.833,
          "en": "Speaking of the files, let's talk about organizing them.",
          "zh": "說到這些檔案，我們來聊聊怎麼整理它們吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.833,
          "end": 19.966,
          "en": "Here, we only got a couple of components",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們只有幾個 component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.966,
          "end": 22.966,
          "en": "and therefore we can store them like this,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以像這樣存放它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.966,
          "end": 25.666,
          "en": "but as your project grows and as you have more",
          "zh": "但隨著你的專案成長，當你有越來越多"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.666,
          "end": 27.933,
          "en": "and more components you might want",
          "zh": "越來越多的 component 時，你可能會想"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.933,
          "end": 30.233,
          "en": "to organize them into sub folders",
          "zh": "把它們整理到子資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.233,
          "end": 34.566,
          "en": "and not just throw them all into one components folder.",
          "zh": "而不是全部丟進同一個 components 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.566,
          "end": 35.966,
          "en": "And, indeed, that is something",
          "zh": "而這確實是一件"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.966,
          "end": 38,
          "en": "we can already get started with.",
          "zh": "我們現在就可以開始做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38,
          "end": 43.2,
          "en": "Here, we could argue that we have some general UI components",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們可以說我們有一些通用的 UI component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 43.266,
          "en": "Here, we could argue that we have some general UI components",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們可以說我們有一些通用的 UI component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.266,
          "end": 45.433,
          "en": "some general user interface elements,",
          "zh": "一些通用的使用者介面元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.433,
          "end": 48.8,
          "en": "which are not tied to a specific feature of the app.",
          "zh": "它們並不綁定於應用程式的某個特定功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.8,
          "end": 51.933,
          "en": "And then, we got some features specific components,",
          "zh": "然後，我們有一些特定功能專屬的 component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.933,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "And then, we got some features specific components,",
          "zh": "然後，我們有一些特定功能專屬的 component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 54.2,
          "en": "like these components, which are dealing",
          "zh": "像這些 component，它們負責"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.2,
          "end": 58.866,
          "en": "with rendering expenses and expense data.",
          "zh": "渲染支出和支出資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.866,
          "end": 61.5,
          "en": "And, therefore, in the components sub folder,",
          "zh": "因此，在 components 這個子資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.5,
          "end": 66.866,
          "en": "we could create an Expenses sub folder,",
          "zh": "我們可以建立一個 Expenses 子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.866,
          "end": 67,
          "en": "we could create an Expenses sub folder,",
          "zh": "我們可以建立一個 Expenses 子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "and next to that a UI sub folder",
          "zh": "並在它旁邊建立一個 UI 子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 77.1,
          "en": "for general user interface elements.",
          "zh": "用來放通用的使用者介面元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 78.9,
          "en": "And we could move the card files",
          "zh": "而我們可以把 card 的檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.9,
          "end": 80.833,
          "en": "into the UI folder and the Expenses, ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "移到 UI 資料夾，並把 Expenses、ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.833,
          "end": 83.633,
          "en": "into the UI folder and the Expenses, ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "移到 UI 資料夾，並把 Expenses、ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.633,
          "end": 88.1,
          "en": "and ExpenseDate files into the Expenses folder.",
          "zh": "以及 ExpenseDate 這些檔案移到 Expenses 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.1,
          "end": 89.6,
          "en": "Now, you just want to make sure",
          "zh": "現在，你只要確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.6,
          "end": 93.533,
          "en": "that you update all your imports like in Expenses.js,",
          "zh": "你更新了所有的 import，像是在 Expenses.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.533,
          "end": 95.7,
          "en": "where we import card, we now, first of all,",
          "zh": "我們在那裡 import card，現在我們首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 96.93299999999999,
          "en": "where we import card, we now, first of all,",
          "zh": "我們在那裡 import card，現在我們首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.93299999999999,
          "end": 101.2,
          "en": "need to go up one level with two dots and then a slash",
          "zh": "需要用兩個點加一個斜線往上跳一層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.2,
          "end": 103.4,
          "en": "and then dive into the UI folder",
          "zh": "然後再進入 UI 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.4,
          "end": 107.333,
          "en": "and import card, the card file.",
          "zh": "並 import card，也就是 card 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.333,
          "end": 110.033,
          "en": "We need to go up one level because Expenses is now",
          "zh": "我們需要往上跳一層，因為 Expenses 現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.033,
          "end": 112.3,
          "en": "in the Expenses folder, and we need to get",
          "zh": "位在 Expenses 資料夾裡，而我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.3,
          "end": 115.93299999999999,
          "en": "out of that folder into the next folder above it",
          "zh": "離開那個資料夾，進到它上一層的資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.93299999999999,
          "end": 116,
          "en": "out of that folder into the next folder above it",
          "zh": "離開那個資料夾，進到它上一層的資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116,
          "end": 120.133,
          "en": "to then dive into the UI folder, which is a sibling folder",
          "zh": "然後再進入 UI 資料夾，它是 Expenses 的同層資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.133,
          "end": 124.166,
          "en": "to Expenses, to the Expenses folder, I mean.",
          "zh": "我是指 Expenses 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.166,
          "end": 126.333,
          "en": "We don't need to update the other imports",
          "zh": "我們不需要更新其他 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.333,
          "end": 128.033,
          "en": "because these files are still in",
          "zh": "因為這些檔案仍然在"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.033,
          "end": 131.666,
          "en": "the same folder as Expenses.js.",
          "zh": "和 Expenses.js 相同的資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.666,
          "end": 134.066,
          "en": "For ExpenseItem, we also need to update",
          "zh": "至於 ExpenseItem，我們也需要更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.066,
          "end": 137.03300000000002,
          "en": "the card import though, go up one level,",
          "zh": "card 的 import，往上跳一層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.03300000000002,
          "end": 141.266,
          "en": "dive into the UI folder and then import card.",
          "zh": "進入 UI 資料夾，然後 import card。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.266,
          "end": 145.066,
          "en": "And in App.js, we no longer import Expenses",
          "zh": "而在 App.js 裡，我們不再從 components 的 Expenses import Expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.066,
          "end": 146.766,
          "en": "from components' Expenses, instead we dive into components",
          "zh": "而是先進入 components，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.766,
          "end": 149.3,
          "en": "from components' Expenses, instead we dive into components",
          "zh": "而是先進入 components，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.3,
          "end": 151.2,
          "en": "then into the Expenses folder",
          "zh": "然後進入 Expenses 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.2,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "and there it's the Expenses file,",
          "zh": "那裡就是 Expenses 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 155.53300000000002,
          "en": "which you want to import from.",
          "zh": "也就是你要 import 的來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.53300000000002,
          "end": 157.36599999999999,
          "en": "So, now, we can adjust these imports.",
          "zh": "所以，現在我們可以調整這些 import。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.36599999999999,
          "end": 163.3,
          "en": "And if you did that, this again, all works if you load it.",
          "zh": "而如果你這麼做了，再次強調，只要你載入它，一切都能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.3,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "And we're really just doing this to organize our files,",
          "zh": "我們這麼做真的只是為了整理我們的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 168.3,
          "en": "and to keep our components organized,",
          "zh": "讓我們的 component 保持有條理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 172.333,
          "en": "and to make sure that they're not all in one big folder.",
          "zh": "並確保它們不會全部擠在一個大資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.333,
          "end": 175.3,
          "en": "Ultimately, it's up to you how you want to organize them.",
          "zh": "到頭來，要怎麼整理它們取決於你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.3,
          "end": 177.166,
          "en": "And, of course you, should just organize them,",
          "zh": "當然，你應該就照著"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.166,
          "end": 180.333,
          "en": "such that you and any team members you might be working",
          "zh": "讓你和任何可能一起共事的團隊成員"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.333,
          "end": 183.433,
          "en": "with are comfortable working with these files.",
          "zh": "都能舒服地使用這些檔案的方式來整理它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.433,
          "end": 185.9,
          "en": "That's the most important thing which matters.",
          "zh": "那才是最重要的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595472",
      "title": "An Alternative Function Syntax",
      "sourceHash": "ea9fe66251f013273eaab0379b4c68652fb14d0aa834736e52b5ee4d91e79349",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.2,
          "en": "Instructor: Now to really conclude this module,",
          "zh": "講師：現在，為了真正為這個單元做個總結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.2,
          "end": 7.933,
          "en": "I just wanna show you an alternative syntax",
          "zh": "我只想讓你看看另一種語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.933,
          "end": 10.666,
          "en": "for writing these functions,",
          "zh": "用來撰寫這些函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.666,
          "end": 14.366,
          "en": "any kinds of functions in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 中任何種類的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.366,
          "end": 17.866,
          "en": "A syntax which is not exclusive to React by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這種語法並不是 React 專屬的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.866,
          "end": 22.166,
          "en": "but which can be used in any modern JavaScript application.",
          "zh": "而是可以用在任何現代 JavaScript 應用程式中的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.166,
          "end": 24.1,
          "en": "Instead of writing a function like this",
          "zh": "與其像這樣撰寫函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.1,
          "end": 26.3,
          "en": "with the function keyword,",
          "zh": "使用 function 關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.3,
          "end": 26.6,
          "en": "with the function keyword,",
          "zh": "使用 function 關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.6,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "you can also write a so-called arrow function,",
          "zh": "你也可以撰寫所謂的箭頭函式（arrow function），"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 33.433,
          "en": "and attached you find a link with more details",
          "zh": "附件中你會找到一個連結，裡面有更多細節"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.433,
          "end": 35.233,
          "en": "on these arrow functions.",
          "zh": "關於這些箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.233,
          "end": 38.7,
          "en": "Again, it's not a React specific thing.",
          "zh": "再次強調，這不是 React 專屬的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 41.2,
          "en": "To use that arrow function syntax.",
          "zh": "要使用那個箭頭函式語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.2,
          "end": 44.4,
          "en": "You replace function with const to create a new constant",
          "zh": "你把 function 換成 const，來建立一個新的常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 45.966,
          "en": "You replace function with const to create a new constant",
          "zh": "你把 function 換成 const，來建立一個新的常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.966,
          "end": 48.933,
          "en": "with a given name app in this case.",
          "zh": "並給它一個名稱，在這個例子中是 app。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.933,
          "end": 52.1,
          "en": "And then the value which you assigned to this constant",
          "zh": "然後你指定給這個常數的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.1,
          "end": 56.533,
          "en": "is an arrow function written like this.",
          "zh": "就是像這樣寫的箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.533,
          "end": 59.233,
          "en": "A list of parameters then an equal sign",
          "zh": "一串參數，然後一個等號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.233,
          "end": 61.933,
          "en": "and a greater sign forming such an arrow",
          "zh": "再加上一個大於符號，形成這樣的箭頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.933,
          "end": 65.43299999999999,
          "en": "and then the function body between curly braces.",
          "zh": "然後是放在大括號之間的函式主體。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.43299999999999,
          "end": 69.766,
          "en": "And again, that's really just standard JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "再次強調，這真的只是標準的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.766,
          "end": 70.533,
          "en": "And again, that's really just standard JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "再次強調，這真的只是標準的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.533,
          "end": 74.3,
          "en": "You can absolutely stick to the function keyword.",
          "zh": "你完全可以繼續使用 function 關鍵字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.3,
          "end": 77.333,
          "en": "This is just a syntax, which I personally prefer",
          "zh": "這只是一種語法，我個人比較偏好它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.333,
          "end": 80.5,
          "en": "because it's a bit shorter or yeah, I just prefer it.",
          "zh": "因為它稍微簡短一些，或者，對，我就是比較喜歡它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.5,
          "end": 84,
          "en": "And therefore I will migrate all my functions to",
          "zh": "所以我會把我所有的函式都改成"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84,
          "end": 88.1,
          "en": "this syntax like this here in the case of card",
          "zh": "這個語法，就像這裡 card 的情況一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.1,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "but you don't have to do that",
          "zh": "但你不需要這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 92.033,
          "en": "if you prefer the other syntax, it's really 100% optional.",
          "zh": "如果你偏好另一種語法，這真的是 100% 可選的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.033,
          "end": 95.033,
          "en": "if you prefer the other syntax, it's really 100% optional.",
          "zh": "如果你偏好另一種語法，這真的是 100% 可選的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.033,
          "end": 96.63300000000001,
          "en": "And in this case here",
          "zh": "而在這裡的這個情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.63300000000001,
          "end": 99.833,
          "en": "it doesn't offer any benefits or anything like that.",
          "zh": "它並不會帶來任何好處或之類的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.833,
          "end": 101.76599999999999,
          "en": "It's really just personal preference.",
          "zh": "這真的只是個人偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.76599999999999,
          "end": 104.033,
          "en": "And I want to show this syntax here",
          "zh": "而我之所以在這裡展示這個語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.033,
          "end": 107.033,
          "en": "since you will also see that in a lot of React projects",
          "zh": "是因為你在很多 React 專案中也會看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.033,
          "end": 109.666,
          "en": "and you therefore should be aware of it",
          "zh": "因此你應該要了解它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.666,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "and you therefore should be aware of it",
          "zh": "因此你應該要了解它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 112.13300000000001,
          "en": "that you can write your functions like this,",
          "zh": "知道你可以像這樣撰寫你的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.13300000000001,
          "end": 116.6,
          "en": "any functions by the way, not just component functions.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，任何函式都可以，不只是元件函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.6,
          "end": 117.666,
          "en": "any functions by the way, not just component functions.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，任何函式都可以，不只是元件函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.666,
          "end": 121.3,
          "en": "And with that, we're really done for this module.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就真的完成這個單元了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.3,
          "end": 122.666,
          "en": "It was a huge module.",
          "zh": "這是一個很龐大的單元。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.666,
          "end": 125.766,
          "en": "And yet we're still only scratching the surface.",
          "zh": "但我們仍然只是觸及了皮毛。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.766,
          "end": 128.733,
          "en": "There's way more we can explore about React,",
          "zh": "關於 React，還有更多可以探索的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.733,
          "end": 132.5,
          "en": "and in the next section, you'll get a practice project",
          "zh": "而在下一個章節，你會拿到一個練習專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.5,
          "end": 137,
          "en": "which will allow you to practice what you learned in this section.",
          "zh": "讓你可以練習你在這個章節學到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.333,
          "end": 141,
          "en": "But thereafter we'll dive way deeper into React.",
          "zh": "但在那之後，我們會更深入地鑽研 React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141,
          "end": 145.133,
          "en": "And we're going to explore more crucial React features.",
          "zh": "我們會探索更多關鍵的 React 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.466,
          "end": 149.966,
          "en": "Most importantly there, after this exercise section,",
          "zh": "最重要的是，在這個練習章節之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.233,
          "end": 155.5,
          "en": "we'll explore the important concept of managing state in React apps,",
          "zh": "我們會探索在 React 應用程式中管理 state 這個重要概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.7,
          "end": 159.633,
          "en": "and of building truly interactive user interfaces.",
          "zh": "以及打造真正具有互動性的使用者介面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38348444",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "sourceHash": "16ef5c0d9719e621448b57ed00af699591e92f8282525b591f37645dd8fb17d1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.32,
          "en": "So, now that we got started",
          "zh": "所以，既然我們已經開始"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.32,
          "end": 6.36,
          "en": "with components and props,",
          "zh": "接觸元件和 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "and how we can build basic React applications,",
          "zh": "以及如何建立基本的 React 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "it's time to practice what we learned,",
          "zh": "現在是時候練習我們學到的東西了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "and it's of course specifically time",
          "zh": "而這當然特別是時候"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.42,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "to practice working with those components,",
          "zh": "練習如何使用那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "because as you learned,",
          "zh": "因為正如你學到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "components are a crucial React concept,",
          "zh": "元件是 React 的關鍵概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "and the core building block of all those user interfaces",
          "zh": "以及所有那些使用者介面的核心組成要素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 31.233,
          "en": "you are going to build with React.",
          "zh": "也就是你將用 React 打造的那些介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.16,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "Therefore, in this course section here,",
          "zh": "因此，在這個課程單元裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 38.82,
          "en": "we're going to build this demo application,",
          "zh": "我們要建立這個示範應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.82,
          "end": 40.89,
          "en": "this very basic website",
          "zh": "這個非常基本的網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 44.13,
          "en": "which will utilize this component concept,",
          "zh": "它會運用元件這個概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.13,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "or which code will utilize this component concept,",
          "zh": "或者說，它的程式碼會運用元件這個概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 51.27,
          "en": "and the idea behind this section here",
          "zh": "而這個單元背後的想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.27,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "is that you can practice what you learned.",
          "zh": "是讓你可以練習你學到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 56.07,
          "en": "For that, in this section,",
          "zh": "為此，在這個單元中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.07,
          "end": 60.18,
          "en": "you're going to split an existing component,",
          "zh": "你會把一個既有的元件拆開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.18,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "an existing React application, you could say,",
          "zh": "或者可以說，一個既有的 React 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 65.85,
          "en": "into smaller components,",
          "zh": "拆成更小的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 68.4,
          "en": "and you're therefore going to create",
          "zh": "因此你將會建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.4,
          "end": 71.64,
          "en": "and use multiple custom components,",
          "zh": "並使用多個自訂元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.64,
          "end": 75.45,
          "en": "and you are also going to need to pass data",
          "zh": "而且你也將需要把資料傳遞"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 77.34,
          "en": "to some of those components.",
          "zh": "給其中一些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.34,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "So, that's also something you're going to do",
          "zh": "所以這也是你會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 81.36,
          "en": "in this course section.",
          "zh": "這個課程單元中做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.36,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "In the next lecture, I'll provide you",
          "zh": "在下一堂課中，我會提供你"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 87.03,
          "en": "with a starting project and your main tasks,",
          "zh": "一個起始專案以及你的主要任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.03,
          "end": 88.38,
          "en": "and thereafter,",
          "zh": "之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.38,
          "end": 92.07300000000001,
          "en": "you should try to complete those tasks on your own.",
          "zh": "你應該試著自己完成那些任務。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38348452",
      "title": "The Starting Project & Your Tasks",
      "sourceHash": "f0e6e2bee0e753694e681a180573cb58ee51abf8bbec7580a59a752f912539a6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "So as mentioned, this is the project,",
          "zh": "所以如前面提到的，這就是那個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.55,
          "en": "the website we're going to build in this section.",
          "zh": "我們要在這個章節中建立的網站。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.55,
          "end": 11.73,
          "en": "And when I say we are going to build it,",
          "zh": "而當我說我們要建立它時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.73,
          "end": 14.94,
          "en": "I basically mean you are going to build it,",
          "zh": "我基本上是指你要去建立它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.94,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "or at least you should try building it first,",
          "zh": "或者至少你應該先試著建立它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 21,
          "en": "because I got a couple of tasks for you",
          "zh": "因為我為你準備了幾個任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "that allow you to practice what you learned.",
          "zh": "讓你練習所學到的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 27.6,
          "en": "Though of course, throughout the rest of this section here,",
          "zh": "當然，在這個章節剩下的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.6,
          "end": 30.856,
          "en": "I'm going to build this website here together with you",
          "zh": "我會在這裡和你一起建立這個網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.856,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "and you can follow along with me",
          "zh": "而你可以在旁邊跟著我做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 35.71,
          "en": "to see how I'm tackling those tasks",
          "zh": "看看我如何處理那些任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.696,
          "end": 38.76,
          "en": "and how I am building this project.",
          "zh": "以及我如何建立這個專案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.76,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "But that being said, let's now take a look at",
          "zh": "話雖如此，我們現在來看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 43.5,
          "en": "this starting project I prepared for you",
          "zh": "我為你準備的這個起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.5,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "and the tasks you should complete with this project.",
          "zh": "以及你應該用這個專案完成的任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 48.54,
          "en": "So here's the starting project",
          "zh": "所以這就是起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 51.39,
          "en": "and you of course find it attached.",
          "zh": "你當然可以在附件中找到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.39,
          "end": 54.45,
          "en": "You also find a link to Code Sandbox attached",
          "zh": "你也可以在附件中找到 Code Sandbox 的連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 56.4,
          "en": "which you can use alternatively",
          "zh": "你可以改用這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "if you don't want to install anything locally.",
          "zh": "如果你不想在本機安裝任何東西的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 62.1,
          "en": "But I'm of course going to use a local environment",
          "zh": "不過我當然會使用本機環境，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.1,
          "end": 64.8,
          "en": "as I always do in this course.",
          "zh": "就像我在這門課中一直做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.8,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "And in this starting project I am providing to you,",
          "zh": "而在我提供給你的這個起始專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "you'll find a source folder",
          "zh": "你會找到一個 source 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "with a couple of JavaScript files",
          "zh": "裡面有幾個 JavaScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 76.08,
          "en": "and an assets folder with a nested images folder.",
          "zh": "以及一個 assets 資料夾，裡面還有個 images 子資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.08,
          "end": 81.08,
          "en": "Now the only really relevant file for us is the App.js file.",
          "zh": "現在對我們來說唯一真正相關的檔案就是 App.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.783,
          "end": 86.1,
          "en": "In that file here, you'll already find some code",
          "zh": "在那個檔案裡，你已經會找到一些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.1,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "and you'll also already find a react component in there.",
          "zh": "而且你還會在裡面找到一個 React 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "Now this component",
          "zh": "現在這個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.00999999999999,
          "en": "and this overall app is not finished though.",
          "zh": "以及整個應用程式都還沒完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.00999999999999,
          "end": 98.1,
          "en": "Instead here in this component I got a header,",
          "zh": "不過在這個元件裡，我有一個 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 102.93,
          "en": "where I output an image and the image is actually imported",
          "zh": "我在那裡輸出一個圖片，而這個圖片其實是"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "like this from the assets folder.",
          "zh": "像這樣從 assets 資料夾 import 進來的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.43,
          "en": "This is an import syntax you can use in React projects.",
          "zh": "這是你可以用在 React 專案中的 import 語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.43,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "It is supported by the underlying development server",
          "zh": "它由底層的 development server 支援，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 114.963,
          "en": "and build process,",
          "zh": "以及建置流程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.167,
          "end": 118.11,
          "en": "and this is how you can use images which are stored",
          "zh": "而這就是你如何使用儲存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.11,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "in this assets images folder here in your component files.",
          "zh": "assets images 資料夾中的圖片，在你的元件檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 125.07,
          "en": "You simply import them, assign any name of your choice",
          "zh": "你只要將它們 import 進來，指定任何你選擇的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.07,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "to them, and then you use them as a dynamic source value.",
          "zh": "然後將它們當作動態 source 值來使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 133.14,
          "en": "But that's already in this file of course.",
          "zh": "但當然，這已經在這個檔案裡了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.14,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "What's not in this file or what's at least not finished",
          "zh": "這個檔案裡沒有的，或者說至少還沒完成的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 140.43,
          "en": "right now is information about some of those",
          "zh": "目前是關於其中一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.43,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "React key concepts you should be aware of.",
          "zh": "你應該知道的 React 關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 147.03,
          "en": "Though I will say that this is just a demo website,",
          "zh": "不過我要說，這只是個示範網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.03,
          "end": 149.083,
          "en": "just an exercise.",
          "zh": "只是個練習。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.083,
          "end": 150.57,
          "en": "And this is not an exhaustive list",
          "zh": "而且這不是一份詳盡的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.57,
          "end": 152.85,
          "en": "of all key React concepts.",
          "zh": "涵蓋所有關鍵的 React 概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.85,
          "end": 156.45,
          "en": "Instead, you're going to learn about more React concepts",
          "zh": "相反地，你將會學到更多 React 概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.45,
          "end": 157.773,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": "在這整門課中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 162.03,
          "en": "But anyways here we got an array full of objects",
          "zh": "但總之，這裡我們有一個裝滿物件的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.03,
          "end": 165.288,
          "en": "and down here the goal is to output the information",
          "zh": "而在下面這裡，目標是輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.288,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "that's contained in those objects in this array.",
          "zh": "這個陣列中那些物件所包含的資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.69,
          "en": "But at the moment that's not happening.",
          "zh": "但目前在畫面上並沒有發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.69,
          "end": 174.66,
          "en": "And that's where your tasks start.",
          "zh": "而你的任務就從這裡開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.66,
          "end": 179.34,
          "en": "The first task is to output those key concepts,",
          "zh": "第一個任務是輸出那些關鍵概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.34,
          "end": 182.28,
          "en": "so that key concepts data.",
          "zh": "也就是那份 key concepts 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 185.325,
          "en": "This data which you find in this area should be output here",
          "zh": "你在這個區域找到的這份資料應該被輸出在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.325,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "on the screen.",
          "zh": "在畫面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 190.56,
          "en": "And of course with that, I don't mean that you should copy",
          "zh": "當然，我這麼說並不是指你應該複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "and paste the text.",
          "zh": "並貼上文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 193.99,
          "en": "Instead, you should find a different way",
          "zh": "相反地，你應該找出不同的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.011,
          "end": 199.07999999999998,
          "en": "of outputting that data, but that's only the first task.",
          "zh": "來輸出那份資料，但那只是第一個任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.07999999999998,
          "end": 204.07999999999998,
          "en": "The second task then is to identify possible components",
          "zh": "第二個任務則是找出可能的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "you could create, possible JSX code snippets",
          "zh": "你可以建立的元件，以及可能的 JSX 程式碼片段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 210.93,
          "en": "you could outsource into a separate component.",
          "zh": "你可以將它們拆分到獨立的元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.93,
          "end": 213.57,
          "en": "For that you should analyze this JSX code",
          "zh": "為此，你應該分析這個 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.57,
          "end": 217.74,
          "en": "in the app component and come up with possible components",
          "zh": "在 app component 中的，並想出可能的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 220.5,
          "en": "this code could be split up into.",
          "zh": "這段程式碼可以拆分成的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.5,
          "end": 223.62,
          "en": "Now of course identifying possible components",
          "zh": "當然，找出可能的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.62,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "isn't everything though.",
          "zh": "並不是全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "Instead then as a last task in this section here,",
          "zh": "而是，作為這個章節的最後一項任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 234.09,
          "en": "you should then also create and use those custom components.",
          "zh": "你應該接著建立並使用那些自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.09,
          "end": 236.94,
          "en": "So you should create new components.",
          "zh": "所以你應該建立新的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.94,
          "end": 239.76,
          "en": "Also use props if you need to use them.",
          "zh": "如果需要使用 props，也要使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.76,
          "end": 243.51,
          "en": "And of course once you went through all these steps",
          "zh": "當然，當你完成所有這些步驟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.51,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "and once you have a working solution,",
          "zh": "而且有了能運作的解決方案之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "definitely also take a look at the remaining lectures",
          "zh": "也一定要看看這個章節中剩下的課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 251.61,
          "en": "in this section because there I will walk you through",
          "zh": "因為在那裡我會帶你逐步了解"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.61,
          "end": 254.73,
          "en": "my solution, repeat some core component",
          "zh": "我的解決方案，複習一些核心元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.73,
          "end": 256.71,
          "en": "and React concepts you must know,",
          "zh": "以及你必須知道的 React 概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "and of course also let you know why I chose this solution",
          "zh": "當然也會讓你知道我為何選擇這個解決方案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 263.88,
          "en": "and why I perform certain steps.",
          "zh": "以及我為何執行某些步驟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.88,
          "end": 266.394,
          "en": "Now in case you're getting stuck whilst trying this",
          "zh": "現在，如果你在自己嘗試時卡住了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.394,
          "end": 269.79,
          "en": "on your own, also take a look at the next lecture,",
          "zh": "也請看看下一堂課，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.79,
          "end": 271.68,
          "en": "so the lecture after this one here,",
          "zh": "也就是這堂課之後的那一堂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.68,
          "end": 274.74,
          "en": "because that will be a hints lecture where",
          "zh": "因為那會是一堂提示課，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.74,
          "end": 277.53,
          "en": "I give you some hints on how to tackle this",
          "zh": "我會給你一些如何著手處理的提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 277.53,
          "end": 280.23,
          "en": "and where idea four can hopefully help you",
          "zh": "也希望其中的一些想法能幫助你"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 280.23,
          "end": 282,
          "en": "come up with a solution.",
          "zh": "想出一個解決方案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 282,
          "end": 285.993,
          "en": "And with that, good luck and I'll see you in my solution.",
          "zh": "那麼，祝你好運，我們在我的解決方案中見。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38348460",
      "title": "Outputting Key Concepts Data",
      "sourceHash": "02077175777021504474098eece99af5c069e7cbb509e4e3e6d163019c05dd96",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "So let's now solve these tasks.",
          "zh": "那麼我們現在來解決這些任務。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.36,
          "en": "And for that, of course, we're going to start",
          "zh": "為此，我們當然要先從"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 10.803,
          "en": "with the first task where we output the key concepts data.",
          "zh": "第一個任務開始，也就是輸出 key concepts 的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.15,
          "end": 14.4,
          "en": "Now, the data is already here",
          "zh": "現在，資料其實已經在這裡了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "in app js in this concepts array.",
          "zh": "在 app js 裡的這個 concepts 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 22.08,
          "en": "And now, the goal is to output that data down there.",
          "zh": "而現在的目標，是要把那個資料輸出到下面那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.08,
          "end": 24.84,
          "en": "And if you take a look at this unordered list here",
          "zh": "如果你看一下這裡這個無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.84,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "where the concept data should be output,",
          "zh": "也就是概念資料應該被輸出的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.96,
          "en": "you can see that I already got one list item there,",
          "zh": "你可以看到我已經在那裡放了一個清單項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.96,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "but at the moment, it only contains dummy content here,",
          "zh": "但目前它裡面只有 dummy 內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 37.413,
          "en": "only dummy data.",
          "zh": "只有 dummy 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.413,
          "end": 39.57,
          "en": "That now needs to be replaced",
          "zh": "現在那需要被替換掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 42.9,
          "en": "with the actual data from these objects.",
          "zh": "換成這些物件裡的實際資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.9,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "And as I mentioned,",
          "zh": "而正如我提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 47.016,
          "en": "the goal is now not to copy and paste that data,",
          "zh": "現在的目標不是複製貼上那些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.016,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "but instead to dynamically access the data",
          "zh": "而是要動態地存取資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "in that concepts array.",
          "zh": "在那個 concepts 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 55.35,
          "en": "And in React, you can do that",
          "zh": "而在 React 中，你可以做到這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 57.84,
          "en": "by using single curly braces,",
          "zh": "透過使用單一大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.84,
          "end": 62.643,
          "en": "as you learned opening and closing single curly braces.",
          "zh": "就像你學過的，一組開頭和結尾的單一大括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 65.61,
          "en": "Between those curly braces,",
          "zh": "在這些大括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "you can put any JavaScript expression that yields a value.",
          "zh": "你可以放入任何會產生值的 JavaScript 運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 73.23,
          "en": "You could, for example, put one plus one in here.",
          "zh": "舉例來說，你可以在這裡放入 one plus one。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 75.06,
          "en": "But, of course, that's not the goal here.",
          "zh": "但當然，那不是這裡的目標。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "Instead, here for the image, I want to refer",
          "zh": "相反地，這裡對圖片，我想引用"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "to this image or precisely to the value stored",
          "zh": "這張圖片，或者更精確地說，是存放在"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 86.733,
          "en": "under the image key in this first object in this array.",
          "zh": "這個陣列中第一個物件裡 image 鍵底下的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "So, this value stored under this image key",
          "zh": "所以，存放在這個 image 鍵底下的這個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 93.243,
          "en": "in the first object of this array.",
          "zh": "在這個陣列的第一個物件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.71000000000001,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "To output that image here, we can go to this source here.",
          "zh": "要把那張圖片輸出到這裡，我們可以到這個 source 這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "So, between those curly braces,",
          "zh": "所以，在這些大括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.34,
          "end": 104.10300000000001,
          "en": "reference this Concepts array by its name.",
          "zh": "用它的名稱來引用這個 Concepts 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "And then, since it's an array,",
          "zh": "然後，由於它是個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 108.96000000000001,
          "en": "and I want to access the first element in there,",
          "zh": "而我想存取裡面的第一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.96000000000001,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "I can use square brackets zero",
          "zh": "我可以用中括號零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 115.17,
          "en": "which does access the first element in that array.",
          "zh": "這樣就能存取那個陣列中的第一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.17,
          "end": 118.233,
          "en": "And that first element will be this object here.",
          "zh": "而第一個元素就會是這裡這個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "And then, this object I now want to get access",
          "zh": "然後，對這個物件，我現在想要存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "to that value that's stored under the key image.",
          "zh": "存放在 image 這個鍵底下的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "So therefore, we can use the dot notation here",
          "zh": "因此，我們可以在這裡使用點記法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.53,
          "en": "and access image like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣存取 image。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 132.753,
          "en": "And this will output the image here.",
          "zh": "這樣就會在這裡輸出圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 137.16,
          "en": "Now, I also want to set the alt text dynamically,",
          "zh": "現在，我也想要動態地設定 alt 文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.16,
          "end": 140.04,
          "en": "and I wanna set this to the title of this concept.",
          "zh": "而我想把它設成這個 concept 的 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.04,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "And therefore, here we again need curly braces",
          "zh": "因此，這裡我們同樣需要大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "to dynamically output some content here.",
          "zh": "才能在這裡動態輸出一些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.57999999999998,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "And then, we use concepts again,",
          "zh": "然後，我們再次使用 concepts，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "square bracket zero,",
          "zh": "中括號零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 154.26,
          "en": "because we're still working on the same Concepts object.",
          "zh": "因為我們還是在處理同一個 Concepts 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.26,
          "end": 157.983,
          "en": "And then, dot title gives us access to the title.",
          "zh": "然後，點 title 讓我們存取到 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.09,
          "end": 161.199,
          "en": "And that's actually also exactly the code",
          "zh": "而這其實也正好就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.199,
          "end": 165.39,
          "en": "I need down here to output the title as text.",
          "zh": "我在下面這裡把 title 當作文字輸出時所需要的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 167.163,
          "en": "So, between those H2 tags.",
          "zh": "也就是在那些 H2 標籤之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.21,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "And then, here, for the paragraph",
          "zh": "然後，這裡，對於段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "where I want to output the description",
          "zh": "也就是我想要輸出 description 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 175.413,
          "en": "I want to access Concepts, zero description.",
          "zh": "我想要存取 Concepts、零、description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 178.77,
          "en": "With that, we should be outputting data",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們應該就能輸出資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "about the first key concept in that Concepts array.",
          "zh": "關於那個 Concepts 陣列中的第一個 key concept。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 185.91,
          "en": "Now, to see this in action here on my local machine,",
          "zh": "現在，要在我本機上實際看到效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 188.04,
          "en": "I need to start this development server,",
          "zh": "我需要啟動這個開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 190.712,
          "en": "which in Visual Studio Code can be done",
          "zh": "在 Visual Studio Code 裡可以透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.712,
          "end": 193.77,
          "en": "by opening a new terminal and running NPM start.",
          "zh": "開啟一個新的終端機並執行 NPM start 來完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.77,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "Though, for this to succeed, I first must run NPM install",
          "zh": "不過，要讓它成功，我必須先執行 NPM install，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.09,
          "en": "to install all those extra dependencies",
          "zh": "來安裝所有那些額外的相依套件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.09,
          "end": 204.63,
          "en": "including that build process that's used behind the scenes.",
          "zh": "包括在背後使用的建置流程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.63,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "And you only need to do this once",
          "zh": "而這個你只需要做一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 209.94,
          "en": "as you learned when you initially set up a project.",
          "zh": "就像你在一開始建立專案時學到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 212.733,
          "en": "And thereafter, we can run NPM start,",
          "zh": "之後，我們就可以執行 NPM start，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.733,
          "end": 216.54,
          "en": "and this will now start that development server.",
          "zh": "這樣就會啟動那個開發伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.54,
          "end": 219.09199999999998,
          "en": "And then, once I visit local host 3000",
          "zh": "然後，一旦我造訪 local host 3000，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.09199999999998,
          "end": 223.263,
          "en": "I can indeed see this key concept here on the screen.",
          "zh": "我確實可以在螢幕上看到這個 key concept。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.28,
          "end": 226.425,
          "en": "It's quite big for me here,",
          "zh": "它在我這裡看起來挺大的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.425,
          "end": 227.61,
          "en": "because I zoomed in quite a bit,",
          "zh": "因為我放大了不少，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.61,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "so that you can see it really well as well.",
          "zh": "這樣你們也能看得很清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 233.04,
          "en": "And I got a light hover effect here,",
          "zh": "而我這裡有個輕微的 hover 效果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.04,
          "end": 235.683,
          "en": "but clicking doesn't actually do anything here.",
          "zh": "但在這裡點擊其實不會有任何作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.56900000000002,
          "end": 237.69,
          "en": "It's just a visual effect.",
          "zh": "這只是個視覺效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.69,
          "end": 241.23,
          "en": "But, this is now the first key concept being output here.",
          "zh": "不過，這就是現在被輸出到這裡的第一個 key concept。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.23,
          "end": 244.061,
          "en": "It's not the only key concept we got though.",
          "zh": "不過，這不是我們唯一的 key concept。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.061,
          "end": 248.37,
          "en": "Instead, if we take a look here at this Concepts array,",
          "zh": "相反地，如果我們看一下這裡的這個 Concepts 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.37,
          "end": 251.713,
          "en": "we of course got two more objects in there.",
          "zh": "裡面當然還有另外兩個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.713,
          "end": 256.62,
          "en": "And the goal, of course, is to also output those concepts.",
          "zh": "而目標當然是要也輸出那些 concepts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.62,
          "end": 260.056,
          "en": "And therefore, what we can do for now,",
          "zh": "因此，我們目前可以做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.056,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "and what will change later is",
          "zh": "而這之後會改變的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 263.67,
          "en": "that we copy and paste this list item.",
          "zh": "就是我們複製並貼上這個清單項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 267.27,
          "en": "And now, access Concepts one image,",
          "zh": "然後存取 Concepts 1 image，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.27,
          "end": 270.24,
          "en": "Concepts one title also here",
          "zh": "Concepts 1 title 也放這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.24,
          "end": 273.24,
          "en": "and also Concepts one description.",
          "zh": "還有 Concepts 1 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.24,
          "end": 275.4,
          "en": "And this will access the second element",
          "zh": "這樣就會存取第二個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.4,
          "end": 276.75,
          "en": "in this Concepts array.",
          "zh": "在這個 Concepts 陣列中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.75,
          "end": 278.64,
          "en": "And then, access image, title",
          "zh": "然後存取 image、title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.64,
          "end": 281.90999999999997,
          "en": "and description for that second element.",
          "zh": "以及那個第二個元素的 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.90999999999997,
          "end": 283.332,
          "en": "And, of course,",
          "zh": "而當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.332,
          "end": 285.21,
          "en": "we can then also repeat this one last time here",
          "zh": "我們接著也可以在這裡再重複最後一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.21,
          "end": 287.28,
          "en": "for the third element",
          "zh": "針對第三個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 287.28,
          "end": 290.28,
          "en": "where we dare for access Concepts two image,",
          "zh": "在那裡我們存取 Concepts 2 image，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.28,
          "end": 293.43,
          "en": "Concepts two title also here",
          "zh": "Concepts 2 title 也放這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.43,
          "end": 295.683,
          "en": "and Concepts two description.",
          "zh": "以及 Concepts 2 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.61,
          "end": 301.05,
          "en": "And with that, we'll be outputting all three concepts",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就會輸出全部三個 concepts，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 301.05,
          "end": 304.74,
          "en": "for the moment simply by copy and pasting this code.",
          "zh": "目前只是透過複製貼上這段程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.74,
          "end": 306.753,
          "en": "But, that of course will change soon.",
          "zh": "但這當然很快就會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 309.66,
          "en": "If you save that though,",
          "zh": "不過，如果你把它儲存起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 309.66,
          "end": 312.63,
          "en": "and you got that development server up and running,",
          "zh": "而且你的開發伺服器已經啟動並在運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 312.63,
          "end": 316.773,
          "en": "you will now see these three key concepts on the screen.",
          "zh": "你現在就會在螢幕上看到這三個 key concepts。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 317.94,
          "end": 320.91,
          "en": "And that, theoretically is of course",
          "zh": "而那在理論上當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 320.91,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "already the final solution.",
          "zh": "已經是最終的解決方案了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 325.803,
          "en": "It's the final website we want to build here,",
          "zh": "這是我們想在這裡建立的最終網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 326.94,
          "end": 331.08,
          "en": "but it's not the final solution for those tasks I gave you.",
          "zh": "但這不是我出給你們那些任務的最終解決方案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 331.08,
          "end": 334.2,
          "en": "It's only the solution for the first task,",
          "zh": "這只是第一個任務的解決方案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 334.2,
          "end": 336.78,
          "en": "because whilst we got a working solution",
          "zh": "因為雖然我們得到了一個可行的解決方案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.78,
          "end": 340.68,
          "en": "we don't have the best possible working solution.",
          "zh": "但我們還沒有最好的可行解決方案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.68,
          "end": 345.42,
          "en": "Instead, the next task is to identify possible components",
          "zh": "相反地，下一個任務是要找出可能的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 345.42,
          "end": 349.14300000000003,
          "en": "before we then also build and use those components.",
          "zh": "然後我們才會建立並使用那些元件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38348466",
      "title": "Identifying Possible Components",
      "sourceHash": "fb55e573a2a5753d925e001d246f8af8b979c90d5f58d1d9070027272712c879",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "So let's now take a look at our code",
          "zh": "那麼我們現在來看看我們的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 8.72,
          "en": "and identify possible components into which we could",
          "zh": "並找出我們可以把目前的程式碼拆解成"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.85,
          "end": 11.013,
          "en": "split up the current code.",
          "zh": "哪些可能的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.06,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "For that, if you take a look at the current code,",
          "zh": "為此，如果你看看目前的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 17.88,
          "en": "the current JSX code, to be precise,",
          "zh": "精確來說，是目前的 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 20.79,
          "en": "I got at least two components",
          "zh": "我至少看到兩個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.79,
          "end": 22.95,
          "en": "into which this could be split up.",
          "zh": "可以把這整段拆解進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "And that would be the header component,",
          "zh": "第一個會是 header 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 27.557,
          "en": "that could be a separate component.",
          "zh": "它可以是一個獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.557,
          "end": 32.557,
          "en": "And then one reusable component for those key concepts.",
          "zh": "然後是一個可重複使用的元件，用來處理那些關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "So this list item could go into its own reusable component.",
          "zh": "所以這個清單項目可以放進它自己的可重複使用元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 41.118,
          "en": "We could also build a third component,",
          "zh": "我們也可以建立第三個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.118,
          "end": 46.08,
          "en": "this concept component, but that is optional.",
          "zh": "這個 concept 元件，但那是選用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.08,
          "end": 49.263,
          "en": "You could definitely do it though, I will say that.",
          "zh": "不過你當然可以這麼做，這我必須說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.31,
          "end": 53.61,
          "en": "Now, before we go ahead and build those components,",
          "zh": "現在，在我們開始建立那些元件之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.61,
          "end": 57.51,
          "en": "I wanna briefly explain why we could split the app",
          "zh": "我想簡單說明一下，為什麼我們可以把這個應用程式拆成"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.51,
          "end": 60.42,
          "en": "into those components I just mentioned.",
          "zh": "我剛剛提到的那幾個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.42,
          "end": 63.69,
          "en": "And for that, I first of all want to say that of course",
          "zh": "為此，我首先想說的是，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.69,
          "end": 66.39,
          "en": "for a very simple website like this one here,",
          "zh": "對於像這裡這樣非常簡單的網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.39,
          "end": 69.69,
          "en": "leaving the code like this wouldn't be wrong,",
          "zh": "把程式碼這樣留著並不算錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.69,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "wouldn't be horrible.",
          "zh": "也不會很糟糕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 74.1,
          "en": "But of course this is just a basic demo absence,",
          "zh": "但當然這只是個基本的示範應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.1,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "we're just getting started with React.",
          "zh": "我們才剛開始接觸 React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 80.16,
          "en": "And of course we wanna practice those key React",
          "zh": "而且我們當然想練習那些關鍵的 React"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.16,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "concepts you already learned about,",
          "zh": "概念，也就是你已經學過的那些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "like components for example.",
          "zh": "例如元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 88.28999999999999,
          "en": "And there actually also is a good reason for",
          "zh": "而且其實也有一個很好的理由"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.28999999999999,
          "end": 90.93,
          "en": "splitting this up into components.",
          "zh": "把這個拆分成元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 94.5,
          "en": "At least a separate component for these concepts",
          "zh": "至少為這些概念建立一個獨立的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.5,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "makes a lot of sense, because right now,",
          "zh": "非常合理，因為現在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "if I ever decide that I wanna get rid of this",
          "zh": "如果我哪天決定要移除這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 102.905,
          "en": "description paragraph, for example,",
          "zh": "例如這段說明段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.905,
          "end": 106.11,
          "en": "I have to delete this paragraph manually",
          "zh": "我必須手動刪掉這個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.11,
          "end": 109.83,
          "en": "in three different places to get rid of it.",
          "zh": "而且要在三個不同的地方刪除才能完全移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.83,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "And whilst this is of course certainly doable,",
          "zh": "雖然這當然絕對做得到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 115.38,
          "en": "it's unnecessary repetition.",
          "zh": "但這是不必要的重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.38,
          "end": 117.45,
          "en": "And that's something we can typically avoid",
          "zh": "而這通常是我們可以避免的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 120.393,
          "en": "by using and embracing React components.",
          "zh": "只要使用並擁抱 React 元件就行。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38348472",
      "title": "Creating & Using a Custom Component",
      "sourceHash": "97073cf029c6011808c7c403d3f9c381bcb018817711f558413410d6b218a142",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "So therefore, let's now also dive",
          "zh": "所以，現在讓我們也來深入"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 6.51,
          "en": "into that last task here",
          "zh": "探討這裡的最後一項任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.51,
          "end": 11.51,
          "en": "and let's create and use some reusable custom components.",
          "zh": "並一起來建立和使用一些可重複使用的 custom component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12,
          "end": 14.19,
          "en": "Now for that, in that app here,",
          "zh": "為此，在這個 app 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "I will start with the header.",
          "zh": "我會從 header 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "The header will actually not be reused",
          "zh": "這個 header 其實不會被重複使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "but still, putting it into its own component",
          "zh": "但儘管如此，把它放進它自己的 component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "is definitely something we can do here.",
          "zh": "絕對是我們在這裡可以做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 27.27,
          "en": "For that, in that src folder,",
          "zh": "為此，在那個 src 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.27,
          "end": 31.62,
          "en": "I'll create a new sub folder named components,",
          "zh": "我會建立一個名為 components 的新子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.62,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "which is not a must do as you learned",
          "zh": "如你所學到的，這並非必要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 35.64,
          "en": "but a common convention.",
          "zh": "而是一種常見的慣例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.64,
          "end": 39.13,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add another subfolder called header",
          "zh": "然後在裡面，我會再加入另一個名為 header 的子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.99,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "because in that header file,",
          "zh": "因為在那個 header 資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "I'll then add a Header.js file,",
          "zh": "我會接著新增一個 Header.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "which should contain the component code.",
          "zh": "裡面應該包含這個 component 的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 50.82,
          "en": "Now, as you learned, and as you can also see in App.js,",
          "zh": "現在，如你所學到的，也如你在 App.js 裡看到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.82,
          "end": 53.403,
          "en": "a component in React is just a function,",
          "zh": "在 React 中，一個 component 就只是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 56.7,
          "en": "a standard JavaScript function,",
          "zh": "一個標準的 JavaScript 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 59.49,
          "en": "which does return JSX code though",
          "zh": "不過它會回傳 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.49,
          "end": 62.07,
          "en": "and which typically is also named like this,",
          "zh": "而且它通常也會這樣命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "starting with an uppercase character.",
          "zh": "也就是以大寫字母開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "Therefore, in Header.js, we can create a new function",
          "zh": "因此，在 Header.js 裡，我們可以建立一個新的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 73.35,
          "en": "and we can name it header, which is a name that makes sense",
          "zh": "並把它命名為 header，這個名稱很合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.35,
          "end": 75.93299999999999,
          "en": "for a component that contains the header code.",
          "zh": "對於一個包含 header 程式碼的 component 來說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.25,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "Then I also want to export this as a default",
          "zh": "接著我也想將它以 default 的形式 export，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 83.703,
          "en": "so that we can use this component outside of this file.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能在這個檔案之外使用這個 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.35,
          "end": 89.703,
          "en": "And then we can go to App.js and cut this header code here,",
          "zh": "然後我們可以到 App.js，把這裡這段 header 程式碼剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 96.42,
          "en": "move it to Header.js and return it there, like this.",
          "zh": "把它移到 Header.js，並像這樣在裡面 return 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 98.82,
          "en": "And if I press the auto formatting shortcut here",
          "zh": "而如果我在這裡按下自動格式化的快速鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.82,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "on my system in Visual Studio Code,",
          "zh": "在我的系統上、也就是在 Visual Studio Code 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "this automatically gets formatted like this.",
          "zh": "它就會自動被格式化成這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 106.02000000000001,
          "en": "Now, of course, I'm using an image here",
          "zh": "當然，我在這裡用了一張圖片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.02000000000001,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "and therefore, since I cut this header code",
          "zh": "因此，既然我是把這段 header 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 112.533,
          "en": "from the app component file and moved it to Header.js,",
          "zh": "從 app component 檔案剪下來並移到 Header.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.37,
          "end": 116.31,
          "en": "I also need to move this import.",
          "zh": "我也需要把這個 import 一起移過去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.31,
          "end": 118.14,
          "en": "So we can also cut this there",
          "zh": "所以我們也可以把它從那裡剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.14,
          "end": 121.233,
          "en": "and move that to Header.js like this.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣把它移到 Header.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.76,
          "end": 125.97,
          "en": "So now we got that import moved over,",
          "zh": "現在我們把那個 import 移過去了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.97,
          "end": 129.3,
          "en": "we got the App.js file cleaned up therefore,",
          "zh": "也因此把 App.js 檔案整理乾淨了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.3,
          "end": 131.13,
          "en": "but of course, now the header,",
          "zh": "但當然，現在這個 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.13,
          "end": 134.19,
          "en": "the header component that we're defining in Header.js",
          "zh": "也就是我們在 Header.js 裡定義的 header component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.19,
          "end": 136.44,
          "en": "should be used in App.js.",
          "zh": "應該要在 App.js 裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.44,
          "end": 137.67000000000002,
          "en": "And to use it there,",
          "zh": "而要在那裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.67000000000002,
          "end": 140.94,
          "en": "we wanna add a new import where we import header,",
          "zh": "我們要新增一個 import，把 header import 進來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "though this name here is up to you",
          "zh": "不過這裡的這個名稱由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.53,
          "end": 145.38,
          "en": "since it's a default we're importing.",
          "zh": "因為我們 import 的是 default。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 147.99,
          "en": "But you should start with an uppercase character",
          "zh": "但你應該以大寫字母開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.99,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "because as you learned,",
          "zh": "因為如你所學到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 151.53,
          "en": "those uppercase characters are needed",
          "zh": "那些大寫字母是必要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.53,
          "end": 154.14,
          "en": "on your own components to differentiate them",
          "zh": "用在你自己的 component 上，以區分它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.14,
          "end": 156.003,
          "en": "from built-in components.",
          "zh": "與內建的 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.11,
          "end": 162.11,
          "en": "And we import the header component from ./components.",
          "zh": "而我們要從 ./components import 這個 header component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 165.003,
          "en": "So diving into that component's folder,",
          "zh": "所以要進入那個 component 的資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.84,
          "end": 169.29,
          "en": "then there into the header folder, and then there header.",
          "zh": "然後進去裡面的 header 資料夾，接著是 header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.29,
          "end": 171.99,
          "en": "And here in this React project, as you learned,",
          "zh": "而在這裡的這個 React 專案中，如你所學到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.99,
          "end": 174.54,
          "en": "you can and should omit the file extension",
          "zh": "你可以、也應該省略副檔名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.54,
          "end": 176.433,
          "en": "for those JavaScript files.",
          "zh": "對那些 JavaScript 檔案來說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 180.9,
          "en": "With that, the component is being imported",
          "zh": "這樣一來，這個 component 就被 import 進來了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.9,
          "end": 184.29,
          "en": "and we can now use it here as a self-closing component",
          "zh": "而我們現在可以在這裡把它當作 self-closing component 來使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 187.953,
          "en": "like this in the JSX code returned by the app component.",
          "zh": "就像這樣寫在 app component 回傳的 JSX 程式碼中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.85,
          "end": 190.32,
          "en": "It doesn't take any props",
          "zh": "它不接受任何 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.32,
          "end": 193.14,
          "en": "because it really doesn't need any props.",
          "zh": "因為它真的不需要任何 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.14,
          "end": 195.3,
          "en": "We could make it configurable",
          "zh": "我們可以讓它變成可設定的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.3,
          "end": 197.76,
          "en": "but since we're not reusing it,",
          "zh": "但既然我們沒有要重複使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.76,
          "end": 199.62,
          "en": "we're not using it anywhere else.",
          "zh": "也沒有在其他地方用到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.62,
          "end": 201.51,
          "en": "There really is no reason to do that.",
          "zh": "那就真的沒有理由這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.51,
          "end": 203.43,
          "en": "And therefore, I'm not accepting any props.",
          "zh": "因此，我不接受任何 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 205.5,
          "en": "I'm not passing any props.",
          "zh": "也不傳遞任何 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.5,
          "end": 209.61,
          "en": "And if I save this, it should work",
          "zh": "而如果我儲存這個，它應該要能正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.61,
          "end": 211.41,
          "en": "but I am getting an error.",
          "zh": "但我卻得到一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "I am getting an error",
          "zh": "我得到一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 216.15,
          "en": "that the image can't be found in the end.",
          "zh": "就是最後找不到那張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.15,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "And this makes sense",
          "zh": "而這很合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "because since I moved this image import,",
          "zh": "因為既然我把這個圖片 import 移走了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 224.25,
          "en": "I also need to check whether the path still is correct.",
          "zh": "我也需要檢查路徑是否仍然正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.25,
          "end": 226.11,
          "en": "And that's not the case here",
          "zh": "而在這裡並不是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 229.26,
          "en": "because the header component file is actually nested",
          "zh": "因為 header component 檔案實際上被放在"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.26,
          "end": 232.953,
          "en": "in the components and then there in the header folder.",
          "zh": "components 裡面，然後再放進 header 資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.94,
          "end": 237.36,
          "en": "So therefore, this import path should be adjusted",
          "zh": "因此，這個 import 路徑應該要調整，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.36,
          "end": 239.76,
          "en": "and I should first go up one level",
          "zh": "我應該先往上一層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.76,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "so that I'm in the components folder,",
          "zh": "這樣我就進到 components 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "and then another level with ../",
          "zh": "然後再用 ../ 往上另一層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 248.88,
          "en": "so that I'm in the source folder.",
          "zh": "這樣我就進到 source 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.88,
          "end": 251.79,
          "en": "And then we can dive into the assets folder",
          "zh": "接著我們可以進入 assets 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.79,
          "end": 253.62,
          "en": "and then there, the images folder",
          "zh": "然後在裡面進到 images 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.62,
          "end": 255.363,
          "en": "and then select this image.",
          "zh": "然後選取這張圖片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 256.44,
          "end": 260.76,
          "en": "So with this, the error now went away.",
          "zh": "這麼一來，這個錯誤就消失了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 262.29,
          "en": "And if I reload this,",
          "zh": "而如果我重新載入這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.29,
          "end": 265.35,
          "en": "the header is still there as it was before",
          "zh": "這個 header 還是跟以前一樣在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.35,
          "end": 268.773,
          "en": "but now it was outsourced into a separate component.",
          "zh": "但現在它已被外包到一個獨立的 component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 269.64,
          "end": 273.39300000000003,
          "en": "Next, let's work on these concept components here.",
          "zh": "接下來，讓我們來處理這裡的這些 concept component。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38348478",
      "title": "Outsourcing Concept Items Into a Reusable Component",
      "sourceHash": "2d4a7090b06deed6811b7a7e3a814a5806bc0af814fcec259a2e4f569c988f59",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.483,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "So let's now outsource",
          "zh": "所以，現在讓我們把"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 7.203,
          "en": "these concept items here, into a separate component.",
          "zh": "這裡的這些 concept 項目，外包到一個獨立的 component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.751,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "And for that of course,",
          "zh": "而要這麼做，當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 13.74,
          "en": "I wanna outsource this list item code here in the end,",
          "zh": "我最後想做的，就是把這裡這段 list item 程式碼外包出去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.74,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "into a separate component.",
          "zh": "放進一個獨立的 component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "For that, in the components folder,",
          "zh": "為此，在 components 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 20.64,
          "en": "we can add another sub folder called concept,",
          "zh": "我們可以再加入一個名為 concept 的子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.64,
          "end": 23.509,
          "en": "though of course this name as always, is up to you.",
          "zh": "不過當然，這個名稱一如既往，由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.509,
          "end": 28.08,
          "en": "And then in there, create a concept.js file,",
          "zh": "然後在裡面建立一個 concept.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.08,
          "end": 30.57,
          "en": "where I also have my concept function",
          "zh": "我同樣在裡面放了我的 concept 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.57,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "for this concept component,",
          "zh": "給這個 concept component 使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 34.77,
          "en": "which of course must be exported,",
          "zh": "它當然必須被 export，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.77,
          "end": 36.993,
          "en": "to make it available outside of this file.",
          "zh": "才能在這個檔案之外使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 43.43,
          "en": "And then here, I want to return this list item, JSX code.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，我想要 return 這段 list item 的 JSX 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "So I can cut it from here, from app.js,",
          "zh": "所以我可以把它從這裡、從 app.js 剪下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 49.533,
          "en": "and move it here into concept.js.",
          "zh": "然後移到這裡的 concept.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 54.04,
          "en": "Now, one very important note here,",
          "zh": "現在，這裡有一點非常重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.04,
          "end": 57.008,
          "en": "in theory, we could now create",
          "zh": "理論上，我們現在可以建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.008,
          "end": 60.12,
          "en": "three different concept components,",
          "zh": "三個不同的 concept component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.12,
          "end": 63.299,
          "en": "one for every core concept that we're outputting here.",
          "zh": "每一個分別對應我們在這裡輸出的一個核心 concept。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.299,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "But if we would do that,",
          "zh": "但如果我們那麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 69.12,
          "en": "we would still be duplicating, and replicating code.",
          "zh": "我們仍然會重複和複製程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "And if we ever wanted to delete the paragraph,",
          "zh": "而如果我們哪天想刪掉那個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 74.1,
          "en": "we still would have to do that",
          "zh": "我們仍然得那麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.1,
          "end": 76.143,
          "en": "in three different components.",
          "zh": "而且是在三個不同的 component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "That's why I'm not building three different components here.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我在這裡不建立三個不同的 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "But instead, one reusable component,",
          "zh": "而是建立一個可重複使用的 component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "which must be configurable, though.",
          "zh": "不過它必須是可設定的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "It must be configurable,",
          "zh": "它必須是可設定的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "so that one and the same component",
          "zh": "這樣同一個 component"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.53999999999999,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "can output different data.",
          "zh": "才能輸出不同的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "Data that's always output in the same way,",
          "zh": "資料總是以相同的方式輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "so that it always has the same shape in the end.",
          "zh": "好讓它最後總是具有相同的結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.499,
          "en": "But the different data pieces,",
          "zh": "但那些不同的資料部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.499,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "the image, the title, the description,",
          "zh": "也就是圖片、標題、描述，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 108.93,
          "en": "the values stored under those keys, that will differ.",
          "zh": "存在那些 key 底下的值，則會有所不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.93,
          "end": 111.87,
          "en": "And that's the idea here with this function component.",
          "zh": "而這就是這裡這個函式 component 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.87,
          "end": 112.703,
          "en": "So therefore,",
          "zh": "所以因此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.703,
          "end": 115.787,
          "en": "it must be configurable, in order to be reusable.",
          "zh": "它必須是可設定的，才能夠可重複使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.787,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "And how do we make it configurable?",
          "zh": "那我們要如何讓它可以被設定呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 121.113,
          "en": "With help of props.",
          "zh": "就是靠 prop 的幫忙。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 126.18,
          "en": "So here we can, and should, accept this props argument,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們可以、也應該接受這個 props 引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.18,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "this props parameter,",
          "zh": "這個 props 參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "which will be created and managed automatically by React,",
          "zh": "它會由 React 自動建立與管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 132.96,
          "en": "and which will be passed",
          "zh": "並且會"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.96,
          "end": 135.363,
          "en": "into this component function by React.",
          "zh": "由 React 傳入這個 component 函式中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.8,
          "end": 139.82999999999998,
          "en": "And then with that, here we can, for example,",
          "zh": "接著有了它，我們在這裡就可以，例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.82999999999998,
          "end": 144.82999999999998,
          "en": "output props.image, and here props.title.",
          "zh": "輸出 props.image，而這裡則是 props.title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "And here it's also props.title.",
          "zh": "而這裡同樣也是 props.title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 150.72,
          "en": "And the same as true here for description,",
          "zh": "這裡對 description 來說也是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.72,
          "end": 152.733,
          "en": "it's props.description.",
          "zh": "它是 props.description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.93,
          "end": 157.26,
          "en": "And with that, we made this component configurable,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就讓這個 component 變成可設定的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.26,
          "end": 160.65,
          "en": "and it does now accept an image, a title,",
          "zh": "而它現在接受一個 image、一個 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.65,
          "end": 162.36,
          "en": "and a description key,",
          "zh": "以及一個 description 的 key，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 164.07,
          "en": "which can and should be set",
          "zh": "而這些可以、也應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.07,
          "end": 167.043,
          "en": "when that component is being used in JSX code.",
          "zh": "在那個 component 被用在 JSX 程式碼中時設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 170.516,
          "en": "Therefore now back in app.js,",
          "zh": "所以現在回到 app.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.516,
          "end": 173.88,
          "en": "we can use this concept component here.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡使用這個 concept component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 178.083,
          "en": "And for it to be usable here, we also must import it.",
          "zh": "而要讓它能在這裡使用，我們也必須 import 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 181.71,
          "en": "So here we should import concept",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們應該 import concept，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.71,
          "end": 186.71,
          "en": "from ./Components/Concept/Concept.",
          "zh": "來源是 ./Components/Concept/Concept。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.36,
          "end": 192.81,
          "en": "And with that import here added, we can go down,",
          "zh": "加上這裡的這個 import 之後，我們可以往下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.81,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "use the concept component like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣使用 concept component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 196.68,
          "en": "as a self-closing component here,",
          "zh": "在這裡把它當作 self-closing component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 198.51,
          "en": "because I'm not passing anything",
          "zh": "因為我沒有在它的"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.51,
          "end": 201.48,
          "en": "between its opening and closing tabs.",
          "zh": "開始和結束標籤之間傳入任何東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 206.48,
          "en": "And then here, we can set the image prop, like this,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，我們可以像這樣設定 image 這個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 212.22,
          "en": "because in concept, I'm extracting an image prop",
          "zh": "因為在 concept 裡，我解構出一個 image prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.22,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "So I'm looking for this key,",
          "zh": "所以我是在找這個 key，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 217.23,
          "en": "hence we should provide it here, on this component.",
          "zh": "因此我們應該在這裡、在這個 component 上提供它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.23,
          "end": 221.237,
          "en": "And set these to concepts(0).image.",
          "zh": "並把它設為 concepts(0).image。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.91,
          "end": 228.78,
          "en": "So we're still accessing that concepts data from this array,",
          "zh": "所以我們仍然從這個陣列存取那些 concepts 資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.78,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "but we're now passing it to our own custom component.",
          "zh": "但我們現在把它傳給我們自己的 custom component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 233.453,
          "en": "And of course,",
          "zh": "而當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.453,
          "end": 235.29,
          "en": "we're now going to do the same for the title.",
          "zh": "我們現在也要對 title 做一樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.29,
          "end": 239.52,
          "en": "Here, we should access concepts(0).title.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們應該存取 concepts(0).title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.52,
          "end": 242.88,
          "en": "And last but not least, we also wanna do that",
          "zh": "最後但同樣重要的是，我們也想這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.88,
          "end": 244.5,
          "en": "for the description of course,",
          "zh": "當然，是針對 description，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.5,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "and pass concepts(0).description,",
          "zh": "並傳入 concepts(0).description，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 250.203,
          "en": "as a value for the description prop.",
          "zh": "作為 description 這個 prop 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.94,
          "end": 255.12,
          "en": "With that, if I formatted this, the code looks like this.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我把它格式化，程式碼看起來就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.12,
          "end": 258.71,
          "en": "And now we can easily replace those list items here,",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以輕鬆地把這裡的那些 list item 替換掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.71,
          "end": 261.979,
          "en": "with our own custom component,",
          "zh": "換成我們自己的 custom component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.979,
          "end": 265.44,
          "en": "and pass the correct data to the props.",
          "zh": "並把正確的資料傳給這些 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.44,
          "end": 269.16,
          "en": "So here for concepts(1), on that second item,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，對於 concepts(1)，也就是第二個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.16,
          "end": 272.13,
          "en": "and on the third item for concepts(2),",
          "zh": "以及第三個項目，也就是 concepts(2)，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.13,
          "end": 274.93399999999997,
          "en": "so for the third concepts item.",
          "zh": "所以是第三個 concepts 項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.93399999999997,
          "end": 278.46,
          "en": "And with that, we now got this reusable component,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們現在就有了這個可重複使用的 component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 278.46,
          "end": 280.35,
          "en": "and we are reusing it,",
          "zh": "而我們正在重複使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.35,
          "end": 284.04,
          "en": "and we are configuring it, with help of props.",
          "zh": "並且靠著 prop 來設定它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.04,
          "end": 288.212,
          "en": "And the HTML structure, is now only defined once,",
          "zh": "而 HTML 結構現在只定義一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 288.212,
          "end": 290.259,
          "en": "inside of this component,",
          "zh": "就在這個 component 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 290.259,
          "end": 292.92,
          "en": "but it can now easily be reused,",
          "zh": "但它現在可以輕鬆地被重複使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.92,
          "end": 295.53,
          "en": "thanks to our custom component.",
          "zh": "這都要歸功於我們的 custom component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 295.53,
          "end": 298.95,
          "en": "And I make sure that here I'm accessing concepts(2),",
          "zh": "而我確保我在這裡存取的是 concepts(2)，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 298.95,
          "end": 301.8,
          "en": "not concepts(3), which would be wrong.",
          "zh": "而不是 concepts(3)，那會是錯的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 303.768,
          "en": "And I saved this again.",
          "zh": "而我又儲存了一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.768,
          "end": 306.69,
          "en": "I've now got the same website as before,",
          "zh": "我現在得到跟之前一樣的網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.69,
          "end": 309.36,
          "en": "with those key concepts items,",
          "zh": "有著那些 key concepts 項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 309.36,
          "end": 312.78,
          "en": "but now we're building it with help of custom components,",
          "zh": "但現在我們是用 custom component 來建構它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.78,
          "end": 315.345,
          "en": "custom reusable components.",
          "zh": "也就是可重複使用的 custom component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.345,
          "end": 318.84,
          "en": "And therefore, all three tasks that I gave you",
          "zh": "因此，我交給你的所有三項任務，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.84,
          "end": 321.933,
          "en": "at the beginning of the section, are now solved.",
          "zh": "也就是在這個章節一開始提到的，現在都解決了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595950",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "sourceHash": "ddf70f7947a56284eedfbc089d05e8feecd2d878b308837c651694e29616a11e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.266,
          "end": 3.2,
          "en": "Maximilian: Now, that we learned",
          "zh": "Maximilian：現在，我們已經學會了"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.2,
          "end": 6,
          "en": "about some important basics of React,",
          "zh": "一些 React 的重要基礎，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6,
          "end": 9.533,
          "en": "most importantly, about components and props",
          "zh": "最重要的是關於元件和 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.533,
          "end": 11.366,
          "en": "It's time to take the next step.",
          "zh": "是時候邁出下一步了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.366,
          "end": 11.5,
          "en": "It's time to take the next step.",
          "zh": "是時候邁出下一步了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.5,
          "end": 14.3,
          "en": "And in this course section, we're going to take",
          "zh": "而在這個課程區段中，我們將要"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.3,
          "end": 19.3,
          "en": "a closer look at user interaction and handling user events",
          "zh": "更仔細地看看使用者互動以及如何處理使用者事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.3,
          "end": 23.333,
          "en": "like clicks or input into text fields and so on.",
          "zh": "例如點擊，或在文字欄位中輸入等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.333,
          "end": 23.766,
          "en": "like clicks or input into text fields and so on.",
          "zh": "例如點擊，或在文字欄位中輸入等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.766,
          "end": 27.066,
          "en": "And we're going to have a look at the very important concept",
          "zh": "我們也會來看看一個非常重要的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.066,
          "end": 32,
          "en": "of state in React apps because, you might remember,",
          "zh": "也就是 React 應用程式中的 state，因為你可能還記得"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32,
          "end": 34.5,
          "en": "that I mentioned earlier in the course",
          "zh": "我在課程前面提過"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.5,
          "end": 38.8,
          "en": "that with React we follow that declarative approach",
          "zh": "使用 React 時，我們採用的是宣告式的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.8,
          "end": 38.933,
          "en": "that with React we follow that declarative approach",
          "zh": "使用 React 時，我們採用的是宣告式的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.933,
          "end": 43.766,
          "en": "where we, in the end, define desired target states",
          "zh": "也就是我們最終會定義想要的目標狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.766,
          "end": 48.266,
          "en": "and React then takes care about reaching that state.",
          "zh": "然後由 React 負責達成那個狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.266,
          "end": 50.766,
          "en": "Well, that is correct and that is already",
          "zh": "嗯，這是正確的，而且這也已經是"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.766,
          "end": 53.366,
          "en": "something we're using but, at the moment,",
          "zh": "我們正在使用的方式，但目前來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.366,
          "end": 55.833,
          "en": "in the application we built thus far",
          "zh": "在我們目前建置的應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.833,
          "end": 58.533,
          "en": "and with the knowledge we gained, up to this point,",
          "zh": "以及以我們到目前為止所學到的知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.533,
          "end": 58.866,
          "en": "and with the knowledge we gained, up to this point,",
          "zh": "以及以我們到目前為止所學到的知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.866,
          "end": 61.666,
          "en": "we can only build static applications",
          "zh": "我們只能建置靜態的應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.666,
          "end": 61.833,
          "en": "we can only build static applications",
          "zh": "我們只能建置靜態的應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.833,
          "end": 64.4,
          "en": "where the state never changes,",
          "zh": "也就是狀態永遠不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.4,
          "end": 67.766,
          "en": "where we always output exactly the same.",
          "zh": "我們總是輸出完全相同的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.766,
          "end": 67.966,
          "en": "where we always output exactly the same.",
          "zh": "我們總是輸出完全相同的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.966,
          "end": 70.333,
          "en": "And that's typically not what you want.",
          "zh": "而這通常不是你想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.333,
          "end": 74.2,
          "en": "You want to have applications which are interactive,",
          "zh": "你希望應用程式是具互動性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.2,
          "end": 74.266,
          "en": "You want to have applications which are interactive,",
          "zh": "你希望應用程式是具互動性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 74.266,
          "end": 77.733,
          "en": "so that you can React to clicks by the user",
          "zh": "讓你能夠對使用者的點擊做出反應"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.733,
          "end": 80.7,
          "en": "and to data being entered by the user",
          "zh": "以及對使用者輸入的資料做出反應"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 81.033,
          "en": "and to data being entered by the user",
          "zh": "以及對使用者輸入的資料做出反應"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81.033,
          "end": 84.3,
          "en": "and which are reactive so that the application",
          "zh": "而且應用程式會有所反應，因此應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.3,
          "end": 87.1,
          "en": "also changes when certain things happen.",
          "zh": "在某些事情發生時也會跟著改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.1,
          "end": 89.833,
          "en": "And, therefore, in this course module",
          "zh": "因此，在這個課程模組中"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 89.833,
          "end": 93.76599999999999,
          "en": "we are going to take a look at handling events,",
          "zh": "我們將要來看看如何處理事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.76599999999999,
          "end": 97.1,
          "en": "handling user events, like clicks and so on.",
          "zh": "處理使用者事件，例如點擊等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.1,
          "end": 97.3,
          "en": "handling user events, like clicks and so on.",
          "zh": "處理使用者事件，例如點擊等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 97.3,
          "end": 99.666,
          "en": "And we'll see how that works in React apps,",
          "zh": "我們也會看到那在 React 應用程式中如何運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 99.666,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "how we can add such event handlers and more.",
          "zh": "我們如何加入這樣的 event handler，以及更多內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 102.93299999999999,
          "en": "how we can add such event handlers and more.",
          "zh": "我們如何加入這樣的 event handler，以及更多內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.93299999999999,
          "end": 106.233,
          "en": "And then, we're going to take a look at how we can ensure",
          "zh": "接著，我們會來看看如何確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 106.233,
          "end": 109.866,
          "en": "that what's visible on the screen changes,",
          "zh": "螢幕上顯示的內容會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 109.866,
          "end": 110.066,
          "en": "that what's visible on the screen changes,",
          "zh": "螢幕上顯示的內容會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.066,
          "end": 113.233,
          "en": "that we reach a different target state.",
          "zh": "我們會達到不同的目標狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 113.233,
          "end": 115.63300000000001,
          "en": "And for that, we're going to take a closer look",
          "zh": "為此，我們將要更仔細地來看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 115.63300000000001,
          "end": 119.26599999999999,
          "en": "at this state concept in React",
          "zh": "React 中的這個 state 概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 119.26599999999999,
          "end": 119.333,
          "en": "at this state concept in React",
          "zh": "React 中的這個 state 概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 119.333,
          "end": 122.533,
          "en": "and we'll learn how we can manipulate the state",
          "zh": "並學習我們如何操作 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 122.533,
          "end": 128.066,
          "en": "and transition from state A to state B, if we want to.",
          "zh": "以及在需要時從 state A 轉換到 state B。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 128.066,
          "end": 130.666,
          "en": "And, in general, in this section",
          "zh": "而整體來說，在這個區段中"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 130.666,
          "end": 133.86599999999999,
          "en": "we're going to learn about a couple of key concepts.",
          "zh": "我們將會學到幾個關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 133.86599999999999,
          "end": 133.9,
          "en": "we're going to learn about a couple of key concepts.",
          "zh": "我們將會學到幾個關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 133.9,
          "end": 137.133,
          "en": "This is a section you absolutely should not skip.",
          "zh": "這是你絕對不應該跳過的區段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 137.133,
          "end": 139.4,
          "en": "And we're also going to take a closer look",
          "zh": "我們也會再次仔細看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 139.4,
          "end": 141.833,
          "en": "at components and state again.",
          "zh": "元件和 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 141.833,
          "end": 142.066,
          "en": "at components and state again.",
          "zh": "元件和 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 142.066,
          "end": 145.566,
          "en": "So, this is another fundamental section covering",
          "zh": "所以，這是另一個基礎的區段，涵蓋"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 145.566,
          "end": 148.733,
          "en": "core features of React, so let's dive in.",
          "zh": "React 的核心功能，所以讓我們開始吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595962",
      "title": "Listening to Events & Working with Event Handlers",
      "sourceHash": "02339ae8df4d4801bd7c1b980016866949c87bca4f3be149c079d3b6e4c8bae7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2,
          "end": 4.266,
          "en": "Maximilian: So this is our demo application",
          "zh": "Maximilian：所以這是我們的 demo 應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.266,
          "end": 7.433,
          "en": "at the moment, and, of course, it's fairly static.",
          "zh": "目前的樣子，而它當然相當靜態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.433,
          "end": 9.9,
          "en": "We have this output here on the screen,",
          "zh": "我們在螢幕上看到這個輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.9,
          "end": 9.933,
          "en": "We have this output here on the screen,",
          "zh": "我們在螢幕上看到這個輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.933,
          "end": 13.633,
          "en": "and we reached that output with help of our components.",
          "zh": "而我們是靠我們的 component 產生出那樣的輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.633,
          "end": 17.533,
          "en": "But as I mentioned, this never changes, it's static.",
          "zh": "但就像我提過的，這永遠不會改變，它是靜態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.533,
          "end": 17.566,
          "en": "But as I mentioned, this never changes, it's static.",
          "zh": "但就像我提過的，這永遠不會改變，它是靜態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.566,
          "end": 20.566,
          "en": "We only have one state in this application,",
          "zh": "這個應用程式裡我們只有一個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.566,
          "end": 24.133,
          "en": "and that's this initial state which we see here.",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這裡看到的這個初始 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.133,
          "end": 28.133,
          "en": "Now, let's dive into how we can react to user events",
          "zh": "現在，我們來深入了解如何對使用者事件做出反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.133,
          "end": 31.1,
          "en": "before we then have a look how such events",
          "zh": "之後我們再看看這樣的事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.1,
          "end": 33.8,
          "en": "could trigger a state change.",
          "zh": "如何能觸發 state 的改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.8,
          "end": 34.066,
          "en": "could trigger a state change.",
          "zh": "如何能觸發 state 的改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.066,
          "end": 36.366,
          "en": "And when we wanna start with events,",
          "zh": "而當我們想開始處理事件時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.366,
          "end": 38.8,
          "en": "I wanna start fairly simple.",
          "zh": "我想從相當簡單的開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.8,
          "end": 39.033,
          "en": "I wanna start fairly simple.",
          "zh": "我想從相當簡單的開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.033,
          "end": 41.466,
          "en": "I wanna start with clicks on a button",
          "zh": "我想從按鈕上的點擊開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.466,
          "end": 43.033,
          "en": "to which you wanna react.",
          "zh": "也就是你想對其做出反應的點擊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.033,
          "end": 45.266,
          "en": "And to get started with all of that,",
          "zh": "而要開始這一切，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.266,
          "end": 47.833,
          "en": "I'll go to the ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "我會到 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 47.833,
          "end": 47.9,
          "en": "I'll go to the ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "我會到 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 47.9,
          "end": 51.866,
          "en": "where we output the title, the amount, and so on.",
          "zh": "我們在那裡輸出 title、amount 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.866,
          "end": 56.4,
          "en": "And in there, I will also add a button below that div",
          "zh": "而在那裡，我也會在那個 div 下方加上一個 button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 59.7,
          "en": "right before we close the card.",
          "zh": "就在我們關閉 card 之前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 63.3,
          "en": "And there, I will just say Change Title.",
          "zh": "而在那裡，我就只寫上 Change Title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.3,
          "end": 67.6,
          "en": "And if we now save that, we will see this button here.",
          "zh": "而如果我們現在儲存它，就會在這裡看到這個 button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.6,
          "end": 68.033,
          "en": "And if we now save that, we will see this button here.",
          "zh": "而如果我們現在儲存它，就會在這裡看到這個 button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 68.033,
          "end": 70.833,
          "en": "Now the styling is definitely not great,",
          "zh": "現在這個樣式肯定不太好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.833,
          "end": 73.866,
          "en": "but this is also just a temporary button.",
          "zh": "但這也只是個暫時的 button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.866,
          "end": 74.033,
          "en": "but this is also just a temporary button.",
          "zh": "但這也只是個暫時的 button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 74.033,
          "end": 75.8,
          "en": "We're going to remove it later.",
          "zh": "我們之後會把它移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.8,
          "end": 77,
          "en": "I'm just using it here",
          "zh": "我現在只是用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77,
          "end": 80.566,
          "en": "so that we can start diving into events and state.",
          "zh": "好讓我們能開始深入事件和 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.566,
          "end": 80.8,
          "en": "so that we can start diving into events and state.",
          "zh": "好讓我們能開始深入事件和 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 80.8,
          "end": 84.26599999999999,
          "en": "Later we'll use what we learned in better places,",
          "zh": "之後我們會把學到的東西用在更好的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.26599999999999,
          "end": 88.1,
          "en": "in places that really help our application.",
          "zh": "用在真正能幫助我們應用程式的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.1,
          "end": 90.43299999999999,
          "en": "But for a start, we now have these buttons,",
          "zh": "但一開始，我們現在有這些 button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.43299999999999,
          "end": 93.166,
          "en": "one per expense item component.",
          "zh": "每個 expense item component 一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.166,
          "end": 93.3,
          "en": "one per expense item component.",
          "zh": "每個 expense item component 一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 93.3,
          "end": 95.93299999999999,
          "en": "And my goal now is simple.",
          "zh": "而我現在的目標很簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 95.93299999999999,
          "end": 98.333,
          "en": "When this button here is clicked,",
          "zh": "當這裡這個 button 被點擊時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 98.333,
          "end": 102.066,
          "en": "I wanna change the title which is being output here.",
          "zh": "我想改變這裡輸出的 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 102.066,
          "end": 104.4,
          "en": "Initially, the title which is being output",
          "zh": "一開始，被輸出的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 104.4,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "is the title we get via props.",
          "zh": "是我們透過 props 取得的 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 110.76599999999999,
          "en": "But I wanna change it whenever this button is clicked.",
          "zh": "但我想在這個 button 被點擊時改變它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.76599999999999,
          "end": 113.13300000000001,
          "en": "And therefore, we, of course, first of all,",
          "zh": "因此，我們當然首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.13300000000001,
          "end": 116.9,
          "en": "need to find out how exactly we can react",
          "zh": "需要弄清楚我們究竟要如何對"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 116.9,
          "end": 119.066,
          "en": "to button clicks in React.",
          "zh": "React 裡的按鈕點擊做出反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 119.066,
          "end": 119.233,
          "en": "to button clicks in React.",
          "zh": "React 裡的按鈕點擊做出反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 119.233,
          "end": 122.8,
          "en": "And it turns out that this is rather simple.",
          "zh": "而結果發現這其實相當簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 122.8,
          "end": 122.93299999999999,
          "en": "And it turns out that this is rather simple.",
          "zh": "而結果發現這其實相當簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 122.93299999999999,
          "end": 127.766,
          "en": "On all built-in HTML elements, like divs and h2,",
          "zh": "在所有內建的 HTML 元素上，像是 div 和 h2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 127.766,
          "end": 130.3,
          "en": "and especially all the buttons and so on,",
          "zh": "特別是所有的 button 等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 130.3,
          "end": 135.933,
          "en": "we have full access to all these native DOM events",
          "zh": "我們都能完整取用所有這些原生 DOM 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 135.933,
          "end": 137.833,
          "en": "which we can listen to.",
          "zh": "也就是我們可以監聽的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 137.833,
          "end": 138.233,
          "en": "which we can listen to.",
          "zh": "也就是我們可以監聽的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 138.233,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "So if you search for HTML button element, for example,",
          "zh": "所以，舉例來說，如果你搜尋 HTML button element，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145,
          "en": "you'll find an article about this button.",
          "zh": "你會找到一篇關於這個 button 的文章。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 145,
          "end": 148.5,
          "en": "And there, if you click on the DOM Interface here,",
          "zh": "在那裡，如果你點一下這裡的 DOM Interface，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 150.53300000000002,
          "en": "this HTML button element, you see from which other elements",
          "zh": "這個 HTML button element，你就能看到它最終是繼承自哪些其他元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 150.53300000000002,
          "end": 152.966,
          "en": "this HTML button element, you see from which other elements",
          "zh": "這個 HTML button element，你就能看到它最終是繼承自哪些其他元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 152.966,
          "end": 155.86599999999999,
          "en": "or from whichever classes this inherits in the end.",
          "zh": "或是最終繼承自哪些 class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 155.86599999999999,
          "end": 158.86599999999999,
          "en": "And here you see that the HTML button element",
          "zh": "而在這裡你會看到 HTML button element"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 158.86599999999999,
          "end": 162.466,
          "en": "is a more specific form of the HTML element,",
          "zh": "是 HTML element 更特定的一種形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 162.466,
          "end": 162.633,
          "en": "is a more specific form of the HTML element,",
          "zh": "是 HTML element 更特定的一種形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 162.633,
          "end": 164.933,
          "en": "which is a more specific form of the element,",
          "zh": "而 HTML element 又是 element 更特定的一種形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 164.933,
          "end": 168.566,
          "en": "which is a more specific form of the node and so on.",
          "zh": "而 element 又是 node 更特定的一種形式，依此類推。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 168.566,
          "end": 172.333,
          "en": "And if we click on Element, for example,",
          "zh": "而如果我們點一下 Element，舉例來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 172.333,
          "end": 176.466,
          "en": "we actually will see that there are a bunch of events",
          "zh": "我們其實會看到有一堆事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 176.466,
          "end": 180.266,
          "en": "to which we can listen, for example, click and blur.",
          "zh": "是我們可以監聽的，例如 click 和 blur。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 180.266,
          "end": 183.333,
          "en": "And basically, for all these default events,",
          "zh": "基本上，對所有這些預設事件來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 183.333,
          "end": 186.933,
          "en": "there is a prop equivalent in React,",
          "zh": "React 裡都有對應的 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 186.933,
          "end": 190.3,
          "en": "which we can add to these built-in HTML elements",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個 prop 加到這些內建的 HTML 元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 190.3,
          "end": 192.7,
          "en": "to listen to these events.",
          "zh": "來監聽這些事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 192.7,
          "end": 192.833,
          "en": "to listen to these events.",
          "zh": "來監聽這些事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.833,
          "end": 197.266,
          "en": "So instead of adding a listener as we would normally do it,",
          "zh": "所以，不像我們平常會做的那樣去加入一個 listener，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 197.266,
          "end": 200.966,
          "en": "by for example selecting an element by ID",
          "zh": "例如透過 ID 選取一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 200.966,
          "end": 204.333,
          "en": "and then adding an event listener like this,",
          "zh": "然後像這樣加上一個 event listener，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 204.333,
          "end": 204.666,
          "en": "and then adding an event listener like this,",
          "zh": "然後像這樣加上一個 event listener，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 204.666,
          "end": 207.666,
          "en": "which would be the imperative way of doing that,",
          "zh": "這會是命令式（imperative）的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 207.666,
          "end": 210.3,
          "en": "in React, we add an event listener",
          "zh": "在 React 裡，我們加入 event listener 的方式是"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 210.3,
          "end": 214.066,
          "en": "by going to the JSX element, like this button.",
          "zh": "到 JSX 元素上，像是這個 button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 214.066,
          "end": 216.566,
          "en": "And there we add a special prop.",
          "zh": "然後在那裡我們加上一個特別的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 216.566,
          "end": 220.633,
          "en": "But now it's not a prop which sets some value",
          "zh": "但現在它不是那種設定某個值的 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 220.633,
          "end": 224,
          "en": "for this button, but instead it's a prop which starts",
          "zh": "不是用來設定這個 button，而是一個開頭為"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 224,
          "end": 226.2,
          "en": "with on.",
          "zh": "on 的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 226.2,
          "end": 226.666,
          "en": "with on.",
          "zh": "on 的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 226.666,
          "end": 230.966,
          "en": "Because React exposes all these default events",
          "zh": "因為 React 把所有這些預設事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 230.966,
          "end": 233.733,
          "en": "as props which start with on.",
          "zh": "以開頭為 on 的 prop 形式提供出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 233.733,
          "end": 237.7,
          "en": "And for example, here we can add onClick.",
          "zh": "舉例來說，在這裡我們可以加上 onClick。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 237.7,
          "end": 240.466,
          "en": "Now, what this does is it adds an event listener",
          "zh": "現在，它的作用是加上一個 event listener，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 240.466,
          "end": 243.866,
          "en": "for click events to this button.",
          "zh": "到這個 button 上，用來處理 click 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 243.866,
          "end": 245.966,
          "en": "Now we just need to define what should happen",
          "zh": "現在我們只需要定義，當這樣的點擊發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 245.966,
          "end": 248.2,
          "en": "when such a click occurs.",
          "zh": "該發生什麼事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 248.2,
          "end": 248.4,
          "en": "when such a click occurs.",
          "zh": "該發生什麼事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 248.4,
          "end": 250.7,
          "en": "And we do that by assigning a value",
          "zh": "而我們的做法是給這個 click 事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 250.7,
          "end": 252.36599999999999,
          "en": "to this click event.",
          "zh": "指派一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 252.36599999999999,
          "end": 255.766,
          "en": "And the value here, and that's now important,",
          "zh": "而這裡的值，這點很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 255.766,
          "end": 257.33299999999997,
          "en": "of course, has to be code",
          "zh": "當然必須是程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 257.33299999999997,
          "end": 261.033,
          "en": "which should be executed when that click occurs.",
          "zh": "是當那個點擊發生時應該被執行的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 261.033,
          "end": 263.766,
          "en": "And how do we define codes that should eventually",
          "zh": "那麼在程式設計中，我們要如何定義最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 263.766,
          "end": 266.4,
          "en": "be executed in programming?",
          "zh": "應該被執行的程式碼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 266.4,
          "end": 266.766,
          "en": "be executed in programming?",
          "zh": "應該被執行的程式碼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 266.766,
          "end": 269.666,
          "en": "Well, we create a function.",
          "zh": "嗯，我們建立一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 269.666,
          "end": 272.266,
          "en": "So all these on props,",
          "zh": "所以所有這些 on 開頭的 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 272.266,
          "end": 276.5,
          "en": "all these event handler props, want a function",
          "zh": "所有這些 event handler prop，要的都是一個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 276.5,
          "end": 277.633,
          "en": "as a value, a function passed as a value for onClick",
          "zh": "作為值，也就是傳給 onClick 的值是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 277.633,
          "end": 281.233,
          "en": "as a value, a function passed as a value for onClick",
          "zh": "作為值，也就是傳給 onClick 的值是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 281.233,
          "end": 283.266,
          "en": "and all these other on props",
          "zh": "以及其他所有這些 on prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 283.266,
          "end": 287.56600000000003,
          "en": "which then is executed when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "這個函式會在該事件發生時被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 287.56600000000003,
          "end": 291.1,
          "en": "Now, here, we can either create this function on the fly.",
          "zh": "現在，在這裡，我們可以即時建立這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 291.1,
          "end": 292.266,
          "en": "For example, like this,",
          "zh": "舉例來說，像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 292.266,
          "end": 296.366,
          "en": "we can create an anonymous arrow function like this.",
          "zh": "我們可以像這樣建立一個匿名的箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 296.366,
          "end": 296.666,
          "en": "we can create an anonymous arrow function like this.",
          "zh": "我們可以像這樣建立一個匿名的箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 296.666,
          "end": 299.766,
          "en": "And then here we could console log Clicked,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡我們可以 console log Clicked，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 299.766,
          "end": 301.866,
          "en": "if we wanted to.",
          "zh": "如果我們想這麼做的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 301.866,
          "end": 304.266,
          "en": "And if we save that and we go back",
          "zh": "而如果我們儲存它，然後回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 304.266,
          "end": 305.466,
          "en": "And if we save that and we go back",
          "zh": "而如果我們儲存它，然後回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 305.466,
          "end": 309.233,
          "en": "and open the developer tools here in the browser,",
          "zh": "並在瀏覽器裡打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 309.233,
          "end": 309.466,
          "en": "and open the developer tools here in the browser,",
          "zh": "並在瀏覽器裡打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 309.466,
          "end": 312.333,
          "en": "and there we go to the console part,",
          "zh": "然後到 console 的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 312.333,
          "end": 315.4,
          "en": "if I click the title, we see clicked.",
          "zh": "如果我點擊標題，我們就會看到 clicked。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 315.4,
          "end": 316.933,
          "en": "So this is how that works.",
          "zh": "所以這就是它的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 316.933,
          "end": 320.5,
          "en": "This is how simple it is to add an event listener",
          "zh": "要加入一個 event listener 就是這麼簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 320.5,
          "end": 323.766,
          "en": "to a React element.",
          "zh": "把它加到一個 React 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 323.766,
          "end": 326.433,
          "en": "Now, typically, you don't just wanna work",
          "zh": "不過，通常你不會只想用"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 326.433,
          "end": 331.266,
          "en": "with such anonymous inline arrow functions though.",
          "zh": "這種匿名的行內箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 331.266,
          "end": 331.4,
          "en": "with such anonymous inline arrow functions though.",
          "zh": "這種匿名的行內箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 331.4,
          "end": 334.2,
          "en": "By the way, it doesn't have to be an arrow function.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，它不一定要是箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 334.2,
          "end": 337.366,
          "en": "You could also create a function with the function keyword.",
          "zh": "你也可以用 function 這個關鍵字建立一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 337.366,
          "end": 340.2,
          "en": "You don't wanna overdo it at least.",
          "zh": "至少你不會想做得太過頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 340.2,
          "end": 340.4,
          "en": "You don't wanna overdo it at least.",
          "zh": "至少你不會想做得太過頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 340.4,
          "end": 343.56600000000003,
          "en": "Because it would mean that you put a lot of code here",
          "zh": "因為那會代表你把很多程式碼放在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 343.56600000000003,
          "end": 347.866,
          "en": "into your JSX block, into your JSX code,",
          "zh": "放進你的 JSX 區塊、你的 JSX 程式碼裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 347.866,
          "end": 351.06600000000003,
          "en": "and that's generally not a good idea.",
          "zh": "而這通常不是個好主意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 351.06600000000003,
          "end": 352.56600000000003,
          "en": "You wanna keep that lean",
          "zh": "你會想讓它保持精簡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 352.56600000000003,
          "end": 356.966,
          "en": "and not put too much logic into your JSX code.",
          "zh": "不要把太多邏輯放進你的 JSX 程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 356.966,
          "end": 360.466,
          "en": "Instead, you typically wanna define a function",
          "zh": "相反地，你通常會想在 return 之前"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 360.466,
          "end": 363.066,
          "en": "before you return.",
          "zh": "先定義一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 363.066,
          "end": 363.133,
          "en": "before you return.",
          "zh": "先定義一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 363.133,
          "end": 366.066,
          "en": "And you can do that either with the function keyword",
          "zh": "而你可以用 function 關鍵字來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 366.066,
          "end": 369.6,
          "en": "or, again, by creating a const or a variable",
          "zh": "或者一樣，建立一個 const 或變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 369.6,
          "end": 372,
          "en": "which holds an arrow function.",
          "zh": "來存放一個箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 372,
          "end": 376.3,
          "en": "So here we could add a clickHandler const,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們可以加上一個 clickHandler 常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 376.3,
          "end": 379.866,
          "en": "the name is up to you, which holds an arrow function,",
          "zh": "名字由你決定，它存放一個箭頭函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 379.866,
          "end": 381.566,
          "en": "like this, and in there, I can also say Clicked",
          "zh": "像這樣，而在裡面我也可以寫 Clicked，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 381.566,
          "end": 384.933,
          "en": "like this, and in there, I can also say Clicked",
          "zh": "像這樣，而在裡面我也可以寫 Clicked，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 384.933,
          "end": 387.466,
          "en": "with a couple of exclamation marks.",
          "zh": "加上幾個驚嘆號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 387.466,
          "end": 389.566,
          "en": "And then here, for this button,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，對這個 button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 389.566,
          "end": 392.966,
          "en": "we just point at clickHandler.",
          "zh": "我們只要指向 clickHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 392.966,
          "end": 396.666,
          "en": "And that's important, by the way, we just point at it.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這很重要，我們只是指向它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 396.666,
          "end": 398.133,
          "en": "We don't execute it here.",
          "zh": "我們不在這裡執行它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 398.133,
          "end": 401.4,
          "en": "You don't add parentheses here.",
          "zh": "你不在這裡加上括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 401.4,
          "end": 401.8,
          "en": "You don't add parentheses here.",
          "zh": "你不在這裡加上括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 401.8,
          "end": 405,
          "en": "Instead, you just repeat the name of the function.",
          "zh": "相反地，你只是重複這個函式的名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 405,
          "end": 408.766,
          "en": "No matter if you created that function like this",
          "zh": "不管你是像這樣建立那個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 408.766,
          "end": 413.3,
          "en": "or with the function keyword, this does not matter.",
          "zh": "還是用 function 關鍵字，這都無所謂。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 413.3,
          "end": 415.133,
          "en": "No matter how you defined it,",
          "zh": "不管你怎麼定義它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 415.133,
          "end": 418.8,
          "en": "you just point at it like this.",
          "zh": "你就只是像這樣指向它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 418.8,
          "end": 419.166,
          "en": "you just point at it like this.",
          "zh": "你就只是像這樣指向它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 419.166,
          "end": 420.366,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": "為什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 420.366,
          "end": 423.133,
          "en": "Because if you would add parentheses here,",
          "zh": "因為如果你在這裡加上括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 423.133,
          "end": 425.533,
          "en": "JavaScript would execute this",
          "zh": "JavaScript 就會執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 425.533,
          "end": 428.133,
          "en": "when this line of code is being parsed.",
          "zh": "在這一行程式碼被解析的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 428.133,
          "end": 430.2,
          "en": "And this line of code is being parsed",
          "zh": "而這一行程式碼被解析的時機，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 430.2,
          "end": 432.933,
          "en": "when the JSX code is returned.",
          "zh": "就是 JSX 程式碼被 return 的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 432.933,
          "end": 433.366,
          "en": "when the JSX code is returned.",
          "zh": "就是 JSX 程式碼被 return 的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 433.366,
          "end": 435.866,
          "en": "So it's then not executing clickHandler",
          "zh": "所以那樣一來，clickHandler 就不是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 435.866,
          "end": 440.1,
          "en": "when the click occurs but when this JSX code is evaluated,",
          "zh": "點擊發生時被執行，而是在這段 JSX 程式碼被求值時執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 440.1,
          "end": 442.7,
          "en": "and that would be too early.",
          "zh": "而那樣就太早了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 442.7,
          "end": 446.2,
          "en": "That's why instead we just point at the clickHandler.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們只是指向 clickHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 446.2,
          "end": 448.33299999999997,
          "en": "We just point at the function.",
          "zh": "我們只是指向這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 448.33299999999997,
          "end": 453.466,
          "en": "We pass a pointer at this function as a value to onClick,",
          "zh": "我們把指向這個函式的指標當作值傳給 onClick，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 453.466,
          "end": 453.533,
          "en": "We pass a pointer at this function as a value to onClick,",
          "zh": "我們把指向這個函式的指標當作值傳給 onClick，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 453.533,
          "end": 456.56600000000003,
          "en": "and then React basically memorizes this",
          "zh": "然後 React 基本上會記住這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 456.56600000000003,
          "end": 461.666,
          "en": "and executes the function for us whenever the click occurs",
          "zh": "並在每次點擊發生時替我們執行這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 461.666,
          "end": 464.83299999999997,
          "en": "so that it's not executed when this is evaluated",
          "zh": "這樣它就不會在這被求值時被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 464.83299999999997,
          "end": 469.466,
          "en": "but when the click occurs, which is exactly what we want.",
          "zh": "而是在點擊發生時執行，這正是我們想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 469.466,
          "end": 474,
          "en": "So now when I save that and I reload here,",
          "zh": "所以現在當我儲存它，然後在這裡重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 474,
          "end": 475.266,
          "en": "you'll see now we have clicked",
          "zh": "你會看到現在我們有 clicked，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 475.266,
          "end": 477.56600000000003,
          "en": "with multiple exclamation marks,",
          "zh": "加上多個驚嘆號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 477.56600000000003,
          "end": 481.4,
          "en": "which is the console log from this const.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 const 印出的 console log。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 481.4,
          "end": 485.6,
          "en": "And that is how we can add event listeners to our elements.",
          "zh": "這就是我們如何把 event listener 加到我們的元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 485.6,
          "end": 488.8,
          "en": "To all these built-in HTML elements,",
          "zh": "在所有這些內建的 HTML 元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 488.8,
          "end": 492.7,
          "en": "we can add supported event listeners basically.",
          "zh": "基本上我們可以加上它支援的 event listener。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 492.7,
          "end": 494.9,
          "en": "OnClick, for example, basically is available",
          "zh": "舉例來說，onClick 基本上"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 494.9,
          "end": 496.33299999999997,
          "en": "on every element.",
          "zh": "在每個元素上都可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 496.33299999999997,
          "end": 499.866,
          "en": "Some events are only available on specific elements.",
          "zh": "有些事件只在特定的元素上可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 499.866,
          "end": 500.2,
          "en": "Some events are only available on specific elements.",
          "zh": "有些事件只在特定的元素上可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 500.2,
          "end": 504.233,
          "en": "But that is all based on the default DOM behavior.",
          "zh": "但那全都取決於預設的 DOM 行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 504.233,
          "end": 507.83299999999997,
          "en": "If an element supports an event, then you can add a listener",
          "zh": "如果一個元素支援某個事件，你就能加上 listener，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 507.83299999999997,
          "end": 510.366,
          "en": "with React by adding such an on",
          "zh": "在 React 裡，做法是加上這樣一個 on，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 510.366,
          "end": 513.1659999999999,
          "en": "and then the event name prop.",
          "zh": "再加上事件名稱的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 513.1659999999999,
          "end": 513.466,
          "en": "and then the event name prop.",
          "zh": "再加上事件名稱的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 513.466,
          "end": 515.366,
          "en": "Just make sure that the event name",
          "zh": "只要確保事件名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 515.366,
          "end": 517.466,
          "en": "starts with a capital character,",
          "zh": "以大寫字母開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 517.466,
          "end": 520.3,
          "en": "like in the case of onClick here.",
          "zh": "就像這裡的 onClick 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 520.3,
          "end": 522.766,
          "en": "And then you just point at a function,",
          "zh": "然後你就只要指向一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 522.766,
          "end": 528.433,
          "en": "either defined in line here or, better, defined upfront,",
          "zh": "它可以是這裡行內定義的，或者更好的是事先定義好的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 528.433,
          "end": 528.566,
          "en": "either defined in line here or, better, defined upfront,",
          "zh": "它可以是這裡行內定義的，或者更好的是事先定義好的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 528.566,
          "end": 531.466,
          "en": "and React will execute that function for you",
          "zh": "而 React 會替你在該事件發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 531.466,
          "end": 533.1,
          "en": "when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "執行那個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 533.1,
          "end": 536,
          "en": "That's how you add events.",
          "zh": "這就是加入事件的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 536,
          "end": 539.133,
          "en": "Now, one word about naming these functions.",
          "zh": "現在，來說一下這些函式的命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 539.133,
          "end": 541.866,
          "en": "It is a convention which you don't have to follow",
          "zh": "這是一個你不一定要遵循的慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 541.866,
          "end": 544.433,
          "en": "but which you might consider following",
          "zh": "但或許可以考慮遵循，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 544.433,
          "end": 547.4,
          "en": "that you name your functions like this.",
          "zh": "也就是像這樣命名你的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 547.4,
          "end": 549.933,
          "en": "If they are triggered upon an event,",
          "zh": "如果它們是在事件發生時被觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 549.933,
          "end": 552.833,
          "en": "that you end with handler.",
          "zh": "就讓名字以 handler 結尾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 552.833,
          "end": 553.166,
          "en": "that you end with handler.",
          "zh": "就讓名字以 handler 結尾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 553.166,
          "end": 554.8,
          "en": "This is not a must-do,",
          "zh": "這不是非得這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 554.8,
          "end": 557.333,
          "en": "and not every React developer does it,",
          "zh": "也不是每個 React 開發者都這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 557.333,
          "end": 559.933,
          "en": "but it is a preference I personally have.",
          "zh": "但這是我個人的偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 559.933,
          "end": 563.366,
          "en": "And you will see it in a couple of projects out there",
          "zh": "而你在外面的一些專案裡會看到這種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 563.366,
          "end": 565.766,
          "en": "so that it's clear that this is a function",
          "zh": "這樣就能清楚知道這是個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 565.766,
          "end": 569.566,
          "en": "which is not called by us, somewhere else in our code,",
          "zh": "不是由我們在程式碼其他地方呼叫的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 569.566,
          "end": 571.6,
          "en": "but that it is a function which we attached",
          "zh": "而是我們附加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 571.6,
          "end": 574.433,
          "en": "to an event listener so that it's eventually called",
          "zh": "某個 event listener 上的函式，因此它最終是由"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 574.433,
          "end": 577.366,
          "en": "by React when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "React 在該事件發生時呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 577.366,
          "end": 577.866,
          "en": "by React when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "React 在該事件發生時呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 577.866,
          "end": 581.566,
          "en": "That's why I'm naming my event handler functions like this,",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我把我的 event handler 函式這樣命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 581.566,
          "end": 583.233,
          "en": "ending with handler.",
          "zh": "以 handler 結尾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 583.233,
          "end": 585.633,
          "en": "But again, this is just my preference.",
          "zh": "但再次強調，這只是我的偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 585.633,
          "end": 587.6659999999999,
          "en": "You see it in a couple of projects.",
          "zh": "你在一些專案裡會看到這種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 587.6659999999999,
          "end": 589.566,
          "en": "You might wanna consider doing that,",
          "zh": "你或許可以考慮這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 589.566,
          "end": 591.7,
          "en": "but you don't have to.",
          "zh": "但你不一定非得這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 591.7,
          "end": 595.6,
          "en": "But now with that, we know how we can react to events.",
          "zh": "不過現在有了這些，我們知道該如何對事件做出反應了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 595.6,
          "end": 597.066,
          "en": "How can we now change",
          "zh": "那麼我們現在要如何改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 597.066,
          "end": 599.2,
          "en": "what is showing up on the screen though?",
          "zh": "螢幕上顯示的內容呢？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595966",
      "title": "How Component Functions Are Executed",
      "sourceHash": "30bb57315bddcda89396cbfd840284c40844cf346f48d27f61ab1a331581b14a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.033,
          "end": 4.166,
          "en": "Maximilian: Reacting to events is an important",
          "zh": "Maximilian：對事件做出反應是重要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.166,
          "end": 5.233,
          "en": "first step,",
          "zh": "第一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.233,
          "end": 8.266,
          "en": "how can we now change what shows up on the screen?",
          "zh": "我們現在要如何改變畫面上顯示的內容呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.266,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "Well, we want to change the title",
          "zh": "嗯，我們想要改變標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 11.766,
          "en": "when the \"button is clicked,",
          "zh": "當按鈕被點擊時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.766,
          "end": 14.366,
          "en": "so this is one thing we could do.",
          "zh": "所以這是我們可以做的一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.366,
          "end": 15.933,
          "en": "We could create a variable",
          "zh": "我們可以建立一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.933,
          "end": 17.233,
          "en": "with let,",
          "zh": "用 let，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 17.233,
          "end": 20.266,
          "en": "which we may rename title,",
          "zh": "我們可以將它命名為 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.266,
          "end": 20.833,
          "en": "which we may rename title,",
          "zh": "我們可以將它命名為 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 20.833,
          "end": 26.366,
          "en": "and initially that holds the value we find in props title .",
          "zh": "而它最初會保存我們在 props.title 中找到的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.366,
          "end": 29.2,
          "en": "And then we use this title variable down there",
          "zh": "然後我們在下面那裡使用這個 title 變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.2,
          "end": 30.833,
          "en": "in our JSX code",
          "zh": "在我們的 JSX 程式碼中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.833,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "to output the title.",
          "zh": "來輸出這個標題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 36.6,
          "en": "Now if I do that we see the same results as before,",
          "zh": "現在如果我這麼做，我們會看到和之前相同的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.6,
          "end": 38.933,
          "en": "so why am I doing that.",
          "zh": "那我為什麼要這麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 38.933,
          "end": 39.733,
          "en": "so why am I doing that.",
          "zh": "那我為什麼要這麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.733,
          "end": 42,
          "en": "Well since it's a variable,",
          "zh": "嗯，因為它是個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42,
          "end": 45.866,
          "en": "we could change it whenever the click handler executes.",
          "zh": "我們可以在 click handler 執行時隨時改變它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.866,
          "end": 45.966,
          "en": "we could change it whenever the click handler executes.",
          "zh": "我們可以在 click handler 執行時隨時改變它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.966,
          "end": 47.8,
          "en": "So whenever this button has clicked,",
          "zh": "所以每當這個按鈕被點擊時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 47.8,
          "end": 50.366,
          "en": "we execute this click handler function",
          "zh": "我們會執行這個 click handler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.366,
          "end": 55.3,
          "en": "and in there if we now change title to updated,",
          "zh": "而在裡面，如果我們現在把 title 改成 updated，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 55.3,
          "end": 55.6,
          "en": "and in there if we now change title to updated,",
          "zh": "而在裡面，如果我們現在把 title 改成 updated，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.6,
          "end": 58.766,
          "en": "then we should see that change title",
          "zh": "那麼我們應該會看到那個標題改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.766,
          "end": 60.333,
          "en": "on our screen, right?",
          "zh": "在我們的畫面上，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 60.333,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "Because we are outputting title down there,",
          "zh": "因為我們在下面那裡輸出 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 64,
          "en": "we're changing it up on a click",
          "zh": "我們在點擊時改變它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 64,
          "end": 67.166,
          "en": "we should see that value here in this place",
          "zh": "我們應該會在這個地方看到那個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 67.166,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "after such a click happened.",
          "zh": "在這樣的點擊發生之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 73.333,
          "en": "Well, let's save everything and give a try.",
          "zh": "嗯，讓我們儲存一切並試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 73.333,
          "end": 76.7,
          "en": "If we go back, you'll notice that if I click change title ,",
          "zh": "如果我們切換回去，你會注意到，如果我點擊 Change Title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.7,
          "end": 78.2,
          "en": "nothing happens.",
          "zh": "什麼事都沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.2,
          "end": 81.633,
          "en": "I can hammer this button and nothing happens.",
          "zh": "我可以猛按這個按鈕，但什麼事都沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 81.633,
          "end": 85.333,
          "en": "This title here never changes,",
          "zh": "這裡的這個標題永遠不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 85.333,
          "end": 85.96600000000001,
          "en": "This title here never changes,",
          "zh": "這裡的這個標題永遠不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 85.96600000000001,
          "end": 88.233,
          "en": "so why is this happening?",
          "zh": "那為什麼會這樣呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 88.233,
          "end": 91.93299999999999,
          "en": "Is something wrong with our click handler?",
          "zh": "是我們的 click handler 有問題嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.93299999999999,
          "end": 94.3,
          "en": "Well this function is getting triggered,",
          "zh": "嗯，這個函式的確有被觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.3,
          "end": 97,
          "en": "I can prove this, if I console lock",
          "zh": "我可以證明這點，如果我 console.log"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 97,
          "end": 98.566,
          "en": "the title here",
          "zh": "這裡的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 98.566,
          "end": 100,
          "en": "after we changed it,",
          "zh": "在我們改變它之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 100,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "after we changed it,",
          "zh": "在我們改變它之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 103.733,
          "en": "you will notice that if I now go back and reload,",
          "zh": "你會注意到，如果我現在切換回去並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 103.733,
          "end": 105.366,
          "en": "if I click change title,",
          "zh": "如果我點擊 Change Title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 105.366,
          "end": 109.033,
          "en": "we see that updated title text here.",
          "zh": "我們會在這裡看到那個更新後的 title 文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 109.033,
          "end": 110.96600000000001,
          "en": "So it looks like it worked,",
          "zh": "所以看起來它成功了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 110.96600000000001,
          "end": 113.5,
          "en": "the click handler clearly executed",
          "zh": "click handler 顯然執行了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 113.5,
          "end": 116.166,
          "en": "and title clearly was changed.",
          "zh": "而 title 顯然被改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 116.166,
          "end": 116.333,
          "en": "and title clearly was changed.",
          "zh": "而 title 顯然被改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 116.333,
          "end": 119.066,
          "en": "Otherwise we wouldn't see that new value",
          "zh": "否則我們不會看到那個新值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 119.066,
          "end": 121.6,
          "en": "which we assign here in line 13",
          "zh": "也就是我們在第 13 行這裡所指派的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 121.6,
          "end": 124.333,
          "en": "once we log it in line 14.",
          "zh": "當我們在第 14 行將它 log 出來時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 124.333,
          "end": 126.5,
          "en": "So if the function executes",
          "zh": "所以如果函式執行了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 126.5,
          "end": 128.2,
          "en": "and the title is changed,",
          "zh": "而且 title 被改變了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 128.2,
          "end": 131.7,
          "en": "why don't we see that reflected in our DOM,",
          "zh": "為什麼我們沒看到它反映在我們的 DOM 中呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 131.7,
          "end": 134.566,
          "en": "after all we are outputting the title down there",
          "zh": "畢竟我們在下面那裡輸出 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 134.566,
          "end": 137.5,
          "en": "in line 21.",
          "zh": "在第 21 行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 137.5,
          "end": 138.333,
          "en": "Well,",
          "zh": "嗯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 138.333,
          "end": 140.966,
          "en": "simply because react doesn't work like this.",
          "zh": "單純是因為 React 不是這樣運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 140.966,
          "end": 143.566,
          "en": "And that's where now I have to dive into",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我現在必須深入探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 143.566,
          "end": 147.166,
          "en": "how react actually passes the JSS code",
          "zh": "React 實際上如何處理 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 147.166,
          "end": 148.933,
          "en": "and how it considers that",
          "zh": "以及它如何看待它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 148.933,
          "end": 151.333,
          "en": "and how it brings it on to the screen.",
          "zh": "還有它如何將它帶到畫面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 151.333,
          "end": 151.53300000000002,
          "en": "and how it brings it on to the screen.",
          "zh": "還有它如何將它帶到畫面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 151.53300000000002,
          "end": 155.266,
          "en": "Though I will have an even deeper dive later in the course,",
          "zh": "雖然我之後在課程中會有更深入的探討，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 155.266,
          "end": 158.933,
          "en": "but there's one key thing which you have to know right now,",
          "zh": "但有件關鍵的事你現在就必須知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 158.933,
          "end": 163.2,
          "en": "keep in mind that your component is a function.",
          "zh": "請記住，你的元件就是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 163.2,
          "end": 164.633,
          "en": "This is a function right?",
          "zh": "這是個函式，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 164.633,
          "end": 167.266,
          "en": "Your component is just a regular function,",
          "zh": "你的元件只是個普通的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 167.266,
          "end": 169.9,
          "en": "the only special thing about that function,",
          "zh": "這個函式唯一特別的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 169.9,
          "end": 172.6,
          "en": "is that it returns JSX.",
          "zh": "就是它會回傳 JSX。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 172.6,
          "end": 174.53300000000002,
          "en": "Now since it's a function",
          "zh": "既然它是個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 174.53300000000002,
          "end": 176.36599999999999,
          "en": "someone has to call it,",
          "zh": "就必須有人去呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 176.36599999999999,
          "end": 179.133,
          "en": "and you might notice that we never called",
          "zh": "而你可能會注意到，我們從來沒有呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 179.133,
          "end": 180.866,
          "en": "our component functions,",
          "zh": "我們的 component functions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 180.866,
          "end": 183.8,
          "en": "instead we just used these functions",
          "zh": "我們只是把這些函式當作"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 183.8,
          "end": 188.833,
          "en": "like HTML elements in this JSX code.",
          "zh": "這個 JSX 程式碼中的 HTML 元素來使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 188.833,
          "end": 190.8,
          "en": "Well, the thing is,",
          "zh": "嗯，事情是這樣的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 190.8,
          "end": 195.433,
          "en": "under the hood this is almost like a function call.",
          "zh": "在底層，這幾乎就像是個函式呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 195.433,
          "end": 198.633,
          "en": "By using our components in JSX code,",
          "zh": "透過在 JSX 程式碼中使用我們的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 198.633,
          "end": 203.466,
          "en": "we make React aware of our component functions.",
          "zh": "我們讓 React 知道我們的 component functions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 203.466,
          "end": 203.7,
          "en": "we make React aware of our component functions.",
          "zh": "我們讓 React 知道我們的 component functions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 203.7,
          "end": 204.833,
          "en": "For example here,",
          "zh": "舉例來說，在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 204.833,
          "end": 209,
          "en": "we make react aware of the expense item function.",
          "zh": "我們讓 React 知道 ExpenseItem 這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 209,
          "end": 212.833,
          "en": "And whenever react evaluates this JSX code,",
          "zh": "而每當 React 評估這段 JSX 程式碼時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 212.833,
          "end": 216.233,
          "en": "it will call these component functions.",
          "zh": "它就會呼叫這些 component functions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 216.233,
          "end": 219.53300000000002,
          "en": "And these component functions stand to return JSX code,",
          "zh": "而這些 component functions 會回傳 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 219.53300000000002,
          "end": 221.733,
          "en": "which is all the evaluated,",
          "zh": "這些都會被評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 221.733,
          "end": 225.53300000000002,
          "en": "up until there's no more JSX code to be evaluated.",
          "zh": "直到沒有更多 JSX 程式碼需要評估為止。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 225.53300000000002,
          "end": 228.53300000000002,
          "en": "So react keeps on calling any component functions",
          "zh": "所以 React 會持續呼叫任何 component functions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 228.53300000000002,
          "end": 230.36599999999999,
          "en": "it encounters in JSX,",
          "zh": "它在 JSX 中遇到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 230.36599999999999,
          "end": 230.733,
          "en": "it encounters in JSX,",
          "zh": "它在 JSX 中遇到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 230.733,
          "end": 233.333,
          "en": "then calls any functions that those",
          "zh": "然後呼叫那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 233.333,
          "end": 234.86599999999999,
          "en": "functions might have returned",
          "zh": "函式所可能回傳的任何函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 234.86599999999999,
          "end": 237.8,
          "en": "so any elements those components might have used",
          "zh": "也就是那些元件在它們的 JSX 程式碼中"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 237.8,
          "end": 242.4,
          "en": "in their JSX code until there are no more functions left.",
          "zh": "可能使用到的任何元素，直到沒有更多函式為止。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 242.4,
          "end": 244.7,
          "en": "So in the case of expenses.js,",
          "zh": "所以在 expenses.js 的例子中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 244.7,
          "end": 247.266,
          "en": "if react encounters this expense item,",
          "zh": "如果 React 遇到這個 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 247.266,
          "end": 247.433,
          "en": "if react encounters this expense item,",
          "zh": "如果 React 遇到這個 ExpenseItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 247.433,
          "end": 250.36599999999999,
          "en": "it calls this expense item component function,",
          "zh": "它就會呼叫這個 ExpenseItem component function，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 250.36599999999999,
          "end": 252.4,
          "en": "executes all the code in there,",
          "zh": "執行裡面所有的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 252.4,
          "end": 254.9,
          "en": "encounters this JSX code",
          "zh": "遇到這段 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 254.9,
          "end": 255.066,
          "en": "encounters this JSX code",
          "zh": "遇到這段 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 255.066,
          "end": 257.066,
          "en": "and calls this card function",
          "zh": "並呼叫這個 Card 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 257.066,
          "end": 259.566,
          "en": "and this expense state function",
          "zh": "以及這個 ExpenseDate 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 259.566,
          "end": 263.83299999999997,
          "en": "and then it goes through the JSX code of this components",
          "zh": "然後它會遍歷這些元件的 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 263.83299999999997,
          "end": 268.666,
          "en": "until there's no more component code left to call.",
          "zh": "直到沒有更多元件程式碼需要呼叫為止。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 268.666,
          "end": 271.83299999999997,
          "en": "And then it re-evaluates the overall result",
          "zh": "然後它會重新評估整體結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 271.83299999999997,
          "end": 271.933,
          "en": "And then it re-evaluates the overall result",
          "zh": "然後它會重新評估整體結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 271.933,
          "end": 275.06600000000003,
          "en": "and translates that into DOM instructions",
          "zh": "並將它轉換成 DOM 指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 275.06600000000003,
          "end": 277.733,
          "en": "which renders something like this on the screen.",
          "zh": "進而在畫面上渲染出像這樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 277.733,
          "end": 280.8,
          "en": "That's how react works.",
          "zh": "這就是 React 的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 280.8,
          "end": 283.866,
          "en": "Now it's all started by the index.js file,",
          "zh": "而這一切都是由 index.js 檔案啟動的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 283.866,
          "end": 287.433,
          "en": "where we initially point at this app component.",
          "zh": "我們在其中最初指向這個 App component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 287.433,
          "end": 287.7,
          "en": "where we initially point at this app component.",
          "zh": "我們在其中最初指向這個 App component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 287.7,
          "end": 290.533,
          "en": "That's the first component function which is being called",
          "zh": "那是第一個被呼叫的 component function，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 290.533,
          "end": 292.7,
          "en": "and that happens when the react app",
          "zh": "而這會發生在 React 應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 292.7,
          "end": 294.4,
          "en": "is been loaded on the screen",
          "zh": "被載入到畫面上時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 294.4,
          "end": 297.666,
          "en": "which happens when the page is been visited.",
          "zh": "這發生在頁面被造訪時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 297.666,
          "end": 297.966,
          "en": "which happens when the page is been visited.",
          "zh": "這發生在頁面被造訪時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 297.966,
          "end": 301.766,
          "en": "So that's how react goes through all these components",
          "zh": "所以這就是 React 如何遍歷所有這些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 301.766,
          "end": 304.7,
          "en": "executes all these components functions",
          "zh": "執行所有這些 component functions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 304.7,
          "end": 307.866,
          "en": "and draws something on to the screen.",
          "zh": "並在畫面上繪製出一些東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 307.866,
          "end": 310,
          "en": "The only problem with that is,",
          "zh": "唯一的問題是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 310,
          "end": 312.866,
          "en": "that react never repeats that.",
          "zh": "React 從不重複這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 312.866,
          "end": 313.333,
          "en": "that react never repeats that.",
          "zh": "React 從不重複這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 313.333,
          "end": 315.6,
          "en": "React goes through all of that",
          "zh": "React 會完成這整個流程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 319.266,
          "en": "when the application is initially rendered,",
          "zh": "在應用程式最初被渲染時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 319.266,
          "end": 321.633,
          "en": "but thereafter it's done.",
          "zh": "但之後就結束了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 321.633,
          "end": 323.8,
          "en": "However in modern applications,",
          "zh": "然而，在現代應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 323.8,
          "end": 326,
          "en": "of course you sometimes want to update",
          "zh": "你當然有時會想要更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 326,
          "end": 327.433,
          "en": "what's visible on the screen,",
          "zh": "畫面上可見的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 327.433,
          "end": 327.666,
          "en": "what's visible on the screen,",
          "zh": "畫面上可見的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 327.666,
          "end": 329.933,
          "en": "for example because a button was clicked",
          "zh": "例如因為某個按鈕被點擊了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 329.933,
          "end": 332.533,
          "en": "and that button should change some text",
          "zh": "而那個按鈕應該要改變一些文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 332.533,
          "end": 334.433,
          "en": "which is being output.",
          "zh": "那些正在被輸出的文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 334.433,
          "end": 337.466,
          "en": "So we need a way of telling react",
          "zh": "所以我們需要一種方式來告訴 React"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 337.466,
          "end": 341.133,
          "en": "that something changed and that a certain component",
          "zh": "有些事情改變了，而且某個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 341.133,
          "end": 344.33299999999997,
          "en": "should be re-evaluated",
          "zh": "應該被重新評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 344.33299999999997,
          "end": 347.266,
          "en": "and that's where react introduces",
          "zh": "這就是 React 引入"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 347.266,
          "end": 349.8,
          "en": "a special concept called state.",
          "zh": "一個叫做 state 的特殊概念的地方。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595970",
      "title": "Working with \"State\"",
      "sourceHash": "6c4e31886955d46cddfafab1c76e2e84cc5d64d83d5d6e00e87570a5bf59a027",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.033,
          "en": "Tutor: State is actually not a React specific concept",
          "zh": "講師：State 其實不是 React 專屬的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.033,
          "end": 8.033,
          "en": "but it is a key concept in React as well.",
          "zh": "但它同時也是 React 中的關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.033,
          "end": 9.766,
          "en": "And here in ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": "而在這裡的 ExpenseItem 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.766,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "we have a scenario where we wanna use",
          "zh": "我們遇到一種情況，我們想使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.333,
          "en": "that built-in state concept.",
          "zh": "那個內建的 state 概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.333,
          "end": 15.633,
          "en": "that built-in state concept.",
          "zh": "那個內建的 state 概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.633,
          "end": 17.233,
          "en": "Because this title here",
          "zh": "因為這裡的這個 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.233,
          "end": 20.166,
          "en": "which changes when the clickHandler executes",
          "zh": "它在 clickHandler 執行時會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.166,
          "end": 23.866,
          "en": "is actually data that should result",
          "zh": "其實是這樣的資料：它應該會導致"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.866,
          "end": 27.233,
          "en": "in this component being re-evaluated",
          "zh": "這個元件被重新評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.233,
          "end": 27.433,
          "en": "in this component being re-evaluated",
          "zh": "這個元件被重新評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.433,
          "end": 31.366,
          "en": "and re-drawn on the screen when it's changes,",
          "zh": "並在它改變時重新繪製到畫面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.366,
          "end": 34.6,
          "en": "when that's title data changes.",
          "zh": "當那個 title 資料改變時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.6,
          "end": 38.533,
          "en": "And by default, regular variables like this one,",
          "zh": "而預設情況下，像這樣的一般變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.533,
          "end": 43.266,
          "en": "are not triggering such a re-evaluation.",
          "zh": "並不會觸發這樣的重新評估。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.266,
          "end": 43.433,
          "en": "are not triggering such a re-evaluation.",
          "zh": "並不會觸發這樣的重新評估。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.433,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "React doesn't care about that.",
          "zh": "React 並不在乎這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 48.5,
          "en": "If you have a variable in your component function",
          "zh": "如果你在元件函式中有一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.5,
          "end": 52.733,
          "en": "and the that variable changes, React ignores it.",
          "zh": "而那個變數改變了，React 會忽略它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.733,
          "end": 52.766,
          "en": "and the that variable changes, React ignores it.",
          "zh": "而那個變數改變了，React 會忽略它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.766,
          "end": 56.3,
          "en": "It doesn't care about that, that code executes, sure,",
          "zh": "它不在乎這件事，那段程式碼確實會執行，沒錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.3,
          "end": 59.633,
          "en": "but the overall component function doesn't execute again",
          "zh": "但整個元件函式並不會再次執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.633,
          "end": 62.566,
          "en": "just because some variable changed.",
          "zh": "只因為某個變數改變了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.566,
          "end": 65.93299999999999,
          "en": "And as a side note, even if it would execute again,",
          "zh": "另外順帶一提，即使它真的再次執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.93299999999999,
          "end": 68.166,
          "en": "of course then title, this variable,",
          "zh": "當然那時候 title 這個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.166,
          "end": 70.2,
          "en": "would all just be retreated",
          "zh": "也只會被重新建立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.2,
          "end": 73.066,
          "en": "and re initialized to the props value.",
          "zh": "並重新初始化為 props 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.066,
          "end": 75.4,
          "en": "Because as part of this component function",
          "zh": "因為在這個元件函式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.4,
          "end": 78.4,
          "en": "we are creating this title variable.",
          "zh": "我們建立了這個 title 變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.4,
          "end": 79.9,
          "en": "So even if that would happen",
          "zh": "所以即使那真的發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.9,
          "end": 82.233,
          "en": "we wouldn't reach the desired result",
          "zh": "我們也達不到想要的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.233,
          "end": 84.1,
          "en": "but we don't even need to think about that",
          "zh": "但我們甚至不需要去想這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.1,
          "end": 86.5,
          "en": "because it is not happening.",
          "zh": "因為它並沒有發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.5,
          "end": 86.633,
          "en": "because it is not happening.",
          "zh": "因為它並沒有發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.633,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "This ExpenseItem component function currently",
          "zh": "這個 ExpenseItem 元件函式目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 93.5,
          "en": "is not called a second time after the initial rendering",
          "zh": "在初次渲染之後並不會被第二次呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.5,
          "end": 95.26599999999999,
          "en": "just because a click occurred",
          "zh": "只因為發生了點擊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.26599999999999,
          "end": 97.033,
          "en": "or because a variable changed",
          "zh": "或因為某個變數改變了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 97.033,
          "end": 102.033,
          "en": "does not trigger this component function to run again.",
          "zh": "都不會觸發這個元件函式再次執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.033,
          "end": 105.13300000000001,
          "en": "So to tell React that it should run it again,",
          "zh": "所以，為了告訴 React 它應該再次執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 105.13300000000001,
          "end": 109.2,
          "en": "we need to import something from the React library.",
          "zh": "我們需要從 React 函式庫 import 一些東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 113.1,
          "en": "And we do it as by adding a so-called named import.",
          "zh": "而我們的做法是加入所謂的具名匯入（named import）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 116.63300000000001,
          "en": "This here, is the default import.",
          "zh": "這裡這個，是預設匯入（default import）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.63300000000001,
          "end": 117.1,
          "en": "This here, is the default import.",
          "zh": "這裡這個，是預設匯入（default import）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.1,
          "end": 118.366,
          "en": "Now, we can add a comma",
          "zh": "現在，我們可以加一個逗號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 118.366,
          "end": 121.766,
          "en": "and curly braces and between the curly braces",
          "zh": "和大括號，而在大括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.766,
          "end": 125.6,
          "en": "we can now extract specifically named things",
          "zh": "我們現在可以特別取出具名的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.6,
          "end": 128.166,
          "en": "from the React library.",
          "zh": "從 React 函式庫中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 128.166,
          "end": 128.766,
          "en": "from the React library.",
          "zh": "從 React 函式庫中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.766,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "Here we imported the overall React object,",
          "zh": "這裡我們匯入了整個 React 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 136.233,
          "en": "now we want to import single pieces from the React library.",
          "zh": "現在我們想從 React 函式庫匯入個別的片段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 136.233,
          "end": 139.466,
          "en": "And we want to import a function here,",
          "zh": "而我們想在這裡匯入一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.466,
          "end": 144.066,
          "en": "a function which is called useState.",
          "zh": "一個叫做 useState 的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 144.066,
          "end": 147.133,
          "en": "This is a function provided by the React library",
          "zh": "這是 React 函式庫提供的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.133,
          "end": 151.066,
          "en": "and this function allows us to define values",
          "zh": "而這個函式讓我們可以定義一些值"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.066,
          "end": 152.36599999999999,
          "en": "as state where changes to these values should reflect",
          "zh": "作為 state，而這些值的變更應該反映"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.36599999999999,
          "end": 156.9,
          "en": "as state where changes to these values should reflect",
          "zh": "作為 state，而這些值的變更應該反映"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.9,
          "end": 159.433,
          "en": "in the component function being called again,",
          "zh": "在元件函式再次被呼叫這件事上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.433,
          "end": 159.633,
          "en": "in the component function being called again,",
          "zh": "在元件函式再次被呼叫這件事上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.633,
          "end": 161.133,
          "en": "which is a key difference",
          "zh": "這是個關鍵的差異，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.133,
          "end": 164.233,
          "en": "to the regular variable we're using here.",
          "zh": "相對於我們這裡使用的一般變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.233,
          "end": 167.433,
          "en": "Now, how do we use this useState function though?",
          "zh": "那麼，我們要如何使用這個 useState 函式呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 167.433,
          "end": 169.133,
          "en": "Well, it's very simple.",
          "zh": "嗯，非常簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 169.133,
          "end": 172.766,
          "en": "Inside of our component function and that's important,",
          "zh": "在我們的元件函式內部，這點很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 172.766,
          "end": 175.7,
          "en": "we have to do that inside of this function.",
          "zh": "我們必須在這個函式內部做這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175.7,
          "end": 179.166,
          "en": "We just call useState.",
          "zh": "我們只要呼叫 useState。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.166,
          "end": 179.666,
          "en": "We just call useState.",
          "zh": "我們只要呼叫 useState。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 179.666,
          "end": 183.966,
          "en": "And useState is a so-called React hook.",
          "zh": "而 useState 是所謂的 React hook。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.966,
          "end": 184.1,
          "en": "And useState is a so-called React hook.",
          "zh": "而 useState 是所謂的 React hook。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.1,
          "end": 186.333,
          "en": "There are other hooks as well,",
          "zh": "當然還有其他 hook，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 186.333,
          "end": 187.86599999999999,
          "en": "and of course we are going to learn",
          "zh": "而我們當然會學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 187.86599999999999,
          "end": 190.233,
          "en": "about all important hooks for all at this course",
          "zh": "這門課程中所有重要的 hook，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 190.233,
          "end": 193.066,
          "en": "but that is one of the most important ones.",
          "zh": "但這是最重要的其中一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.066,
          "end": 196.166,
          "en": "And all these React hooks can be recognized",
          "zh": "而所有這些 React hook 都可以辨認出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 196.166,
          "end": 199.333,
          "en": "by the fact that they start with the word \"use\"",
          "zh": "靠的是它們的名稱以「use」這個字開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 199.333,
          "end": 201.2,
          "en": "in their name,",
          "zh": "在它們的名稱中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 201.2,
          "end": 201.433,
          "en": "in their name,",
          "zh": "在它們的名稱中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 201.433,
          "end": 205.2,
          "en": "and all these hooks must only be called",
          "zh": "而所有這些 hook 只能在"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 205.2,
          "end": 209.8,
          "en": "inside of React component functions like ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "像 ExpenseItem 這樣的 React 元件函式內部被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 209.8,
          "end": 210.066,
          "en": "inside of React component functions like ExpenseItem.",
          "zh": "像 ExpenseItem 這樣的 React 元件函式內部被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.066,
          "end": 215.833,
          "en": "They can't be called outside of these functions, like this.",
          "zh": "它們不能在這些函式之外被呼叫，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 215.833,
          "end": 216.1,
          "en": "They can't be called outside of these functions, like this.",
          "zh": "它們不能在這些函式之外被呼叫，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 216.1,
          "end": 217.8,
          "en": "And they all just shouldn't be called",
          "zh": "而它們全都不應該被呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 217.8,
          "end": 220.4,
          "en": "in any nested functions.",
          "zh": "在任何巢狀函式中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 220.4,
          "end": 220.6,
          "en": "in any nested functions.",
          "zh": "在任何巢狀函式中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 220.6,
          "end": 222.766,
          "en": "They must be called directly",
          "zh": "它們必須直接被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 222.766,
          "end": 225.36599999999999,
          "en": "inside such component functions.",
          "zh": "在這樣的元件函式內部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 225.36599999999999,
          "end": 227.633,
          "en": "There is one exception which we'll talk about later",
          "zh": "有一個例外，我們之後會談到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 227.633,
          "end": 231.933,
          "en": "but for the moment, that is what you should keep in mind.",
          "zh": "但就目前而言，這是你們應該記住的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 231.933,
          "end": 235.066,
          "en": "Now, useState doesn't work just like that.",
          "zh": "現在，useState 並不是就這樣運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 235.066,
          "end": 239.433,
          "en": "Instead, useState once a default state value,",
          "zh": "相反地，useState 需要一個預設的 state 值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 239.433,
          "end": 241.466,
          "en": "because with useState",
          "zh": "因為透過 useState，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 241.466,
          "end": 245.066,
          "en": "we basically create a special kind of variable,",
          "zh": "我們基本上建立了一種特別的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 245.066,
          "end": 246.233,
          "en": "you could say,",
          "zh": "可以這麼說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 246.233,
          "end": 246.666,
          "en": "you could say,",
          "zh": "可以這麼說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 246.666,
          "end": 249.533,
          "en": "a variable where changes will lead",
          "zh": "一個當它改變時會導致"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 249.533,
          "end": 252.433,
          "en": "this component function to be called again.",
          "zh": "這個元件函式再次被呼叫的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 252.433,
          "end": 252.833,
          "en": "this component function to be called again.",
          "zh": "這個元件函式再次被呼叫的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 252.833,
          "end": 256.133,
          "en": "And of course we can therefore assign an initial value",
          "zh": "而我們當然可以因此指定一個初始值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 256.133,
          "end": 258.133,
          "en": "for that special variable,",
          "zh": "給那個特別的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 258.133,
          "end": 260.566,
          "en": "just as we're assigning a value here",
          "zh": "就像我們在這裡指定一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 260.566,
          "end": 263.3,
          "en": "for does regular variable.",
          "zh": "給這個一般變數一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 263.3,
          "end": 263.9,
          "en": "for does regular variable.",
          "zh": "給這個一般變數一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 263.9,
          "end": 267.433,
          "en": "So here, my initial value is props.title.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我的初始值是 props.title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 267.433,
          "end": 272.133,
          "en": "And we simply pass this as an argument to useState.",
          "zh": "而我們只要把它當作參數傳給 useState。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 272.133,
          "end": 275.3,
          "en": "Now does special variable is created.",
          "zh": "現在這個特別的變數就被建立了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 275.3,
          "end": 275.7,
          "en": "Now does special variable is created.",
          "zh": "現在這個特別的變數就被建立了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 275.7,
          "end": 278.83299999999997,
          "en": "Of course, we also want to be able to use that variable,",
          "zh": "當然，我們也希望能夠使用那個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 278.83299999999997,
          "end": 281.766,
          "en": "we want to be able to use it down here, for example",
          "zh": "例如，我們希望能夠在下面這裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 281.766,
          "end": 282,
          "en": "we want to be able to use it down here, for example",
          "zh": "例如，我們希望能夠在下面這裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 282,
          "end": 286.06600000000003,
          "en": "and therefore useState also returns something.",
          "zh": "因此 useState 也會回傳一些東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 286.06600000000003,
          "end": 289.8,
          "en": "It gives us access to this special variable.",
          "zh": "它讓我們可以存取這個特別的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 289.8,
          "end": 292.6,
          "en": "However, it does not just return that,",
          "zh": "不過，它回傳的不只是那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 292.6,
          "end": 296.866,
          "en": "it also returns a function which we can then call",
          "zh": "它也會回傳一個函式，我們之後可以呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 296.866,
          "end": 301.066,
          "en": "to assign a new value to that variable.",
          "zh": "來為那個變數指定新值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 301.066,
          "end": 303.633,
          "en": "So we'll not be assigning values like this",
          "zh": "所以我們不會像這樣指定值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 303.633,
          "end": 305,
          "en": "with the equal sign,",
          "zh": "用等號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 305,
          "end": 307.866,
          "en": "instead, we will be assigning new values",
          "zh": "而是會透過呼叫一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 307.866,
          "end": 309.3,
          "en": "by calling a function.",
          "zh": "來指定新的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 309.3,
          "end": 313.766,
          "en": "That's just how this state variable thing works.",
          "zh": "這就是這個 state 變數東西的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 313.766,
          "end": 314.466,
          "en": "That's just how this state variable thing works.",
          "zh": "這就是這個 state 變數東西的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 314.466,
          "end": 318.266,
          "en": "And for that useState actually returns an array",
          "zh": "而為此，useState 實際上會回傳一個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 318.266,
          "end": 322.933,
          "en": "where the first value is the variable itself,",
          "zh": "其中第一個值是變數本身，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 322.933,
          "end": 325.633,
          "en": "you could say, the value itself.",
          "zh": "可以說，就是那個值本身。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 325.633,
          "end": 325.83299999999997,
          "en": "you could say, the value itself.",
          "zh": "可以說，就是那個值本身。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 325.83299999999997,
          "end": 327.966,
          "en": "And the second element in the array",
          "zh": "而陣列中的第二個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 327.966,
          "end": 330.666,
          "en": "is that updating function.",
          "zh": "就是那個更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 330.666,
          "end": 331.3,
          "en": "is that updating function.",
          "zh": "就是那個更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 331.3,
          "end": 334.433,
          "en": "And we can use a modern JavaScript feature",
          "zh": "而我們可以使用一個現代的 JavaScript 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 334.433,
          "end": 338.7,
          "en": "called array destructuring, which looks like this,",
          "zh": "叫做陣列解構（array destructuring），它看起來像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 338.7,
          "end": 341.9,
          "en": "to store both elements in separate variables",
          "zh": "來把這兩個元素存入不同的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 341.9,
          "end": 345.166,
          "en": "or constants, and here I'll use constants.",
          "zh": "或常數，而在這裡我會用常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 345.166,
          "end": 349.366,
          "en": "And I'll come back to why it's a constant in a second.",
          "zh": "我待會兒會再說明為什麼它是常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 349.366,
          "end": 349.83299999999997,
          "en": "And I'll come back to why it's a constant in a second.",
          "zh": "我待會兒會再說明為什麼它是常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 349.83299999999997,
          "end": 352.166,
          "en": "Now you can choose any names of your choice",
          "zh": "現在你可以選擇任何你喜歡的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 352.166,
          "end": 355.4,
          "en": "because for a radius structuring, it's just your order",
          "zh": "因為對於陣列解構來說，只有你的順序"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 355.4,
          "end": 360.733,
          "en": "which matters and all named as title and setTitle.",
          "zh": "才是重要的，而我把他們命名為 title 和 setTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 360.733,
          "end": 363.4,
          "en": "The first element, as I just said,",
          "zh": "第一個元素，就像我剛剛說的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 363.4,
          "end": 367.066,
          "en": "is a point at that managed value.",
          "zh": "指向那個被管理的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 367.066,
          "end": 367.366,
          "en": "is a point at that managed value.",
          "zh": "指向那個被管理的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 367.366,
          "end": 370.966,
          "en": "So initially at props title, the value stored",
          "zh": "所以一開始，它的值是 props title，也就是儲存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 370.966,
          "end": 372.366,
          "en": "in props title,",
          "zh": "props title 中的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 372.366,
          "end": 374.233,
          "en": "and the second element here",
          "zh": "而這裡的第二個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 374.233,
          "end": 377.966,
          "en": "is a function which we can later call to set a new title,",
          "zh": "是一個函式，我們之後可以呼叫它來設定新的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 377.966,
          "end": 380.766,
          "en": "hence this name, which I chose.",
          "zh": "這也是我選這個名稱的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 380.766,
          "end": 381.266,
          "en": "hence this name, which I chose.",
          "zh": "這也是我選這個名稱的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 381.266,
          "end": 383.33299999999997,
          "en": "Both names are up to you,",
          "zh": "這兩個名稱都由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 383.33299999999997,
          "end": 385.966,
          "en": "but the convention is to use something",
          "zh": "但慣例是使用一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 385.966,
          "end": 387.666,
          "en": "which describes the value",
          "zh": "能描述該值的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 387.666,
          "end": 391.4,
          "en": "as a name for this first element, since that is the value",
          "zh": "作為第一個元素的名稱，因為那就是那個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 391.4,
          "end": 395.1,
          "en": "and then set, and then that name repeated",
          "zh": "然後是 set，接著把那個名稱重複一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 395.1,
          "end": 397.366,
          "en": "just with a capital starting character here.",
          "zh": "只是開頭的字母改成大寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 397.366,
          "end": 399.06600000000003,
          "en": "This capital T for that function which updates the value.",
          "zh": "這個大寫的 T 是給那個負責更新值的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 399.06600000000003,
          "end": 401.83299999999997,
          "en": "This capital T for that function which updates the value.",
          "zh": "這個大寫的 T 是給那個負責更新值的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 401.83299999999997,
          "end": 402.9,
          "en": "That's the convention",
          "zh": "這就是慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 402.9,
          "end": 407.733,
          "en": "on how you name these two elements returned by useState.",
          "zh": "關於如何命名 useState 回傳的這兩個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 407.733,
          "end": 412.56600000000003,
          "en": "And useState, this hook, always returns an array",
          "zh": "而 useState 這個 hook 永遠會回傳一個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 412.56600000000003,
          "end": 414.8,
          "en": "with exactly two elements.",
          "zh": "正好包含兩個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 414.8,
          "end": 416.433,
          "en": "That's always the case.",
          "zh": "這永遠都是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 416.433,
          "end": 416.6,
          "en": "That's always the case.",
          "zh": "這永遠都是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 416.6,
          "end": 418.533,
          "en": "And it's always the case",
          "zh": "而且永遠都是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 418.533,
          "end": 422.9,
          "en": "that the first element is the current state value.",
          "zh": "第一個元素是目前的 state 值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 422.9,
          "end": 427.033,
          "en": "And the second element is a function for updating that.",
          "zh": "而第二個元素則是用來更新它的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 427.033,
          "end": 430.066,
          "en": "Now with that, we can remove that title variable",
          "zh": "現在有了這些，我們可以移除那個 title 變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 430.066,
          "end": 433.533,
          "en": "and we can also remove that value assignment",
          "zh": "我們也可以移除那個值的指定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 433.533,
          "end": 435.833,
          "en": "in clickHandler.",
          "zh": "在 clickHandler 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 435.833,
          "end": 440.733,
          "en": "And we can still use title like this down there in JSX.",
          "zh": "而我們仍然可以在下面的 JSX 中像這樣使用 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 440.733,
          "end": 442.966,
          "en": "So if we now save it like this,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們現在像這樣儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 442.966,
          "end": 445.933,
          "en": "we still see toilet paper here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡還是會看到 toilet paper。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 445.933,
          "end": 446.1,
          "en": "we still see toilet paper here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡還是會看到 toilet paper。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 446.1,
          "end": 448.166,
          "en": "So that hasn't changed,",
          "zh": "所以那並沒有改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 448.166,
          "end": 450.566,
          "en": "but of course the button still doesn't do anything",
          "zh": "但當然，這個按鈕還是不會有任何作用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 450.566,
          "end": 454.3,
          "en": "because at the moment we're never updating this.",
          "zh": "因為目前我們從來沒有更新它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 454.3,
          "end": 458.1,
          "en": "Now, as I said, with the value returned by useState,",
          "zh": "現在，就像我說的，對於 useState 回傳的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 458.1,
          "end": 461.6,
          "en": "we're not going to assign a new value with an equal sign.",
          "zh": "我們不會用等號來指定新值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 461.6,
          "end": 466.133,
          "en": "Instead, we assign a new value by calling setTitle.",
          "zh": "相反地，我們透過呼叫 setTitle 來指定新值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 466.133,
          "end": 470.466,
          "en": "So by calling this state updating function",
          "zh": "所以，透過呼叫這個 state 更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 470.466,
          "end": 473.233,
          "en": "and then we just passed a new value",
          "zh": "然後我們只要傳入一個新值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 473.233,
          "end": 477.33299999999997,
          "en": "as argument, in this case updated.",
          "zh": "作為參數，在這個例子中是 updated。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 477.33299999999997,
          "end": 479.266,
          "en": "Now, why does it work like this though?",
          "zh": "不過，為什麼它會這樣運作呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 479.266,
          "end": 482.266,
          "en": "Why do we have this state updating function",
          "zh": "為什麼我們會有這個 state 更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 482.266,
          "end": 485.6,
          "en": "instead of assigning a new value like this?",
          "zh": "而不是像這樣直接指定新值呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 485.6,
          "end": 486.5,
          "en": "instead of assigning a new value like this?",
          "zh": "而不是像這樣直接指定新值呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 486.5,
          "end": 489.5,
          "en": "The reason for that is, that calling this function",
          "zh": "原因是，呼叫這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 489.5,
          "end": 493.9,
          "en": "does not just assign a new value to some variable,",
          "zh": "並不只是把新值指定給某個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 493.9,
          "end": 497.766,
          "en": "but that instead it is a special variable to begin with.",
          "zh": "而是它從一開始就是一個特別的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 497.766,
          "end": 501.633,
          "en": "It's managed by React somewhere in memory.",
          "zh": "它是由 React 在記憶體中的某處管理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 501.633,
          "end": 501.83299999999997,
          "en": "It's managed by React somewhere in memory.",
          "zh": "它是由 React 在記憶體中的某處管理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 501.83299999999997,
          "end": 504.933,
          "en": "And when we call this state updating function,",
          "zh": "而當我們呼叫這個 state 更新函式時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 504.933,
          "end": 509.7,
          "en": "this special variable will not just receive a new value",
          "zh": "這個特別的變數不只是會收到一個新值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 509.7,
          "end": 512,
          "en": "but, and that's important,",
          "zh": "而是，這點很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 512,
          "end": 515.1659999999999,
          "en": "the component function in which you called",
          "zh": "那個你在其中呼叫了"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 515.1659999999999,
          "end": 517.066,
          "en": "this state updating function.",
          "zh": "這個 state 更新函式的元件函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 517.066,
          "end": 521.366,
          "en": "And in which you initialized your state with useState",
          "zh": "而且你在其中用 useState 初始化了你的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 521.366,
          "end": 523.866,
          "en": "will be executed again.",
          "zh": "這個元件函式會再次被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 523.866,
          "end": 526.2,
          "en": "And that is exactly what we need.",
          "zh": "而這正是我們需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 526.2,
          "end": 529.333,
          "en": "We want to call this component function again",
          "zh": "我們希望再次呼叫這個元件函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 529.333,
          "end": 532.366,
          "en": "when our state changes.",
          "zh": "每當我們的 state 改變時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 532.366,
          "end": 532.633,
          "en": "when our state changes.",
          "zh": "每當我們的 state 改變時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 532.633,
          "end": 535.433,
          "en": "And by calling this state updating function",
          "zh": "而透過呼叫這個 state 更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 535.433,
          "end": 536.966,
          "en": "that's happening.",
          "zh": "這就會發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 536.966,
          "end": 538.7,
          "en": "Because by calling this function,",
          "zh": "因為透過呼叫這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 538.7,
          "end": 542.433,
          "en": "you're telling React that you wanna assign a new value",
          "zh": "你是在告訴 React，你想指定一個新值"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 542.433,
          "end": 543.8,
          "en": "to this state.",
          "zh": "給這個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 543.8,
          "end": 544.066,
          "en": "to this state.",
          "zh": "給這個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 544.066,
          "end": 546.6,
          "en": "And that then also tells React",
          "zh": "而那也會告訴 React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 546.6,
          "end": 550.366,
          "en": "that the component in which this staid was registered",
          "zh": "這個 state 註冊所在的那個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 550.366,
          "end": 554.733,
          "en": "with useState should be re-evaluated.",
          "zh": "也就是用 useState 註冊的元件，應該被重新評估。"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 554.733,
          "end": 556.866,
          "en": "And therefore React will go ahead",
          "zh": "因此，React 會繼續"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 556.866,
          "end": 559.5,
          "en": "and execute this component function again,",
          "zh": "再次執行這個元件函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 559.5,
          "end": 564.6,
          "en": "and therefore also evaluate this JSX code again.",
          "zh": "因此也會再次評估這段 JSX 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 564.6,
          "end": 565.233,
          "en": "and therefore also evaluate this JSX code again.",
          "zh": "因此也會再次評估這段 JSX 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 565.233,
          "end": 569.333,
          "en": "And then it will draw any changes which it's detects",
          "zh": "然後它會把它偵測到的任何變更繪製出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 569.333,
          "end": 574.366,
          "en": "compared to the last time it evaluated this onto the screen.",
          "zh": "相較於上一次評估的結果，繪製到畫面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 574.366,
          "end": 576.333,
          "en": "So if we now save everything,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們現在儲存所有內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 576.333,
          "end": 578,
          "en": "if I click Change Title,",
          "zh": "如果我點擊 Change Title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 578,
          "end": 581.633,
          "en": "you see the title changes to updated",
          "zh": "你會看到這個 title 變成 updated，"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 581.633,
          "end": 581.7,
          "en": "you see the title changes to updated",
          "zh": "你會看到這個 title 變成 updated，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 581.7,
          "end": 585.1659999999999,
          "en": "for the ExpenseItem in which we're doing this.",
          "zh": "對於我們正在這麼做的這個 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 585.1659999999999,
          "end": 589.633,
          "en": "And that's now how this works.",
          "zh": "而這就是它現在的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 589.633,
          "end": 592.266,
          "en": "Now you will notice that these console locks",
          "zh": "現在你會注意到，這些 console log"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 592.266,
          "end": 592.466,
          "en": "Now you will notice that these console locks",
          "zh": "現在你會注意到，這些 console log"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 592.466,
          "end": 596.233,
          "en": "still show the title before it was updated.",
          "zh": "仍然顯示更新之前的 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 596.233,
          "end": 598.366,
          "en": "The reason for this is that calling",
          "zh": "原因是，呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 598.366,
          "end": 600.433,
          "en": "this state updating function",
          "zh": "這個 state 更新函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 600.433,
          "end": 603.3,
          "en": "actually doesn't change the value right away,",
          "zh": "實際上並不會立刻改變這個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 603.3,
          "end": 607.066,
          "en": "but instead schedules this state update.",
          "zh": "而是排程這個 state 更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 607.066,
          "end": 609.133,
          "en": "So in the very next line thereafter,",
          "zh": "所以在緊接著的下一行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 609.133,
          "end": 612,
          "en": "this new value isn't available yet.",
          "zh": "這個新值還無法取得。"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 612,
          "end": 614.366,
          "en": "That's why we see the old value being locked",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們看到舊的值被記錄下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 614.366,
          "end": 617.666,
          "en": "even though we updated it before logging.",
          "zh": "即使我們在記錄之前已經更新了它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 617.666,
          "end": 618.933,
          "en": "But you do see",
          "zh": "但你的確會看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 618.933,
          "end": 621.933,
          "en": "that eventually this component is called again",
          "zh": "最終這個元件會再次被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 621.933,
          "end": 623.733,
          "en": "and is evaluated again.",
          "zh": "並再次被評估。"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 623.733,
          "end": 629.566,
          "en": "And that therefore we see our updated value on the screen.",
          "zh": "因此我們在畫面上看到更新後的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 629.566,
          "end": 630.233,
          "en": "And that therefore we see our updated value on the screen.",
          "zh": "因此我們在畫面上看到更新後的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 630.233,
          "end": 632.433,
          "en": "That's how React state works.",
          "zh": "這就是 React state 的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 632.433,
          "end": 636.3,
          "en": "And this is another key concept in React.",
          "zh": "而這是 React 中另一個關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 636.3,
          "end": 639.5,
          "en": "If you have data, which might change,",
          "zh": "如果你有資料，而它可能會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 639.5,
          "end": 642.6659999999999,
          "en": "and where changes to that data should be reflected",
          "zh": "而且該資料的變更應該反映"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 642.6659999999999,
          "end": 644.5,
          "en": "on the user interface",
          "zh": "在使用者介面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 644.5,
          "end": 647.033,
          "en": "then you need state",
          "zh": "那麼你就需要 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 647.033,
          "end": 650.1,
          "en": "because a regular variables will not do the trick",
          "zh": "因為一般變數沒辦法達到這個效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 650.1,
          "end": 654.1659999999999,
          "en": "with state, however you can set and change values.",
          "zh": "不過，有了 state，你就可以設定和改變值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 654.1659999999999,
          "end": 655.633,
          "en": "And when they do change,",
          "zh": "而當它們真的改變時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 655.633,
          "end": 658.333,
          "en": "React will re-evaluate the component",
          "zh": "React 會重新評估那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 658.333,
          "end": 660.533,
          "en": "in which the state was registered.",
          "zh": "註冊了這個 state 的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 660.533,
          "end": 663.133,
          "en": "And only that component, by the way",
          "zh": "而且順帶一提，只有那個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 663.133,
          "end": 664.933,
          "en": "not any other components,",
          "zh": "不是任何其他元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 664.933,
          "end": 669.4,
          "en": "just this component in which this state was registered.",
          "zh": "就只有這個註冊了這個 state 的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 669.4,
          "end": 671.2,
          "en": "Now let's take a closer look",
          "zh": "現在讓我們更仔細地看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 671.2,
          "end": 673.5,
          "en": "at the state and why we use const.",
          "zh": "state，以及為什麼我們使用 const，"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 673.5,
          "end": 675.666,
          "en": "And how does all works in detail.",
          "zh": "以及這一切在細節上是如何運作的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595974",
      "title": "A Closer Look at the \"useState\" Hook",
      "sourceHash": "bd124f7aa740c7e07a057081509095b401583493cae98d41475426fc640109c8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.3,
          "end": 4.033,
          "en": "Tutor: So now we learned about State.",
          "zh": "Tutor：所以我們現在學到了 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.033,
          "end": 6.4,
          "en": "And State as you can probably tell by now",
          "zh": "而 State，你現在大概已經看得出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.4,
          "end": 8.966,
          "en": "is a key concept in React.",
          "zh": "是 React 中一個關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.966,
          "end": 10.733,
          "en": "Now, there are a couple of things",
          "zh": "那麼，有幾件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.733,
          "end": 12.933,
          "en": "I wanna clarify about useState",
          "zh": "我想針對 useState 釐清一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.933,
          "end": 16.633,
          "en": "and about why we use a const here, for example.",
          "zh": "還有例如為什麼我們這裡要用 const。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.633,
          "end": 19.3,
          "en": "Now, first let's start with one important thing,",
          "zh": "首先，我們從一件重要的事情開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.3,
          "end": 21.5,
          "en": "which I did mention in the last lecture already.",
          "zh": "這件事我在上一堂課其實已經提過了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.5,
          "end": 25.166,
          "en": "UseState registers some State,",
          "zh": "useState 會註冊一些 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.166,
          "end": 27.633,
          "en": "so some value as a State",
          "zh": "也就是把某個值註冊為 State"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.633,
          "end": 30.933,
          "en": "for the component in which it is being called.",
          "zh": "給呼叫它的那個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.933,
          "end": 34.066,
          "en": "And I wanna be even more precise here.",
          "zh": "而我想在這裡說得更精確一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.066,
          "end": 38.433,
          "en": "It registers it for a specific component instance.",
          "zh": "它是為某個特定的元件實例註冊的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.433,
          "end": 40.566,
          "en": "For example, ExpenseItem here",
          "zh": "舉例來說，這裡的 ExpenseItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.566,
          "end": 43.433,
          "en": "is being used four times, right?",
          "zh": "被使用了四次，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.433,
          "end": 47.966,
          "en": "And Expenses.js we have four ExpenseItems.",
          "zh": "而在 Expenses.js 裡我們有四個 ExpenseItem。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.966,
          "end": 52.233,
          "en": "Now, every item receives its own separate State",
          "zh": "現在，每一個 item 都會收到自己獨立的 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.233,
          "end": 55.3,
          "en": "which is detached from the other States.",
          "zh": "它與其他的 State 彼此獨立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.3,
          "end": 55.766,
          "en": "which is detached from the other States.",
          "zh": "它與其他的 State 彼此獨立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.766,
          "end": 58.466,
          "en": "We have one ExpenseItem definition here,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡只有一份 ExpenseItem 的定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.466,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "but then this function is basically called four times",
          "zh": "但這個函式基本上會被呼叫四次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 65.3,
          "en": "when we create four ExpenseItems.",
          "zh": "當我們建立四個 ExpenseItem 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.3,
          "end": 65.733,
          "en": "when we create four ExpenseItems.",
          "zh": "當我們建立四個 ExpenseItem 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.733,
          "end": 70.333,
          "en": "And every time it's called, a new separate State is created",
          "zh": "而每次它被呼叫時，都會建立一個新的獨立 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.333,
          "end": 71.966,
          "en": "of course in the same way",
          "zh": "當然，方式都一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.966,
          "end": 76,
          "en": "but managed independently by React.",
          "zh": "但由 React 獨立管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76,
          "end": 76.43299999999999,
          "en": "but managed independently by React.",
          "zh": "但由 React 獨立管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.43299999999999,
          "end": 78.333,
          "en": "So if we change the title",
          "zh": "所以如果我們改變標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.333,
          "end": 82.5,
          "en": "in the first ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "在第一個 ExpenseItem 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.5,
          "end": 84.46600000000001,
          "en": "the other ones are not affected",
          "zh": "其他的並不會受到影響，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.46600000000001,
          "end": 86.9,
          "en": "because they have their own State.",
          "zh": "因為它們有各自的 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.9,
          "end": 88.1,
          "en": "That's really important.",
          "zh": "這真的非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.1,
          "end": 92.43299999999999,
          "en": "It's on a per component instance basis.",
          "zh": "這是以每個元件實例為單位的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.43299999999999,
          "end": 92.7,
          "en": "It's on a per component instance basis.",
          "zh": "這是以每個元件實例為單位的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.7,
          "end": 94.63300000000001,
          "en": "So we have separate States,",
          "zh": "所以我們有各自獨立的 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.63300000000001,
          "end": 98.566,
          "en": "even if we create a component more than once.",
          "zh": "即使我們把同一個元件建立了不只一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.566,
          "end": 98.666,
          "en": "even if we create a component more than once.",
          "zh": "即使我們把同一個元件建立了不只一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.666,
          "end": 100.566,
          "en": "And that's of course crucial",
          "zh": "而這當然至關重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.566,
          "end": 103.76599999999999,
          "en": "because it would be a rather undesired behavior",
          "zh": "因為那會是相當不想要的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.76599999999999,
          "end": 106.5,
          "en": "if we change something in one item",
          "zh": "如果我們在某個 item 裡改了東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.5,
          "end": 109.63300000000001,
          "en": "and all the other items are updated as well.",
          "zh": "結果所有其他的 item 也都跟著更新了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.63300000000001,
          "end": 113.76599999999999,
          "en": "So that's a good thing to have.",
          "zh": "所以這是件好事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.76599999999999,
          "end": 116.9,
          "en": "Now, in addition, whenever State changes",
          "zh": "另外，每當 State 改變時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.9,
          "end": 119.1,
          "en": "because we click a button in this case",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡是因為我們點了按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.1,
          "end": 121.433,
          "en": "it's only this component function",
          "zh": "就只有這個元件函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.433,
          "end": 123.9,
          "en": "and only that specific instance",
          "zh": "而且只有那個特定的實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.9,
          "end": 126.1,
          "en": "where this component is being used",
          "zh": "也就是這個元件被使用的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.1,
          "end": 129.466,
          "en": "where React will re-evaluate it.",
          "zh": "React 才會重新評估它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.466,
          "end": 129.966,
          "en": "where React will re-evaluate it.",
          "zh": "React 才會重新評估它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 129.966,
          "end": 132.166,
          "en": "And you can tell that this is the fact",
          "zh": "而你可以看出事情確實如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.166,
          "end": 135.566,
          "en": "if you add a number of console.log here",
          "zh": "如果你在這裡加上幾個 console.log，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.566,
          "end": 137.6,
          "en": "in the component, function itself,",
          "zh": "就在元件函式本身裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.6,
          "end": 138.03300000000002,
          "en": "in the component, function itself,",
          "zh": "就在元件函式本身裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 138.03300000000002,
          "end": 145.066,
          "en": "where you say ExpenseItem evaluated by React.",
          "zh": "寫上像 ExpenseItem evaluated by React 這樣的訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 145.066,
          "end": 147.666,
          "en": "This will be called whenever the ExpenseItem",
          "zh": "每當 ExpenseItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.666,
          "end": 151.266,
          "en": "component function is being executed.",
          "zh": "元件函式被執行時，它就會被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.266,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "component function is being executed.",
          "zh": "元件函式被執行時，它就會被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 156.266,
          "en": "And therefore if I reload, we see it's called four times",
          "zh": "因此如果我重新載入，就會看到它被呼叫了四次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 156.266,
          "end": 156.833,
          "en": "And therefore if I reload, we see it's called four times",
          "zh": "因此如果我重新載入，就會看到它被呼叫了四次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.833,
          "end": 158.03300000000002,
          "en": "which makes a lot of sense",
          "zh": "這非常合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 158.03300000000002,
          "end": 162.53300000000002,
          "en": "because we're using ExpenseItem four times in expenses.",
          "zh": "因為我們在 expenses 裡使用了 ExpenseItem 四次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.53300000000002,
          "end": 162.666,
          "en": "because we're using ExpenseItem four times in expenses.",
          "zh": "因為我們在 expenses 裡使用了 ExpenseItem 四次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 162.666,
          "end": 164.766,
          "en": "So four separate instances",
          "zh": "所以有四個獨立的實例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 164.766,
          "end": 168.466,
          "en": "of this component are being created.",
          "zh": "這個元件的實例被建立出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 168.466,
          "end": 170.733,
          "en": "But if I now click on change title",
          "zh": "但如果我現在點擊 change title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 170.733,
          "end": 172.933,
          "en": "in one of the ExpenseItems,",
          "zh": "在其中一個 ExpenseItem 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 172.933,
          "end": 175.6,
          "en": "we see it's only printed once.",
          "zh": "就會看到它只被印出一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 175.6,
          "end": 176.966,
          "en": "Which is basically happening",
          "zh": "這基本上會發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 176.966,
          "end": 179.133,
          "en": "because of what I just explained.",
          "zh": "就是因為我剛剛解釋的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 179.133,
          "end": 182.433,
          "en": "Only that specific instance is being updated",
          "zh": "只有那個特定的實例被更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 182.433,
          "end": 184.833,
          "en": "and therefore for being re-evaluated,",
          "zh": "也因此被重新評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 184.833,
          "end": 184.933,
          "en": "and therefore for being re-evaluated,",
          "zh": "也因此被重新評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 184.933,
          "end": 188,
          "en": "and the other instances are not affected",
          "zh": "而其他的實例不會受到影響，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 188,
          "end": 190.433,
          "en": "by that State change.",
          "zh": "受到那次 State 變更的影響。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 190.433,
          "end": 192.233,
          "en": "And that's important to keep in mind",
          "zh": "而這點很重要，要記住，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.233,
          "end": 194.666,
          "en": "that State really is separated",
          "zh": "State 真的是彼此分開的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 194.666,
          "end": 198.7,
          "en": "on a per component instance basis.",
          "zh": "以每個元件實例為單位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 198.7,
          "end": 201.5,
          "en": "Now there's one other thing which could be confusing.",
          "zh": "現在還有一件事可能會讓人困惑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 201.5,
          "end": 204.633,
          "en": "And that's the fact that I'm using const here.",
          "zh": "那就是我在這裡使用了 const。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 204.633,
          "end": 206.766,
          "en": "Why am I using const here",
          "zh": "為什麼我這裡要用 const，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 206.766,
          "end": 211.133,
          "en": "when we do eventually assign a new value?",
          "zh": "當我們最終確實會指定一個新值的時候？"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 211.133,
          "end": 212.633,
          "en": "Well, keep in mind",
          "zh": "嗯，請記住，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 212.633,
          "end": 215.733,
          "en": "that we're not assigning a value with the equal sign.",
          "zh": "我們並不是用等號來指定值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 215.733,
          "end": 217.433,
          "en": "That would indeed fail",
          "zh": "那樣確實會失敗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 217.433,
          "end": 220.266,
          "en": "but that is not how we assign a new value",
          "zh": "但那不是我們指定新值的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 220.266,
          "end": 222.166,
          "en": "when we update a State.",
          "zh": "當我們更新 State 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 222.166,
          "end": 222.5,
          "en": "when we update a State.",
          "zh": "當我們更新 State 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 222.5,
          "end": 225.53300000000002,
          "en": "Instead we call this State updating function,",
          "zh": "我們改為呼叫這個 State 更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 225.53300000000002,
          "end": 229.833,
          "en": "and the concrete value is simply managed somewhere else",
          "zh": "而實際的值只是被管理在其他地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 229.833,
          "end": 231.03300000000002,
          "en": "by React.",
          "zh": "由 React 管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 231.03300000000002,
          "end": 234.03300000000002,
          "en": "By calling useState we tell React",
          "zh": "透過呼叫 useState，我們告訴 React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 234.03300000000002,
          "end": 236.6,
          "en": "that it should manage some value for us.",
          "zh": "它應該替我們管理某個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 236.6,
          "end": 240.633,
          "en": "We never see that variable itself.",
          "zh": "我們永遠不會看到那個變數本身。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 240.633,
          "end": 243.3,
          "en": "So therefore, we just call a function",
          "zh": "所以，我們只是呼叫一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 243.3,
          "end": 243.366,
          "en": "So therefore, we just call a function",
          "zh": "所以，我們只是呼叫一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 243.366,
          "end": 246.2,
          "en": "and we never assign a new value to title",
          "zh": "而我們從不指定新的值給 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 246.2,
          "end": 248.7,
          "en": "with the equal operator.",
          "zh": "用等號運算子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 248.7,
          "end": 248.833,
          "en": "with the equal operator.",
          "zh": "用等號運算子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 248.833,
          "end": 252.766,
          "en": "And therefore, using a const is absolutely fine.",
          "zh": "因此，使用 const 完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 252.766,
          "end": 256.1,
          "en": "How do we get the latest title value then though?",
          "zh": "那我們又要怎麼取得最新的 title 值呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 256.1,
          "end": 258.433,
          "en": "Well, keep in mind that the component function",
          "zh": "嗯，請記住，元件函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 258.433,
          "end": 261.33299999999997,
          "en": "is re-executed when the State is updated.",
          "zh": "會在 State 更新時重新執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 261.33299999999997,
          "end": 261.4,
          "en": "is re-executed when the State is updated.",
          "zh": "會在 State 更新時重新執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 261.4,
          "end": 263.766,
          "en": "And therefore, of course, this line of code,",
          "zh": "因此，當然，這一行程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 263.766,
          "end": 266.9,
          "en": "line nine, also is executed again",
          "zh": "第九行，也會再次被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 266.9,
          "end": 270.8,
          "en": "whenever the component function is executed again.",
          "zh": "每當元件函式再次被執行時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 270.8,
          "end": 273.233,
          "en": "So if we called setTitle",
          "zh": "所以如果我們呼叫了 setTitle，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 273.233,
          "end": 275.266,
          "en": "and we assign a new title,",
          "zh": "並指定了一個新的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 275.266,
          "end": 278.5,
          "en": "that leads to this component being called again",
          "zh": "那會導致這個元件再次被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 278.5,
          "end": 278.733,
          "en": "that leads to this component being called again",
          "zh": "那會導致這個元件再次被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 278.733,
          "end": 283.733,
          "en": "and therefore, this new title, this updated title",
          "zh": "因此，這個新的 title、這個更新後的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 283.733,
          "end": 286.533,
          "en": "is fetched from React, which manages the State for us.",
          "zh": "會從 React 取得，因為 React 替我們管理 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 286.533,
          "end": 288.9,
          "en": "is fetched from React, which manages the State for us.",
          "zh": "會從 React 取得，因為 React 替我們管理 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 290.533,
          "en": "Basically we go to React",
          "zh": "基本上我們會去找 React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 290.533,
          "end": 294.5,
          "en": "and say, \"Hey please give me that latest title State",
          "zh": "並說：「嘿，請把最新的 title State 給我，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 294.5,
          "end": 297,
          "en": "which I told you to manage for me.\"",
          "zh": "就是我請你替我管理的那個。」"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 297,
          "end": 300.866,
          "en": "And React provides us this latest State in this array",
          "zh": "而 React 會在這個陣列中提供給我們最新的 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 300.866,
          "end": 304.066,
          "en": "which useState always returns.",
          "zh": "這是 useState 總是回傳的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 304.066,
          "end": 304.6,
          "en": "which useState always returns.",
          "zh": "這是 useState 總是回傳的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 304.6,
          "end": 307.5,
          "en": "So we always get a brand new snapshot",
          "zh": "所以我們總是會拿到一份全新的快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 307.5,
          "end": 312,
          "en": "of that State when this component function re-executes.",
          "zh": "在元件函式重新執行時取得該 State 的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 312,
          "end": 315.8,
          "en": "That's how this works under the hood.",
          "zh": "這就是它在底層運作的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 315.8,
          "end": 318.5,
          "en": "Now you might be wondering if that doesn't mean",
          "zh": "現在你可能會想，這是不是代表"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 318.5,
          "end": 321.9,
          "en": "that we always overwrite any State changes",
          "zh": "我們總是會覆寫掉所有的 State 變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 321.9,
          "end": 324.4,
          "en": "with props.title again, here.",
          "zh": "又用 props.title 蓋掉，在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 324.4,
          "end": 324.6,
          "en": "with props.title again, here.",
          "zh": "又用 props.title 蓋掉，在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 324.6,
          "end": 328.133,
          "en": "And here, the special thing is that React keeps track",
          "zh": "而這裡特別的地方是，React 會追蹤"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 328.133,
          "end": 331.866,
          "en": "of when we call useState in a given component instance",
          "zh": "我們在特定的元件實例中何時第一次呼叫 useState，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 331.866,
          "end": 333.83299999999997,
          "en": "for the first time.",
          "zh": "也就是第一次呼叫的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 333.83299999999997,
          "end": 336.633,
          "en": "And when we call it for the first time ever,",
          "zh": "而當我們有史以來第一次呼叫它時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 336.633,
          "end": 339.6,
          "en": "it'll take that argument as an initial value.",
          "zh": "它會把那個參數當作初始值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 339.6,
          "end": 339.83299999999997,
          "en": "it'll take that argument as an initial value.",
          "zh": "它會把那個參數當作初始值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 339.83299999999997,
          "end": 342.9,
          "en": "But if a component is then re-executed",
          "zh": "但如果某個元件之後被重新執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 342.9,
          "end": 345.666,
          "en": "because of such a State change, for example,",
          "zh": "例如因為這樣的 State 變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 345.666,
          "end": 349.266,
          "en": "React will not reinitialize the State.",
          "zh": "React 並不會重新初始化該 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 349.266,
          "end": 353.06600000000003,
          "en": "Instead, it will detect that this State had been initialized",
          "zh": "相反地，它會偵測到這個 State 過去已經被初始化過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 353.06600000000003,
          "end": 356.533,
          "en": "in the past, and it will just grab the latest State",
          "zh": "然後它只會抓取最新的 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 356.533,
          "end": 359.166,
          "en": "which is based on some State update, for example,",
          "zh": "例如那是基於某次 State 更新而來的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 359.166,
          "end": 362.233,
          "en": "and give us that State instead.",
          "zh": "並改為給我們那個 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 362.233,
          "end": 362.533,
          "en": "and give us that State instead.",
          "zh": "並改為給我們那個 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 362.533,
          "end": 365.9,
          "en": "So this initial value is really only considered",
          "zh": "所以這個初始值其實只有在"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 365.9,
          "end": 368.633,
          "en": "when this component function is being executed",
          "zh": "當這個元件函式被執行時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 368.633,
          "end": 373.333,
          "en": "for the first time, for a given component instance.",
          "zh": "第一次、針對特定的元件實例，才會被納入考慮。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 373.333,
          "end": 376.966,
          "en": "And I know that this is a lot of knowledge about State",
          "zh": "我知道這是很多關於 State 的知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 376.966,
          "end": 380.033,
          "en": "and it might be confusing to a certain extent.",
          "zh": "而且某種程度上可能會讓人困惑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 380.033,
          "end": 380.366,
          "en": "and it might be confusing to a certain extent.",
          "zh": "而且某種程度上可能會讓人困惑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 380.366,
          "end": 381.933,
          "en": "It is just important",
          "zh": "重點只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 381.933,
          "end": 384.766,
          "en": "to understand how State works under the hood,",
          "zh": "要了解 State 在底層是如何運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 384.766,
          "end": 387.83299999999997,
          "en": "because if you're don't fully understand that",
          "zh": "因為如果你沒有完全理解這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 387.83299999999997,
          "end": 389.7,
          "en": "then you will run into problems",
          "zh": "那麼你就會遇到問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 389.7,
          "end": 392.166,
          "en": "in more complex React applications",
          "zh": "在更複雜的 React 應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 392.166,
          "end": 392.366,
          "en": "in more complex React applications",
          "zh": "在更複雜的 React 應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 392.366,
          "end": 395.766,
          "en": "where suddenly some value isn't updated",
          "zh": "某些值突然沒有更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 395.766,
          "end": 397.766,
          "en": "as you expected it to be.",
          "zh": "如你預期的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 397.766,
          "end": 401.033,
          "en": "That's why I'm explaining this in great detail.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我要這麼詳細地解釋。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 401.033,
          "end": 404.8,
          "en": "In a nutshell, using State is simple though.",
          "zh": "不過，簡單來說，使用 State 其實很簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 404.8,
          "end": 404.866,
          "en": "In a nutshell, using State is simple though.",
          "zh": "不過，簡單來說，使用 State 其實很簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 404.866,
          "end": 407.7,
          "en": "You just register State with useState,",
          "zh": "你只要用 useState 註冊 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 407.7,
          "end": 410.466,
          "en": "you always get back two values;",
          "zh": "你總是會拿回兩個值；"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 410.466,
          "end": 410.633,
          "en": "you always get back two values;",
          "zh": "你總是會拿回兩個值；"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 410.633,
          "end": 413.5,
          "en": "the value itself and the updating function.",
          "zh": "值本身以及更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 413.5,
          "end": 415.33299999999997,
          "en": "You call the updating function",
          "zh": "你在 State 應該改變時"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 415.33299999999997,
          "end": 417.8,
          "en": "whenever the State should change,",
          "zh": "呼叫更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 417.8,
          "end": 418.166,
          "en": "whenever the State should change,",
          "zh": "呼叫更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 418.166,
          "end": 420.033,
          "en": "and you use that first element",
          "zh": "而你在想使用 State 值時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 420.033,
          "end": 422.233,
          "en": "whenever you wanna use the State value,",
          "zh": "就使用第一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 422.233,
          "end": 425.633,
          "en": "like here for outputting it in the JSX code.",
          "zh": "就像這裡，把它輸出到 JSX 程式碼中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 425.633,
          "end": 427.3,
          "en": "And React, will do the rest",
          "zh": "而 React 會處理剩下的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 427.3,
          "end": 430.4,
          "en": "and it will re-execute the component function",
          "zh": "它會重新執行元件函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 430.4,
          "end": 433.7,
          "en": "and re-evaluate the JSX code therefore;",
          "zh": "並因此重新評估 JSX 程式碼；"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 433.7,
          "end": 435.933,
          "en": "whenever the State changes.",
          "zh": "每當 State 改變時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 435.933,
          "end": 439.166,
          "en": "That's State and that's an important concept",
          "zh": "這就是 State，而這是個重要的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 439.166,
          "end": 443.83299999999997,
          "en": "because it's State which adds reactivity to our application.",
          "zh": "因為正是 State 為我們的應用程式加入了反應性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 443.83299999999997,
          "end": 448.266,
          "en": "Without State, our user interface would never change.",
          "zh": "沒有 State，我們的使用者介面永遠不會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 448.266,
          "end": 448.433,
          "en": "Without State, our user interface would never change.",
          "zh": "沒有 State，我們的使用者介面永遠不會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 448.433,
          "end": 452.433,
          "en": "But with State and with listening to events,",
          "zh": "但有了 State，並且監聽事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 452.433,
          "end": 455.933,
          "en": "we can make sure that we can react to user input",
          "zh": "我們就能確保可以對使用者的輸入做出反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 455.933,
          "end": 458.433,
          "en": "and that such input can result",
          "zh": "並且這樣的輸入可以導致"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 458.433,
          "end": 461.733,
          "en": "in a visible change on our screen.",
          "zh": "螢幕上可見的變化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 461.733,
          "end": 464.633,
          "en": "So State is a super important concept",
          "zh": "所以 State 是個超級重要的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 464.633,
          "end": 467.3,
          "en": "and of course being able to listen to user events",
          "zh": "而當然，能夠監聽使用者事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 467.3,
          "end": 469.33299999999997,
          "en": "is also important as you can tell.",
          "zh": "也同樣重要，正如你所看到的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595982",
      "title": "Adding Form Inputs",
      "sourceHash": "78445f3eac9e19314db3d4fc115c1aa7f9a8c731384a8b347f6631ff8175c544",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.266,
          "end": 5.166,
          "en": "Maximilian: Now that we know what state is and now",
          "zh": "Maximilian：現在我們知道 state 是什麼了，而且現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.166,
          "end": 9.6,
          "en": "that we also understand how we can listen to events,",
          "zh": "我們也了解如何監聽事件了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.6,
          "end": 12.5,
          "en": "we can continue working on this application",
          "zh": "我們可以繼續開發這個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.5,
          "end": 16.7,
          "en": "and turn this more and more into an expense tracker.",
          "zh": "並逐漸把它變成一個支出追蹤器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.7,
          "end": 19.066,
          "en": "And one important piece is missing.",
          "zh": "而且有一個重要的部分還缺少了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.066,
          "end": 23.466,
          "en": "For example, well, the capability to gather user input",
          "zh": "例如，收集使用者輸入的能力"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.466,
          "end": 23.733,
          "en": "For example, well, the capability to gather user input",
          "zh": "例如，收集使用者輸入的能力"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.733,
          "end": 26.833,
          "en": "so that users can add their own expenses.",
          "zh": "讓使用者可以新增自己的支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.833,
          "end": 26.9,
          "en": "so that users can add their own expenses.",
          "zh": "讓使用者可以新增自己的支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.9,
          "end": 30.2,
          "en": "This sounds fairly important for an expense tracker",
          "zh": "這對一個支出追蹤器來說聽起來相當重要"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.2,
          "end": 32.766,
          "en": "and up to this point, that's not possible.",
          "zh": "而到目前為止，這是不可能的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.766,
          "end": 34.733,
          "en": "So that's what we'll work on next.",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們接下來要處理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.733,
          "end": 39.066,
          "en": "And for that, I will, first of all, add new components",
          "zh": "為此，我首先要新增一些新的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.066,
          "end": 42.166,
          "en": "and I'll add a new category of components.",
          "zh": "而且我會新增一個新的元件類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.166,
          "end": 44.066,
          "en": "You could say, because thus far",
          "zh": "可以這麼說，因為到目前為止"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.066,
          "end": 46.4,
          "en": "the expense components we have here are",
          "zh": "我們這裡的支出元件都是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.4,
          "end": 47.233,
          "en": "about outputting expenses about showing these expenses here.",
          "zh": "用來輸出支出，用來在這裡顯示這些支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.233,
          "end": 51.5,
          "en": "about outputting expenses about showing these expenses here.",
          "zh": "用來輸出支出，用來在這裡顯示這些支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.5,
          "end": 55.233,
          "en": "Now I want to gather user input and therefore",
          "zh": "現在我想要收集使用者輸入，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.233,
          "end": 58.433,
          "en": "I'll add a new sub folder in the components folder",
          "zh": "我會在 components 資料夾中新增一個子資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.433,
          "end": 62.766,
          "en": "and I'll simply name it new expense because ultimately",
          "zh": "而我會直接把它命名為 new expense，因為最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.766,
          "end": 65.866,
          "en": "that will be what the components here are about.",
          "zh": "這裡的元件就是為了這個用途。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.866,
          "end": 70,
          "en": "About gathering the input for a new expense.",
          "zh": "用來收集新增支出的輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70,
          "end": 72.6,
