          "start": 338.166,
          "end": 341.133,
          "en": "going to add listeners to wait for user input.",
          "zh": "就會加入監聽器來等待使用者輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 341.133,
          "end": 344.56600000000003,
          "en": "And we're soon going to manage some state with that.",
          "zh": "我們很快也會用它們來管理一些 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 344.56600000000003,
          "end": 346.6,
          "en": "So this is some crucial groundwork",
          "zh": "所以這是一些關鍵的基礎工作"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 346.6,
          "end": 348.866,
          "en": "which we have to do first.",
          "zh": "是我們必須先完成的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 348.866,
          "end": 349.433,
          "en": "which we have to do first.",
          "zh": "是我們必須先完成的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 349.433,
          "end": 353.133,
          "en": "Now we can copy this div with the label and title",
          "zh": "現在我們可以複製這個帶有 label 和 title 的 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 353.133,
          "end": 357.533,
          "en": "and duplicate it to also have a input for the amount",
          "zh": "並再複製一份，來加入一個金額的 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 357.533,
          "end": 357.866,
          "en": "and duplicate it to also have a input for the amount",
          "zh": "並再複製一份，來加入一個金額的 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 357.866,
          "end": 360.633,
          "en": "the type here could be number.",
          "zh": "這裡的 type 可以是 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 360.633,
          "end": 361.533,
          "en": "And we could set a minimum, a minimum value",
          "zh": "我們也可以設定一個最小值，最小值"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 361.533,
          "end": 362.833,
          "en": "And we could set a minimum, a minimum value",
          "zh": "我們也可以設定一個最小值，最小值"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 362.833,
          "end": 365.533,
          "en": "of zero dot zero one",
          "zh": "為 0.01"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 365.533,
          "end": 369.8,
          "en": "and set up a step of zero dot zero one as well.",
          "zh": "並同樣把 step 設定為 0.01。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 369.8,
          "end": 369.933,
          "en": "and set up a step of zero dot zero one as well.",
          "zh": "並同樣把 step 設定為 0.01。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 369.933,
          "end": 373.4,
          "en": "And these are just default HTML attributes",
          "zh": "而這些只是 input 元素的"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 373.4,
          "end": 375.066,
          "en": "for input elements",
          "zh": "預設 HTML 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 375.066,
          "end": 379.6,
          "en": "which control how this element can be used.",
          "zh": "用來控制這個元素可以如何使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 379.6,
          "end": 382.83299999999997,
          "en": "And last but not least I'll replicate the div",
          "zh": "最後同樣重要的是，我會複製這個 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 382.83299999999997,
          "end": 386.9,
          "en": "One more time to also provide an input for the date",
          "zh": "再一次，來加入一個日期的 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 386.9,
          "end": 389.366,
          "en": "set the type here to date",
          "zh": "把這裡的 type 設為 date"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 389.366,
          "end": 389.5,
          "en": "set the type here to date",
          "zh": "把這裡的 type 設為 date"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 389.5,
          "end": 392.9,
          "en": "and this will then automatically give us a date picker.",
          "zh": "這樣就會自動給我們一個日期選擇器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 392.9,
          "end": 395.33299999999997,
          "en": "And I will also set up a min date",
          "zh": "我還會設定一個最小日期"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 395.33299999999997,
          "end": 401.33299999999997,
          "en": "and set this to January 1st, 2019 and add a max date",
          "zh": "把它設為 2019 年 1 月 1 日，並加上一個最大日期"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 401.33299999999997,
          "end": 407.33299999999997,
          "en": "which I'll set to 2022 and there December 31st.",
          "zh": "我會把它設為 2022 年 12 月 31 日。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 407.33299999999997,
          "end": 407.666,
          "en": "which I'll set to 2022 and there December 31st.",
          "zh": "我會把它設為 2022 年 12 月 31 日。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 407.666,
          "end": 410.266,
          "en": "And I'm picking this min and max date",
          "zh": "我之所以選擇這個最小和最大日期"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 410.266,
          "end": 414.233,
          "en": "because later we also want to add a filter where",
          "zh": "是因為之後我們還想加入一個篩選器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 414.233,
          "end": 419.8,
          "en": "we only provide the years 2019 to 2022 for filtering.",
          "zh": "我們只提供 2019 到 2022 年來做篩選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 419.8,
          "end": 420.866,
          "en": "So I want to make sure",
          "zh": "所以我想要確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 420.866,
          "end": 425.3,
          "en": "that these are also the only years expenses can be set to.",
          "zh": "這些也是支出唯一可以設定的年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 425.3,
          "end": 427.8,
          "en": "Of course you can play around with these values.",
          "zh": "當然，你可以自由調整這些值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 427.8,
          "end": 433.2,
          "en": "These are just some example values I'm working with here.",
          "zh": "這些只是我在這裡使用的範例值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 433.2,
          "end": 435.2,
          "en": "Now we got all these inputs.",
          "zh": "現在我們有了所有這些 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 435.2,
          "end": 439.7,
          "en": "We now also need a button to submit the form",
          "zh": "我們現在還需要一個按鈕來提交表單"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 439.7,
          "end": 439.9,
          "en": "We now also need a button to submit the form",
          "zh": "我們現在還需要一個按鈕來提交表單"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 439.9,
          "end": 443.1,
          "en": "and therefore right before the form closes",
          "zh": "因此，就在 form 結束之前"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 443.1,
          "end": 444.2,
          "en": "I'll add a new div",
          "zh": "我會新增一個 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 444.2,
          "end": 447.233,
          "en": "next to the other div, which holds the controls.",
          "zh": "放在另一個容納 controls 的 div 旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 447.233,
          "end": 451.733,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add a new expense actions class",
          "zh": "在其中，我會加上 new expense actions 這個 class"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 451.733,
          "end": 456.33299999999997,
          "en": "like this new dash expense underscore underscore actions.",
          "zh": "像這樣：new-expense__actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 456.33299999999997,
          "end": 460.33299999999997,
          "en": "And then in there add a button where we say add expense",
          "zh": "然後在其中加入一個按鈕，寫著 Add Expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 460.33299999999997,
          "end": 462.233,
          "en": "like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 462.233,
          "end": 463.83299999999997,
          "en": "and I'll set the type",
          "zh": "我會把這個按鈕的 type"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 463.83299999999997,
          "end": 465.766,
          "en": "of this button to submit so that when this button is pressed",
          "zh": "設為 submit，這樣當這個按鈕被按下時"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 465.766,
          "end": 468.33299999999997,
          "en": "of this button to submit so that when this button is pressed",
          "zh": "設為 submit，這樣當這個按鈕被按下時"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 468.33299999999997,
          "end": 474.466,
          "en": "since it's inside of this form, this form will be submitted.",
          "zh": "由於它在這個表單裡面，這個表單就會被提交。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 474.466,
          "end": 477.3,
          "en": "Now, there was a lot of work on the expense form.",
          "zh": "好了，我們在 expense form 上做了不少工作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 477.3,
          "end": 481.7,
          "en": "Now we can use the expense form in the new expense component",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在 new expense 元件中使用 expense form"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 481.7,
          "end": 482.966,
          "en": "and therefore we of course want to",
          "zh": "因此我們當然想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 482.966,
          "end": 486.833,
          "en": "import our expense form functional component.",
          "zh": "import 我們的 expense form 函式元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 486.833,
          "end": 490.366,
          "en": "So this component function, we import this",
          "zh": "所以這個元件函式，我們像這樣 import 它"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 490.366,
          "end": 495.166,
          "en": "from new expense dot JS without the file extension",
          "zh": "從 new expense 這個 JS 檔案，不用加副檔名"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 495.166,
          "end": 496.4,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 496.4,
          "end": 500.033,
          "en": "And then here, we can just render this",
          "zh": "然後在這裡，我們就可以直接 render 這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 500.033,
          "end": 502.166,
          "en": "and add it as an HTML element",
          "zh": "並把它當作 HTML 元素加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 502.166,
          "end": 506.5,
          "en": "in our new expense function body",
          "zh": "在我們的 new expense 函式主體中"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 506.5,
          "end": 506.9,
          "en": "in our new expense function body",
          "zh": "在我們的 new expense 函式主體中"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 506.9,
          "end": 510.533,
          "en": "so that the new expense component will render the",
          "zh": "這樣 new expense 元件就會 render"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 510.533,
          "end": 511.766,
          "en": "expense form component.",
          "zh": "expense form 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 511.766,
          "end": 514.1,
          "en": "That should be expense form of course, my bad.",
          "zh": "那當然應該是 expense form，我的錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 514.1,
          "end": 516.266,
          "en": "So expense form is being rendered here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡 render 的是 expense form。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 516.266,
          "end": 519.933,
          "en": "And now when I rendered this entire new expense component",
          "zh": "而現在當我 render 這整個 new expense 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 519.933,
          "end": 524,
          "en": "in the App JS file, because in there in the end",
          "zh": "在 App JS 檔案中，因為最終在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 524,
          "end": 528.133,
          "en": "we're combining all these components.",
          "zh": "我們會組合所有這些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 528.133,
          "end": 532.6,
          "en": "So here I'll import new expense from dot slash",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會 import new expense，來源是"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 532.6,
          "end": 537.9,
          "en": "components slash new expense slash new expense.",
          "zh": "'./components/new expense/new expense'。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 537.9,
          "end": 538.2,
          "en": "components slash new expense slash new expense.",
          "zh": "'./components/new expense/new expense'。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 538.2,
          "end": 541.9,
          "en": "That's the path to this new expense JavaScript file.",
          "zh": "那就是這個 new expense JavaScript 檔案的路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 541.9,
          "end": 546.133,
          "en": "And then here, finally, instead of this dummy age to tech",
          "zh": "然後最後在這裡，我們不再使用這個 dummy 的 h2 標籤"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 546.133,
          "end": 549.8,
          "en": "we can render new expense like this.",
          "zh": "而是可以像這樣 render new expense。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 549.8,
          "end": 552.533,
          "en": "If we now saved this,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 552.533,
          "end": 554.166,
          "en": "this doesn't load",
          "zh": "它載入不了"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 554.166,
          "end": 556.6,
          "en": "because I have an error in the new expense",
          "zh": "因為我在 new expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 556.6,
          "end": 559.266,
          "en": "JavaScript file. I'm importing expense form",
          "zh": "JavaScript 檔案中有個錯誤。我 import 了 expense form"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 559.266,
          "end": 562.5,
          "en": "from new expense that's of course not correct.",
          "zh": "從 new expense，這當然是不對的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 562.5,
          "end": 562.833,
          "en": "from new expense that's of course not correct.",
          "zh": "從 new expense，這當然是不對的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 562.833,
          "end": 565.1,
          "en": "I should be importing from expense form.",
          "zh": "我應該從 expense form import 才對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 565.1,
          "end": 566.8,
          "en": "That's where this component lives.",
          "zh": "那才是這個元件所在的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 566.8,
          "end": 568.433,
          "en": "Otherwise I create an infinite loop",
          "zh": "否則我會造成無限迴圈"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 568.433,
          "end": 572.933,
          "en": "and that's this page that's causing this page, not to load.",
          "zh": "而那正是導致這個頁面無法載入的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 572.933,
          "end": 575,
          "en": "Now, this works after changing this",
          "zh": "現在，改了這個地方之後就正常了"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 575,
          "end": 576.533,
          "en": "and restarting the server",
          "zh": "並重新啟動伺服器"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 576.533,
          "end": 579.333,
          "en": "and revisiting local host 3000.",
          "zh": "然後重新造訪 localhost:3000。"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 579.333,
          "end": 585.1,
          "en": "And now we have this form here at the top, which is great.",
          "zh": "現在我們在最上方有這個表單，這太棒了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 585.1,
          "end": 587.066,
          "en": "Now we added the component",
          "zh": "現在我們加入了這個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 587.066,
          "end": 589.533,
          "en": "but the component is not doing anything.",
          "zh": "但這個元件還沒有任何作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 589.533,
          "end": 595.133,
          "en": "My next goal is now to make sure that we gather the inputs.",
          "zh": "我接下來的目標是確保我們能收集這些 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 595.133,
          "end": 598.3,
          "en": "The user chooses here may be on every keystroke",
          "zh": "使用者在這裡選擇的內容，也許是每次按鍵時"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 598.3,
          "end": 600.766,
          "en": "or basically whenever the value in one",
          "zh": "或者基本上是每當其中一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 600.766,
          "end": 604.5,
          "en": "of these inputs changes so that we can, for example",
          "zh": "input 的值改變時，這樣我們就可以，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 604.5,
          "end": 607,
          "en": "locked us to the console for a start.",
          "zh": "先把它 log 到 console 看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 607,
          "end": 609.1,
          "en": "And that then as a next step",
          "zh": "然後接下來下一步"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 609.1,
          "end": 612,
          "en": "when the form is submitted, we step in",
          "zh": "當表單被提交時，我們就介入"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 612,
          "end": 616.333,
          "en": "in our code and we take these Gavart input values",
          "zh": "在我們的程式碼中，並取出這些收集到的 input 值"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 616.333,
          "end": 619.066,
          "en": "and combine them into a new expense object.",
          "zh": "並把它們組合成一個新的支出物件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595990",
      "title": "Listening to User Input",
      "sourceHash": "a4c9a1b2b48730a784a6ed64672ec584351bf0f9b13ce2c2e2557472e0cdd12d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.333,
          "en": "Maximilian: So let's now work on gathering user input.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：所以我們現在來處理收集使用者的輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.333,
          "end": 7.333,
          "en": "And as I said, for a start",
          "zh": "就像我說的，首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.333,
          "end": 11.266,
          "en": "I wanna react to every change in any of the inputs.",
          "zh": "我想對任何一個 input 的每一次變更做出反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.266,
          "end": 13.633,
          "en": "So for example, on every keystroke,",
          "zh": "舉例來說，每一次按鍵輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.633,
          "end": 17.733,
          "en": "and I simply wanna get the value the user entered",
          "zh": "而我只想取得使用者輸入的 value"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.733,
          "end": 20.833,
          "en": "and store that somewhere.",
          "zh": "並把它儲存在某個地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.833,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "and store that somewhere.",
          "zh": "並把它儲存在某個地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 24.2,
          "en": "And for example just log it to the console.",
          "zh": "舉例來說，就把它 log 到 console。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.2,
          "end": 26.533,
          "en": "Now to do that, for a start",
          "zh": "現在要做到這點，首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.533,
          "end": 28.766,
          "en": "we need to add listeners to listen,",
          "zh": "我們需要加上監聽器來監聽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.766,
          "end": 32.9,
          "en": "for every keystroke or for every change of these inputs.",
          "zh": "每一次按鍵，或這些 input 的每一次變更。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.9,
          "end": 33.133,
          "en": "for every keystroke or for every change of these inputs.",
          "zh": "每一次按鍵，或這些 input 的每一次變更。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.133,
          "end": 35.233,
          "en": "And you'll learn that you can do that,",
          "zh": "而你們會學到，你可以這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.233,
          "end": 37.3,
          "en": "on the element where you wanna add a listener.",
          "zh": "在你想要加上監聽器的那個元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.3,
          "end": 39.5,
          "en": "So for example, on this input here",
          "zh": "舉例來說，在這裡這個 input 上"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.5,
          "end": 42.3,
          "en": "by adding a prop that starts with \"on\"",
          "zh": "加上一個以 \"on\" 開頭的 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.3,
          "end": 44.033,
          "en": "and then the question just is",
          "zh": "接著問題就只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.033,
          "end": 46.8,
          "en": "to which event you want to listen.",
          "zh": "你想監聽哪一個 event。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 47.266,
          "en": "to which event you want to listen.",
          "zh": "你想監聽哪一個 event。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.266,
          "end": 49.5,
          "en": "Now we could listen to on input",
          "zh": "現在我們可以監聽 on input"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.5,
          "end": 53.166,
          "en": "and therefore react to basically every keystroke,",
          "zh": "因此基本上對每一次按鍵做出反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.166,
          "end": 55.033,
          "en": "but there also is the just the on change event",
          "zh": "但其實也有 on change event"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.033,
          "end": 57.366,
          "en": "which basically does the same here.",
          "zh": "它在這裡基本上做的是同一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.366,
          "end": 59.9,
          "en": "It will also trigger on every keystroke,",
          "zh": "它也會在每一次按鍵時觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.9,
          "end": 60.2,
          "en": "It will also trigger on every keystroke,",
          "zh": "它也會在每一次按鍵時觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 60.2,
          "end": 62.233,
          "en": "but the advantage of the on change event",
          "zh": "但 on change event 的優點"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.233,
          "end": 63.5,
          "en": "is that we can for example",
          "zh": "是我們可以例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 63.5,
          "end": 66.466,
          "en": "use that same event for all inputs types.",
          "zh": "對所有 input 類型使用同一個 event。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 66.466,
          "end": 69.666,
          "en": "For example, all the four Dropdowns.",
          "zh": "例如，所有四個 Dropdown。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 69.666,
          "end": 73.266,
          "en": "So here I will add on change this event listener",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加上 on change 這個 event 監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 73.266,
          "end": 76.666,
          "en": "to this input or this prop, to this input",
          "zh": "到這個 input，或說這個 prop，到這個 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 76.666,
          "end": 76.93299999999999,
          "en": "to this input or this prop, to this input",
          "zh": "到這個 input，或說這個 prop，到這個 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.93299999999999,
          "end": 78.93299999999999,
          "en": "and under the hood, this will then add",
          "zh": "而在底層，這會接著加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.93299999999999,
          "end": 80.96600000000001,
          "en": "an event listener for the change event",
          "zh": "一個針對 change event 的 event 監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 80.96600000000001,
          "end": 83.93299999999999,
          "en": "to the input element which is rendered in the DOM.",
          "zh": "到被渲染到 DOM 中的 input 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 83.93299999999999,
          "end": 86.93299999999999,
          "en": "And then we need to point at to code",
          "zh": "然後我們需要指向程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 86.93299999999999,
          "end": 89.7,
          "en": "at the function that should be executed",
          "zh": "指向那個應該被執行的 function"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 92.333,
          "en": "when that event occurs.",
          "zh": "當那個 event 發生時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 92.333,
          "end": 95.5,
          "en": "Now, you'll learn that we can define it in line here",
          "zh": "現在你們會學到，我們可以在這裡 inline 定義它"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.5,
          "end": 98.2,
          "en": "with function or with an arrow function,",
          "zh": "用 function 或 arrow function，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.2,
          "end": 100.93299999999999,
          "en": "but that it's better to define it upfront.",
          "zh": "但最好事先定義好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.93299999999999,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "but that it's better to define it upfront.",
          "zh": "但最好事先定義好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 102.93299999999999,
          "en": "And therefore that's what I'll do.",
          "zh": "所以我就會這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 102.93299999999999,
          "end": 107.533,
          "en": "I'll add a new const and name it, title Change Handler.",
          "zh": "我會新增一個 const，並把它命名為 titleChangeHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 107.533,
          "end": 109.866,
          "en": "To make it clear that this will be called",
          "zh": "為了清楚表示這會被呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 109.866,
          "end": 113.76599999999999,
          "en": "upon an event I end with handler,",
          "zh": "在 event 發生時，我在結尾加上 handler，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.76599999999999,
          "end": 114.13300000000001,
          "en": "and I'll name it, title Change Handler",
          "zh": "並把它命名為 titleChangeHandler"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114.13300000000001,
          "end": 116.13300000000001,
          "en": "and I'll name it, title Change Handler",
          "zh": "並把它命名為 titleChangeHandler"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 116.13300000000001,
          "end": 118.96600000000001,
          "en": "because this function which I'll store here,",
          "zh": "因為我儲存在這裡的這個 function，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 118.96600000000001,
          "end": 125.7,
          "en": "should be executed, whenever this, well title input changes.",
          "zh": "應該在這個——嗯，title input 變更時被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 125.7,
          "end": 128.566,
          "en": "So here for you on change prop,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，這個 on change prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.566,
          "end": 132.233,
          "en": "I'll pass a pointer at this title change handler,",
          "zh": "我會傳入一個指向 titleChangeHandler 的指標，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 132.233,
          "end": 135.86599999999999,
          "en": "so this function here, as a value.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡這個 function，作為值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 135.86599999999999,
          "end": 138.333,
          "en": "And again we don't execute it here,",
          "zh": "再說一次，我們不會在這裡執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 138.333,
          "end": 143.466,
          "en": "we don't add parentheses, we just point at this function.",
          "zh": "我們不加括號，我們只是指向這個 function。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 143.466,
          "end": 146.03300000000002,
          "en": "And this if I console log now,",
          "zh": "而這個，如果我現在 console log，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 146.03300000000002,
          "end": 149.566,
          "en": "will now execute whenever we",
          "zh": "現在就會在我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 149.566,
          "end": 152.966,
          "en": "type in this type labeled field.",
          "zh": "在這個 type 標示的欄位中輸入時執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 152.966,
          "end": 153.53300000000002,
          "en": "type in this type labeled field.",
          "zh": "在這個 type 標示的欄位中輸入時執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 153.53300000000002,
          "end": 157.53300000000002,
          "en": "So if we go back and open the developer tools,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們回到頁面並打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.53300000000002,
          "end": 158,
          "en": "So if we go back and open the developer tools,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們回到頁面並打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 158,
          "end": 160.86599999999999,
          "en": "if I type here in the title,",
          "zh": "如果我在 title 這裡輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 160.86599999999999,
          "end": 165.566,
          "en": "you see title changed for every keystroke I do.",
          "zh": "你會看到我每按一個鍵就印出 title changed。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 165.566,
          "end": 167.466,
          "en": "Now that's great, but typically",
          "zh": "這很棒，但通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 167.466,
          "end": 171.4,
          "en": "we wanna get the value the user entered.",
          "zh": "我們想取得使用者輸入的 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 171.4,
          "end": 172.03300000000002,
          "en": "we wanna get the value the user entered.",
          "zh": "我們想取得使用者輸入的 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 172.03300000000002,
          "end": 175.4,
          "en": "And the question now is how can we get that value?",
          "zh": "而現在的問題是，我們要怎麼取得那個 value？"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 175.4,
          "end": 178.766,
          "en": "Which possibilities do we have here?",
          "zh": "我們在這裡有哪些可能做法？"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.766,
          "end": 181,
          "en": "And the answer is quite trivial.",
          "zh": "而答案其實很簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 181,
          "end": 183.9,
          "en": "At least if you know Vanilla JavaScript.",
          "zh": "至少如果你懂原生 JavaScript（Vanilla JavaScript）的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 183.9,
          "end": 187.1,
          "en": "So JavaScript without react.",
          "zh": "也就是沒有 React 的 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 187.1,
          "end": 191.433,
          "en": "If you would add an event listener,",
          "zh": "如果你加上一個 event 監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 191.433,
          "end": 196.433,
          "en": "to some element in Vanilla JavaScript like this,",
          "zh": "到原生 JavaScript 中像這樣的某個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 196.433,
          "end": 196.9,
          "en": "to some element in Vanilla JavaScript like this,",
          "zh": "到原生 JavaScript 中像這樣的某個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 196.9,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "then you would listen to let's say the click event",
          "zh": "那你會監聽比如說 click event"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 203.833,
          "en": "and in the function which you pass as a second argument,",
          "zh": "而在你作為第二個參數傳入的 function 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 203.833,
          "end": 206.133,
          "en": "which by the away is basically the function",
          "zh": "順帶一提，那基本上就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 206.133,
          "end": 209.166,
          "en": "you pass as a value to this prop.",
          "zh": "你作為值傳給這個 prop 的 function。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 209.166,
          "end": 209.6,
          "en": "you pass as a value to this prop.",
          "zh": "你作為值傳給這個 prop 的 function。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 209.6,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "There, you automatically get an event object",
          "zh": "在那裡，你會自動拿到一個 event object"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 216.86599999999999,
          "en": "which describes the event which occurred.",
          "zh": "它描述所發生的 event。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 216.86599999999999,
          "end": 219.733,
          "en": "That's a default JavaScript behavior,",
          "zh": "那是 JavaScript 的預設行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 219.733,
          "end": 223.1,
          "en": "you get in the browser when you listen to events.",
          "zh": "當你在瀏覽器中監聽 event 時就會拿到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 223.1,
          "end": 227.7,
          "en": "And we get this default event object here as well.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡也會拿到這個預設的 event object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 227.7,
          "end": 228.2,
          "en": "And we get this default event object here as well.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡也會拿到這個預設的 event object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 228.2,
          "end": 232.133,
          "en": "Automatically, we don't need to do anything to get this.",
          "zh": "自動地，我們不需要做任何事就能拿到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 232.133,
          "end": 235.666,
          "en": "Since we passed this function to react basically,",
          "zh": "因為我們基本上是把這個 function 傳給 React，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 235.666,
          "end": 239.633,
          "en": "CRUD is on change prop, react we'll make sure",
          "zh": "透過這個 on change prop，React 會確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 239.633,
          "end": 242.9,
          "en": "or actually even the browser itself will make sure",
          "zh": "或者其實連瀏覽器本身都會確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 242.9,
          "end": 244.9,
          "en": "that we get such a event object",
          "zh": "我們會拿到這樣一個 event object"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244.9,
          "end": 248.266,
          "en": "when this change event occurs.",
          "zh": "當這個 change event 發生時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 248.266,
          "end": 252.433,
          "en": "Now we can lock this object to see what's inside it.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以 log 這個 object 來看看裡面有什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 252.433,
          "end": 252.733,
          "en": "Now we can lock this object to see what's inside it.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以 log 這個 object 來看看裡面有什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 252.733,
          "end": 255.766,
          "en": "So I'll lock this event argument.",
          "zh": "所以我會 log 這個 event 參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 255.766,
          "end": 258.633,
          "en": "And if I now reload and I start typing,",
          "zh": "而如果我現在重新載入並開始打字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 258.633,
          "end": 261,
          "en": "I get to does object here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡就拿到這個 object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 261,
          "end": 263.533,
          "en": "And this object has a bunch of data.",
          "zh": "而這個 object 有一堆資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 263.533,
          "end": 269,
          "en": "The interesting thing for us is this target field here.",
          "zh": "對我們來說有趣的是這裡這個 target 欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 269,
          "end": 272.133,
          "en": "This target here simply points at the DOM element",
          "zh": "這裡的 target 只是指向那個 DOM 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 272.133,
          "end": 273.666,
          "en": "for which the event occurred.",
          "zh": "也就是發生 event 的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 273.666,
          "end": 276.4,
          "en": "So in this case this input, and this input element in turn",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子中就是這個 input，而這個 input 元素接著"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 276.4,
          "end": 279.266,
          "en": "So in this case this input, and this input element in turn",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子中就是這個 input，而這個 input 元素接著"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 279.266,
          "end": 283,
          "en": "has a long list of properties which we can read and set.",
          "zh": "有一長串我們可以讀取和設定的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 283,
          "end": 289.33299999999997,
          "en": "But most importantly for us, it also has a value property.",
          "zh": "但對我們來說最重要的是，它也有一個 value 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 289.33299999999997,
          "end": 291.06600000000003,
          "en": "And this value property,",
          "zh": "而這個 value 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 291.06600000000003,
          "end": 293.966,
          "en": "holds the current value of this input.",
          "zh": "保存著這個 input 目前的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 293.966,
          "end": 298,
          "en": "At the point of time this event occurs",
          "zh": "在這個 event 發生的那個時間點"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 298,
          "end": 298.633,
          "en": "At the point of time this event occurs",
          "zh": "在這個 event 發生的那個時間點"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 298.633,
          "end": 300.333,
          "en": "and that's super useful",
          "zh": "而那非常有用"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 300.333,
          "end": 303,
          "en": "because that means that we can drill into this target.",
          "zh": "因為那表示我們可以深入這個 target。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 303,
          "end": 305.6,
          "en": "And then this value I just showed you",
          "zh": "然後用我剛剛示範的這個 value"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 305.6,
          "end": 308.433,
          "en": "to get the value which was currently entered",
          "zh": "來取得當時所輸入的 value"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 308.433,
          "end": 309.9,
          "en": "when that event occurred",
          "zh": "當那個 event 發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 309.9,
          "end": 309.933,
          "en": "when that event occurred",
          "zh": "當那個 event 發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 309.933,
          "end": 310.566,
          "en": "when that event occurred",
          "zh": "當那個 event 發生時"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 310.566,
          "end": 313.733,
          "en": "for that element on which we're listening.",
          "zh": "針對我們正在監聽的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 313.733,
          "end": 315.4,
          "en": "So now if I reload,",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 315.4,
          "end": 318.566,
          "en": "you'll see that I get the current value",
          "zh": "你會看到我取得目前的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 318.566,
          "end": 322,
          "en": "with every keystroke and that's super useful.",
          "zh": "每一次按鍵都會，而那非常有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 322,
          "end": 323.7,
          "en": "Now we got this value.",
          "zh": "現在我們拿到這個 value 了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595992",
      "title": "Working with Multiple States",
      "sourceHash": "baaa396914fb807eff683fed4f769009f8afb2d582c62ef1f147f9c6adbd7b42",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2,
          "end": 5.3,
          "en": "Tutor: The question now is what do we want to do",
          "zh": "講師：現在的問題是，我們想對"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.3,
          "end": 6.566,
          "en": "with that value?",
          "zh": "那個值做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.566,
          "end": 8.566,
          "en": "What's the goal now?",
          "zh": "現在的目標是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.566,
          "end": 11.9,
          "en": "And the answer is, well, we want to make sure",
          "zh": "而答案是，我們想確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.9,
          "end": 15.966,
          "en": "that we store it somewhere so that when later",
          "zh": "把它儲存在某個地方，這樣之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.966,
          "end": 20.833,
          "en": "when the form is submitted, we can use that value.",
          "zh": "當表單送出時，我們就能使用那個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.833,
          "end": 23.5,
          "en": "Because of course, we want to gather all the values",
          "zh": "因為當然，我們想收集所有的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.5,
          "end": 25.966,
          "en": "for all inputs and then combine them",
          "zh": "來自所有輸入欄位，然後把它們合併"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.966,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "into an object when the form overall is submitted.",
          "zh": "成一個物件，在整個表單送出時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 32.8,
          "en": "And one way of storing that value",
          "zh": "而儲存那個值的一種方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.8,
          "end": 34.7,
          "en": "and making sure that it survives,",
          "zh": "並確保它能保留下來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.7,
          "end": 37.733,
          "en": "even if that function would be re executed",
          "zh": "即使那個函式會被重新執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.733,
          "end": 39.033,
          "en": "for whatever reason,",
          "zh": "不管是什麼原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.033,
          "end": 40.866,
          "en": "so this component function, I mean.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 component 函式，我是說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.866,
          "end": 41.266,
          "en": "so this component function, I mean.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 component 函式，我是說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.266,
          "end": 44.766,
          "en": "To make sure that we store the value and that it survives",
          "zh": "為了確保我們儲存那個值，而且它能保留"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.766,
          "end": 47.166,
          "en": "if that function would be re-executed",
          "zh": "如果那個函式被重新執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.166,
          "end": 50.133,
          "en": "and the component would be re-evaluated,",
          "zh": "而且這個 component 被重新評估，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.133,
          "end": 52.666,
          "en": "we can again, use State.",
          "zh": "我們同樣可以使用 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.666,
          "end": 56.9,
          "en": "So we can import the useState hook from React here,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡從 React import useState hook，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.9,
          "end": 57.3,
          "en": "So we can import the useState hook from React here,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡從 React import useState hook，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.3,
          "end": 60.5,
          "en": "and basically just call it here",
          "zh": "基本上就是在這裡呼叫它"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.5,
          "end": 63.766,
          "en": "at the beginning of the ExpenseForm function",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 函式的開頭"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.766,
          "end": 64.066,
          "en": "at the beginning of the ExpenseForm function",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 函式的開頭"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.066,
          "end": 66.8,
          "en": "and set the State for this input here, so to say.",
          "zh": "並為這個輸入欄位設定 State，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.8,
          "end": 68.7,
          "en": "and set the State for this input here, so to say.",
          "zh": "並為這個輸入欄位設定 State，可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 70.533,
          "en": "And initially that's an empty string",
          "zh": "而一開始它是空字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.533,
          "end": 73,
          "en": "because initially when this component is rendered",
          "zh": "因為一開始當這個 component 被渲染時"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73,
          "end": 76.1,
          "en": "for the first time, nothing was entered,",
          "zh": "第一次的時候，什麼都還沒輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.1,
          "end": 76.3,
          "en": "for the first time, nothing was entered,",
          "zh": "第一次的時候，什麼都還沒輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.3,
          "end": 78.533,
          "en": "but then we can again, use destructuring",
          "zh": "但接著我們同樣可以使用解構"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 78.533,
          "end": 80.96600000000001,
          "en": "to get our two elements,",
          "zh": "來取得我們的兩個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 80.96600000000001,
          "end": 83.233,
          "en": "which is the currently enteredTitle.",
          "zh": "也就是目前的 enteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 83.233,
          "end": 85.93299999999999,
          "en": "Maybe we name it, enteredTitle",
          "zh": "也許我們把它命名為 enteredTitle"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 85.93299999999999,
          "end": 88.666,
          "en": "and a function for updating the State,",
          "zh": "以及一個用來更新 State 的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.666,
          "end": 88.833,
          "en": "and a function for updating the State,",
          "zh": "以及一個用來更新 State 的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.833,
          "end": 91.26599999999999,
          "en": "which following the convention",
          "zh": "依照慣例"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 91.26599999999999,
          "end": 96.033,
          "en": "should be named setEnteredTitle.",
          "zh": "應該命名為 setEnteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 96.033,
          "end": 99.4,
          "en": "And here, when we react to this event",
          "zh": "而在這裡，當我們對這個事件做出反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 99.4,
          "end": 101.733,
          "en": "where the user enters something,",
          "zh": "也就是使用者輸入了某些內容時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 101.733,
          "end": 105.033,
          "en": "we can't just call setEnteredTitle",
          "zh": "我們不能只是呼叫 setEnteredTitle"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 105.033,
          "end": 105.2,
          "en": "we can't just call setEnteredTitle",
          "zh": "我們不能只是呼叫 setEnteredTitle"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 105.2,
          "end": 107.366,
          "en": "and pass events target value.",
          "zh": "並傳入 event 的 target value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 107.366,
          "end": 110.76599999999999,
          "en": "So the currently entered value as a parameter,",
          "zh": "也就是目前輸入的值作為參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.76599999999999,
          "end": 115.066,
          "en": "as argument, to setEnteredTitle.",
          "zh": "作為引數，傳給 setEnteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 115.066,
          "end": 118.166,
          "en": "And therefore this will be stored in our State.",
          "zh": "因此這會被儲存在我們的 State 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 118.166,
          "end": 122.066,
          "en": "Now, here I'm not really doing it to update this component",
          "zh": "現在，我在這裡並不是真的為了更新這個 component"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 122.066,
          "end": 123.966,
          "en": "though the component will update.",
          "zh": "雖然 component 確實會更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 123.966,
          "end": 126.566,
          "en": "That will always happen when you update the State",
          "zh": "當你更新 State 時，那總是會發生"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 126.566,
          "end": 126.833,
          "en": "That will always happen when you update the State",
          "zh": "當你更新 State 時，那總是會發生"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 126.833,
          "end": 128.933,
          "en": "but I'm doing it to ensure that we're storing",
          "zh": "但我這麼做是為了確保我們把"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.933,
          "end": 131.966,
          "en": "this in some variable, which is kind of detached",
          "zh": "這個值存在某個變數裡，而它有點脫離了"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 131.966,
          "end": 135.5,
          "en": "from the life cycle of this component function.",
          "zh": "這個 component 函式的生命週期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 135.5,
          "end": 135.7,
          "en": "from the life cycle of this component function.",
          "zh": "這個 component 函式的生命週期。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 135.7,
          "end": 138.133,
          "en": "So that no matter how often this component function",
          "zh": "這樣一來，不論這個 component 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 138.133,
          "end": 143.6,
          "en": "might execute again, this State is stored and survives.",
          "zh": "再執行多少次，這個 State 都會被保存下來並存續。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 143.6,
          "end": 145.833,
          "en": "There would be other ways of solving this as well",
          "zh": "當然也有其他解決這個問題的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 145.833,
          "end": 148.066,
          "en": "but that works just fine.",
          "zh": "但這樣做就很好用了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 148.066,
          "end": 148.3,
          "en": "but that works just fine.",
          "zh": "但這樣做就很好用了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 148.3,
          "end": 150.03300000000002,
          "en": "And it has another advantage",
          "zh": "而且它還有另一個優點"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 150.03300000000002,
          "end": 152.7,
          "en": "because we'll need that State for updating",
          "zh": "因為我們會需要那個 State 來更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 152.7,
          "end": 157.233,
          "en": "and for re-rendering that component later anyways.",
          "zh": "以及之後重新渲染那個 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 157.233,
          "end": 160.833,
          "en": "But for the moment we just use a to safe to value.",
          "zh": "但就目前來說，我們只是用它來儲存那個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 160.833,
          "end": 163.433,
          "en": "Now we can do the same for the other two inputs.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以對其他兩個輸入欄位做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 163.433,
          "end": 166.766,
          "en": "And of course, definitely try this on your own as well.",
          "zh": "當然，也一定要自己試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 166.766,
          "end": 169.1,
          "en": "Pause the video and make sure you listen",
          "zh": "暫停影片，並確保你也有"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.1,
          "end": 172,
          "en": "to these change events for the other inputs as well",
          "zh": "為其他輸入欄位監聽這些 change 事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 172,
          "end": 172.333,
          "en": "to these change events for the other inputs as well",
          "zh": "為其他輸入欄位監聽這些 change 事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 172.333,
          "end": 177.4,
          "en": "and that you also store State for those changes.",
          "zh": "並且也為這些變更儲存 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 177.4,
          "end": 179.36599999999999,
          "en": "So here's your chance to pause the video,",
          "zh": "所以現在是你們暫停影片的機會，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 179.36599999999999,
          "end": 182.966,
          "en": "thereafter, we'll implement this together.",
          "zh": "之後，我們會一起來實作這個部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 185.066,
          "end": 187.133,
          "en": "So, did you add that?",
          "zh": "那麼，你加上了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 187.133,
          "end": 189.36599999999999,
          "en": "Let's now do it together.",
          "zh": "現在我們一起來做吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 189.36599999999999,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "And I'll start by adding a new function",
          "zh": "我會先新增一個新的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 195.266,
          "en": "and that will be the amountChangeHandler.",
          "zh": "也就是 amountChangeHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 195.266,
          "end": 199.266,
          "en": "And the logic is basically the same as before.",
          "zh": "而邏輯基本上和之前一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 199.266,
          "end": 199.8,
          "en": "And the logic is basically the same as before.",
          "zh": "而邏輯基本上和之前一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 199.8,
          "end": 200.666,
          "en": "I want to make sure",
          "zh": "我想確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 200.666,
          "end": 202.36599999999999,
          "en": "that this function gets triggered",
          "zh": "這個函式會被觸發"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 202.36599999999999,
          "end": 204.6,
          "en": "whenever the amount changes.",
          "zh": "每當 amount 改變的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 208.666,
          "en": "So on the amount input, we can add a onChange prop",
          "zh": "所以在 amount 輸入欄位上，我們可以加上一個 onChange prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 208.666,
          "end": 213.266,
          "en": "and point at the amountChangeHandler, just like that.",
          "zh": "並指向 amountChangeHandler，就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 213.266,
          "end": 215.733,
          "en": "And before I add any code in there,",
          "zh": "而在我往裡面加任何程式碼之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 215.733,
          "end": 218.233,
          "en": "I will already add the third function",
          "zh": "我會先加上第三個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 218.233,
          "end": 223.8,
          "en": "for my dateChangeHandler, like this",
          "zh": "也就是我的 dateChangeHandler，像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 223.8,
          "end": 227.133,
          "en": "and that should be triggered whenever the date changed.",
          "zh": "而它應該在 date 改變時被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 227.133,
          "end": 227.5,
          "en": "and that should be triggered whenever the date changed.",
          "zh": "而它應該在 date 改變時被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 227.5,
          "end": 229.933,
          "en": "So here I always listened to onChange",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我一樣監聽 onChange"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 229.933,
          "end": 234.86599999999999,
          "en": "and point at the dateChangeHandler.",
          "zh": "並指向 dateChangeHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 234.86599999999999,
          "end": 237.5,
          "en": "So now all these inputs are wired up",
          "zh": "所以現在所有這些輸入欄位都接好了"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 237.5,
          "end": 240.666,
          "en": "but of course at the moment nothing is happening here.",
          "zh": "但當然目前這裡什麼事都還沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 240.666,
          "end": 241.166,
          "en": "but of course at the moment nothing is happening here.",
          "zh": "但當然目前這裡什麼事都還沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 241.166,
          "end": 242.433,
          "en": "Now I also of course",
          "zh": "現在我當然也"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 242.433,
          "end": 245.1,
          "en": "want to store State for changes made here.",
          "zh": "想為這裡所做的變更儲存 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 245.1,
          "end": 247.5,
          "en": "And that brings up one important question.",
          "zh": "而這帶出一個重要的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 247.5,
          "end": 247.833,
          "en": "And that brings up one important question.",
          "zh": "而這帶出一個重要的問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 247.833,
          "end": 250.266,
          "en": "Maybe a problem you also encountered,",
          "zh": "也許是你們也遇過的問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 250.266,
          "end": 254,
          "en": "how can you manage more than one State?",
          "zh": "你要如何管理多個 State？"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 254,
          "end": 254.2,
          "en": "how can you manage more than one State?",
          "zh": "你要如何管理多個 State？"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 254.2,
          "end": 256.933,
          "en": "It is something we have learned up to this point",
          "zh": "這是我們到目前為止還沒學過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 256.933,
          "end": 259.8,
          "en": "but it turns out that it is rather simple.",
          "zh": "但結果發現它其實相當簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 259.8,
          "end": 262.9,
          "en": "You can call useState more than once.",
          "zh": "你可以呼叫 useState 不只一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 262.9,
          "end": 263.3,
          "en": "You can call useState more than once.",
          "zh": "你可以呼叫 useState 不只一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 263.3,
          "end": 266.33299999999997,
          "en": "Maybe you tried that and if you did good job,",
          "zh": "也許你試過了，如果試過，做得好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 266.33299999999997,
          "end": 268.2,
          "en": "because you can do that.",
          "zh": "因為這是可以做到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 268.2,
          "end": 272.266,
          "en": "You can have multiple States, multiple States slices",
          "zh": "你可以擁有多個 State，多個 State 切片"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 272.266,
          "end": 275.7,
          "en": "or State pieces per component.",
          "zh": "或每個 component 的多個 State 部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 275.7,
          "end": 276.2,
          "en": "or State pieces per component.",
          "zh": "或每個 component 的多個 State 部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 276.2,
          "end": 279.866,
          "en": "And all of these States inside of one at the same component",
          "zh": "而這些位於同一個 component 裡的所有 State"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 279.866,
          "end": 284.133,
          "en": "will then all to be totally separated from each other.",
          "zh": "彼此之間都會是完全分開的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 284.133,
          "end": 286.533,
          "en": "So you're all called useState again",
          "zh": "所以我們再次呼叫 useState"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 286.533,
          "end": 288.83299999999997,
          "en": "and extract my enteredAmount",
          "zh": "並取出我的 enteredAmount"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 288.83299999999997,
          "end": 294.9,
          "en": "and my setEnteredAmount function with RAD structuring.",
          "zh": "以及我的 setEnteredAmount 函式，透過解構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 294.9,
          "end": 297.1,
          "en": "And now we've got these two pieces of State",
          "zh": "而現在我們有了這兩塊 State"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 297.1,
          "end": 299.233,
          "en": "which belong to this component",
          "zh": "它們都屬於這個 component"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 299.233,
          "end": 299.5,
          "en": "which belong to this component",
          "zh": "它們都屬於這個 component"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 299.5,
          "end": 302.933,
          "en": "and we can update and read them individually.",
          "zh": "而且我們可以個別地更新和讀取它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 302.933,
          "end": 305.6,
          "en": "So they work in a totally separated way.",
          "zh": "所以它們以完全分開的方式運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 305.6,
          "end": 307.033,
          "en": "When I update the amount,",
          "zh": "當我更新 amount 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 307.033,
          "end": 311.633,
          "en": "this will not affect the title and vice versa.",
          "zh": "這不會影響 title，反之亦然。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 311.633,
          "end": 313.166,
          "en": "So for the amountChangeHandler,",
          "zh": "所以在 amountChangeHandler 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 313.166,
          "end": 316.466,
          "en": "we can call setEnteredAmount",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫 setEnteredAmount"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 316.466,
          "end": 322.066,
          "en": "and pass in event target value here as well.",
          "zh": "並在這裡同樣傳入 event 的 target value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 322.066,
          "end": 326.366,
          "en": "Well, and unsurprisingly, we can do the same for the date.",
          "zh": "嗯，不出意料地，我們也可以對 date 做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 326.366,
          "end": 326.6,
          "en": "Well, and unsurprisingly, we can do the same for the date.",
          "zh": "嗯，不出意料地，我們也可以對 date 做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 326.6,
          "end": 328,
          "en": "Call useState again",
          "zh": "再次呼叫 useState"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 328,
          "end": 330.366,
          "en": "and store an empty string here as well.",
          "zh": "並且在這裡也儲存空字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 330.366,
          "end": 332.7,
          "en": "By the way, I'm storing strings all the time",
          "zh": "順帶一提，我一直都儲存字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 332.7,
          "end": 336.266,
          "en": "and not a number here for the amount, for example,",
          "zh": "而不是數字，比如說這裡的 amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 336.266,
          "end": 336.466,
          "en": "and not a number here for the amount, for example,",
          "zh": "而不是數字，比如說這裡的 amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 336.466,
          "end": 339.533,
          "en": "because by default, whenever you listen to the change event",
          "zh": "因為預設上，每當你監聽 change 事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 339.533,
          "end": 344.1,
          "en": "for an input, if you read the value of that input element,",
          "zh": "為某個輸入欄位時，如果你讀取那個 input 元素的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 344.1,
          "end": 346.1,
          "en": "it'll always be a string.",
          "zh": "它永遠會是字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 346.1,
          "end": 347.7,
          "en": "Even if it stores a number",
          "zh": "即使它儲存的是數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 347.7,
          "end": 350.06600000000003,
          "en": "it will be a number as a string and the same for the date.",
          "zh": "它也會是以字串形式呈現的數字，date 也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 350.06600000000003,
          "end": 351.7,
          "en": "it will be a number as a string and the same for the date.",
          "zh": "它也會是以字串形式呈現的數字，date 也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 351.7,
          "end": 353.33299999999997,
          "en": "So we always get a string here.",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡拿到的永遠是字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 353.33299999999997,
          "end": 357.933,
          "en": "That's why I also initialize all States with a string.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我也用字串來初始化所有的 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 357.933,
          "end": 361.533,
          "en": "And here, therefore, for this third State,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，針對這第三個 State，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 361.533,
          "end": 365.966,
          "en": "I have my enteredDate and setEnteredDate.",
          "zh": "我有我的 enteredDate 和 setEnteredDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 365.966,
          "end": 370.6,
          "en": "And I now also can update this State here",
          "zh": "而我現在也可以在這裡更新這個 State"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 370.6,
          "end": 379.233,
          "en": "with setEnteredDate events target value, like this.",
          "zh": "用 setEnteredDate event 的 target value，像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 379.233,
          "end": 380.3,
          "en": "Okay.",
          "zh": "好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 380.3,
          "end": 383.033,
          "en": "Now we got these three State slices",
          "zh": "現在我們有了這三個 State 切片"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 383.033,
          "end": 385.133,
          "en": "and this is really important.",
          "zh": "而這真的非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 385.133,
          "end": 385.466,
          "en": "and this is really important.",
          "zh": "而這真的非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 385.466,
          "end": 387.83299999999997,
          "en": "This is absolutely okay",
          "zh": "這完全是沒問題的"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 387.83299999999997,
          "end": 389.933,
          "en": "and you will see that quite a lot,",
          "zh": "而且你會很常看到這種寫法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 389.933,
          "end": 392.766,
          "en": "that you have more than one State per component.",
          "zh": "也就是每個 component 有多個 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 392.766,
          "end": 396.766,
          "en": "You can have these separate States and update them",
          "zh": "你可以擁有這些各自分開的 State，並個別地"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 396.766,
          "end": 399.4,
          "en": "separately and manage them separately.",
          "zh": "更新它們、分別管理它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 399.4,
          "end": 403.06600000000003,
          "en": "That is a key part of this entire State concept",
          "zh": "這是整個 State 概念中的關鍵部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 403.06600000000003,
          "end": 404.866,
          "en": "React ships with.",
          "zh": "React 本身就內建。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 404.866,
          "end": 408.166,
          "en": "You can, and you often will have multiple States",
          "zh": "你可以，而且你經常會擁有"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 408.166,
          "end": 409.4,
          "en": "per component.",
          "zh": "每個 component 多個 State。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 409.4,
          "end": 411.83299999999997,
          "en": "Nonetheless, this multiple States",
          "zh": "不過，這個多個 State"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 411.83299999999997,
          "end": 414.56600000000003,
          "en": "verses one State thing is a concept",
          "zh": "與單一 State 的對比，是一個概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 414.56600000000003,
          "end": 416.233,
          "en": "I wanna take a closer look at.",
          "zh": "我想更仔細地探討。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25595998",
      "title": "Using One State Instead (And What's Better)",
      "sourceHash": "60f151ef74bc36e3d6fcb62981532f86ca5b07b59ddbfa3c512ea15a6ffd5de9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.166,
          "end": 3.433,
          "en": "-: So in the last lecture",
          "zh": "上一堂課中"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.433,
          "end": 4.433,
          "en": "we added these",
          "zh": "我們加上了這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.433,
          "end": 6.1,
          "en": "handler functions",
          "zh": "處理函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.1,
          "end": 6.966,
          "en": "and we added",
          "zh": "而我們加上了"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 6.966,
          "end": 8.4,
          "en": "multiple state slices.",
          "zh": "多個 state 切片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "Now I did",
          "zh": "我確實"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 10.266,
          "en": "emphasize,",
          "zh": "強調過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 10.266,
          "end": 11.533,
          "en": "that you can have",
          "zh": "你可以擁有"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 11.533,
          "end": 12.833,
          "en": "multiple such slices",
          "zh": "多個這樣的切片"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 12.833,
          "end": 14.333,
          "en": "that this is totally normal.",
          "zh": "這完全正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 14.333,
          "end": 16.9,
          "en": "However, there also is an alternative",
          "zh": "不過，還有另一種替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 16.9,
          "end": 20.433,
          "en": "and it depends basically on your personal preferences",
          "zh": "這基本上取決於你的個人偏好"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 20.433,
          "end": 22.533,
          "en": "which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": "你比較喜歡哪一種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 22.533,
          "end": 23.766,
          "en": "You can have multiple slices,",
          "zh": "你可以擁有多個切片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 23.766,
          "end": 25.433,
          "en": "but you could also argue that",
          "zh": "但也可以主張"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 25.433,
          "end": 29.166,
          "en": "of course, all three States here are related",
          "zh": "當然，這裡這三個 State 全都和"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 29.166,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "to our form,",
          "zh": "我們的表單有關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 31.433,
          "en": "that,",
          "zh": "也就是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 31.433,
          "end": 33.033,
          "en": "in all three States, we just",
          "zh": "在這三個 State 裡，我們都只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 33.033,
          "end": 36.1,
          "en": "store some user input and that it's therefore",
          "zh": "儲存一些使用者輸入，因此它"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 36.1,
          "end": 40.766,
          "en": "basically the same concept repeated three times.",
          "zh": "基本上就是同一個概念重複了三次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 40.766,
          "end": 42.8,
          "en": "Therefore, you could also go",
          "zh": "因此，你也可以選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 42.8,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "for one state instead of three states.",
          "zh": "用一個 state 取代三個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 47.666,
          "en": "How?",
          "zh": "怎麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 47.666,
          "end": 51.833,
          "en": "simply by commenting this out.",
          "zh": "只要把這個註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 51.833,
          "end": 52.066,
          "en": "simply by commenting this out.",
          "zh": "只要把這個註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 52.066,
          "end": 53.333,
          "en": "by calling used state",
          "zh": "只呼叫 useState"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 53.333,
          "end": 55.066,
          "en": "only once",
          "zh": "一次就好"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 55.066,
          "end": 55.3,
          "en": "only once",
          "zh": "一次就好"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 55.3,
          "end": 59.133,
          "en": "and by passing in an object as a value",
          "zh": "並且傳入一個物件作為值"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 59.133,
          "end": 59.5,
          "en": "and by passing in an object as a value",
          "zh": "並且傳入一個物件作為值"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 59.5,
          "end": 60.633,
          "en": "and that's important",
          "zh": "而這很重要"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 60.633,
          "end": 61.633,
          "en": "not a string",
          "zh": "不是字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 61.633,
          "end": 64.6,
          "en": "or number or anything like that, but an object.",
          "zh": "或數字或之類的東西，而是一個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 64.6,
          "end": 66.8,
          "en": "And of course in this object,",
          "zh": "當然，在這個物件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 66.8,
          "end": 69.533,
          "en": "you can now group together, your three States",
          "zh": "你現在可以把你的三個 State 群組在一起"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 69.533,
          "end": 71.9,
          "en": "you could have a title key, or",
          "zh": "你可以有一個 title key，或"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 71.9,
          "end": 74.766,
          "en": "maybe alter it entered title key,",
          "zh": "也許改叫 entered title key，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 74.766,
          "end": 78.26599999999999,
          "en": "And that holds an empty string initially.",
          "zh": "而它一開始存放的是空字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 78.26599999999999,
          "end": 80.7,
          "en": "And you have an entered amount key as well",
          "zh": "你也可以有一個 entered amount key"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 84.7,
          "en": "with an empty string and an entered date.",
          "zh": "存放空字串，還有一個 entered date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 84.7,
          "end": 85.3,
          "en": "So,",
          "zh": "所以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 85.3,
          "end": 86.43299999999999,
          "en": "the logic is kind of the same",
          "zh": "邏輯大致相同"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 86.43299999999999,
          "end": 88.5,
          "en": "but now it's in one state object",
          "zh": "但現在它放在一個 state 物件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 88.5,
          "end": 90.46600000000001,
          "en": "managed as one piece of state",
          "zh": "當作一塊 state 來管理"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 90.46600000000001,
          "end": 94.3,
          "en": "instead of three separate slices.",
          "zh": "而不是三個分開的切片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 94.3,
          "end": 95.2,
          "en": "The difference now,",
          "zh": "現在的差別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 95.2,
          "end": 96.033,
          "en": "of course is",
          "zh": "當然就在於"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 96.033,
          "end": 97.93299999999999,
          "en": "that whenever you update this state",
          "zh": "每當你更新這個 state 時"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 97.93299999999999,
          "end": 99.3,
          "en": "you need to update all",
          "zh": "你需要更新全部"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 103,
          "en": "three properties and not just one.",
          "zh": "三個屬性，而不只是其中一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 103,
          "end": 105.233,
          "en": "So here you could then also extract this",
          "zh": "所以在這裡你同樣可以把它解構出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 105.233,
          "end": 109.566,
          "en": "and have your user input, for example,",
          "zh": "例如取得你的 user input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 109.566,
          "end": 111.166,
          "en": "and have your user input, for example,",
          "zh": "例如取得你的 user input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 111.166,
          "end": 112.6,
          "en": "and set user input.",
          "zh": "以及 set user input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 112.6,
          "end": 114.5,
          "en": "And now when,",
          "zh": "而現在當，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 114.5,
          "end": 118.033,
          "en": "the user enters a title, you wouldn't store it",
          "zh": "使用者輸入 title 時，你不會像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 118.033,
          "end": 118.866,
          "en": "like this,",
          "zh": "儲存它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 118.866,
          "end": 119.96600000000001,
          "en": "but you would call set user input.",
          "zh": "而是會呼叫 set user input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 119.96600000000001,
          "end": 120.833,
          "en": "And in the end here, you then want to pass",
          "zh": "而在最後這裡，你會想傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 120.833,
          "end": 123.533,
          "en": "And in the end here, you then want to pass",
          "zh": "而在最後這裡，你會想傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 123.533,
          "end": 128.433,
          "en": "in a new object where you set the entered title",
          "zh": "一個新的物件，並在其中把 entered title"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 128.433,
          "end": 131.733,
          "en": "in this case to event dot target dot value.",
          "zh": "在這個情況下設為 event.target.value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 131.733,
          "end": 132.466,
          "en": "But that's not the tricky part",
          "zh": "但棘手的部分不是這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 132.466,
          "end": 136.03300000000002,
          "en": "But that's not the tricky part",
          "zh": "但棘手的部分不是這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 136.03300000000002,
          "end": 137.36599999999999,
          "en": "where you also ensure",
          "zh": "而是你還得確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 137.36599999999999,
          "end": 141.966,
          "en": "that the other two pieces of data don't get lost.",
          "zh": "另外兩筆資料不會遺失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 141.966,
          "end": 145.166,
          "en": "If you would just set your new user input state",
          "zh": "如果你只是把你的新 user input state"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 145.166,
          "end": 150.5,
          "en": "to this object, you would basically dump the Abra keys",
          "zh": "設成這個物件，你基本上就會丟掉其他的 key"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 150.5,
          "end": 150.833,
          "en": "to this object, you would basically dump the Abra keys",
          "zh": "設成這個物件，你基本上就會丟掉其他的 key"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 150.833,
          "end": 152.333,
          "en": "because when you update your state",
          "zh": "因為當你更新你的 state 時"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 152.333,
          "end": 154.86599999999999,
          "en": "react will not merge this",
          "zh": "React 不會把這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 154.86599999999999,
          "end": 156.133,
          "en": "with the old state.",
          "zh": "和舊的 state 合併。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 156.133,
          "end": 156.966,
          "en": "It will simply replace",
          "zh": "它只會單純地"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 156.966,
          "end": 160.266,
          "en": "the old state with the new one.",
          "zh": "把舊的 state 換成新的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 160.266,
          "end": 162.666,
          "en": "And if your new one is a object",
          "zh": "而如果你的新東西是一個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 162.666,
          "end": 164.03300000000002,
          "en": "with one key value pair here",
          "zh": "在這裡只帶有一組 key value pair"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 164.03300000000002,
          "end": 166.4,
          "en": "the old state will be replaced and therefore",
          "zh": "舊的 state 就會被取代，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 166.4,
          "end": 169.466,
          "en": "The other are two key value pairs",
          "zh": "另外兩組 key value pair"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 169.466,
          "end": 173,
          "en": "for amounted to date would be lost.",
          "zh": "也就是 amount 和 date 的，就會遺失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 173,
          "end": 174.166,
          "en": "So if you go for this",
          "zh": "所以如果你採用這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 174.166,
          "end": 177.8,
          "en": "one state approach and you manage such a object",
          "zh": "單一 state 的做法，並管理這樣一個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 177.8,
          "end": 181.3,
          "en": "it's all your responsibility to make sure",
          "zh": "那麼確保其他資料不會遺失，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 181.3,
          "end": 185.2,
          "en": "that the other data does not get lost.",
          "zh": "就完全是你的責任。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 185.2,
          "end": 185.7,
          "en": "that the other data does not get lost.",
          "zh": "就完全是你的責任。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 186.86599999999999,
          "en": "And to do that,",
          "zh": "而要這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 186.86599999999999,
          "end": 187.8,
          "en": "you manually need to",
          "zh": "你需要手動"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 187.8,
          "end": 189.333,
          "en": "copy",
          "zh": "複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 189.333,
          "end": 190.6,
          "en": "the other values",
          "zh": "其他的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 190.6,
          "end": 192.933,
          "en": "which you're not updating here.",
          "zh": "也就是你在這裡沒有要更新的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 192.933,
          "end": 193.133,
          "en": "which you're not updating here.",
          "zh": "也就是你在這裡沒有要更新的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 193.133,
          "end": 195.833,
          "en": "So if you are updating the title, you also want to copy",
          "zh": "所以如果你在更新 title，你也會想複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 195.833,
          "end": 200,
          "en": "in the existing values for amount and date.",
          "zh": "amount 和 date 現有的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 200,
          "end": 200.833,
          "en": "And one way",
          "zh": "而其中一種"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 200.833,
          "end": 203.966,
          "en": "of doing this would be to use the spread operator",
          "zh": "做法就是使用展開運算子（spread operator）"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 203.966,
          "end": 207.36599999999999,
          "en": "which is a default JavaScript operator",
          "zh": "這是現代 JavaScript 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 207.36599999999999,
          "end": 208.566,
          "en": "in modern JavaScript.",
          "zh": "預設就有的運算子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 208.566,
          "end": 211.4,
          "en": "And you copy in user input",
          "zh": "你把 user input 複製進來"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 211.4,
          "end": 212.9,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 212.9,
          "end": 215.333,
          "en": "Actually, you do this first and then you just",
          "zh": "其實，你先把這個做掉，然後你就只要"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 215.333,
          "end": 216.333,
          "en": "Actually, you do this first and then you just",
          "zh": "其實，你先把這個做掉，然後你就只要"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 216.333,
          "end": 219.1,
          "en": "override entered title.",
          "zh": "覆寫 entered title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 219.1,
          "end": 221.1,
          "en": "If you haven't seen this syntax before,",
          "zh": "如果你以前沒看過這個語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 221.1,
          "end": 221.966,
          "en": "this in the end just",
          "zh": "它最終只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 221.966,
          "end": 223.166,
          "en": "takes an object,",
          "zh": "取出一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 223.166,
          "end": 225.5,
          "en": "pulls out all the key value pairs,",
          "zh": "把所有的 key value pair 拉出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 225.5,
          "end": 227.966,
          "en": "and adds them to this new object.",
          "zh": "然後把它們加到這個新物件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 227.966,
          "end": 230.666,
          "en": "And then we can still override key value pairs like",
          "zh": "接著我們仍然可以覆寫 key value pair，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 230.666,
          "end": 233.7,
          "en": "in this case entered title.",
          "zh": "在這個情況下的 entered title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 233.7,
          "end": 234.766,
          "en": "And by doing it like this,",
          "zh": "而這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 234.766,
          "end": 236.8,
          "en": "we ensure that the other values",
          "zh": "我們就能確保其他的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 236.8,
          "end": 238.266,
          "en": "aren't thrown away,",
          "zh": "不會被丟掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 238.266,
          "end": 241.533,
          "en": "but are also part of that new state.",
          "zh": "而是也成為那個新 state 的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 241.533,
          "end": 242.933,
          "en": "And now we could do this",
          "zh": "現在我們可以把這件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 242.933,
          "end": 244.86599999999999,
          "en": "in all three places here,",
          "zh": "在這裡的三個地方都做一遍，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 244.86599999999999,
          "end": 246.066,
          "en": "of course,",
          "zh": "當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 246.066,
          "end": 247.9,
          "en": "and update the entered",
          "zh": "並更新 entered"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 247.9,
          "end": 249.733,
          "en": "Amount here and",
          "zh": "Amount，還有"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 249.733,
          "end": 251.6,
          "en": "do the same here,",
          "zh": "在這裡做一樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 251.6,
          "end": 256.6,
          "en": "Just that here, we update the entered date",
          "zh": "只是在這裡，我們更新的是 entered date"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 256.6,
          "end": 258.5,
          "en": "and that would be an alternative",
          "zh": "而這就會是另一種選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 258.5,
          "end": 262,
          "en": "to having the three individual state slices.",
          "zh": "相對於使用三個獨立的 state 切片。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 262,
          "end": 263.433,
          "en": "It's up to you, what you prefer.",
          "zh": "這取決於你，看你偏好哪一種。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 263.433,
          "end": 266.2,
          "en": "And this code also, isn't perfect yet,",
          "zh": "另外，這段程式碼也還不完美，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 266.2,
          "end": 267.033,
          "en": "by the way",
          "zh": "順帶一提"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 267.033,
          "end": 268.266,
          "en": "I'll come back to this in a second",
          "zh": "我等等會再回來談這一點"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 268.266,
          "end": 269.466,
          "en": "but generally,",
          "zh": "但一般來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 269.466,
          "end": 272.733,
          "en": "you can switch between these approaches.",
          "zh": "你可以在這些做法之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 272.733,
          "end": 277.2,
          "en": "Now, I tend to prefer the individual state slices,",
          "zh": "我自己比較偏好獨立的 state 切片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 277.2,
          "end": 280.666,
          "en": "And I would say you also see that more often out there",
          "zh": "而且我會說，在外面你也更常看到這種寫法"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 280.666,
          "end": 283.133,
          "en": "in the world, in other react projects,",
          "zh": "在其他 React 專案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 283.133,
          "end": 286.8,
          "en": "but ultimately both approaches are fine.",
          "zh": "但到頭來，兩種做法都沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 286.8,
          "end": 288.4,
          "en": "One thing is not fine though,",
          "zh": "不過有一件事是有問題的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 288.4,
          "end": 291.7,
          "en": "And that is how I update my state here.",
          "zh": "那就是我在這裡更新 state 的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 291.7,
          "end": 296.83299999999997,
          "en": "When I also consider my oldest state for copying in values.",
          "zh": "也就是當我也把我舊的 state 拿來複製值的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 296.83299999999997,
          "end": 299.033,
          "en": "And that's something we're going to take a closer look",
          "zh": "而這是我們接下來要更仔細看看的"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 299.033,
          "end": 300.766,
          "en": "at in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "內容，就在下一堂課。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25596010",
      "title": "Updating State That Depends On The Previous State",
      "sourceHash": "b8d2af712e7ca941c2af976484f746325ab31da8b62eb39f483e6ddf58df8f26",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2,
          "end": 3.666,
          "en": "Instructor: So in the last lecture I showed you",
          "zh": "講師：所以在上一堂課中，我示範了"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.666,
          "end": 6.566,
          "en": "how you can use one state instead of multiple states.",
          "zh": "如何用一個 state 取代多個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.566,
          "end": 8.566,
          "en": "And I did talk about it there.",
          "zh": "而我在那裡確實有談到這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.566,
          "end": 10.733,
          "en": "Now the way I'm updating my state here",
          "zh": "不過我在這裡更新 state 的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.733,
          "end": 13.1,
          "en": "is not entirely correct though.",
          "zh": "其實並不完全正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.1,
          "end": 13.4,
          "en": "is not entirely correct though.",
          "zh": "其實並不完全正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 15.766,
          "en": "It technically would work,",
          "zh": "技術上來說它是可行的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.766,
          "end": 18.966,
          "en": "but in niche cases it could fail,",
          "zh": "但在某些特殊情況下可能會出錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.966,
          "end": 23.366,
          "en": "and it's simply not a good practice to update it like this.",
          "zh": "而且這樣更新 state 單純不是個好做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.366,
          "end": 25.366,
          "en": "So what's the problem here?",
          "zh": "那麼問題出在哪裡呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.366,
          "end": 28.533,
          "en": "Here, I'm depending on my previous state",
          "zh": "在這裡，我依賴了我的 previous state"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.533,
          "end": 30.2,
          "en": "for updating the state.",
          "zh": "來更新 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.2,
          "end": 32.933,
          "en": "In this case, we depend on the previous state",
          "zh": "在這個情況下，我們會依賴 previous state"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.933,
          "end": 34.9,
          "en": "because we used this one state",
          "zh": "因為我們用了這一個 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.9,
          "end": 37.433,
          "en": "instead of three-states approach",
          "zh": "而不是用三個 state 的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.433,
          "end": 37.466,
          "en": "instead of three-states approach",
          "zh": "而不是用三個 state 的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.466,
          "end": 39.933,
          "en": "and we need to copy in the other values",
          "zh": "而且我們需要把其他值複製進來"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.933,
          "end": 41.9,
          "en": "so that we don't lose them.",
          "zh": "才不會把它們弄丟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.9,
          "end": 45.3,
          "en": "Hence we depend on the previous state snapshot",
          "zh": "因此我們依賴 previous state 的快照"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.3,
          "end": 47.5,
          "en": "to copy in the existing values",
          "zh": "來複製既有的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 47.5,
          "end": 51.666,
          "en": "and then just override one value with a new one.",
          "zh": "然後只用新的值覆寫其中一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.666,
          "end": 52.033,
          "en": "and then just override one value with a new one.",
          "zh": "然後只用新的值覆寫其中一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 52.033,
          "end": 55.066,
          "en": "Now whenever, and that's another key rule",
          "zh": "現在，每當——這也是另一個重要規則"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 55.066,
          "end": 56.566,
          "en": "which you should memorize,",
          "zh": "你應該要牢牢記住的——"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 56.566,
          "end": 59.266,
          "en": "whenever you update state",
          "zh": "每當你更新 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 59.266,
          "end": 62.6,
          "en": "and you depend on the previous state,",
          "zh": "而且是依賴 previous state 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.6,
          "end": 65.233,
          "en": "so for example, as we do here in this object,",
          "zh": "比如說，就像我們在這個物件裡所做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 65.233,
          "end": 67.6,
          "en": "but also if you would be managing a counter",
          "zh": "但如果你是在管理一個計數器"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 67.6,
          "end": 70.166,
          "en": "which you increment by one, for example,",
          "zh": "例如每次都把它加一的那種，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.166,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "which you increment by one, for example,",
          "zh": "例如每次都把它加一的那種，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 72.2,
          "en": "whenever you update your state",
          "zh": "每當你更新你的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 72.2,
          "end": 74.233,
          "en": "and you depend on the previous state,",
          "zh": "而且是依賴 previous state 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 74.233,
          "end": 76.4,
          "en": "you should not do it like this",
          "zh": "你不該像這樣寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 76.4,
          "end": 78.96600000000001,
          "en": "but you should use an alternative form",
          "zh": "而應該改用另一種形式的"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 78.96600000000001,
          "end": 82.633,
          "en": "of this state updating function.",
          "zh": "state 更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 82.633,
          "end": 85.133,
          "en": "Instead of calling it like this,",
          "zh": "與其像這樣呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 85.133,
          "end": 90.233,
          "en": "you should call it and pass in a function to that function.",
          "zh": "你應該呼叫它，並把一個函式傳進那個函式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.233,
          "end": 92.8,
          "en": "So you call the setUserInput function",
          "zh": "所以你要呼叫 setUserInput 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 92.8,
          "end": 94.7,
          "en": "and you pass a function to it,",
          "zh": "然後傳一個函式給它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.7,
          "end": 98.8,
          "en": "for example, such an anonymous arrow function.",
          "zh": "例如像這樣一個匿名的箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.8,
          "end": 102.866,
          "en": "And this function, which you pass to setUserInput here,",
          "zh": "而你傳給 setUserInput 的這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.866,
          "end": 105.96600000000001,
          "en": "will automatically be executed by React.",
          "zh": "會由 React 自動執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 105.96600000000001,
          "end": 106.13300000000001,
          "en": "will automatically be executed by React.",
          "zh": "會由 React 自動執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.13300000000001,
          "end": 110.46600000000001,
          "en": "And it will receive the previous state snapshot",
          "zh": "而且它會收到 previous state 的快照"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.46600000000001,
          "end": 112.96600000000001,
          "en": "for that state for which you're calling",
          "zh": "也就是你呼叫更新函式的那個 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 112.96600000000001,
          "end": 114.566,
          "en": "the updating function,",
          "zh": "的 previous state 快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 114.566,
          "end": 114.63300000000001,
          "en": "the updating function,",
          "zh": "的 previous state 快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114.63300000000001,
          "end": 118.4,
          "en": "so in this case, for this object state here.",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下，就是這裡這個物件 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 118.4,
          "end": 121.433,
          "en": "So we'll get the previous state snapshot,",
          "zh": "所以我們會拿到 previous state 的快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 121.433,
          "end": 127.833,
          "en": "and now here, we should return the new state snapshot.",
          "zh": "而現在在這裡，我們應該回傳新的 state 快照。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 127.833,
          "end": 128.933,
          "en": "So instead of this function",
          "zh": "所以與其像這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.933,
          "end": 131.133,
          "en": "which we passed to the state updating function,",
          "zh": "我們傳給 state 更新函式的這種寫法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 131.133,
          "end": 133.933,
          "en": "we return the new state now.",
          "zh": "我們現在改成回傳新的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 133.933,
          "end": 135.533,
          "en": "And that now could be,",
          "zh": "而那個新的 state 可以是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 135.533,
          "end": 138.233,
          "en": "or in this case, should be, our object",
          "zh": "或者說，在這個情況下應該是，我們的物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 138.233,
          "end": 138.633,
          "en": "or in this case, should be, our object",
          "zh": "或者說，在這個情況下應該是，我們的物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 138.633,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "where I copy in the key value pairs from the previous state",
          "zh": "我在裡面把 previous state 的鍵值對複製進來"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 144.733,
          "en": "with the spread operator,",
          "zh": "使用展開運算子（spread operator），"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 144.733,
          "end": 146.86599999999999,
          "en": "but where we then also override,",
          "zh": "但接著我們也覆寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 146.86599999999999,
          "end": 153.233,
          "en": "in this case here, enteredTitle with event.target.value.",
          "zh": "在這個情況下就是 enteredTitle，用 event.target.value 覆寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 153.233,
          "end": 157.166,
          "en": "Now why should we do it like this instead of like this?",
          "zh": "那麼，為什麼我們該用這種寫法，而不是這種寫法呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 157.166,
          "end": 157.53300000000002,
          "en": "Now why should we do it like this instead of like this?",
          "zh": "那麼，為什麼我們該用這種寫法，而不是這種寫法呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 157.53300000000002,
          "end": 160.53300000000002,
          "en": "In many cases, both will work fine,",
          "zh": "在許多情況下，兩種寫法都能正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 160.53300000000002,
          "end": 162.433,
          "en": "but keep in mind that I mentioned",
          "zh": "但請記住我提過"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 162.433,
          "end": 165.333,
          "en": "that Reacts schedules state updates,",
          "zh": "React 會排程 state 更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 165.333,
          "end": 168.333,
          "en": "it doesn't perform them instantly.",
          "zh": "它不會立刻執行這些更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 168.333,
          "end": 168.53300000000002,
          "en": "it doesn't perform them instantly.",
          "zh": "它不會立刻執行這些更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 168.53300000000002,
          "end": 170.733,
          "en": "And therefore, theoretically,",
          "zh": "因此，理論上來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 170.733,
          "end": 174.566,
          "en": "if you schedule a lot of state updates at the same time,",
          "zh": "如果你同時排程了大量的 state 更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 174.566,
          "end": 176.933,
          "en": "you could be depending on an outdated",
          "zh": "你可能會依賴到過時的"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 176.933,
          "end": 178.833,
          "en": "or incorrect state snapshot",
          "zh": "或錯誤的 state 快照"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 178.833,
          "end": 181.4,
          "en": "if you use this approach.",
          "zh": "如果你使用這種寫法的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 181.4,
          "end": 184.86599999999999,
          "en": "If you use this approach, React will guarantee",
          "zh": "如果你使用這種寫法，React 會保證"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 184.86599999999999,
          "end": 187.766,
          "en": "that the state snapshot it gives you here",
          "zh": "它在這裡給你的 state 快照"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 187.766,
          "end": 189.5,
          "en": "in this inner function,",
          "zh": "在這個內部函式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 189.5,
          "end": 192.966,
          "en": "will always be the latest state snapshot,",
          "zh": "永遠會是最新的 state 快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 192.966,
          "end": 196.633,
          "en": "keeping all scheduled state updates in mind.",
          "zh": "並把所有已排程的 state 更新都納入考量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 196.633,
          "end": 197.066,
          "en": "keeping all scheduled state updates in mind.",
          "zh": "並把所有已排程的 state 更新都納入考量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 197.066,
          "end": 198.8,
          "en": "So this is the safer way",
          "zh": "所以這是比較安全的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 198.8,
          "end": 200.86599999999999,
          "en": "to ensure that you always operate",
          "zh": "能確保你永遠都是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 200.86599999999999,
          "end": 203.8,
          "en": "on the latest state snapshot.",
          "zh": "最新的 state 快照上操作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 203.8,
          "end": 207.36599999999999,
          "en": "So you should use this function syntax here",
          "zh": "所以你應該使用這裡這種函式語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 207.36599999999999,
          "end": 212.36599999999999,
          "en": "whenever your state update depends on the previous state.",
          "zh": "每當你的 state 更新依賴 previous state 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 212.36599999999999,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "whenever your state update depends on the previous state.",
          "zh": "每當你的 state 更新依賴 previous state 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 214.53300000000002,
          "en": "That is something you should memorize.",
          "zh": "這是你要記住的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 214.53300000000002,
          "end": 217.166,
          "en": "If your state update depends on the previous state,",
          "zh": "如果你的 state 更新依賴 previous state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 217.166,
          "end": 219.9,
          "en": "use this function form.",
          "zh": "就使用這種函式形式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 219.9,
          "end": 221.766,
          "en": "With all of that though,",
          "zh": "不過，講了這麼多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 221.766,
          "end": 224.7,
          "en": "I wanted to show this because these are key concepts",
          "zh": "我之所以想示範這個，是因為這些都是關鍵概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 224.7,
          "end": 227.166,
          "en": "which you're also going to see again and again",
          "zh": "你之後也會一再看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 227.166,
          "end": 228.36599999999999,
          "en": "throughout this course",
          "zh": "在整門課程中"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 228.36599999999999,
          "end": 230.666,
          "en": "and throughout a lot of React projects,",
          "zh": "以及在許多 React 專案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 230.666,
          "end": 233.166,
          "en": "but here I will actually comment out",
          "zh": "但在這裡，我其實會把"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 233.166,
          "end": 235.2,
          "en": "all of these alternatives",
          "zh": "所有這些替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 235.36599999999999,
          "en": "all of these alternatives",
          "zh": "所有這些替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 235.36599999999999,
          "end": 236.4,
          "en": "and I will switch back",
          "zh": "並且我會切換回來"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 236.4,
          "end": 239.833,
          "en": "to that multiple states approach instead,",
          "zh": "改用那個多個 state 的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 239.833,
          "end": 241.333,
          "en": "which we initially had.",
          "zh": "也就是我們原本的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 241.333,
          "end": 241.7,
          "en": "which we initially had.",
          "zh": "也就是我們原本的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 241.7,
          "end": 243.4,
          "en": "So let's comment out all of that",
          "zh": "所以我們把這些全部註解掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 243.4,
          "end": 246.7,
          "en": "and go back to this initial approach.",
          "zh": "並回到這個最初的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 246.7,
          "end": 248.533,
          "en": "I just wanted to show the alternative",
          "zh": "我只是想示範這個替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 248.533,
          "end": 251,
          "en": "because it is a valid alternative,",
          "zh": "因為它是個可行的替代做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 251,
          "end": 252.733,
          "en": "you will see it in many projects,",
          "zh": "你會在很多專案裡看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 252.733,
          "end": 255.333,
          "en": "you will have scenarios where you need it.",
          "zh": "你也會遇到需要它的情境。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 255.333,
          "end": 255.8,
          "en": "you will have scenarios where you need it.",
          "zh": "你也會遇到需要它的情境。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 255.8,
          "end": 258.266,
          "en": "And this thing regarding the,",
          "zh": "而關於這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 258.266,
          "end": 260.5,
          "en": "if you depend on the previous state,",
          "zh": "如果你依賴 previous state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 260.5,
          "end": 263.466,
          "en": "use this approach thing here,",
          "zh": "就使用這種寫法這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 263.466,
          "end": 265.9,
          "en": "that's something you should keep in mind in general,",
          "zh": "這是整體上你都該記住的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 265.9,
          "end": 269.066,
          "en": "because you will often depend on a previous state,",
          "zh": "因為你經常會依賴 previous state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 269.066,
          "end": 271.83299999999997,
          "en": "not just if you merged state like this",
          "zh": "不只是像這樣合併 state 的時候"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 271.83299999999997,
          "end": 273.533,
          "en": "but also in other scenarios,",
          "zh": "在其他情境也是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 273.533,
          "end": 276.4,
          "en": "like the counter which I mentioned, for example.",
          "zh": "例如我提到的計數器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 276.4,
          "end": 277.933,
          "en": "So that's why I mentioned this.",
          "zh": "這就是我提到這件事的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 277.933,
          "end": 281.7,
          "en": "Nonetheless, let's go back to this multi-state approach now.",
          "zh": "儘管如此，我們現在就回到這個多個 state 的做法吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38345448",
      "title": "Alternative: Creating A Shared Handler Function",
      "sourceHash": "1d656bdb623ec61952d5d012db74d51c031facea00e814fcc1a0e48f07961d11",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "Now before we'll dive deeper",
          "zh": "在我們更深入探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "into state, React events,",
          "zh": "state、React 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 9.81,
          "en": "and what we can do with all these things,",
          "zh": "以及我們能用這些東西做些什麼之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.81,
          "end": 11.43,
          "en": "I wanna take a closer look",
          "zh": "我想先仔細看一下"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.43,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "at these change handler functions,",
          "zh": "這些 change handler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 18.81,
          "en": "because at the moment in this demo application",
          "zh": "因為目前在這個示範應用程式裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 21.96,
          "en": "I have three change handler functions.",
          "zh": "我有三個 change handler 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 26.34,
          "en": "One for the title, one for the amount, and one for the date.",
          "zh": "一個給 title，一個給 amount，還有一個給 date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.34,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "Which makes sense since I have these three state slices",
          "zh": "這很合理，因為我有這三個 state 片段"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 33.813,
          "en": "and these three main inputs.",
          "zh": "以及這三個主要的 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 38.91,
          "en": "And of course, using this approach is also absolutely fine.",
          "zh": "當然，採用這種做法也完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.91,
          "end": 40.11,
          "en": "There's nothing wrong",
          "zh": "這樣做並沒有任何不對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.11,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "with having these different change handler functions,",
          "zh": "也就是擁有這些不同的 change handler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "but I wanna show you an alternative approach",
          "zh": "但我想給你看一個替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 49.293,
          "en": "which you also could consider using.",
          "zh": "你也可以考慮採用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.13,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "Instead of having all these",
          "zh": "與其擁有這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "separate change handler functions,",
          "zh": "各自分開的 change handler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 58.71,
          "en": "you could try to create one shared change handler function.",
          "zh": "你可以試著建立一個共用的 change handler 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "For that, we could create a new function",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以建立一個新的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 64.053,
          "en": "which could be named inputChangeHandler.",
          "zh": "可以把它命名為 inputChangeHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.16,
          "end": 67.89,
          "en": "And here I'll also create an arrow function,",
          "zh": "在這裡我也會建立一個箭頭函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 72.12,
          "en": "but I'll now not accept the event argument.",
          "zh": "但這次我不會接收 event 參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.12,
          "end": 76.74,
          "en": "But instead here we could accept some identifier,",
          "zh": "相反的，我們可以在這裡接收某個 identifier，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.74,
          "end": 79.38,
          "en": "though this name is up to you because it's your function,",
          "zh": "不過這個名稱由你決定，因為這是你寫的函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "hence your parameter name.",
          "zh": "也就是你的參數名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 83.10300000000001,
          "en": "And then maybe a value.",
          "zh": "然後也許再加一個 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.45,
          "end": 87.69,
          "en": "And my idea is that I can use this one single function",
          "zh": "我的想法是，我可以用這一個單一的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.69,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "for all my inputs, for all those onChange events.",
          "zh": "來處理我所有的 input、所有的 onChange 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 96.12,
          "en": "And then we can simply identify the different inputs",
          "zh": "接著我們就可以輕鬆辨識出不同的 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.12,
          "end": 97.62,
          "en": "with help of this identifier",
          "zh": "透過這個 identifier 的幫助"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.62,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "and update the correct state slice",
          "zh": "並更新正確的 state 片段"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "based on the identifier that was passed to this function",
          "zh": "根據傳進這個函式的 identifier"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 106.263,
          "en": "with that value.",
          "zh": "以及那個 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.43,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "So in here we could, for example, check if identifier",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們可以，比如說，檢查 identifier"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "is equal to, let's say, title.",
          "zh": "是否等於，比方說，title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 118.95,
          "en": "And if that's the case, we update the title state",
          "zh": "如果真的是這樣，我們就更新 title 這個 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.95,
          "end": 120.58,
          "en": "by calling setEnteredTitle",
          "zh": "透過呼叫 setEnteredTitle"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.53,
          "end": 124.563,
          "en": "and setting this equal to the new value.",
          "zh": "並把它設成新的 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 130.86,
          "en": "Else if it's not title, we could check if the identifier",
          "zh": "否則，如果它不是 title，我們可以檢查這個 identifier"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.86,
          "end": 135.86,
          "en": "is maybe equal to the date here, so if it's equal to date,",
          "zh": "是否也許等於這裡的 date，所以如果它等於 date，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 143.27,
          "en": "and then update the EnteredDate with the value.",
          "zh": "然後就用那個 value 更新 EnteredDate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "And else it must be the amount,",
          "zh": "再不然它就一定是 amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 149.57999999999998,
          "en": "and therefore we could then call setEnteredAmount",
          "zh": "因此我們就可以接著呼叫 setEnteredAmount"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.57999999999998,
          "end": 151.713,
          "en": "and set as equal to value.",
          "zh": "並把它設成等於 value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 154.14,
          "end": 156.03,
          "en": "So with that, I am calling",
          "zh": "如此一來，我就是在呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.03,
          "end": 157.98,
          "en": "all these state updating functions,",
          "zh": "所有這些 state 更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 159.03,
          "en": "but I'm now doing this",
          "zh": "但我現在是把這件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.03,
          "end": 162.03300000000002,
          "en": "all in one shared change handler function.",
          "zh": "全都在同一個共用的 change handler 函式裡完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.39,
          "end": 166.38,
          "en": "Now we can't use this change handler function",
          "zh": "不過我們現在不能把這個 change handler 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.38,
          "end": 169.77,
          "en": "as a input for onChange now though.",
          "zh": "當成 onChange 的 input 來使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.77,
          "end": 171.99,
          "en": "That won't work because as you learned,",
          "zh": "這樣行不通，因為就像你學過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.99,
          "end": 174.96,
          "en": "React will, in the end, call this function for us",
          "zh": "React 最後會替我們呼叫這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 178.07999999999998,
          "en": "and will pass such an event object to it",
          "zh": "並傳一個這樣的 event 物件給它"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.07999999999998,
          "end": 180.75,
          "en": "and it will definitely not pass an identifier",
          "zh": "而它絕對不會傳一個 identifier"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.75,
          "end": 182.13,
          "en": "and value to it.",
          "zh": "和 value 給它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.13,
          "end": 184.86,
          "en": "We're not going to get those data points",
          "zh": "我們不會拿到那些資料點"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.86,
          "end": 186.933,
          "en": "when React calls this function.",
          "zh": "當 React 呼叫這個函式時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.8,
          "end": 191.013,
          "en": "But we need them for this function to work correctly.",
          "zh": "但我們需要它們，這個函式才能正確運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192.06,
          "end": 195.6,
          "en": "Now what we can do here to work around this,",
          "zh": "那麼我們在這裡可以怎麼繞過這個問題呢，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.6,
          "end": 198.45,
          "en": "is we can go to this onChange function",
          "zh": "就是我們可以到這個 onChange 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.45,
          "end": 202.5,
          "en": "and instead of passing a pointer to inputChangeHandler",
          "zh": "與其傳一個指向 inputChangeHandler 的參考"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.5,
          "end": 204.39,
          "en": "as a value to onChange,",
          "zh": "作為 onChange 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.39,
          "end": 206.57999999999998,
          "en": "we can pass an arrow function to it.",
          "zh": "我們可以改傳一個箭頭函式給它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.04,
          "en": "A new anonymous arrow function",
          "zh": "一個新的匿名箭頭函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 209.04,
          "end": 212.1,
          "en": "which we create down there where we need it.",
          "zh": "我們就在需要它的地方就地建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.1,
          "end": 215.04,
          "en": "With that, it's this arrow function that will be called",
          "zh": "這樣一來，會被呼叫的就是這個箭頭函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.04,
          "end": 217.71,
          "en": "by React whenever this input changes.",
          "zh": "每當這個 input 變動時，由 React 呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.71,
          "end": 220.26,
          "en": "Therefore this arrow function will receive",
          "zh": "因此這個箭頭函式會收到"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.26,
          "end": 221.583,
          "en": "this event object.",
          "zh": "這個 event 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.78,
          "end": 225.6,
          "en": "And in the body of this arrow function",
          "zh": "而在這個箭頭函式的內容裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.6,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "we can now manually execute inputChangeHandler.",
          "zh": "我們現在可以手動執行 inputChangeHandler。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 233.94,
          "en": "So execute this function here, which I just added.",
          "zh": "也就是執行我剛剛加入的這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.94,
          "end": 237.18,
          "en": "We manually execute it by adding parentheses.",
          "zh": "我們透過加上括號來手動執行它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.18,
          "end": 239.79,
          "en": "And now this code in here will not be executed",
          "zh": "而現在這裡的這段程式碼不會被執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 239.79,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "when this line of code here is parsed,",
          "zh": "當這一行程式碼被解析時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 244.98,
          "en": "but instead this here will only be executed",
          "zh": "相反的，這裡的這段只會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.98,
          "end": 247.98,
          "en": "when this arrow function here is executed.",
          "zh": "這個箭頭函式被執行時才會執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.98,
          "end": 250.35,
          "en": "And that will only be the case",
          "zh": "而那只有在"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.35,
          "end": 252.093,
          "en": "when this change event occurs.",
          "zh": "這個 change 事件發生時才會成立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.44,
          "end": 257.67,
          "en": "But now that we have this wrapper arrow function here",
          "zh": "但既然我們現在有這個包裝用的箭頭函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.67,
          "end": 259.74,
          "en": "we have full control",
          "zh": "我們就能完全掌控"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.74,
          "end": 262.89300000000003,
          "en": "over how inputChangeHandler will be executed.",
          "zh": "inputChangeHandler 會如何被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.73,
          "end": 266.73,
          "en": "And we can therefore now pass our identifier",
          "zh": "因此我們現在可以傳入我們的 identifier"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 266.73,
          "end": 268.77,
          "en": "as a first argument.",
          "zh": "作為第一個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 268.77,
          "end": 270.9,
          "en": "So for example, title here,",
          "zh": "所以比如說，這裡的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 270.9,
          "end": 274.35,
          "en": "so that for this title input here,",
          "zh": "這樣對於這裡這個 title input 來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 274.35,
          "end": 276.48,
          "en": "we pass title as an identifier,",
          "zh": "我們就傳入 title 作為 identifier，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.48,
          "end": 279.183,
          "en": "so that we make it into this if branch here.",
          "zh": "讓我們能進到這裡這個 if 分支。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 280.8,
          "end": 284.76,
          "en": "And as a second argument, we pass the value that changed.",
          "zh": "而作為第二個參數，我們傳入那個變動後的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.76,
          "end": 288.3,
          "en": "So in this case here, event.target.value,",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下，就是 event.target.value，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.3,
          "end": 292.02,
          "en": "just as before, but now in this arrow function.",
          "zh": "就跟之前一樣，但現在是在這個箭頭函式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.02,
          "end": 294.42,
          "en": "And with that, we as a developer,",
          "zh": "如此一來，我們身為開發者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 294.42,
          "end": 297.15,
          "en": "control how this function here will be called",
          "zh": "就能掌控這裡這個函式會如何被呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.15,
          "end": 299.82,
          "en": "by wrapping it in such a arrow function,",
          "zh": "透過把它包在這樣一個箭頭函式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.82,
          "end": 302.25,
          "en": "which is the actual function that's passed",
          "zh": "而這個箭頭函式才是實際上被傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 302.25,
          "end": 304.413,
          "en": "as a value to the onChange prop.",
          "zh": "作為 onChange prop 值的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 305.67,
          "end": 308.1,
          "en": "But then we control how this inner function",
          "zh": "但接著我們掌控了這個內部函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 308.1,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "will be executed when the change event occurs,",
          "zh": "在 change 事件發生時會如何被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 314.19,
          "en": "and we can then use this generic handler function",
          "zh": "我們就可以使用這個通用的 handler 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.19,
          "end": 317.7,
          "en": "because now we could use this same code here,",
          "zh": "因為我們現在可以在這裡使用相同的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.7,
          "end": 319.62,
          "en": "or almost the same code,",
          "zh": "或者幾乎相同的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 319.62,
          "end": 322.98,
          "en": "on the amount input value, for example,",
          "zh": "比如說用在 amount 的 input 值上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.98,
          "end": 325.623,
          "en": "and pass amount as an identifier.",
          "zh": "並傳入 amount 作為 identifier。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 326.52,
          "end": 328.59,
          "en": "But other than that, it's the same code",
          "zh": "但除此之外，程式碼是一樣的"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 328.59,
          "end": 332.34000000000003,
          "en": "and the function that's being executed is always the same.",
          "zh": "而且被執行的函式永遠是同一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 332.34000000000003,
          "end": 335.94,
          "en": "And this approach simply is an alternative",
          "zh": "而這種做法就只是一種替代方案"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 335.94,
          "end": 340.40999999999997,
          "en": "to having multiple specialized handler functions.",
          "zh": "用來取代擁有多個專門化的 handler 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 342.78,
          "en": "As mentioned, there's nothing wrong",
          "zh": "就像提過的，這樣做並沒有任何問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 342.78,
          "end": 345.72,
          "en": "with having these specialized handler functions,",
          "zh": "也就是擁有這些專門化的 handler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 345.72,
          "end": 347.55,
          "en": "but as an alternative,",
          "zh": "但作為一種替代方案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 347.55,
          "end": 350.523,
          "en": "you could consider using such shared functions.",
          "zh": "你可以考慮使用這種共用的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 351.72,
          "end": 354.36,
          "en": "With that, I'll get rid of that though",
          "zh": "不過，講完之後我會把它拿掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 354.36,
          "end": 357.9,
          "en": "and move back to the code we had before",
          "zh": "並退回到我們之前的那份程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 357.9,
          "end": 359.97,
          "en": "with the titleChangeHandler",
          "zh": "也就是有 titleChangeHandler"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 359.97,
          "end": 362.193,
          "en": "and the amountChangeHandler here.",
          "zh": "和這裡的 amountChangeHandler 的版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 364.23,
          "end": 367.08,
          "en": "But I definitely wanted to share this alternative",
          "zh": "但我一定要分享這個替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 367.08,
          "end": 370.32,
          "en": "since it is something you might see in some React projects.",
          "zh": "因為你可能會在某些 React 專案裡看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 370.32,
          "end": 373.23,
          "en": "And since it is something you might want to use yourself",
          "zh": "也因為它可能是你自己會想用的東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 373.23,
          "end": 375.093,
          "en": "in your React projects.",
          "zh": "在你的 React 專案裡。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25596014",
      "title": "Handling Form Submission",
      "sourceHash": "f5f12bddc2c62ffb92a99767ab72f2df8ab6b28c1c40e183118581c01c5e968b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 3.533,
          "en": "Instructor: Now we spent a lot of time",
          "zh": "講師：現在我們花了很多時間"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.533,
          "end": 5.1,
          "en": "on this state here",
          "zh": "在這裡的這個 state 上"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.1,
          "end": 7.166,
          "en": "and it showed a lot of alternatives",
          "zh": "而它展示了許多替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.166,
          "end": 8.666,
          "en": "but up to this point of course",
          "zh": "但到目前為止，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.666,
          "end": 10.1,
          "en": "we're not doing too much",
          "zh": "我們並沒有做太多"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.1,
          "end": 11.6,
          "en": "with that state.",
          "zh": "運用那個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 11.6,
          "end": 13.866,
          "en": "That's what I wanna change now, though.",
          "zh": "不過，這就是我現在想改變的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 13.866,
          "end": 15.533,
          "en": "Now I wanna make sure that",
          "zh": "現在我想確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 15.533,
          "end": 17,
          "en": "this form can be submitted",
          "zh": "這個 form 可以被提交"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 17,
          "end": 18.833,
          "en": "when this button is pressed",
          "zh": "當這個按鈕被按下時"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 18.833,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "when this button is pressed",
          "zh": "當這個按鈕被按下時"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 20.2,
          "en": "and that then",
          "zh": "然後接著"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 20.2,
          "end": 22.333,
          "en": "we basically gather",
          "zh": "我們基本上是收集"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 22.333,
          "end": 25,
          "en": "these different state slices here",
          "zh": "這裡這些不同的 state 片段"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 25,
          "end": 28.066,
          "en": "and combine them into one object",
          "zh": "並把它們組合成一個 object"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 28.066,
          "end": 29.133,
          "en": "which for the moment",
          "zh": "這個 object 目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 29.133,
          "end": 30.833,
          "en": "is then just locked to the console",
          "zh": "只是被記錄到 console 上"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 30.833,
          "end": 31.766,
          "en": "but which we can use",
          "zh": "但我們之後可以拿它來"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 31.766,
          "end": 34.733,
          "en": "for different things later",
          "zh": "做不同的事情"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 34.733,
          "end": 36.866,
          "en": "and therefore we wanna listen",
          "zh": "因此我們想監聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 36.866,
          "end": 38.833,
          "en": "to the form being submitted.",
          "zh": "這個 form 被提交的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 38.833,
          "end": 41.433,
          "en": "Now we could add a click listener here",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡加一個 click 監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 41.433,
          "end": 44.5,
          "en": "to this add expense button",
          "zh": "到這個 add expense 按鈕上"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 44.5,
          "end": 45.733,
          "en": "but this would not be",
          "zh": "但這樣不會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 45.733,
          "end": 47.833,
          "en": "the best way of listening here",
          "zh": "在這裡監聽的最佳方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 47.833,
          "end": 48.3,
          "en": "the best way of listening here",
          "zh": "在這裡監聽的最佳方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 48.3,
          "end": 49.5,
          "en": "because indeed there is",
          "zh": "因為確實有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 49.5,
          "end": 50.833,
          "en": "a default behavior",
          "zh": "預設行為"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 50.833,
          "end": 52.4,
          "en": "built into the browser",
          "zh": "內建在瀏覽器中"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 52.4,
          "end": 55.566,
          "en": "and built into forums on web pages.",
          "zh": "也內建在網頁上的 form 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 55.566,
          "end": 56.033,
          "en": "and built into forums on web pages.",
          "zh": "也內建在網頁上的 form 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 56.033,
          "end": 57.533,
          "en": "If a button,",
          "zh": "如果一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 57.533,
          "end": 59.633,
          "en": "especially with type submit",
          "zh": "尤其是 type 為 submit 的按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 59.633,
          "end": 62.1,
          "en": "is pressed inside of a form,",
          "zh": "在 form 裡被按下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 62.1,
          "end": 64.033,
          "en": "this overall form element",
          "zh": "這整個 form 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 64.033,
          "end": 65.533,
          "en": "will emit an event",
          "zh": "就會發出一個 event"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 65.533,
          "end": 66.966,
          "en": "to which we can listen",
          "zh": "我們可以監聽它"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 66.966,
          "end": 67.2,
          "en": "to which we can listen",
          "zh": "我們可以監聽它"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 67.2,
          "end": 69.7,
          "en": "and that's the submit event.",
          "zh": "而那就是 submit event。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 69.7,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "So it's on this form",
          "zh": "所以就是在這個 form 上"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 74.3,
          "en": "where I wanna react to on submit",
          "zh": "我想要對 on submit 做出反應"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 74.3,
          "end": 77,
          "en": "and then execute some function",
          "zh": "然後執行某個 function"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 77,
          "end": 80.566,
          "en": "whenever this form is being submitted.",
          "zh": "每當這個 form 被提交時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 80.566,
          "end": 82.566,
          "en": "Now that's a function I'll add here",
          "zh": "現在我會在這裡加一個 function"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 82.566,
          "end": 83.633,
          "en": "and I'll name it,",
          "zh": "然後我會把它命名為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 83.633,
          "end": 87.866,
          "en": "submit handler like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣的 submit handler，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 87.866,
          "end": 88.7,
          "en": "add that here,",
          "zh": "把它加在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 88.7,
          "end": 91.1,
          "en": "we just point at submit handler",
          "zh": "我們只要指向 submit handler"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 91.1,
          "end": 91.93299999999999,
          "en": "as we did it",
          "zh": "就像我們之前做的"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 91.93299999999999,
          "end": 96.533,
          "en": "for all the other events as well.",
          "zh": "對所有其他 event 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 96.533,
          "end": 97.7,
          "en": "Now, the thing here",
          "zh": "現在，這裡的重點"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 97.7,
          "end": 99.566,
          "en": "is that I just said",
          "zh": "是我剛剛說過"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 99.566,
          "end": 102.033,
          "en": "that this is a default browser behavior",
          "zh": "這是瀏覽器的預設行為"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 102.033,
          "end": 103.63300000000001,
          "en": "and unfortunately,",
          "zh": "而很不幸地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 103.63300000000001,
          "end": 106.43299999999999,
          "en": "a part of this default browser behavior",
          "zh": "這個瀏覽器預設行為的一部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 106.43299999999999,
          "end": 109.866,
          "en": "is that if you do click this button,",
          "zh": "就是如果你真的點擊這個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 109.866,
          "end": 112.4,
          "en": "the page reloads because the browser",
          "zh": "頁面會重新載入，因為瀏覽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 112.4,
          "end": 115.3,
          "en": "actually automatically sends a request",
          "zh": "其實會自動送出一個請求"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 115.3,
          "end": 116.96600000000001,
          "en": "whenever a form is submitted",
          "zh": "每當 form 被提交時"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 116.96600000000001,
          "end": 118.1,
          "en": "to the server",
          "zh": "送到伺服器"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 118.1,
          "end": 119.5,
          "en": "which is hosting this webpage.",
          "zh": "也就是託管這個網頁的伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 119.5,
          "end": 120.333,
          "en": "So in this case",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況下"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 120.333,
          "end": 122.3,
          "en": "to this development server",
          "zh": "送到這個開發伺服器"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 122.3,
          "end": 122.8,
          "en": "to this development server",
          "zh": "送到這個開發伺服器"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 122.8,
          "end": 124.866,
          "en": "and that's not what we want here.",
          "zh": "而這不是我們在這裡想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 124.866,
          "end": 126.833,
          "en": "Instead here, we wanna handle",
          "zh": "相反地，我們想在這裡處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 126.833,
          "end": 128.266,
          "en": "this form submission",
          "zh": "這個 form 提交"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 128.266,
          "end": 130.733,
          "en": "with Java script and manually collect",
          "zh": "用 JavaScript 並手動收集"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 130.733,
          "end": 132.433,
          "en": "with Java script and manually collect",
          "zh": "用 JavaScript 並手動收集"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 132.433,
          "end": 133.6,
          "en": "and combine the data",
          "zh": "並組合這些資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 133.6,
          "end": 135.5,
          "en": "and do something with it.",
          "zh": "然後用它做點事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 135.5,
          "end": 137.3,
          "en": "Thankfully we can disable",
          "zh": "幸運的是，我們可以停用"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 137.3,
          "end": 139.933,
          "en": "or prevent this default behavior",
          "zh": "或阻止這個預設行為"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 139.933,
          "end": 140.833,
          "en": "because we again",
          "zh": "因為我們同樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 140.833,
          "end": 142.53300000000002,
          "en": "get an event object here,",
          "zh": "在這裡會拿到一個 event object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 142.53300000000002,
          "end": 144.166,
          "en": "automatically just as",
          "zh": "自動地，就像"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 144.166,
          "end": 146.466,
          "en": "for the change events",
          "zh": "在 change event 時一樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 146.466,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "for the change events",
          "zh": "在 change event 時一樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 148.6,
          "en": "and on this object,",
          "zh": "而在這個 object 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 148.6,
          "end": 153.466,
          "en": "we can call a prevent default method.",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫一個 preventDefault 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 153.466,
          "end": 155.53300000000002,
          "en": "This is built into JavaScript",
          "zh": "這是 JavaScript 內建的"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 155.53300000000002,
          "end": 157.066,
          "en": "nothing reacts specific",
          "zh": "不是 React 專屬的"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 157.066,
          "end": 159.933,
          "en": "this default JavaScript behavior.",
          "zh": "這個 JavaScript 的預設行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 159.933,
          "end": 161.466,
          "en": "We can prevent the default",
          "zh": "我們可以阻止這個預設"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 161.466,
          "end": 164.233,
          "en": "of this request being sent",
          "zh": "讓這個請求不被送出"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 164.233,
          "end": 164.53300000000002,
          "en": "of this request being sent",
          "zh": "讓這個請求不被送出"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 164.53300000000002,
          "end": 166.86599999999999,
          "en": "and since that request is not sent",
          "zh": "而既然那個請求沒有被送出"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 166.86599999999999,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "the page will now also not reload",
          "zh": "頁面現在也就不會重新載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 169.8,
          "en": "because we stay",
          "zh": "因為我們會留在"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 171.266,
          "en": "on the currently loaded page",
          "zh": "目前載入的頁面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 171.266,
          "end": 173.8,
          "en": "without sending any request anywhere",
          "zh": "不會送出任何請求到任何地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 173.8,
          "end": 175.933,
          "en": "and we can continue handling this",
          "zh": "而我們可以繼續處理這件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 175.933,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "with Java script.",
          "zh": "用 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 180,
          "en": "So they offer now",
          "zh": "所以現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 180,
          "end": 182.733,
          "en": "we can create our",
          "zh": "我們可以建立我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 182.733,
          "end": 185.933,
          "en": "let's say expense data object here",
          "zh": "比如說在這裡建立一個 expense data object"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 185.933,
          "end": 186.133,
          "en": "let's say expense data object here",
          "zh": "比如說在這裡建立一個 expense data object"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 186.133,
          "end": 187.233,
          "en": "and now we'll combine",
          "zh": "現在我們會組合"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 187.233,
          "end": 189.433,
          "en": "all that entered data.",
          "zh": "所有那些輸入的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 189.433,
          "end": 191,
          "en": "Of course, if you used this",
          "zh": "當然，如果你用的是這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 191,
          "end": 192.233,
          "en": "one state instead of",
          "zh": "單一 state 而不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 192.233,
          "end": 193.6,
          "en": "free States approach",
          "zh": "三個 state 的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 193.6,
          "end": 196.7,
          "en": "you already have such a combined object",
          "zh": "你已經有這樣一個組合好的 object"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 196.7,
          "end": 198,
          "en": "but I don't have that here.",
          "zh": "但我在這裡沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 198,
          "end": 199.166,
          "en": "So I will now create it",
          "zh": "所以我現在會建立它"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 199.166,
          "end": 201.066,
          "en": "once the form is submitted",
          "zh": "在 form 被提交之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 201.066,
          "end": 203.666,
          "en": "and simply add a title here",
          "zh": "並在這裡簡單地加上一個 title"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 203.666,
          "end": 204.233,
          "en": "and simply add a title here",
          "zh": "並在這裡簡單地加上一個 title"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 204.233,
          "end": 206.333,
          "en": "and set this to the value stored",
          "zh": "並把它設為儲存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 206.333,
          "end": 208.666,
          "en": "in the entered title state,",
          "zh": "entered title state 中的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 208.666,
          "end": 210.633,
          "en": "add an amount property",
          "zh": "加上一個 amount 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 210.633,
          "end": 213.86599999999999,
          "en": "and set this to entered amount",
          "zh": "並把它設為 entered amount"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 213.86599999999999,
          "end": 214.133,
          "en": "and set this to entered amount",
          "zh": "並把它設為 entered amount"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 214.133,
          "end": 216.1,
          "en": "and a date property",
          "zh": "還有一個 date 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 216.1,
          "end": 219.166,
          "en": "and actually set this to a new date,",
          "zh": "並實際上把它設為一個 new Date，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 219.166,
          "end": 220.5,
          "en": "constructing a new date",
          "zh": "用內建的"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 220.5,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "with the built in date constructor",
          "zh": "Date 建構函式建立一個新的 date"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 223.36599999999999,
          "en": "with the built in date constructor",
          "zh": "Date 建構函式建立一個新的 date"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 223.36599999999999,
          "end": 224.433,
          "en": "to which then in turn",
          "zh": "然後接著"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 224.433,
          "end": 226.36599999999999,
          "en": "I passed the entered date",
          "zh": "我把 entered date 傳給它"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 226.36599999999999,
          "end": 228.3,
          "en": "which will parse that date string",
          "zh": "它會把那個 date 字串解析"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 228.3,
          "end": 231.633,
          "en": "and converted into a date object.",
          "zh": "並轉換成一個 date object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 231.633,
          "end": 233.433,
          "en": "Now these property names here,",
          "zh": "現在這裡這些屬性名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 233.433,
          "end": 236.133,
          "en": "title, amount and date are up to you",
          "zh": "title、amount 和 date 都由你決定"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 236.133,
          "end": 238.03300000000002,
          "en": "because this is your object.",
          "zh": "因為這是你的 object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 238.03300000000002,
          "end": 238.433,
          "en": "because this is your object.",
          "zh": "因為這是你的 object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 238.433,
          "end": 239.433,
          "en": "This year, of course",
          "zh": "在這裡，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 239.433,
          "end": 241.433,
          "en": "entered title, entered amount",
          "zh": "entered title 和 entered amount"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 241.433,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "and entered date",
          "zh": "以及 entered date"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 245.533,
          "en": "points at these state variables",
          "zh": "指向這些 state 變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 245.533,
          "end": 247.3,
          "en": "so to say.",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 247.3,
          "end": 249.6,
          "en": "If you used the combined approach",
          "zh": "如果你用的是合併的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 249.6,
          "end": 250.633,
          "en": "you also might wanna",
          "zh": "你可能也會想"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 250.633,
          "end": 252.5,
          "en": "remap the property names",
          "zh": "重新對應這些屬性名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 252.5,
          "end": 253.6,
          "en": "because later in the app,",
          "zh": "因為之後在 app 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 253.6,
          "end": 255.166,
          "en": "I will rely on having",
          "zh": "我會依賴有"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 255.166,
          "end": 258.7,
          "en": "a title amount and date property name.",
          "zh": "title、amount 和 date 這些屬性名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 258.7,
          "end": 259.066,
          "en": "a title amount and date property name.",
          "zh": "title、amount 和 date 這些屬性名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 259.066,
          "end": 259.933,
          "en": "So make sure that",
          "zh": "所以請確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 259.933,
          "end": 261.266,
          "en": "these property names exist",
          "zh": "這些屬性名稱存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 261.266,
          "end": 263.733,
          "en": "and hold the correct value",
          "zh": "並保存正確的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 263.733,
          "end": 264.9,
          "en": "and then for the moment",
          "zh": "然後目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 264.9,
          "end": 269.933,
          "en": "I will just console log expense data",
          "zh": "我只會用 console log 印出 expense data"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 269.933,
          "end": 272.366,
          "en": "so that we can see that.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 272.366,
          "end": 274.4,
          "en": "Now, if we reload this",
          "zh": "現在，如果我們重新載入這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 274.4,
          "end": 277.5,
          "en": "and enter test and 1299",
          "zh": "並輸入 test 和 1299"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 277.5,
          "end": 279.366,
          "en": "and then pick some date here",
          "zh": "然後在這裡選個日期"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 279.366,
          "end": 281.733,
          "en": "if I click add expense,",
          "zh": "如果我點擊 add expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 281.733,
          "end": 282.8,
          "en": "that's looking good.",
          "zh": "看起來不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 282.8,
          "end": 283.766,
          "en": "We've got this object,",
          "zh": "我們取得了這個 object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 283.766,
          "end": 286.633,
          "en": "which has all that data stored.",
          "zh": "裡面儲存了所有的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 286.633,
          "end": 287.7,
          "en": "which has all that data stored.",
          "zh": "裡面儲存了所有的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 287.7,
          "end": 289.3,
          "en": "So this now all the works",
          "zh": "所以現在這一切都運作正常"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 289.3,
          "end": 290.6,
          "en": "and we are reacting",
          "zh": "而我們正在對"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 290.6,
          "end": 292.766,
          "en": "to the form submission.",
          "zh": "這個 form 提交做出反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 292.766,
          "end": 295.933,
          "en": "Now, I also wanna clear the inputs",
          "zh": "現在，我也想清空這些 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 295.933,
          "end": 297.966,
          "en": "to delete the entered values",
          "zh": "刪除已輸入的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 297.966,
          "end": 300.266,
          "en": "when that form is submitted.",
          "zh": "當那個 form 被提交時。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25596016",
      "title": "Adding Two-Way Binding",
      "sourceHash": "bfd6d4223d0d3669bb7cd01cc721b9a797487670b2d6b08ce6a2559a7fcfc1ea",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.8,
          "en": "Instructor: How can we clear those inputs?",
          "zh": "講師：我們要如何清空那些輸入欄位？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.8,
          "end": 8.2,
          "en": "Well, that's part of the reason why I wanted",
          "zh": "嗯，這就是為什麼我想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.2,
          "end": 12.7,
          "en": "to use state for storing the entered values.",
          "zh": "使用 state 來儲存已輸入的值的原因之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 15.066,
          "en": "We could've also used the global variables",
          "zh": "我們原本也可以使用全域變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.066,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "outside of the component function.",
          "zh": "放在 component function 外面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 20.633,
          "en": "Otherwise, if we just wanted to persist the values,",
          "zh": "否則，如果我們只是想保留這些值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.633,
          "end": 23.766,
          "en": "but by using state, we have an advantage.",
          "zh": "但透過使用 state，我們有一個優勢。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.766,
          "end": 25.666,
          "en": "We can now implement something",
          "zh": "我們現在可以實作一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.666,
          "end": 28.833,
          "en": "which is called two-way binding, which simply means",
          "zh": "叫做 two-way binding 的東西，它的意思很簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.833,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "which is called two-way binding, which simply means",
          "zh": "叫做 two-way binding 的東西，它的意思很簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 35.166,
          "en": "that for inputs we don't just listen to changes,",
          "zh": "就是對於 inputs，我們不只是監聽變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.166,
          "end": 40,
          "en": "but we can also pass a new value back into the input.",
          "zh": "我們還可以將新的 value 傳回 input 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40,
          "end": 44.633,
          "en": "So that we can reset or change the input programmatically.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能以程式化方式重設或變更 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.633,
          "end": 47.666,
          "en": "And how do we do that? Well, it's very simple.",
          "zh": "那我們要怎麼做呢？嗯，非常簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.666,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "All we have to do is add the value attribute,",
          "zh": "我們只要加上 value 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 56.333,
          "en": "which is a default attribute, to this input element.",
          "zh": "它是個預設屬性，加到這個 input 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.333,
          "end": 59.133,
          "en": "This will set the internal value property,",
          "zh": "這會設定內部的 value property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.133,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "which every input element has.",
          "zh": "這是每個 input 元素都有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 64.3,
          "en": "And we can set it to a new value.",
          "zh": "而我們可以將它設定為新的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.3,
          "end": 69.066,
          "en": "And here, I will bind this to enteredTitle.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我會將它綁定到 enteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.066,
          "end": 71.166,
          "en": "So now it is this two-way binding",
          "zh": "所以現在這就是所謂的 two-way binding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.166,
          "end": 71.2,
          "en": "So now it is this two-way binding",
          "zh": "所以現在這就是所謂的 two-way binding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.2,
          "end": 73.733,
          "en": "because now we don't just listen to changes",
          "zh": "因為現在我們不只是監聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.733,
          "end": 76.366,
          "en": "in the input to update our state.",
          "zh": "input 中的變更來更新我們的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.366,
          "end": 79.733,
          "en": "But we also feed the state back into the input",
          "zh": "我們還會把 state 送回 input 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.733,
          "end": 83.633,
          "en": "so that when we change the state, we also change input.",
          "zh": "這樣當我們變更 state 時，我們也會變更 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.633,
          "end": 85.46600000000001,
          "en": "This might sound like an infinite loop,",
          "zh": "這聽起來可能像是無限迴圈，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.46600000000001,
          "end": 86.533,
          "en": "but it actually isn't.",
          "zh": "但實際上並不是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.533,
          "end": 89.3,
          "en": "So we won't have a problem there.",
          "zh": "所以我們在那裡不會有問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.3,
          "end": 91.833,
          "en": "But the advantage is that when the form is submitted",
          "zh": "但優勢在於，當表單被提交時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.833,
          "end": 93.5,
          "en": "for example, we can call setEnteredTitle.",
          "zh": "舉例來說，我們可以呼叫 setEnteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.5,
          "end": 97.6,
          "en": "for example, we can call setEnteredTitle.",
          "zh": "舉例來說，我們可以呼叫 setEnteredTitle。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.6,
          "end": 100.566,
          "en": "And set this back to an empty string,",
          "zh": "並將它設回空字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.566,
          "end": 103.833,
          "en": "which also was our initial state.",
          "zh": "這也正是我們最初的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.833,
          "end": 107.5,
          "en": "And by doing that, we override what the user entered",
          "zh": "這麼做，我們就會覆寫使用者所輸入的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.5,
          "end": 109.43299999999999,
          "en": "after the form was submitted",
          "zh": "在表單提交之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.43299999999999,
          "end": 111.733,
          "en": "and therefore cleared the input.",
          "zh": "因此清空了 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.733,
          "end": 112.366,
          "en": "and therefore cleared the input.",
          "zh": "因此清空了 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.366,
          "end": 114.6,
          "en": "And we can do this for all inputs.",
          "zh": "我們可以對所有 inputs 這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.6,
          "end": 117.7,
          "en": "We can set the entered amount to an empty string,",
          "zh": "我們可以將已輸入的金額設為空字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.7,
          "end": 123.466,
          "en": "and set the entered date to an empty string,",
          "zh": "並將已輸入的日期設為空字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.466,
          "end": 128.2,
          "en": "and then just add to the value prop to all these inputs.",
          "zh": "然後只要對所有這些 inputs 加上 value prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.2,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "and then just add to the value prop to all these inputs.",
          "zh": "然後只要對所有這些 inputs 加上 value prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 132.066,
          "en": "So here I add value and point at enteredAmount",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我加上 value 並指向 enteredAmount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.066,
          "end": 135.033,
          "en": "to pass that back into the amount input.",
          "zh": "將它傳回 amount input 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.033,
          "end": 137.9,
          "en": "And do the same here for the date,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡對 date 做同樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.9,
          "end": 138.03300000000002,
          "en": "And do the same here for the date,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡對 date 做同樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.03300000000002,
          "end": 142.766,
          "en": "pass the entered date back into the input.",
          "zh": "將已輸入的日期傳回 input 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.766,
          "end": 148.433,
          "en": "If we now save that and I reload, this is looking good.",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存並重新載入，看起來很不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.433,
          "end": 153.2,
          "en": "Now, we can still enter something here as it seems,",
          "zh": "現在，我們似乎還是可以在這裡輸入一些內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.2,
          "end": 155.266,
          "en": "but if I click Add Expense,",
          "zh": "但如果我點擊 Add Expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.266,
          "end": 157.733,
          "en": "you'll see it's all cleared again.",
          "zh": "你會看到它又全部被清空了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.733,
          "end": 159.633,
          "en": "And we still have our data collected",
          "zh": "而我們仍然有收集到的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.633,
          "end": 161.966,
          "en": "and stored here in this object.",
          "zh": "並儲存在這裡的這個物件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.966,
          "end": 164.8,
          "en": "So this is a neat behavior, but more importantly,",
          "zh": "所以這是個很棒的行為，但更重要的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.8,
          "end": 168.03300000000002,
          "en": "this is also another key concept in React.",
          "zh": "這也是 React 中另一個關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.03300000000002,
          "end": 168.166,
          "en": "this is also another key concept in React.",
          "zh": "這也是 React 中另一個關鍵概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.166,
          "end": 170.633,
          "en": "Two-way binding is very useful",
          "zh": "Two-way binding 非常有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.633,
          "end": 172.633,
          "en": "when you're working with forms",
          "zh": "當你在處理表單時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.633,
          "end": 175.333,
          "en": "because it allows you to gather user input,",
          "zh": "因為它讓你收集使用者的輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.333,
          "end": 176.86599999999999,
          "en": "but then also change it.",
          "zh": "但同時也能變更它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.86599999999999,
          "end": 179.4,
          "en": "For example, upon form of mission.",
          "zh": "例如，在表單提交時。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25596020",
      "title": "Child-to-Parent Component Communication (Bottom-up)",
      "sourceHash": "142da12209dce90503cc8da7f515e1bae8a68fcbb59a8070f1bfbe5ffa8b429d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.233,
          "end": 3.866,
          "en": "Instructor: Now with the changes we made",
          "zh": "講師：現在，靠著我們所做的變更"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.866,
          "end": 5.766,
          "en": "over the last lectures,",
          "zh": "在過去幾堂課裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.766,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "we are able to gather our expense data,",
          "zh": "我們能夠收集我們的支出資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "our user input and combine it into this object",
          "zh": "也就是使用者的輸入，並把它合併進這個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.233,
          "en": "and clear the form thereafter.",
          "zh": "然後在之後清空表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.233,
          "end": 18.933,
          "en": "The only problem is that having this data is nice",
          "zh": "唯一的問題是，擁有這些資料固然不錯"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.933,
          "end": 20.866,
          "en": "but we technically don't need it",
          "zh": "但嚴格說來，我們並不需要它"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.866,
          "end": 24.733,
          "en": "in the expense form component, do we?",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 元件裡，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.733,
          "end": 24.966,
          "en": "in the expense form component, do we?",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 元件裡，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.966,
          "end": 27.5,
          "en": "Instead we needed in the new expense",
          "zh": "我們反而需要它出現在 NewExpense"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.5,
          "end": 30.833,
          "en": "or to be precise in the app JS component even",
          "zh": "或者更精確地說，甚至是在 App.js 元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.833,
          "end": 31.033,
          "en": "or to be precise in the app JS component even",
          "zh": "或者更精確地說，甚至是在 App.js 元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.033,
          "end": 33.633,
          "en": "because there we have our expenses array",
          "zh": "因為在那裡我們有我們的 expenses 陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.633,
          "end": 37.9,
          "en": "and ultimately our goal will be to add this new expense",
          "zh": "而最終我們的目標會是把這筆新支出加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.9,
          "end": 42.5,
          "en": "which the user entered to this list of existing expenses",
          "zh": "也就是使用者輸入的這筆，加到這份現有支出的清單中"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.5,
          "end": 42.733,
          "en": "which the user entered to this list of existing expenses",
          "zh": "也就是使用者輸入的這筆，加到這份現有支出的清單中"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.733,
          "end": 47.6,
          "en": "and we probably also wanna enrich it by adding an ID.",
          "zh": "而我們可能也想透過加上一個 ID 來讓它更完整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.6,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "So, we need to pass the data which we're collecting",
          "zh": "所以，我們需要把我們正在收集的資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 56.4,
          "en": "and generating in expense form to the app component.",
          "zh": "也就是在 ExpenseForm 中產生的資料，傳到 App 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 58.366,
          "en": "Now I put as point, we only learned",
          "zh": "現在我要特別點出的是，我們只學過"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.366,
          "end": 60.5,
          "en": "how we can pass data down.",
          "zh": "如何把資料往下傳。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.5,
          "end": 65.566,
          "en": "So how we can, for example, in the expenses folder",
          "zh": "所以，比如說，我們如何在 Expenses 資料夾裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.566,
          "end": 69.666,
          "en": "pass title, amount and date from the expenses component",
          "zh": "把 title、amount 和 date 從 Expenses 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.666,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "pass title, amount and date from the expenses component",
          "zh": "把 title、amount 和 date 從 Expenses 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 73.566,
          "en": "to the expense items component.",
          "zh": "傳到 ExpenseItem 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.566,
          "end": 77.033,
          "en": "So from parent to child, that's something we learned.",
          "zh": "所以從父元件到子元件，這是我們學過的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.033,
          "end": 79.566,
          "en": "We can do that with props,",
          "zh": "我們可以用 props 做到這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.566,
          "end": 82.333,
          "en": "but how can we do it in the other direction",
          "zh": "但我們要怎麼反過來做"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.333,
          "end": 82.43299999999999,
          "en": "but how can we do it in the other direction",
          "zh": "但我們要怎麼反過來做"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.43299999999999,
          "end": 85.633,
          "en": "if data is generated in the expense form",
          "zh": "如果資料是在 ExpenseForm 中產生的"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.633,
          "end": 89.9,
          "en": "and we then wanna pass it up to the app component?",
          "zh": "而我們接著想把它往上傳到 App 元件呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 93.566,
          "en": "Well, actually we already saw how it works",
          "zh": "嗯，其實我們已經看過它是怎麼運作的了"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.566,
          "end": 95.066,
          "en": "but it's easy to miss it.",
          "zh": "但很容易錯過它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.066,
          "end": 97.2,
          "en": "So let me show it to you again.",
          "zh": "所以讓我再示範一次給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 97.76599999999999,
          "en": "So let me show it to you again.",
          "zh": "所以讓我再示範一次給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.76599999999999,
          "end": 101.76599999999999,
          "en": "In expense form, we are listening to user input",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 中，我們在監聽使用者的輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.76599999999999,
          "end": 105.96600000000001,
          "en": "to change this to the title input, for example",
          "zh": "例如針對 title 這個輸入欄位的變更"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.96600000000001,
          "end": 108.533,
          "en": "and whenever the user types here,",
          "zh": "而每當使用者在這裡輸入時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.533,
          "end": 113.233,
          "en": "this function title change handler executes",
          "zh": "這個 titleChangeHandler 函式就會執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.233,
          "end": 113.5,
          "en": "this function title change handler executes",
          "zh": "這個 titleChangeHandler 函式就會執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.5,
          "end": 117.5,
          "en": "and there we get this default event object,",
          "zh": "而我們在那裡會拿到這個預設的 event 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.5,
          "end": 119.76599999999999,
          "en": "that's something the browser gives us.",
          "zh": "那是瀏覽器提供給我們的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.76599999999999,
          "end": 120.4,
          "en": "that's something the browser gives us.",
          "zh": "那是瀏覽器提供給我們的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.4,
          "end": 125.266,
          "en": "Now, actually we can think about this input element here",
          "zh": "現在，其實我們可以把這裡這個 input 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.266,
          "end": 127.4,
          "en": "as a component as well.",
          "zh": "也看成一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.4,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "It's not one of our components",
          "zh": "它不是我們自己寫的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 132.566,
          "en": "but it is simply a pre-built component,",
          "zh": "而只是一個預先建好的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.566,
          "end": 135.8,
          "en": "we could say, provided to us by react",
          "zh": "可以說，是 React 提供給我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.8,
          "end": 139.6,
          "en": "and of course translate it to the input Dom element",
          "zh": "當然，它會被轉譯成 input DOM 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.6,
          "end": 142.6,
          "en": "but it has this component character in the end",
          "zh": "但到頭來它帶有元件的特性"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.6,
          "end": 142.766,
          "en": "but it has this component character in the end",
          "zh": "但到頭來它帶有元件的特性"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.766,
          "end": 145.733,
          "en": "and we do also set some props on that component",
          "zh": "而且我們也確實在那個元件上設定了一些 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.733,
          "end": 149.6,
          "en": "including this special onchange prop.",
          "zh": "包括這個特別的 onChange prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.6,
          "end": 152.86599999999999,
          "en": "Now, actually this onchange prop isn't that special,",
          "zh": "其實，這個 onChange prop 並沒有那麼特別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.86599999999999,
          "end": 155.266,
          "en": "it's just a prop named onchange",
          "zh": "它就只是一個名為 onChange 的 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.266,
          "end": 159.3,
          "en": "which wants a function as a value",
          "zh": "它想要一個函式作為值"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.3,
          "end": 159.6,
          "en": "which wants a function as a value",
          "zh": "它想要一個函式作為值"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.6,
          "end": 162.633,
          "en": "and then internally the input element",
          "zh": "然後在內部，input 元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 162.633,
          "end": 164,
          "en": "adds this event listener.",
          "zh": "會加入這個事件監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164,
          "end": 167,
          "en": "So react basically sees that we set a value",
          "zh": "所以 React 基本上是看到我們設定了一個值"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167,
          "end": 170,
          "en": "on this onchange prop and adds that listener",
          "zh": "到這個 onChange prop 上，然後加入那個監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 170,
          "end": 172.9,
          "en": "on the rendered input element.",
          "zh": "到被渲染出來的 input 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.9,
          "end": 175.766,
          "en": "But that is a pattern we can replicate",
          "zh": "但這是我們可以複製的模式"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.766,
          "end": 178.833,
          "en": "for our own components as well.",
          "zh": "套用到我們自己的元件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.833,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "for our own components as well.",
          "zh": "套用到我們自己的元件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 181.833,
          "en": "We can create our own event props,",
          "zh": "我們可以建立自己的事件 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 181.833,
          "end": 185.233,
          "en": "if we wanna call it like, and we can expect functions",
          "zh": "如果我們想這樣稱呼的話，而我們可以預期有函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.233,
          "end": 188.166,
          "en": "as values and that would allow us",
          "zh": "作為值，而這將讓我們能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.166,
          "end": 190.966,
          "en": "to pass a function from a parent component",
          "zh": "把一個函式從父元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.966,
          "end": 192.533,
          "en": "to a child component and then call that function",
          "zh": "傳到子元件，然後在"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 192.533,
          "end": 194.2,
          "en": "to a child component and then call that function",
          "zh": "傳到子元件，然後在"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 194.2,
          "end": 196.466,
          "en": "inside of the child component.",
          "zh": "子元件內部呼叫那個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 196.466,
          "end": 198.9,
          "en": "And when we then call a function,",
          "zh": "而當我們接著呼叫一個函式時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 198.9,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "we can of course pass data to that function as a parameter",
          "zh": "我們當然可以把資料當作參數傳給那個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 208.3,
          "en": "and that's how we can communicate up from child to parent.",
          "zh": "這就是我們如何從子元件往上跟父元件溝通的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 208.3,
          "end": 208.833,
          "en": "and that's how we can communicate up from child to parent.",
          "zh": "這就是我們如何從子元件往上跟父元件溝通的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 208.833,
          "end": 210.6,
          "en": "Now, in case this was too quick,",
          "zh": "現在，如果這樣講太快了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 210.6,
          "end": 213,
          "en": "let me simply show it to you.",
          "zh": "就讓我直接示範給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 213,
          "end": 215.966,
          "en": "Let's say we wanna pass the expense data",
          "zh": "假設我們想把支出資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 215.966,
          "end": 219.066,
          "en": "which we gather in the expense form component",
          "zh": "也就是我們在 ExpenseForm 元件中收集的資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 219.066,
          "end": 219.266,
          "en": "which we gather in the expense form component",
          "zh": "也就是我們在 ExpenseForm 元件中收集的資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 219.266,
          "end": 222.4,
          "en": "to the new expense component as a first step",
          "zh": "第一步先傳到 NewExpense 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 222.4,
          "end": 225.666,
          "en": "because if we ultimately wanna reach the app component,",
          "zh": "因為如果我們最終想傳到 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.666,
          "end": 225.8,
          "en": "because if we ultimately wanna reach the app component,",
          "zh": "因為如果我們最終想傳到 App 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 225.8,
          "end": 229.066,
          "en": "we first of all have to reach the new expense component",
          "zh": "我們首先必須先傳到 NewExpense 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 229.066,
          "end": 231.233,
          "en": "because it's the new expense component",
          "zh": "因為是 NewExpense 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 231.233,
          "end": 233.833,
          "en": "which uses the expense form",
          "zh": "使用了 ExpenseForm"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 233.833,
          "end": 234,
          "en": "which uses the expense form",
          "zh": "使用了 ExpenseForm"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 234,
          "end": 237.266,
          "en": "and then in a second step later, it's the app component",
          "zh": "然後第二步，才是 App 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 237.266,
          "end": 240.3,
          "en": "which use the new expense component",
          "zh": "它使用了 NewExpense 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 240.3,
          "end": 240.633,
          "en": "which use the new expense component",
          "zh": "它使用了 NewExpense 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 240.633,
          "end": 243.6,
          "en": "but we can't skip components in between,",
          "zh": "但我們不能跳過中間的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 243.6,
          "end": 245.1,
          "en": "that's also something you learned",
          "zh": "這也是你學過的"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 245.1,
          "end": 247.266,
          "en": "in the previous course section.",
          "zh": "在之前的課程單元中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 247.266,
          "end": 250.633,
          "en": "Props can only be passed from parent to child,",
          "zh": "Props 只能從父元件傳到子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 250.633,
          "end": 254.566,
          "en": "we can't skip intermediate components.",
          "zh": "我們不能跳過中間的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 254.566,
          "end": 257.033,
          "en": "So therefore as a first step,",
          "zh": "所以，第一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 257.033,
          "end": 261.233,
          "en": "let's make sure we can pass the expense data to new expense",
          "zh": "讓我們確保能把支出資料傳到 NewExpense"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 261.233,
          "end": 261.566,
          "en": "let's make sure we can pass the expense data to new expense",
          "zh": "讓我們確保能把支出資料傳到 NewExpense"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 261.566,
          "end": 265.6,
          "en": "and we can do it as by adding a new prop to expense form.",
          "zh": "而我們可以透過在 ExpenseForm 上加入一個新的 prop 來做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 265.6,
          "end": 268.366,
          "en": "It's our components, so we can name it however we want,",
          "zh": "這是我們的元件，所以我們想怎麼命名都行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 268.366,
          "end": 274.6,
          "en": "but I will name it on save expense data,",
          "zh": "但我會把它命名為 onSaveExpenseData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 274.6,
          "end": 277.133,
          "en": "but the name is totally up to you,",
          "zh": "不過名字完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 277.133,
          "end": 280,
          "en": "I'm just naming it on something",
          "zh": "我只是把它取成 on 開頭的名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 280,
          "end": 281.83299999999997,
          "en": "because I wanna make it clear",
          "zh": "因為我想讓它清楚表明"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.83299999999997,
          "end": 285.633,
          "en": "that the value for this prop should be a function,",
          "zh": "這個 prop 的值應該是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 285.633,
          "end": 285.7,
          "en": "that the value for this prop should be a function,",
          "zh": "這個 prop 的值應該是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 285.7,
          "end": 288.533,
          "en": "a function which will eventually be triggered",
          "zh": "一個最終會被觸發的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 288.533,
          "end": 292.466,
          "en": "when something happens inside of this component.",
          "zh": "當這個元件內部發生某些事情時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 292.466,
          "end": 296.7,
          "en": "In this case, when the user saves the entered expense data,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，就是當使用者儲存所輸入的支出資料時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 296.7,
          "end": 300.066,
          "en": "so when the form is submitted in the end.",
          "zh": "也就是當表單最後被送出時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 300.066,
          "end": 302.433,
          "en": "so that's again a convention I'm following,",
          "zh": "所以這又是我遵循的一個慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 302.433,
          "end": 303.9,
          "en": "you don't have to name it like this,",
          "zh": "你不一定要這樣命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 303.9,
          "end": 305.966,
          "en": "you can name it however you want,",
          "zh": "你想怎麼命名就怎麼命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 305.966,
          "end": 307.166,
          "en": "It's totally up to you.",
          "zh": "完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 307.166,
          "end": 309.933,
          "en": "It doesn't have to start with on.",
          "zh": "它不一定要以 on 開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 309.933,
          "end": 310.333,
          "en": "It doesn't have to start with on.",
          "zh": "它不一定要以 on 開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 310.333,
          "end": 313.4,
          "en": "I just do start with on to follow this convention",
          "zh": "我之所以用 on 開頭，是為了遵循這個慣例"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 313.4,
          "end": 316.766,
          "en": "and to make it clear that the value for this prop",
          "zh": "並讓它清楚表明這個 prop 的值"
