          "start": 319.666,
          "end": 323.33299999999997,
          "en": "inside of the expense form component.",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 元件內部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 323.33299999999997,
          "end": 327.866,
          "en": "Hence, it's a function we should define here in new expense",
          "zh": "因此，這是一個我們應該在 NewExpense 這裡定義的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 327.866,
          "end": 328.1,
          "en": "Hence, it's a function we should define here in new expense",
          "zh": "因此，這是一個我們應該在 NewExpense 這裡定義的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 328.1,
          "end": 330.533,
          "en": "just as we did it for the input elements",
