          "end": 336.233,
          "en": "we define those in the expense form",
          "zh": "我們是在 ExpenseForm 中定義它們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 336.233,
          "end": 339.7,
          "en": "before we returned the JS Xcode as well.",
          "zh": "同樣是在我們回傳 JSX 程式碼之前。"
