          "en": "for our own custom expense form component.",
          "zh": "為我們自己自訂的 ExpenseForm 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 348.9,
          "end": 354.233,
          "en": "So here I'll add a const save expense data handler",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加上一個 const saveExpenseDataHandler"
