        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 371.766,
          "end": 375.166,
          "en": "to get this parameter.",
          "zh": "會收到這個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 375.166,
          "end": 379.633,
          "en": "And then here we can add our expense data",
