          "zh": "精確地說，就是在 ExpenseForm 內部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 555.7,
          "end": 558.3,
          "en": "And we can execute the function",
          "zh": "而我們可以執行這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 558.3,
          "end": 561.366,
          "en": "even though it's not defined inside of expense form",
          "zh": "即使它並不是在 ExpenseForm 內部定義的"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 561.366,
          "end": 564.166,
          "en": "because we are passing a pointer at it",
          "zh": "因為我們傳遞了一個指向它的指標"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 564.166,
          "end": 567.766,
          "en": "through the onSave expense data prop.",
          "zh": "透過 onSaveExpenseData prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 567.766,
          "end": 568.3,
          "en": "through the onSave expense data prop.",
          "zh": "透過 onSaveExpenseData prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 568.3,
          "end": 571.266,
          "en": "And this is a super important pattern",
          "zh": "而這是一個超級重要的模式"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 571.266,
          "end": 574.3,
          "en": "which you will use a lot in react.",
          "zh": "你在 React 中會很常使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 574.3,
          "end": 577.1,
          "en": "This is how you can communicate between components",
          "zh": "這就是你能在元件之間溝通的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 577.1,
          "end": 579.5,
          "en": "and how you can communicate up,",
          "zh": "以及你如何往上溝通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 579.5,
          "end": 579.933,
          "en": "and how you can communicate up,",
          "zh": "以及你如何往上溝通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 579.933,
          "end": 583.3,
          "en": "how you can make sure that a child component,",
          "zh": "你如何確保一個子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 583.3,
          "end": 585.933,
          "en": "the expense form component here for example,",
          "zh": "例如這裡的 ExpenseForm 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 585.933,
          "end": 588.866,
          "en": "can communicate up to the parent component,",
          "zh": "能夠往上跟父元件溝通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 588.866,
          "end": 591.533,
          "en": "the new expense component in this case.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中就是 NewExpense 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 591.533,
          "end": 591.966,
          "en": "the new expense component in this case.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中就是 NewExpense 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 591.966,
          "end": 594.933,
          "en": "We can call a function in the new expense component",
          "zh": "我們可以在 NewExpense 元件中呼叫一個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 594.933,
          "end": 598.233,
          "en": "and we can pass data as a parameter.",
          "zh": "並且我們可以把資料當作參數傳過去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 598.233,
          "end": 598.633,
          "en": "and we can pass data as a parameter.",
          "zh": "並且我們可以把資料當作參數傳過去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 598.633,
          "end": 601.866,
          "en": "So here, when we call onSave expense data",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，當我們呼叫 onSaveExpenseData"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 601.866,
          "end": 604.933,
          "en": "in the expense form, I can pass the expense data",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 中時，我可以把支出資料傳過去"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 604.933,
          "end": 608.766,
          "en": "which are generated here as our argument",
          "zh": "也就是在這裡產生的資料，當作我們的引數"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 608.766,
          "end": 610.733,
          "en": "and that's the value which we'll receive",
          "zh": "而這就是我們將會收到的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 610.733,
          "end": 614.466,
          "en": "as a parameter here in new expense.",
          "zh": "作為這裡 NewExpense 中的參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 614.466,
          "end": 615.466,
          "en": "as a parameter here in new expense.",
          "zh": "作為這裡 NewExpense 中的參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 615.466,
          "end": 617.8,
          "en": "I hope this flow is clear.",
          "zh": "我希望這個流程很清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 617.8,
          "end": 620.3,
          "en": "The trick really is that we pass around",
          "zh": "訣竅其實就是我們傳遞的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 620.3,
          "end": 623.166,
          "en": "a pointer at a function.",
          "zh": "一個指向函式的指標。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 623.166,
          "end": 625.966,
          "en": "Now, if we go back and I reload,",
          "zh": "現在，如果我們回到畫面，然後我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 625.966,
          "end": 629.833,
          "en": "if I again, enter something here",
          "zh": "如果我再次在這裡輸入一些東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 629.833,
          "end": 632.6659999999999,
          "en": "and pick a date if I click add expense,",
          "zh": "並挑選一個日期，如果我點擊 add expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 632.6659999999999,
          "end": 632.966,
          "en": "and pick a date if I click add expense,",
          "zh": "並挑選一個日期，如果我點擊 add expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 632.966,
          "end": 635.433,
          "en": "you see this is being locked to the console",
          "zh": "你看，這被 log 到 console 了"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 635.433,
          "end": 639.433,
          "en": "and it's being locked from the new expense file line 12,",
          "zh": "而它是從 NewExpense 檔案的第十二行 log 出來的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 639.433,
          "end": 641.933,
          "en": "so it's does log here.",
          "zh": "所以它是在這裡 log 的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 641.933,
          "end": 642.866,
          "en": "so it's does log here.",
          "zh": "所以它是在這裡 log 的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 642.866,
          "end": 644.333,
          "en": "And we can tell that it's from there",
          "zh": "而我們可以看出它是從那裡來的"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 644.333,
          "end": 646.733,
          "en": "because we also have an ID field there",
          "zh": "因為我們在那裡也有一個 id 欄位"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 646.733,
          "end": 648.6,
          "en": "which has this random number",
          "zh": "它帶有這個隨機數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 648.6,
          "end": 651.9,
          "en": "which has generated and converted to a string.",
          "zh": "這是產生出來並轉換成字串的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 651.9,
          "end": 652.366,
          "en": "which has generated and converted to a string.",
          "zh": "這是產生出來並轉換成字串的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 652.366,
          "end": 654.7,
          "en": "And that's how we can communicate up",
          "zh": "而這就是我們如何往上溝通"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 654.7,
          "end": 658.266,
          "en": "and this is a super important pattern.",
          "zh": "而這是一個超級重要的模式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 658.266,
          "end": 661.633,
          "en": "Now, of course, we can continue in this chain now",
          "zh": "現在，我們當然可以繼續這個鏈結"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 661.633,
          "end": 666.533,
          "en": "and we can communicate up from inside new expense to app",
          "zh": "我們可以從 NewExpense 內部往上跟 App 溝通"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 666.533,
          "end": 666.766,
          "en": "and we can communicate up from inside new expense to app",
          "zh": "我們可以從 NewExpense 內部往上跟 App 溝通"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 666.766,
          "end": 668.866,
          "en": "because it's this app component which needs",
          "zh": "因為是這個 App 元件需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 668.866,
          "end": 673.333,
          "en": "the new expense in the end to add it to this expenses array.",
          "zh": "最終需要 NewExpense 把它加到這個 expenses 陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 673.333,
          "end": 677.4,
          "en": "So therefore again, in app JS,",
          "zh": "所以，同樣地，在 App.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 677.4,
          "end": 679.833,
          "en": "we can add a function which we defined",
          "zh": "我們可以加入一個我們定義的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 679.833,
          "end": 682.266,
          "en": "before we return JSX code",
          "zh": "在我們回傳 JSX 程式碼之前"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 682.266,
          "end": 682.5,
          "en": "before we return JSX code",
          "zh": "在我們回傳 JSX 程式碼之前"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 682.5,
          "end": 687.833,
          "en": "and we can simply name this at expense handler",
          "zh": "我們可以簡單地把它命名為 addExpenseHandler"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 687.833,
          "end": 692.4,
          "en": "and be expect to get our expense here as a parameter",
          "zh": "並且預期在這裡把這筆 expense 當作參數收到"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 692.4,
          "end": 692.5,
          "en": "and be expect to get our expense here as a parameter",
          "zh": "並且預期在這裡把這筆 expense 當作參數收到"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 692.5,
          "end": 694.4,
          "en": "and then we do something with it.",
          "zh": "然後我們對它做些什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 694.4,
          "end": 694.466,
          "en": "and then we do something with it.",
          "zh": "然後我們對它做些什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 694.466,
          "end": 698.933,
          "en": "And for the moment I'll just console log in app JS",
          "zh": "而目前我只會在 App.js 中 console log"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 698.933,
          "end": 701.066,
          "en": "and console log the expense",
          "zh": "並把這筆 expense console log 出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 701.066,
          "end": 703.3,
          "en": "because we haven't quite yet learned",
          "zh": "因為我們還沒真正學到"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 703.3,
          "end": 707.333,
          "en": "how we can render lists of data dynamically",
          "zh": "如何動態渲染資料清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 707.333,
          "end": 708.8,
          "en": "and therefore for the moment,",
          "zh": "因此目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 262,
          "start": 708.8,
          "end": 711.5,
          "en": "I will not update the expenses array,",
          "zh": "我不會更新 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 263,
          "start": 711.5,
          "end": 713.4,
          "en": "that is something we'll do",
          "zh": "那是我們之後會做的"
        },
        {
          "id": 264,
          "start": 713.4,
          "end": 716.333,
          "en": "and learn about in the next course section though.",
          "zh": "並在下一課程單元中學到的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 265,
          "start": 716.333,
          "end": 720.833,
          "en": "For the moment, I just wanna confirm that the data arrived.",
          "zh": "目前我只想確認資料有送達。"
        },
        {
          "id": 266,
          "start": 720.833,
          "end": 721.2,
          "en": "For the moment, I just wanna confirm that the data arrived.",
          "zh": "目前我只想確認資料有送達。"
        },
        {
          "id": 267,
          "start": 721.2,
          "end": 723.866,
          "en": "So here's the function now again,",
          "zh": "所以現在這又是那個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 268,
          "start": 723.866,
          "end": 726.166,
          "en": "using the same pattern as before,",
          "zh": "使用和之前一樣的模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 269,
          "start": 726.166,
          "end": 730.066,
          "en": "we can pass a pointer at this function to a new expense",
          "zh": "我們可以把指向這個函式的指標傳給 NewExpense"
        },
        {
          "id": 270,
          "start": 730.066,
          "end": 730.2,
          "en": "we can pass a pointer at this function to a new expense",
          "zh": "我們可以把指向這個函式的指標傳給 NewExpense"
        },
        {
          "id": 271,
          "start": 730.2,
          "end": 731.8,
          "en": "so that inside of new expense,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，在 NewExpense 內部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 272,
          "start": 731.8,
          "end": 735.1,
          "en": "we can call this function and pass that expense data",
          "zh": "我們就可以呼叫這個函式，並把那筆支出資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 273,
          "start": 735.1,
          "end": 737.766,
          "en": "up to the app component.",
          "zh": "往上傳到 App 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 274,
          "start": 737.766,
          "end": 741.166,
          "en": "So we could name this prop here on add expense,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把這裡的這個 prop 命名為 onAddExpense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 275,
          "start": 741.166,
          "end": 743.966,
          "en": "again, the name is up to you, it's your component",
          "zh": "再次強調，名字由你決定，這是你的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 276,
          "start": 743.966,
          "end": 746.4,
          "en": "but again, I will follow this convention",
          "zh": "但同樣地，我會遵循這個慣例"
        },
        {
          "id": 277,
          "start": 746.4,
          "end": 748.466,
          "en": "starting with on to make it clear",
          "zh": "以 on 開頭，好讓它清楚表明"
        },
        {
          "id": 278,
          "start": 748.466,
          "end": 750.133,
          "en": "that it's a function pointer",
          "zh": "它是一個函式指標"
        },
        {
          "id": 279,
          "start": 750.133,
          "end": 752.6,
          "en": "which has passed as our argument",
          "zh": "它會作為我們的引數傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 280,
          "start": 752.6,
          "end": 756.033,
          "en": "and then I pass a pointer at add expense handler",
          "zh": "然後我把指向 addExpenseHandler 的指標"
        },
        {
          "id": 281,
          "start": 756.033,
          "end": 761.366,
          "en": "to the on expense prop on new expense,",
          "zh": "傳給 NewExpense 上的 onAddExpense prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 282,
          "start": 761.366,
          "end": 765.266,
          "en": "and therefore inside of new expense, we can now call it.",
          "zh": "因此，在 NewExpense 內部，我們現在可以呼叫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 283,
          "start": 765.266,
          "end": 768.3,
          "en": "We can accept the props argument here as well,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡同樣可以接收 props 參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 284,
          "start": 768.3,
          "end": 770.333,
          "en": "this parameter and in safe expense data handler",
          "zh": "也就是這個參數，而在 saveExpenseDataHandler 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 285,
          "start": 770.333,
          "end": 773.5,
          "en": "this parameter and in safe expense data handler",
          "zh": "也就是這個參數，而在 saveExpenseDataHandler 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 286,
          "start": 773.5,
          "end": 776.133,
          "en": "which itself is called when something happens",
          "zh": "它本身會在有些事情發生時被呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 287,
          "start": 776.133,
          "end": 777.766,
          "en": "in the expense form, we can of course",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 中，我們當然可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 288,
          "start": 777.766,
          "end": 778.9,
          "en": "in the expense form, we can of course",
          "zh": "在 ExpenseForm 中，我們當然可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 289,
          "start": 778.9,
          "end": 784.966,
          "en": "now also called props on add expense",
          "zh": "現在也呼叫 props.onAddExpense"
        },
        {
          "id": 290,
          "start": 784.966,
          "end": 787.3,
          "en": "and of course here, we wanna use the name",
          "zh": "當然，在這裡我們想用"
        },
        {
          "id": 291,
          "start": 787.3,
          "end": 789.8,
          "en": "which we chose here in the app component.",
          "zh": "我們在 App 元件這裡所選的名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 292,
          "start": 789.8,
          "end": 792.733,
          "en": "We're calling the function past as a value",
          "zh": "我們呼叫的是作為值傳入的那個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 293,
          "start": 792.733,
          "end": 795.7,
          "en": "for that on add expense prop.",
          "zh": "也就是給那個 onAddExpense prop 的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 294,
          "start": 795.7,
          "end": 798.7,
          "en": "I'm calling us here, and it will forward",
          "zh": "我在這裡呼叫它，而它會轉送"
        },
        {
          "id": 295,
          "start": 798.7,
          "end": 802.833,
          "en": "my enriched expense data here.",
          "zh": "我這裡充實後的支出資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 296,
          "start": 802.833,
          "end": 804.833,
          "en": "And if we now save everything,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存所有東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 297,
          "start": 804.833,
          "end": 812.1,
          "en": "again if I reload, and I add a book here for 1299,",
          "zh": "再次，如果我重新載入，並在這裡新增一本書，金額 1299，"
        },
        {
          "id": 298,
          "start": 812.1,
          "end": 814.533,
          "en": "if I click add expense, this is being logged",
          "zh": "如果我點擊 add expense，這被 log 出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 299,
          "start": 814.533,
          "end": 817.766,
          "en": "from inside the app component as we can clearly tell",
          "zh": "從 App 元件內部，我們可以清楚看出"
        },
        {
          "id": 300,
          "start": 817.766,
          "end": 821.6,
          "en": "and I'm actually logging the expenses as I see,",
          "zh": "而我看得出來，我其實 log 的是 expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 301,
          "start": 821.6,
          "end": 824.133,
          "en": "I wanted to log the expense instead,",
          "zh": "我原本想 log 的其實是 expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 302,
          "start": 824.133,
          "end": 827.1,
          "en": "so let me fix this.",
          "zh": "所以讓我修正一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 303,
          "start": 827.1,
          "end": 831.133,
          "en": "Let me give this another try, a book 1299,",
          "zh": "讓我再試一次，一本書 1299，"
        },
        {
          "id": 304,
          "start": 831.133,
          "end": 836.466,
          "en": "pick a date, yeah, so now we're logging the single expense.",
          "zh": "選個日期，沒錯，所以現在我們 log 的是單筆 expense。"
        },
        {
          "id": 305,
          "start": 836.466,
          "end": 838.433,
          "en": "Again, we'll use that expense",
          "zh": "再次強調，我們會利用那筆支出"
        },
        {
          "id": 306,
          "start": 838.433,
          "end": 841.866,
          "en": "and change the array and output DRA dynamically too,",
          "zh": "並改變陣列，也動態地輸出它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 307,
          "start": 841.866,
          "end": 844.333,
          "en": "we'll do that in the next course section",
          "zh": "我們會在下一課程單元做這件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 308,
          "start": 844.333,
          "end": 846.766,
          "en": "but for the moment I wanted to focus",
          "zh": "但目前我想專注在"
        },
        {
          "id": 309,
          "start": 846.766,
          "end": 849.6,
          "en": "on that state and event handling thing",
          "zh": "那個 state 和事件處理的事情上"
        },
        {
          "id": 310,
          "start": 849.6,
          "end": 854.4,
          "en": "and being able to pass data up is a crucial part of it",
          "zh": "而能夠把資料往上傳是其中非常關鍵的一部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 311,
          "start": 854.4,
          "end": 855.933,
          "en": "and here's how it works.",
          "zh": "而它就是這麼運作的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25596024",
      "title": "Lifting The State Up",
      "sourceHash": "676761099496214a80d28cd5278272646da1ff81004757b8ffff2578b8cb6296",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.166,
          "end": 3.466,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lecture,",
          "zh": "講師：在上一堂課中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.466,
          "end": 8.966,
          "en": "we learned about a very important concept of moving data",
          "zh": "我們學到了一個非常重要的概念，就是把資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.966,
          "end": 14.166,
          "en": "from a child to a parent component by utilizing props",
          "zh": "透過 props 從子元件往上傳到父元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.166,
          "end": 16.2,
          "en": "to receive a function from the parent component",
          "zh": "也就是接收來自父元件的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.2,
          "end": 17.866,
          "en": "to receive a function from the parent component",
          "zh": "也就是接收來自父元件的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.866,
          "end": 20.466,
          "en": "which we call in the child component.",
          "zh": "並在子元件中呼叫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.466,
          "end": 24,
          "en": "And this is closely related to another,",
          "zh": "而這和另一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 27.833,
          "en": "a key concept which we also already used",
          "zh": "我們其實早就用過、只是渾然不覺的關鍵概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.833,
          "end": 29.466,
          "en": "without even knowing.",
          "zh": "息息相關。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.466,
          "end": 33.4,
          "en": "And that's a concept called Lifting State Up.",
          "zh": "那就是所謂的 Lifting State Up（向上提升 state）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.4,
          "end": 35.766,
          "en": "Now what is that about?",
          "zh": "這到底是什麼意思呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.766,
          "end": 38.8,
          "en": "Consider this basic Component Tree",
          "zh": "想想這個基本的 Component Tree（元件樹），"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.8,
          "end": 43.033,
          "en": "which is roughly what we have in this demo application",
          "zh": "它大致上就是我們這個示範應用程式裡的結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.033,
          "end": 45.333,
          "en": "where we have an app component",
          "zh": "裡面有一個 app 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.333,
          "end": 47.766,
          "en": "which in turn renders and expenses",
          "zh": "它會渲染 expenses"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.766,
          "end": 50.833,
          "en": "and a new expense component.",
          "zh": "以及 new expense 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.833,
          "end": 51.566,
          "en": "and a new expense component.",
          "zh": "以及 new expense 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.566,
          "end": 52.966,
          "en": "Now, in this case,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.966,
          "end": 56.1,
          "en": "the new expense component is a component",
          "zh": "new expense 元件是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.1,
          "end": 59.666,
          "en": "which generates some data, some state.",
          "zh": "會產生一些資料、一些 state 的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.666,
          "end": 62.2,
          "en": "In our example application,",
          "zh": "在我們的範例應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.2,
          "end": 65.2,
          "en": "we are fetching some user input here.",
          "zh": "我們就是在這裡取得一些使用者輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.2,
          "end": 65.43299999999999,
          "en": "we are fetching some user input here.",
          "zh": "我們就是在這裡取得一些使用者輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.43299999999999,
          "end": 68.93299999999999,
          "en": "Now it is quite common that you do generate",
          "zh": "其實很常見的情況是，你在某個元件中產生"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.93299999999999,
          "end": 72.133,
          "en": "or fetch data in a component",
          "zh": "或取得資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.133,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "but that you might not need that data in that component.",
          "zh": "但你未必會在那個元件裡用到這些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "but that you might not need that data in that component.",
          "zh": "但你未必會在那個元件裡用到這些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 79.666,
          "en": "Instead, we need it in another component,",
          "zh": "相反地，我們是在另一個元件裡需要它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.666,
          "end": 81.26599999999999,
          "en": "in the expenses component.",
          "zh": "也就是 expenses 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.26599999999999,
          "end": 85.066,
          "en": "That's where this generated data is needed in the end,",
          "zh": "那才是這些產生的資料最終需要的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.066,
          "end": 88.8,
          "en": "slightly transformed, packed into an object",
          "zh": "稍微轉換一下、包成一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.8,
          "end": 92.733,
          "en": "but it is the data we fetch in new expense.",
          "zh": "但它就是我們在 new expense 中取得的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.733,
          "end": 93.166,
          "en": "but it is the data we fetch in new expense.",
          "zh": "但它就是我們在 new expense 中取得的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.166,
          "end": 98.733,
          "en": "So naturally we would like to hand that data over",
          "zh": "所以我們自然會想把那些資料傳過去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.733,
          "end": 100.43299999999999,
          "en": "but that doesn't work like this",
          "zh": "但這樣子行不通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.43299999999999,
          "end": 103.43299999999999,
          "en": "because we have no direct connection",
          "zh": "因為兩個同層元件之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.43299999999999,
          "end": 106.533,
          "en": "between two sibling components.",
          "zh": "並沒有直接的連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.533,
          "end": 106.93299999999999,
          "en": "between two sibling components.",
          "zh": "並沒有直接的連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.93299999999999,
          "end": 109.1,
          "en": "Instead, as you learned by now,",
          "zh": "相反地，就像你現在已經知道的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.1,
          "end": 113.63300000000001,
          "en": "we can only communicate from parent to child",
          "zh": "我們只能從父元件傳到子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.63300000000001,
          "end": 117.3,
          "en": "and from child to parent.",
          "zh": "以及從子元件傳到父元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.3,
          "end": 120.733,
          "en": "That's why in such cases like we have it here,",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼在像我們這裡這樣的情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.733,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "we utilize the closest component,",
          "zh": "我們會利用最接近的那個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 128.233,
          "en": "the closest parent component which has direct",
          "zh": "也就是最接近、能夠直接"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.233,
          "end": 132.6,
          "en": "or indirect access to both involved components",
          "zh": "或間接存取到這兩個相關元件的父元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.6,
          "end": 135.166,
          "en": "in this case, the app component.",
          "zh": "在這裡就是 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.166,
          "end": 135.566,
          "en": "in this case, the app component.",
          "zh": "在這裡就是 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.566,
          "end": 138.9,
          "en": "The app component in our application has access",
          "zh": "我們應用程式中的 app 元件可以存取到"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.9,
          "end": 142.266,
          "en": "to both the new expense and the expenses component",
          "zh": "new expense 和 expenses 這兩個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.266,
          "end": 142.3,
          "en": "to both the new expense and the expenses component",
          "zh": "new expense 和 expenses 這兩個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.3,
          "end": 149.433,
          "en": "because it renders both components in its returned JSX code,",
          "zh": "因為它在回傳的 JSX 程式碼中同時渲染了這兩個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.433,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "that's why we wanna utilize that.",
          "zh": "所以我們才想利用這一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 154.7,
          "en": "Because we can now store our state",
          "zh": "因為我們現在可以把我們的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.7,
          "end": 158.066,
          "en": "in that closest involved component.",
          "zh": "儲存在那個最接近的相關元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.066,
          "end": 160.9,
          "en": "So in that parent component which has access",
          "zh": "所以在那個能夠存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.9,
          "end": 163.166,
          "en": "to both involved components by lifting our state up.",
          "zh": "這兩個相關元件的父元件中，藉由把我們的 state 往上提升。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.166,
          "end": 166.766,
          "en": "to both involved components by lifting our state up.",
          "zh": "這兩個相關元件的父元件中，藉由把我們的 state 往上提升。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.766,
          "end": 172.2,
          "en": "So by passing our generated state data from the new expense",
          "zh": "所以透過把產生的 state 資料從 new expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.2,
          "end": 174.5,
          "en": "to the app component.",
          "zh": "傳到 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.5,
          "end": 174.966,
          "en": "to the app component.",
          "zh": "傳到 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.966,
          "end": 176.8,
          "en": "And that's what we're already doing",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這個示範應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.8,
          "end": 178.733,
          "en": "in this demo application.",
          "zh": "已經在做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.733,
          "end": 182.733,
          "en": "We're doing this by utilizing props,",
          "zh": "我們是靠 props 做到這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.733,
          "end": 182.866,
          "en": "We're doing this by utilizing props,",
          "zh": "我們是靠 props 做到這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.866,
          "end": 188.566,
          "en": "by calling the function we receive on the onAddExpense prop.",
          "zh": "也就是呼叫我們從 onAddExpense prop 收到的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.566,
          "end": 191.533,
          "en": "That alone is not lifting the state up.",
          "zh": "光是這樣還不算 Lifting the State Up。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.533,
          "end": 193.36599999999999,
          "en": "That's just calling a function",
          "zh": "那只是呼叫一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.36599999999999,
          "end": 195.36599999999999,
          "en": "we receive through props.",
          "zh": "我們透過 props 收到的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.36599999999999,
          "end": 195.833,
          "en": "we receive through props.",
          "zh": "我們透過 props 收到的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 195.833,
          "end": 198.066,
          "en": "But then we do something important.",
          "zh": "但接著我們做了一件重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.066,
          "end": 202.36599999999999,
          "en": "We actually do pass data to that function",
          "zh": "我們確實把資料傳給了那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 202.36599999999999,
          "end": 204.1,
          "en": "which we call here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡所呼叫的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 204.1,
          "end": 208.53300000000002,
          "en": "We pass the expense data to function we receive",
          "zh": "我們把 expense 資料傳給我們從"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.53300000000002,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "on the onAddExpense prop.",
          "zh": "onAddExpense prop 收到的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 214.53300000000002,
          "en": "So we're passing data to that function,",
          "zh": "所以我們把資料傳給那個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.53300000000002,
          "end": 218.266,
          "en": "and by doing that we're lifting that data,",
          "zh": "這麼做就等於把那些資料、"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.266,
          "end": 220.3,
          "en": "that state up.",
          "zh": "把那個 state 往上提升。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.3,
          "end": 220.733,
          "en": "that state up.",
          "zh": "把那個 state 往上提升。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.733,
          "end": 223.633,
          "en": "We're not keeping it in the new expense component.",
          "zh": "我們沒有把它留在 new expense 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.633,
          "end": 226.233,
          "en": "We're not keeping expense data there,",
          "zh": "我們沒有把 expense 資料留在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.233,
          "end": 230.633,
          "en": "instead, we are lifting it up to the app component",
          "zh": "而是把它往上提升到 app 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 230.633,
          "end": 235.633,
          "en": "so that in there we can use it like an AddExpenseHandler",
          "zh": "這樣在那裡我們就能像用 addExpenseHandler 一樣處理它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.633,
          "end": 240.433,
          "en": "where at the moment we are logging it to the console.",
          "zh": "而目前我們只是把它記錄到 console。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.433,
          "end": 240.733,
          "en": "where at the moment we are logging it to the console.",
          "zh": "而目前我們只是把它記錄到 console。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.733,
          "end": 244.7,
          "en": "Now we're not yet managing that data as state here,",
          "zh": "現在我們還沒在這裡把那個資料當成 state 來管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 244.7,
          "end": 247.5,
          "en": "instead, we're just logging it to a console.",
          "zh": "而是只把它記錄到 console。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.5,
          "end": 249.86599999999999,
          "en": "But in the next course section,",
          "zh": "但在下一個課程單元中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.86599999999999,
          "end": 255.066,
          "en": "we are going to manage this whole array here as state.",
          "zh": "我們會把這裡這整個陣列當成 state 來管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 255.066,
          "end": 259.4,
          "en": "And we are going to add the expense to that array.",
          "zh": "而且我們會把這筆支出加到那個陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 259.4,
          "end": 259.766,
          "en": "And we are going to add the expense to that array.",
          "zh": "而且我們會把這筆支出加到那個陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 259.766,
          "end": 263.1,
          "en": "And we are already passing down that array",
          "zh": "而我們已經把那個陣列往下傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 263.1,
          "end": 267.3,
          "en": "to the expenses component because that's the other part",
          "zh": "給 expenses 元件，因為這是 Lifting the State Up"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.3,
          "end": 270.366,
          "en": "of this Lifting the State Up concept.",
          "zh": "這個概念的另一半。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 270.366,
          "end": 270.7,
          "en": "of this Lifting the State Up concept.",
          "zh": "這個概念的另一半。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.7,
          "end": 273.06600000000003,
          "en": "We are Lifting the State Up.",
          "zh": "我們正在 Lifting the State Up。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 273.06600000000003,
          "end": 276.966,
          "en": "We are passing data up to some parent component",
          "zh": "我們把資料往上傳給某個父元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 276.966,
          "end": 280.1,
          "en": "because we either need that data directly",
          "zh": "因為我們可能直接在 app 元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 280.1,
          "end": 281.6,
          "en": "in the app component",
          "zh": "需要那些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 281.6,
          "end": 281.7,
          "en": "in the app component",
          "zh": "需要那些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 281.7,
          "end": 284.966,
          "en": "or as it's the case in our demo application.",
          "zh": "或者就像我們示範應用程式的情況那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 284.966,
          "end": 286.83299999999997,
          "en": "And as it is quite common,",
          "zh": "而這也很常見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 286.83299999999997,
          "end": 290.533,
          "en": "because we then wanna pass that data down",
          "zh": "因為我們接著想透過 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 290.533,
          "end": 294.06600000000003,
          "en": "to another component via props.",
          "zh": "把那些資料往下傳給另一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 294.06600000000003,
          "end": 297.366,
          "en": "That's what we did in the last course lecture.",
          "zh": "那就是我們在上一堂課做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 297.366,
          "end": 299.666,
          "en": "And that is an important concept.",
          "zh": "而這是一個重要的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 299.666,
          "end": 299.866,
          "en": "And that is an important concept.",
          "zh": "而這是一個重要的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 299.866,
          "end": 303.066,
          "en": "You will hear the term Lifting the State Up",
          "zh": "之後在這門課程中當你使用 React 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.066,
          "end": 305.033,
          "en": "quite a bit when you were working",
          "zh": "你會很常聽到"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.033,
          "end": 307.666,
          "en": "with React also later in the course.",
          "zh": "Lifting the State Up 這個詞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 307.666,
          "end": 309.4,
          "en": "And whenever you hear that,",
          "zh": "而每當你聽到這個詞，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309.4,
          "end": 313.366,
          "en": "it is about moving data from a child component",
          "zh": "它指的就是把資料從子元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 313.366,
          "end": 317.33299999999997,
          "en": "to some parent component to either use it there",
          "zh": "移到某個父元件，可能是在那裡使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 317.33299999999997,
          "end": 322.33299999999997,
          "en": "or to then pass it down to some other child component.",
          "zh": "或是再把它往下傳給另一個子元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 322.33299999999997,
          "end": 323.8,
          "en": "And as a side note,",
          "zh": "另外補充一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 323.8,
          "end": 327.6,
          "en": "this does not just work if you have the app component",
          "zh": "這並不只是適用於 app 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 327.6,
          "end": 331.466,
          "en": "which interacts with two direct child components.",
          "zh": "直接和兩個子元件互動的情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 331.466,
          "end": 331.7,
          "en": "which interacts with two direct child components.",
          "zh": "直接和兩個子元件互動的情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 331.7,
          "end": 334.366,
          "en": "Instead in this example already,",
          "zh": "其實光是在這個例子裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 334.366,
          "end": 338.33299999999997,
          "en": "the new expense component is actually not the component",
          "zh": "new expense 元件其實並不是那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 338.33299999999997,
          "end": 341.7,
          "en": "which generates the data which we're passing up.",
          "zh": "產生我們往上傳的資料的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 341.7,
          "end": 342,
          "en": "which generates the data which we're passing up.",
          "zh": "產生我們往上傳的資料的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 342,
          "end": 344.866,
          "en": "Instead it's the ExpenseForm component",
          "zh": "相反地，是 ExpenseForm 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 344.866,
          "end": 346.83299999999997,
          "en": "which generates that data.",
          "zh": "產生了那些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 346.83299999999997,
          "end": 350.166,
          "en": "It's that component which works with state",
          "zh": "就是那個使用 state、"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 350.166,
          "end": 354.266,
          "en": "and which fetches user input and stores user input.",
          "zh": "取得使用者輸入並儲存使用者輸入的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 354.266,
          "end": 354.5,
          "en": "and which fetches user input and stores user input.",
          "zh": "取得使用者輸入並儲存使用者輸入的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 354.5,
          "end": 359.166,
          "en": "And that component then passes up that fetched data",
          "zh": "然後那個元件再把取得的那筆資料往上傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 359.166,
          "end": 361.566,
          "en": "to the new expense component.",
          "zh": "給 new expense 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.566,
          "end": 364.966,
          "en": "So here we are already Lifting State Up",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們其實就已經在做 Lifting State Up，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 364.966,
          "end": 365.233,
          "en": "So here we are already Lifting State Up",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們其實就已經在做 Lifting State Up，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 365.233,
          "end": 368,
          "en": "and then we're lifting it up even further",
          "zh": "接著我們又把它再往上提升，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 368,
          "end": 370.933,
          "en": "to the app component since it's the app component",
          "zh": "提升到 app 元件，因為 app 元件才是"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 370.933,
          "end": 373.933,
          "en": "which is then the first component in line",
          "zh": "第一個同時能存取到"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 373.933,
          "end": 376.9,
          "en": "which does not just have access to the new expense",
          "zh": "不只是能存取到 new expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 376.9,
          "end": 379.2,
          "en": "and ExpenseForm component but also",
          "zh": "和 ExpenseForm 元件，而且還能存取到"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 379.2,
          "end": 381.166,
          "en": "to the expenses component.",
          "zh": "expenses 元件的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 381.166,
          "end": 381.566,
          "en": "to the expenses component.",
          "zh": "expenses 元件的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 381.566,
          "end": 384.366,
          "en": "And since the expenses component is the component",
          "zh": "而因為 expenses 元件就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 384.366,
          "end": 386.233,
          "en": "where we need the data in the end,",
          "zh": "我們最終需要這些資料的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 386.233,
          "end": 391.33299999999997,
          "en": "it is the app component where we wanna lift our state up to.",
          "zh": "所以 app 元件就是我們想把 state 往上提升到的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 391.33299999999997,
          "end": 391.9,
          "en": "it is the app component where we wanna lift our state up to.",
          "zh": "所以 app 元件就是我們想把 state 往上提升到的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 391.9,
          "end": 394.4,
          "en": "Now, as you will see throughout this course,",
          "zh": "現在，就像你在這門課程中會看到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 394.4,
          "end": 397.9,
          "en": "it's not always that root app component",
          "zh": "要把 state 往上提升的對象，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 397.9,
          "end": 400.366,
          "en": "to which you wanna lift your state up.",
          "zh": "並不總是那個根 app 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 400.366,
          "end": 405.366,
          "en": "Instead, the goal is to lift it up just as high as necessary",
          "zh": "相反地，目標是把它提升到剛好必要的高度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 405.4,
          "end": 408.9,
          "en": "in your Component Tree until you have a component",
          "zh": "在你的 Component Tree 中找到一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 408.9,
          "end": 411.8,
          "en": "which has both access to the components",
          "zh": "它既能存取到"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 411.8,
          "end": 415.3,
          "en": "that generate data as well as the components",
          "zh": "產生資料的元件，也能存取到"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 415.3,
          "end": 417.233,
          "en": "that needs data,",
          "zh": "需要資料的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 417.233,
          "end": 419.166,
          "en": "that might be the app component,",
          "zh": "那可能就是 app 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 419.166,
          "end": 421.7,
          "en": "but that could also be another component.",
          "zh": "但也可能是另一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 421.7,
          "end": 424.8,
          "en": "Again, you are going to see those quite frequently",
          "zh": "再次強調，你在這門課程中"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 424.8,
          "end": 426.1,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": "會很常看到這些情況。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "38345450",
      "title": "Derived / Computed State",
      "sourceHash": "1434b15b51287e517a62bc2b54b2df59bc74c94f9feb8e3282c4095741eb67a2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.29,
          "en": "So at this point in the section,",
          "zh": "到這個章節的這個階段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.29,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "you already learned quite a bit about state, and events,",
          "zh": "你已經學到不少關於 state 和事件的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 11.67,
          "en": "and a lot about React in general.",
          "zh": "也學了很多 React 的一般知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.67,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "Now, before we come to an end and conclude this section,",
          "zh": "現在，在我們要結束並總結這個章節之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.6,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "I wanna dive into",
          "zh": "我想深入探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 21.03,
          "en": "another state related very important concept,",
          "zh": "另一個和 state 有關、非常重要的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.03,
          "end": 26.03,
          "en": "and that's the concept of derived or computed state,",
          "zh": "也就是 derived（衍生）或 computed（計算）state 的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 30.87,
          "en": "or derived or computed values as you could also say.",
          "zh": "或者你也可以說是 derived 或 computed values（衍生/計算值）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.87,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "And to explore this concept,",
          "zh": "為了探討這個概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 36.75,
          "en": "let's say that below the \"expenses filter\"",
          "zh": "假設在 \"expenses filter\" 的下方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.75,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "but above the \"expense item\" elements here,",
          "zh": "但在這裡的 \"expense item\" 元素上方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 43.77,
          "en": "I wanna show a little text in a paragraph.",
          "zh": "我想用一個段落顯示一小段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.77,
          "end": 45.727,
          "en": "And let's say that here, I wanna say,",
          "zh": "假設在這裡，我想顯示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.727,
          "end": 50.727,
          "en": "\"Data for years 2019, 2021, and 2022 is hidden,\"",
          "zh": "「2019、2021 和 2022 年的資料已隱藏，」"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54,
          "end": 57.51,
          "en": "if the filter is set to 2020.",
          "zh": "如果篩選器設定為 2020。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 57.51,
          "end": 60.6,
          "en": "If it's set to 2021,",
          "zh": "如果設定為 2021，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "I of course wanna say \"2019, 2020, and 2022.\"",
          "zh": "我當然就會想顯示「2019、2020 和 2022」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 68.28,
          "en": "So, I basically wanna list all the years",
          "zh": "所以，我基本上就是想列出所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 68.28,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "which are currently not selected.",
          "zh": "目前沒有被選取的年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "Now this is actually a feature which I'll soon remove",
          "zh": "其實這個功能我很快就會移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.67,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "because we don't actually need it here in this app,",
          "zh": "因為這個應用程式其實不需要它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "but it is a feature that allows me to explore",
          "zh": "但它是一個能讓我探討"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 83.793,
          "en": "this important concept of derived values.",
          "zh": "derived values 這個重要概念的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.87,
          "end": 88.02,
          "en": "Because one way of implementing this here",
          "zh": "因為要在這裡實作這個功能，其中一種做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 88.02,
          "end": 91.59700000000001,
          "en": "would be to register a new state, which we could name,",
          "zh": "是註冊一個新的 state，我們可以把它命名為"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.59700000000001,
          "end": 93.99000000000001,
          "en": "\"filter info text,\"",
          "zh": "\"filterInfoText\"，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.99000000000001,
          "end": 98.88,
          "en": "with a \"set filter info text\" state updating function.",
          "zh": "並搭配一個 \"setFilterInfoText\" 的 state 更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 103.88,
          "en": "And the initial value here could be this string here maybe,",
          "zh": "而這裡的初始值也許可以是這個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "where we say, \"2019, 2021, 2022,\"",
          "zh": "也就是我們寫的「2019、2021、2022」，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 112.267,
          "en": "and then we dynamically output",
          "zh": "然後我們再動態輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 112.267,
          "end": 114.90299999999999,
          "en": "\"filter info text\" down there.",
          "zh": "下面的 \"filterInfoText\"。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 120.87,
          "en": "And now, we could update this whenever the filter changes.",
          "zh": "而這樣我們就可以在篩選器變更時更新它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 120.87,
          "end": 125.87,
          "en": "Then we could check \"if selected year is equal to 2019,\"",
          "zh": "接著我們可以檢查「如果 selected year 等於 2019」，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 127.44,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "and if that's the case, we call \"set filter info text,\"",
          "zh": "如果是這樣，我們就呼叫 \"setFilterInfoText\"，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 136.67000000000002,
          "en": "and set this to \"2020, '21 and '22.\"",
          "zh": "並把它設定為「2020、'21 和 '22」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 140.617,
          "end": 145.44,
          "en": "\"Else if selected year is 2020,\"",
          "zh": "「否則如果 selected year 是 2020，」"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 150.44,
          "en": "we \"set filter info text\" to \"2019, '21 and '22,\" and so on.",
          "zh": "我們就把 \"filterInfoText\" 設為「2019、'21 和 '22」，依此類推。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 159.06,
          "en": "We also would of course add the condition for '21,",
          "zh": "我們當然也會加上 '21 的條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 159.06,
          "end": 162.42000000000002,
          "en": "where we set the filter info text like this.",
          "zh": "在那裡我們像這樣設定 filterInfoText。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 162.42000000000002,
          "end": 167.163,
          "en": "And \"else\" for the last case, we would exclude '22.",
          "zh": "而在最後一個情況的「else」中，我們會排除 '22。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "That's how we could implement this.",
          "zh": "這就是我們可以實作這個功能的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 175.5,
          "en": "If we save this, we have this text here.",
          "zh": "如果我們儲存，就會得到這裡這段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 175.5,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "It's a bit hard to read because it's not styled",
          "zh": "它有點難讀，因為它沒有加上樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 180.9,
          "en": "because I'll delete it soon anyways.",
          "zh": "反正我很快就會把它刪掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 180.9,
          "end": 184.32,
          "en": "But you can see that currently 2020 is excluded",
          "zh": "但你可以看到目前 2020 被排除了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 184.32,
          "end": 186.45,
          "en": "because that's the year I selected.",
          "zh": "因為那是我選取的年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 186.45,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "If I switch this to 2021 on the other hand,",
          "zh": "另一方面，如果我把它切換到 2021，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 194.28,
          "en": "this updates and '21 is now excluded in this list here,",
          "zh": "這裡就會更新，'21 現在被排除在這個清單之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 194.28,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "and instead all the other years are mentioned.",
          "zh": "反而列出所有其他年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 197.34,
          "end": 200.46,
          "en": "Also, please keep in mind that the filter doesn't work yet",
          "zh": "另外請記住，篩選功能目前還不能用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 200.46,
          "end": 203.07,
          "en": "which is why we see all these years.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們會看到所有這些年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 203.07,
          "end": 205.653,
          "en": "But, this text updates as expected.",
          "zh": "不過，這段文字會如預期地更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 206.94,
          "end": 207.81,
          "en": "Nonetheless,",
          "zh": "儘管如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 207.81,
          "end": 212.1,
          "en": "this is typically not how you should implement this.",
          "zh": "這通常不是你應該採用的實作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 212.1,
          "end": 213.66,
          "en": "Whilst it works,",
          "zh": "雖然這樣能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 213.66,
          "end": 217.2,
          "en": "you are managing an additional piece of state",
          "zh": "但你多管理了一份 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 217.2,
          "end": 219.72,
          "en": "which in the end is redundant.",
          "zh": "而它到頭來是多餘的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 219.72,
          "end": 224.4,
          "en": "Because this state here is in the end based on this state.",
          "zh": "因為這裡這個 state 最終是依據另一個 state 而來的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 224.4,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "The year we exclude",
          "zh": "我們所排除的年份"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "is the year we're managing in this state.",
          "zh": "就是我們在這個 state 中所管理的年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 232.44,
          "en": "So we're managing two pieces of state here,",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡管理了兩份 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 232.44,
          "end": 237.44,
          "en": "even though they both depend on the same source so to say.",
          "zh": "儘管可以說它們都依賴同一個來源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 237.63,
          "end": 240.09,
          "en": "One state would be enough here.",
          "zh": "這裡其實只要一個 state 就夠了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 240.09,
          "end": 243.36,
          "en": "Instead of being managed as a standalone state",
          "zh": "與其把它當成一個獨立的 state 來管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 243.36,
          "end": 246.99,
          "en": "which updates whenever the other state updates,",
          "zh": "在另一個 state 更新時才跟著更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 246.99,
          "end": 251.73,
          "en": "we should manage the info text as a computed value.",
          "zh": "我們應該把這段資訊文字當成 computed value 來管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 251.73,
          "end": 256.73,
          "en": "And that's what that derived state or computed state concept",
          "zh": "而這就是 derived state 或 computed state 這個概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 257.22,
          "end": 258.33,
          "en": "is all about.",
          "zh": "在談的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 258.33,
          "end": 260.76,
          "en": "If you are setting a state that in the end",
          "zh": "如果你設定的某個 state 最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 264.09,
          "en": "is directly related to another state,",
          "zh": "和另一個 state 直接相關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 264.09,
          "end": 267.48,
          "en": "you typically don't wanna manage this as a separate state.",
          "zh": "你通常不會想把它當成另一個獨立的 state 來管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 267.48,
          "end": 270.36,
          "en": "Instead you just want to add a new variable,",
          "zh": "相反地，你只會想新增一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 270.36,
          "end": 273.57,
          "en": "a good old variable in your component function.",
          "zh": "一個在元件函式裡再普通不過的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 273.57,
          "end": 276.06,
          "en": "And that could now be the \"filter info text\"",
          "zh": "而它現在可以是 \"filterInfoText\"，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 276.06,
          "end": 279.06,
          "en": "which initially is this text here",
          "zh": "它一開始就是這裡這段文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 279.06,
          "end": 281.973,
          "en": "with the year 2020 excluded.",
          "zh": "排除了 2020 年。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 283.74,
          "end": 286.92,
          "en": "And then we can extract this \"if\" check here",
          "zh": "然後我們可以把這裡的這個「if」檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 286.92,
          "end": 289.14,
          "en": "out of this handler function,",
          "zh": "從這個 handler 函式中抽出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 289.14,
          "end": 292.503,
          "en": "and also put it directly in this component function.",
          "zh": "並且直接放進這個元件函式裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 293.49,
          "end": 296.85,
          "en": "So that there, we now check our filtered year.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就在那裡檢查我們所篩選的年份。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 296.85,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "So this state on which this value in the end depends,",
          "zh": "所以這個 state，也就是這個值最終所依賴的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 304.65,
          "en": "we use this state in our \"if\" condition here,",
          "zh": "我們在「if」條件這裡使用這個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 304.65,
          "end": 306.9,
          "en": "and we simply set our variable",
          "zh": "然後我們單純把我們的變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 306.9,
          "end": 309.183,
          "en": "to those different pieces of text.",
          "zh": "設定成那些不同的文字片段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 310.02,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "So instead of updating a separate state,",
          "zh": "所以，與其更新一個獨立的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 317.48,
          "en": "we just dynamically compute the value of this variable,",
          "zh": "我們只是動態計算這個變數的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 317.64,
          "end": 320.19,
          "en": "and the value will be different",
          "zh": "而這個值會不一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 320.19,
          "end": 323.403,
          "en": "depending on which state was selected.",
          "zh": "取決於選取的是哪一個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 324.39,
          "end": 326.88,
          "en": "This condition now also is redundant here,",
          "zh": "現在這個條件在這裡也變成多餘的了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 326.88,
          "end": 331.35,
          "en": "since the value for this check here is our default anyways.",
          "zh": "因為這裡這個檢查的值無論如何都是我們的預設值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 331.35,
          "end": 333.84000000000003,
          "en": "So, we can even get rid of that.",
          "zh": "所以我們甚至可以直接把它移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 333.84000000000003,
          "end": 338.07,
          "en": "And now we have this leaner computed code here,",
          "zh": "現在我們就有了這裡這段更精簡的 computed 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 338.07,
          "end": 341.67,
          "en": "which works because when the state is updated,",
          "zh": "它能運作是因為當 state 被更新時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 341.67,
          "end": 343.62,
          "en": "when this function here is called,",
          "zh": "當這裡這個函式被呼叫時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 343.62,
          "end": 348.36,
          "en": "this component function will re-execute again anyways.",
          "zh": "這個元件函式無論如何都會重新執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 348.36,
          "end": 351.63,
          "en": "So all this code here will be executed again,",
          "zh": "所以這裡所有這些程式碼都會再次被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 351.63,
          "end": 353.85,
          "en": "and will derive a new value",
          "zh": "並因此推導出一個新的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 353.85,
          "end": 355.803,
          "en": "for \"filter info text\" therefore.",
          "zh": "給 \"filterInfoText\"。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 356.67,
          "end": 359.01,
          "en": "Hence, now I save everything,",
          "zh": "因此，現在我把所有內容都儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 359.01,
          "end": 362.43,
          "en": "we get exactly the same behavior as before.",
          "zh": "我們得到和之前完全相同的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 362.43,
          "end": 367.263,
          "en": "If I switch my state here, my filter, this value updates.",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡切換我的 state、我的篩選器，這個值就會更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 368.25,
          "end": 371.88,
          "en": "Even though the value itself is not managed as state,",
          "zh": "即使這個值本身並不是以 state 來管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 371.88,
          "end": 374.13,
          "en": "but it's part of the component",
          "zh": "而是它是這個元件的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 374.13,
          "end": 377.13,
          "en": "that's re-executed when the state changes,",
          "zh": "當 state 改變時它會重新執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 377.13,
          "end": 380.463,
          "en": "and it then depends on the state that changes.",
          "zh": "而它接著就取決於那個改變的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 381.57,
          "end": 384.12,
          "en": "So this here is a computed value,",
          "zh": "所以這裡這個就是一個 computed value，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 384.12,
          "end": 387.66,
          "en": "a value which we derive based on this state.",
          "zh": "一個我們依據這個 state 推導出來的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 387.66,
          "end": 390.9,
          "en": "And whilst you could also manage multiple states,",
          "zh": "雖然你也可以管理多個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 390.9,
          "end": 393.33,
          "en": "and it wouldn't be a huge problem",
          "zh": "而且那也不會是什麼大問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 393.33,
          "end": 395.763,
          "en": "using derived values like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣使用 derived values，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 395.763,
          "end": 400.32,
          "en": "it's typically the more elegant and recommended approach.",
          "zh": "通常是更優雅、也更推薦的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 400.32,
          "end": 402.39,
          "en": "Here, I'll get rid of that though",
          "zh": "不過在這裡，我還是要把它移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 402.39,
          "end": 405.45,
          "en": "because we don't need that info text.",
          "zh": "因為我們不需要那段資訊文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 405.45,
          "end": 408.93,
          "en": "But knowing about this concept of derived state",
          "zh": "但認識 derived state 這個概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 408.93,
          "end": 412.803,
          "en": "or derived values as it's also called, is important.",
          "zh": "或者說所謂的 derived values，是很重要的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25596066",
      "title": "Controlled vs Uncontrolled Components & Stateless vs Stateful Components",
      "sourceHash": "99c5d89db743cc44bd09a5252b3e79a7c1eb67d5f706a01811bc9b724a11db6c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 4.333,
          "en": "Maximilian: Now, that's it for this section.",
          "zh": "Maximilian：好的，這個單元就到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.333,
          "end": 8.633,
          "en": "In the last section, we again implemented two way binding",
          "zh": "在上一個單元中，我們再次實作了雙向綁定（two-way binding）"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.633,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "as part of the assignment.",
          "zh": "作為作業的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 13.033,
          "en": "Actually it was a bonus section",
          "zh": "其實那算是作業的"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.033,
          "end": 13.933,
          "en": "of the assignment I would say,",
          "zh": "加分部分，我會這麼說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.933,
          "end": 16.4,
          "en": "but again, we added two way binding",
          "zh": "不過我們又再次加入了雙向綁定"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.4,
          "end": 19.866,
          "en": "and we did something which has an official term in React",
          "zh": "而且我們做的事情在 React 中有一個正式名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.866,
          "end": 22.6,
          "en": "which I don't wanna hide from you.",
          "zh": "我不想對你隱瞞這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.6,
          "end": 25.533,
          "en": "We created a controlled component",
          "zh": "我們建立了一個受控元件（controlled component）"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.533,
          "end": 25.833,
          "en": "We created a controlled component",
          "zh": "我們建立了一個受控元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.833,
          "end": 28.433,
          "en": "and it's not the first time we did that.",
          "zh": "而且這已經不是我們第一次這麼做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.433,
          "end": 31.466,
          "en": "Basically, whenever you use two way binding",
          "zh": "基本上，每當你使用雙向綁定"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.466,
          "end": 33.7,
          "en": "you are controlling a component",
          "zh": "你就是在控制一個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.7,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "but here we're controlling our own custom component.",
          "zh": "但在這裡，我們控制的是自己建立的自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 38.866,
          "en": "Now, what does this mean?",
          "zh": "那麼，這是什麼意思呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.866,
          "end": 42.733,
          "en": "It means that a value which is used in the component",
          "zh": "這代表元件中使用到的某個值"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.733,
          "end": 45.633,
          "en": "like the value selected in the dropdown",
          "zh": "例如下拉選單中選取的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.633,
          "end": 45.666,
          "en": "like the value selected in the dropdown",
          "zh": "例如下拉選單中選取的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.666,
          "end": 50.833,
          "en": "is passed on to a parent component, through props",
          "zh": "會透過 props 傳到父元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.833,
          "end": 54.7,
          "en": "and is received from the parent component.",
          "zh": "再從父元件接收回來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.7,
          "end": 57.166,
          "en": "Both the currently set value,",
          "zh": "無論是目前所設定的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.166,
          "end": 59.966,
          "en": "as well as the function which in the end",
          "zh": "還是最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.966,
          "end": 62.433,
          "en": "handles the selected value is not part of expenses filter.",
          "zh": "處理所選值的函式，都不屬於 ExpensesFilter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.433,
          "end": 65.566,
          "en": "handles the selected value is not part of expenses filter.",
          "zh": "處理所選值的函式，都不屬於 ExpensesFilter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.566,
          "end": 65.8,
          "en": "handles the selected value is not part of expenses filter.",
          "zh": "處理所選值的函式，都不屬於 ExpensesFilter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.8,
          "end": 68.833,
          "en": "Expenses filter is really just a component",
          "zh": "ExpensesFilter 真的就只是一個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.833,
          "end": 72.966,
          "en": "that presents DUI, that presents the dropdown",
          "zh": "它負責呈現 UI、呈現那個下拉選單"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.966,
          "end": 77.166,
          "en": "and then attaches a couple of listeners or props,",
          "zh": "然後掛上幾個監聽器或 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.166,
          "end": 77.6,
          "en": "and then attaches a couple of listeners or props,",
          "zh": "然後掛上幾個監聽器或 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.6,
          "end": 81.533,
          "en": "but the real logic recites in the parent component",
          "zh": "但真正的邏輯其實位於父元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.533,
          "end": 83.96600000000001,
          "en": "and that turns ExpensesFilter",
          "zh": "這就讓 ExpensesFilter"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.96600000000001,
          "end": 88.866,
          "en": "into something which is called a controlled component.",
          "zh": "成為所謂的受控元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.866,
          "end": 91.76599999999999,
          "en": "Now, technically there is no difference.",
          "zh": "不過，技術上其實沒有任何差別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.76599999999999,
          "end": 94.7,
          "en": "ExpensesFilter is still a regular component",
          "zh": "ExpensesFilter 依然是一般的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.7,
          "end": 96,
          "en": "as you learned it.",
          "zh": "就像你學過的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96,
          "end": 96.3,
          "en": "as you learned it.",
          "zh": "就像你學過的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.3,
          "end": 99.233,
          "en": "It's just a special term that when you see it",
          "zh": "這只是一個特殊術語，當你看到它時"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.233,
          "end": 101.5,
          "en": "basically means what I just explained",
          "zh": "基本上就是代表我剛剛解釋的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 101.5,
          "end": 105.066,
          "en": "that both the value, as well as changes to the value",
          "zh": "也就是值本身，以及值的變更"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.066,
          "end": 107.76599999999999,
          "en": "are not handled in the component itself",
          "zh": "都不是在元件本身內處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.76599999999999,
          "end": 110.233,
          "en": "but in a parent component.",
          "zh": "而是在父元件中處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.233,
          "end": 110.566,
          "en": "but in a parent component.",
          "zh": "而是在父元件中處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 110.566,
          "end": 115.1,
          "en": "This component controls the expenses filter component.",
          "zh": "這個元件控制著 ExpensesFilter 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.1,
          "end": 118.666,
          "en": "And that's just a term which you should be aware of.",
          "zh": "而這只是你應該知道的一個術語。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.666,
          "end": 119.13300000000001,
          "en": "And that's just a term which you should be aware of.",
          "zh": "而這只是你應該知道的一個術語。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.13300000000001,
          "end": 122.966,
          "en": "Another term or another concept you should be aware of",
          "zh": "另一個你應該知道的術語或概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 122.966,
          "end": 125.166,
          "en": "because you might hear it from time to time",
          "zh": "因為你偶爾可能會聽到它"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.166,
          "end": 130.36599999999999,
          "en": "is about presentational verses stateful components",
          "zh": "是關於展示型元件與有狀態元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.36599999999999,
          "end": 133.766,
          "en": "or stateless versus stateful components",
          "zh": "或是無狀態元件與有狀態元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.766,
          "end": 133.966,
          "en": "or stateless versus stateful components",
          "zh": "或是無狀態元件與有狀態元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 133.966,
          "end": 137.86599999999999,
          "en": "or dumb versus smart components.",
          "zh": "或是笨元件與聰明元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 137.86599999999999,
          "end": 138,
          "en": "or dumb versus smart components.",
          "zh": "或是笨元件與聰明元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 142.233,
          "en": "There are a lot of terms for that, but what do they mean?",
          "zh": "這方面有很多術語，但它們到底是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.233,
          "end": 144.833,
          "en": "It simply means that in basically all",
          "zh": "它簡單來說就是，在基本上所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.833,
          "end": 147,
          "en": "React apps which you're building,",
          "zh": "你正在建立的 React 應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "you will have a couple of components that manage some state",
          "zh": "你會有一些負責管理 state 的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 151.766,
          "en": "you will have a couple of components that manage some state",
          "zh": "你會有一些負責管理 state 的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.766,
          "end": 153.466,
          "en": "like this expenses component",
          "zh": "例如這個 Expenses 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 153.466,
          "end": 156.166,
          "en": "which manages this filter state",
          "zh": "它管理著這個篩選的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.166,
          "end": 161.2,
          "en": "or the expense form component which manages the input state.",
          "zh": "或是管理輸入 state 的 ExpenseForm 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.2,
          "end": 161.733,
          "en": "or the expense form component which manages the input state.",
          "zh": "或是管理輸入 state 的 ExpenseForm 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 161.733,
          "end": 163.9,
          "en": "And then you will have other components",
          "zh": "接著你會有其他元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 163.9,
          "end": 168.03300000000002,
          "en": "which don't manage any state, like expense item",
          "zh": "它們不管理任何 state，例如 ExpenseItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.03300000000002,
          "end": 168.133,
          "en": "which don't manage any state, like expense item",
          "zh": "它們不管理任何 state，例如 ExpenseItem"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 168.133,
          "end": 170.4,
          "en": "if we remove the button, which we should do",
          "zh": "如果我們移除那個按鈕，而我們應該這麼做"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 170.4,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "because it was just there for demo purposes.",
          "zh": "因為它只是為了示範目的而存在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 177.36599999999999,
          "en": "If we remove it, we can also remove the useState call",
          "zh": "如果我們把它移除，也可以移除 useState 的呼叫"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.36599999999999,
          "end": 179.566,
          "en": "and we should remove it.",
          "zh": "而我們應該這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 179.566,
          "end": 180,
          "en": "and we should remove it.",
          "zh": "而我們應該這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 180,
          "end": 185.666,
          "en": "We can also remove that and that and if we do all of that,",
          "zh": "我們也可以移除那個和那個，如果我們做了這一切，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 185.666,
          "end": 189.166,
          "en": "and we set this here back to props title,",
          "zh": "並把這裡改回 props.title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 189.166,
          "end": 193.466,
          "en": "then this is a state less component as it should be.",
          "zh": "那麼這就是一個無狀態元件（stateless component），本來就該如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 193.466,
          "end": 193.8,
          "en": "then this is a state less component as it should be.",
          "zh": "那麼這就是一個無狀態元件（stateless component），本來就該如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.8,
          "end": 196.6,
          "en": "This component is a state less component",
          "zh": "這個元件是無狀態元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 196.6,
          "end": 200.833,
          "en": "also called presentational or dumb component",
          "zh": "也稱為展示型元件或笨元件（dumb component）"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 200.833,
          "end": 203.266,
          "en": "because it doesn't have any internal state",
          "zh": "因為它沒有任何內部的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 203.266,
          "end": 207.233,
          "en": "it's just there to output some data.",
          "zh": "它只是負責輸出一些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 207.233,
          "end": 209.633,
          "en": "And in most react applications,",
          "zh": "而在大多數 React 應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 209.633,
          "end": 214.2,
          "en": "you will have more presentational and dumb components",
          "zh": "展示型與笨元件的數量"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 214.2,
          "end": 217.466,
          "en": "than smart or stateful components.",
          "zh": "會比聰明或有狀態的元件來得多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 217.466,
          "end": 217.666,
          "en": "than smart or stateful components.",
          "zh": "會比聰明或有狀態的元件來得多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 217.666,
          "end": 220.766,
          "en": "So even though dumb might sound negative",
          "zh": "所以即使「笨」聽起來可能很負面"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 220.766,
          "end": 224.633,
          "en": "and it might sound like stateful components are better,",
          "zh": "聽起來好像有狀態元件比較好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 224.633,
          "end": 226.133,
          "en": "that's not the case.",
          "zh": "事實並非如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 226.133,
          "end": 226.433,
          "en": "that's not the case.",
          "zh": "事實並非如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 226.433,
          "end": 228.3,
          "en": "These are really just terms",
          "zh": "這些真的就只是術語"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 228.3,
          "end": 232.86599999999999,
          "en": "and typically you end up with less state full components",
          "zh": "而通常到頭來，有狀態的元件會比"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 232.86599999999999,
          "end": 236.1,
          "en": "than with state less components.",
          "zh": "無狀態的元件來得少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 236.1,
          "end": 236.53300000000002,
          "en": "than with state less components.",
          "zh": "無狀態的元件來得少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 236.53300000000002,
          "end": 238.9,
          "en": "Because you wanna split up your application",
          "zh": "因為你會想把應用程式拆分成"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 238.9,
          "end": 241.333,
          "en": "into small reusable pieces",
          "zh": "可重複使用的小片段"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 241.333,
          "end": 244.2,
          "en": "and most pieces, most components",
          "zh": "而大多數的片段、大多數的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 244.2,
          "end": 247.566,
          "en": "indeed will only focus on outputting something,",
          "zh": "確實只會專注在輸出某些東西、"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 247.566,
          "end": 247.633,
          "en": "indeed will only focus on outputting something,",
          "zh": "確實只會專注在輸出某些東西、"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 247.633,
          "end": 249.566,
          "en": "on having some JSX code,",
          "zh": "擁有某些 JSX 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 249.566,
          "end": 252.333,
          "en": "maybe some transformation logic like this here",
          "zh": "也許還有像這裡這樣的一些轉換邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 252.333,
          "end": 254.633,
          "en": "and maybe some CSS code,",
          "zh": "以及也許一些 CSS 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 254.633,
          "end": 256.8,
          "en": "but it's only a couple of components",
          "zh": "但只有少數幾個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 256.8,
          "end": 259.533,
          "en": "which typically do manage state.",
          "zh": "通常會實際管理 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 259.533,
          "end": 259.666,
          "en": "which typically do manage state.",
          "zh": "通常會實際管理 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 259.666,
          "end": 262.433,
          "en": "And then this state is spread out",
          "zh": "接著這個 state 會向外擴散"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 262.433,
          "end": 266.4,
          "en": "and distributed through props in the end,",
          "zh": "最後透過 props 分配到各處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 266.4,
          "end": 268.8,
          "en": "like here in the expenses component",
          "zh": "就像這裡在 Expenses 元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 268.8,
          "end": 271.6,
          "en": "where we managed to filter state",
          "zh": "我們在那裡管理著篩選的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 271.6,
          "end": 274.4,
          "en": "and then we pass the filtered year.",
          "zh": "然後我們把篩選後的年份，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 274.4,
          "end": 280.06600000000003,
          "en": "So this state value through props, back to expenses filter.",
          "zh": "把這個 state 的值透過 props 傳回 ExpensesFilter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 280.06600000000003,
          "end": 280.3,
          "en": "So this state value through props, back to expenses filter.",
          "zh": "把這個 state 的值透過 props 傳回 ExpensesFilter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 280.3,
          "end": 283.533,
          "en": "This is a standard pattern which you'll see a lot",
          "zh": "這是一個你會經常看到的標準模式"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 283.533,
          "end": 286.233,
          "en": "that you manage state and a couple of components,",
          "zh": "也就是你在少數幾個元件中管理 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 286.233,
          "end": 290.766,
          "en": "and then you might pass that around to other components.",
          "zh": "然後再把它傳遞給其他元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 290.766,
          "end": 293.56600000000003,
          "en": "And that's basically it for this module.",
          "zh": "這個模組基本上就到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 293.56600000000003,
          "end": 297.166,
          "en": "What you learned here again, was super important.",
          "zh": "你在這裡學到的東西，同樣非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 297.166,
          "end": 299.2,
          "en": "So make sure it's clear to you,",
          "zh": "所以請務必確認自己都清楚了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 299.2,
          "end": 301.566,
          "en": "make sure you understand what state is",
          "zh": "確保你了解 state 是什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 301.566,
          "end": 305.5,
          "en": "and how you can handle events and how you can pass data",
          "zh": "以及如何處理事件，還有如何傳遞資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 305.5,
          "end": 308,
          "en": "from a child to a parent component.",
          "zh": "從子元件傳到父元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 308,
          "end": 309.433,
          "en": "And with all of that,",
          "zh": "有了這一切，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 309.433,
          "end": 312.1,
          "en": "combined with the core section before",
          "zh": "再加上之前的核心單元"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 312.1,
          "end": 314.866,
          "en": "we are recovered components in general,",
          "zh": "我們大致上已經把元件都學過一遍，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 314.866,
          "end": 318.8,
          "en": "we're now prepared to dive into the next core section",
          "zh": "現在我們已經準備好進入下一個核心單元"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 318.8,
          "end": 324.766,
          "en": "and basically conclude the hard core of React basics.",
          "zh": "並大致上為 React 基礎中最核心的部分收尾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 324.766,
          "end": 327.566,
          "en": "But the next section again will be super important",
          "zh": "不過下一個單元同樣非常重要"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 327.566,
          "end": 331.166,
          "en": "because it will be about Lists and Conditional Content.",
          "zh": "因為它會談到清單（Lists）與條件式內容（Conditional Content）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25597068",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "sourceHash": "0aae7a990a38aa9e88564e55627efbd921ae06f7f75981395a8f26064036a56b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.466,
          "en": "- [Instructor] By now we know how to build components",
          "zh": "- [講師] 到目前為止，我們已經知道如何建立元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.466,
          "end": 8.133,
          "en": "and work with multiple components,",
          "zh": "以及如何操作多個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.133,
          "end": 10.266,
          "en": "and we know how to work with state",
          "zh": "我們也知道如何操作 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.266,
          "end": 12.266,
          "en": "and how to handle user events.",
          "zh": "以及如何處理使用者事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.266,
          "end": 12.533,
          "en": "and how to handle user events.",
          "zh": "以及如何處理使用者事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.533,
          "end": 14.4,
          "en": "In this course section,",
          "zh": "在這個課程單元中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.6,
          "en": "we're now going to dive into rendering lists",
          "zh": "我們現在要深入了解如何渲染清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.6,
          "end": 20.533,
          "en": "and rendering conditional content.",
          "zh": "以及渲染條件式內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.533,
          "end": 20.566,
          "en": "and rendering conditional content.",
          "zh": "以及渲染條件式內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.566,
          "end": 25.366,
          "en": "So we'll have a look at how we can output arrays of data",
          "zh": "所以我們會看看如何把資料陣列輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.366,
          "end": 28.9,
          "en": "on our page and how we can show different content",
          "zh": "到我們的頁面上，以及如何顯示不同的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.9,
          "end": 30.866,
          "en": "based on different conditions,",
          "zh": "根據不同的條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.866,
          "end": 31.2,
          "en": "based on different conditions,",
          "zh": "根據不同的條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.2,
          "end": 32.633,
          "en": "and that's exactly what we're going",
          "zh": "而這正是我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.633,
          "end": 34.7,
          "en": "to dive into in this module.",
          "zh": "在這個模組中要深入探討的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.7,
          "end": 37.166,
          "en": "We're going to continue working on the application",
          "zh": "我們會繼續開發這個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.166,
          "end": 40.033,
          "en": "we already started over the last course sections,",
          "zh": "也就是我們在前幾個課程單元中已經開始著手的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.033,
          "end": 43,
          "en": "but in this module we're now going to finish it",
          "zh": "不過在這個模組中，我們現在要把它完成"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43,
          "end": 44.733,
          "en": "by adding these features.",
          "zh": "透過加入這些功能。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25597070",
      "title": "Rendering Lists of Data",
      "sourceHash": "1fdcfd03308bf230c169ececf192bfe0680b4bd93071c22479f99d105f43ccb9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.366,
          "end": 3.933,
          "en": "- [Maximilian] So here's our project,",
          "zh": "- [Maximilian] 所以這是我們的專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.933,
          "end": 7.033,
          "en": "and we already got a list of data there,",
          "zh": "而我們已經在那裡有一份資料清單了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.033,
          "end": 9,
          "en": "but of course this list is static.",
          "zh": "但當然，這份清單是靜態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 11.833,
          "en": "It's not dynamic at all at the moment.",
          "zh": "目前它完全不是動態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.833,
          "end": 14,
          "en": "So for example, if we filter here",
          "zh": "所以舉例來說，如果我們在這裡做篩選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14,
          "end": 16.266,
          "en": "this does not affect the list at all,",
          "zh": "這完全不會影響到清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.266,
          "end": 19.666,
          "en": "and also if we would add a new item here,",
          "zh": "另外，如果我們在這裡新增一個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.7,
          "end": 24.4,
          "en": "you would also see that as we pick this and add this",
          "zh": "你也會看到，當我們選了這個並把它新增進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.4,
          "end": 26.833,
          "en": "it's not added to the list because we haven't added",
          "zh": "它並不會被加入清單，因為我們還沒加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.833,
          "end": 28.5,
          "en": "the logic for this yet.",
          "zh": "這部分的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 29.2,
          "en": "the logic for this yet.",
          "zh": "這部分的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.2,
          "end": 31.033,
          "en": "So therefore that's what we're going to do,",
          "zh": "所以，這就是我們接下來要做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.033,
          "end": 33.166,
          "en": "and therefore, here in this application",
          "zh": "因此，在這個應用程式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.166,
          "end": 35.866,
          "en": "we now wanna continue working on that.",
          "zh": "我們現在要繼續處理這個部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.866,
          "end": 39.266,
          "en": "In the Expenses.js file we currently render",
          "zh": "在 Expenses.js 檔案裡，我們目前渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.266,
          "end": 43.933,
          "en": "our list of expenses by individually adding",
          "zh": "我們的支出清單，方式是逐一加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.933,
          "end": 48.233,
          "en": "these expense item elements here in our JSX code,",
          "zh": "這些 expense item 元素到我們的 JSX 程式碼裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.233,
          "end": 48.666,
          "en": "these expense item elements here in our JSX code,",
          "zh": "這些 expense item 元素到我們的 JSX 程式碼裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.666,
          "end": 51.733,
          "en": "and that's of course not dynamic at all.",
          "zh": "而這當然完全不是動態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.733,
          "end": 55.2,
          "en": "In most web applications we don't know in advance",
          "zh": "在多數網頁應用程式裡，我們事先並不知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.2,
          "end": 57.3,
          "en": "how many items we wanna render.",
          "zh": "我們想要渲染多少個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.3,
          "end": 57.5,
          "en": "how many items we wanna render.",
          "zh": "我們想要渲染多少個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.5,
          "end": 60.733,
          "en": "I mean, here for example, we don't know how many expenses",
          "zh": "我的意思是，例如在這裡，我們不知道有多少筆支出"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.733,
          "end": 63.566,
          "en": "the user is going to add and how many expenses",
          "zh": "是使用者將會新增的，以及有多少筆支出"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.566,
          "end": 67,
          "en": "should be displayed when a certain year is selected.",
          "zh": "應該在某個年份被選取時顯示出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67,
          "end": 67.466,
          "en": "should be displayed when a certain year is selected.",
          "zh": "應該在某個年份被選取時顯示出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.466,
          "end": 70.766,
          "en": "So therefore hard coding the number of expense items",
          "zh": "所以，像我們現在這樣把支出項目的數量寫死，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.766,
          "end": 75.3,
          "en": "as we're currently doing it is definitely not the way to go.",
          "zh": "絕對不是正確的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.3,
          "end": 78.166,
          "en": "Instead we wanna render that list dynamically,",
          "zh": "我們想要改成動態地渲染那份清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.166,
          "end": 80.46600000000001,
          "en": "and doing that as a standard case,",
          "zh": "而這是一個很標準的情境，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.46600000000001,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "which you'll face in a lot of projects and applications,",
          "zh": "你在很多專案和應用程式裡都會遇到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 87.366,
          "en": "and it's therefore also straightforward to do with React.",
          "zh": "因此在 React 裡做起來也很直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.366,
          "end": 87.6,
          "en": "and it's therefore also straightforward to do with React.",
          "zh": "因此在 React 裡做起來也很直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.6,
          "end": 89.733,
          "en": "So here is how it does work.",
          "zh": "那麼，它的運作方式就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.733,
          "end": 94.93299999999999,
          "en": "We wanna render our expenses which are defined in App.js.",
          "zh": "我們想要渲染定義在 App.js 裡的 expenses。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.93299999999999,
          "end": 95,
          "en": "We wanna render our expenses which are defined in App.js.",
          "zh": "我們想要渲染定義在 App.js 裡的 expenses。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95,
          "end": 97.666,
          "en": "Here we got this expenses array,",
          "zh": "這裡我們有這個 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.666,
          "end": 98.233,
          "en": "Here we got this expenses array,",
          "zh": "這裡我們有這個 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.233,
          "end": 101.6,
          "en": "and we wanna render this in the expenses component,",
          "zh": "而我們想要在 expenses 元件裡渲染它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 101.6,
          "end": 104.366,
          "en": "therefore, the first step is to pass",
          "zh": "因此，第一步是把"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.366,
          "end": 106.833,
          "en": "our expenses down via props, which we're already doing.",
          "zh": "我們的 expenses 透過 props 往下傳，而這我們已經在做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.833,
          "end": 108.566,
          "en": "our expenses down via props, which we're already doing.",
          "zh": "我們的 expenses 透過 props 往下傳，而這我們已經在做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 108.566,
          "end": 110.733,
          "en": "We are passing the items prop,",
          "zh": "我們傳遞了 items 這個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.733,
          "end": 112.96600000000001,
          "en": "which points at this expenses array.",
          "zh": "它指向這個 expenses 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 114.5,
          "end": 118.46600000000001,
          "en": "So in the expenses component, we do get our list of expenses",
          "zh": "所以在 expenses 元件裡，我們的確拿到了支出清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 118.46600000000001,
          "end": 120.6,
          "en": "but we're currently not using that,",
          "zh": "但我們目前並沒有使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.6,
          "end": 120.833,
          "en": "but we're currently not using that,",
          "zh": "但我們目前並沒有使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 120.833,
          "end": 122.533,
          "en": "and that's what we wanna change.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們想要改變的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 122.533,
          "end": 122.9,
          "en": "and that's what we wanna change.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們想要改變的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 122.9,
          "end": 126.033,
          "en": "On our props we got this items prop,",
          "zh": "在我們的 props 上，我們有這個 items prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 126.033,
          "end": 128.5,
          "en": "and the value of that will be that array,",
          "zh": "而它的值就是那個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.5,
          "end": 130.733,
          "en": "which will be in the end when I render here,",
          "zh": "當我在這裡渲染時，最終就會是它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 130.733,
          "end": 131.633,
          "en": "which will be in the end when I render here,",
          "zh": "當我在這裡渲染時，最終就會是它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 131.633,
          "end": 133.633,
          "en": "but we don't wanna output the array",
          "zh": "但我們不想把這個陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 133.633,
          "end": 134.966,
          "en": "as text or anything like that.",
          "zh": "當成文字之類的東西輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 134.966,
          "end": 138.4,
          "en": "Instead, we wanna render one expense item",
          "zh": "相對地，我們想針對陣列中的每個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 138.4,
          "end": 141.233,
          "en": "per element in the array, and that's straightforward to do.",
          "zh": "渲染一個 expense item，而這做起來很直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 141.233,
          "end": 143.766,
          "en": "per element in the array, and that's straightforward to do.",
          "zh": "渲染一個 expense item，而這做起來很直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 147.36599999999999,
          "en": "For this, we first of all need single curly braces,",
          "zh": "為此，我們首先需要一對大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 147.36599999999999,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "opening and closing, because we wanna execute",
          "zh": "一個開、一個關，因為我們想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.53300000000002,
          "en": "opening and closing, because we wanna execute",
          "zh": "一個開、一個關，因為我們想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 150.53300000000002,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "a dynamic expression in our JSX code,",
          "zh": "在我們的 JSX 程式碼裡執行一個動態運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 154.5,
          "end": 154.9,
          "en": "a dynamic expression in our JSX code,",
          "zh": "在我們的 JSX 程式碼裡執行一個動態運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 154.9,
          "end": 158.066,
          "en": "and you learned that that's done with curly braces.",
          "zh": "而你學過，這是用大括號來完成的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 158.066,
          "end": 161.833,
          "en": "Then we can execute JavaScript expressions here.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就可以在這裡執行 JavaScript 運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 161.833,
          "end": 162.2,
          "en": "Then we can execute JavaScript expressions here.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就可以在這裡執行 JavaScript 運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 162.2,
          "end": 165.2,
          "en": "Now the expression which I do want to execute here",
          "zh": "而我在這裡真正想執行的運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 165.2,
          "end": 168.8,
          "en": "is that I reach out to my array of data,",
          "zh": "就是去取用我的資料陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 168.8,
          "end": 171.566,
          "en": "in this case the array of expenses,",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡，就是 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 171.566,
          "end": 172.066,
          "en": "in this case the array of expenses,",
          "zh": "在這個例子裡，就是 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 172.066,
          "end": 173.833,
          "en": "and that then for every element",
          "zh": "然後針對其中的每個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 173.833,
          "end": 177.1,
          "en": "we wanna create such a JSX element.",
          "zh": "我們想要建立一個這樣的 JSX 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 177.1,
          "end": 177.833,
          "en": "we wanna create such a JSX element.",
          "zh": "我們想要建立一個這樣的 JSX 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 177.833,
          "end": 180.233,
          "en": "For this we can access props items,",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以取用 props.items，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 180.233,
          "end": 182.733,
          "en": "that's our array of items, our array of expenses,",
          "zh": "那就是我們的 items 陣列，也就是我們的 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 182.733,
          "end": 184.766,
          "en": "that's our array of items, our array of expenses,",
          "zh": "那就是我們的 items 陣列，也就是我們的 expenses 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 184.766,
          "end": 188.2,
          "en": "and now we can use a built in array method,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以使用一個內建的陣列方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 188.2,
          "end": 191.233,
          "en": "which is built into standard JavaScript,",
          "zh": "這是標準 JavaScript 內建的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 191.233,
          "end": 194.033,
          "en": "and that's the map method.",
          "zh": "也就是 map 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 194.033,
          "end": 194.433,
          "en": "and that's the map method.",
          "zh": "也就是 map 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 194.433,
          "end": 196.36599999999999,
          "en": "You can learn more about this method",
          "zh": "你可以更深入了解這個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 196.36599999999999,
          "end": 198.8,
          "en": "if you Google for JS array map,",
          "zh": "只要用 Google 搜尋 JS array map，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 199.733,
          "end": 203.666,
          "en": "and what this method does, is that it creates a new array",
          "zh": "而這個方法的作用，是根據另一個陣列建立一個新的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 203.666,
          "end": 207.666,
          "en": "based on another array, and that basically transforms",
          "zh": "它會根據另一個陣列建立新陣列，基本上就是轉換"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 207.666,
          "end": 211.1,
          "en": "every element in that original array.",
          "zh": "原始陣列裡的每一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 211.1,
          "end": 211.7,
          "en": "every element in that original array.",
          "zh": "原始陣列裡的每一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 211.7,
          "end": 213.833,
          "en": "So here in this example, you, for example,",
          "zh": "所以在這個範例裡，你可以看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 213.833,
          "end": 215.633,
          "en": "see that we have an array of numbers,",
          "zh": "我們有一個數字陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 215.633,
          "end": 219.266,
          "en": "and with map we multiply every number with two",
          "zh": "而用 map，我們把每個數字都乘以二，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 219.266,
          "end": 222.333,
          "en": "so that we get this new array as a result,",
          "zh": "結果就得到這個新的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 224.266,
          "end": 227.6,
          "en": "and for applying this transformation, map,",
          "zh": "而要套用這個轉換，map"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 227.6,
          "end": 229.3,
          "en": "this method which we can call,",
          "zh": "這個我們可以呼叫的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 229.3,
          "end": 233,
          "en": "takes a function, which we pass as an argument,",
          "zh": "會接收一個函式，我們把它當作參數傳進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 233,
          "end": 233.266,
          "en": "takes a function, which we pass as an argument,",
          "zh": "會接收一個函式，我們把它當作參數傳進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 233.266,
          "end": 236.1,
          "en": "and that function is then executed",
          "zh": "接著這個函式會被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 236.1,
          "end": 240.966,
          "en": "for every item in the array on which we're calling map,",
          "zh": "針對我們呼叫 map 的那個陣列裡的每一個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 240.966,
          "end": 241.233,
          "en": "for every item in the array on which we're calling map,",
          "zh": "針對我們呼叫 map 的那個陣列裡的每一個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 241.233,
          "end": 244.2,
          "en": "and the result of this function is the element",
          "zh": "而這個函式的結果，就是那個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 244.2,
          "end": 246.9,
          "en": "which will be added to the newly created array.",
          "zh": "它會被加入新建立的那個陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 246.9,
          "end": 248.833,
          "en": "That's how this works, and that's a built in method,",
          "zh": "它就是這樣運作的，而這是個內建方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 248.833,
          "end": 250.433,
          "en": "That's how this works, and that's a built in method,",
          "zh": "它就是這樣運作的，而這是個內建方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 250.433,
          "end": 252.9,
          "en": "as I said, and we can utilize it here",
          "zh": "就像我說的，我們可以在這裡利用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 252.9,
          "end": 257.466,
          "en": "to transform our array of objects, which we have here,",
          "zh": "把我們這裡的物件陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 257.466,
          "end": 259.6,
          "en": "we got a bunch of objects in there,",
          "zh": "裡面有一堆物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 259.6,
          "end": 262.733,
          "en": "into an array of JSX elements, to be precise,",
          "zh": "轉換成一個 JSX 元素陣列，精確地說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 262.733,
          "end": 264.033,
          "en": "into an array of JSX elements, to be precise,",
          "zh": "轉換成一個 JSX 元素陣列，精確地說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 264.033,
          "end": 268.3,
          "en": "into an array full of expense item JSX elements,",
          "zh": "轉換成一個充滿 expense item JSX 元素的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 268.3,
          "end": 268.9,
          "en": "into an array full of expense item JSX elements,",
          "zh": "轉換成一個充滿 expense item JSX 元素的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 268.9,
          "end": 273.9,
          "en": "because if you do output an array of JSX elements here,",
          "zh": "因為如果你在這裡輸出一個 JSX 元素陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 275.06600000000003,
          "end": 280.06600000000003,
          "en": "like a couple of cards, then React is capable",
          "zh": "例如幾張卡片，那麼 React 就能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 280.06600000000003,
          "end": 283.7,
          "en": "of simply rendering these elements.",
          "zh": "直接把這些元素渲染出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 283.7,
          "end": 284,
          "en": "of simply rendering these elements.",
          "zh": "直接把這些元素渲染出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 284,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "So if you had something like this,",
          "zh": "所以如果你有像這樣的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 290,
          "en": "an array of JSX elements as part of your JSX code,",
          "zh": "在你的 JSX 程式碼裡放入一個 JSX 元素陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 290,
          "end": 294.8,
          "en": "react would simply render these elements side by side,",
          "zh": "React 就會直接把這些元素並排渲染出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 294.8,
          "end": 295.233,
          "en": "react would simply render these elements side by side,",
          "zh": "React 就會直接把這些元素並排渲染出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 295.233,
          "end": 297.83299999999997,
          "en": "and that's what we utilize here to transform",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這裡利用它，把"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 297.83299999999997,
          "end": 301.766,
          "en": "our array of objects into such an array of expense items,",
          "zh": "我們的物件陣列轉換成這樣一個 expense items 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 301.766,
          "end": 304.266,
          "en": "which then are rendered by React.",
          "zh": "再由 React 把它們渲染出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 305.433,
          "end": 308.4,
          "en": "So map, as I just showed you, takes a function",
          "zh": "所以 map，就像我剛剛示範的，會接收一個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 308.4,
          "end": 311.166,
          "en": "as a argument, and that function executes",
          "zh": "當作參數，而那個函式會針對"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 311.166,
          "end": 314.766,
          "en": "for every element in the array, and it gets that element",
          "zh": "陣列裡的每個元素執行，而它會把那個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 314.766,
          "end": 318.7,
          "en": "for which it's currently executing as a parameter.",
          "zh": "當作參數傳進來，也就是它目前正在處理的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 318.7,
          "end": 318.966,
          "en": "for which it's currently executing as a parameter.",
          "zh": "當作參數傳進來，也就是它目前正在處理的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 318.966,
          "end": 322.5,
          "en": "So here we get our expense, for example,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，比如說，我們會拿到我們的 expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 322.5,
          "end": 322.83299999999997,
          "en": "So here we get our expense, for example,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，比如說，我們會拿到我們的 expense，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 322.83299999999997,
          "end": 325,
          "en": "and then in the function body,",
          "zh": "然後在函式主體裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 325,
          "end": 326.83299999999997,
          "en": "so on the right side of this arrow",
          "zh": "也就是這個箭頭的右側，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 326.83299999999997,
          "end": 328.966,
          "en": "if we're using our arrow function,",
          "zh": "如果我們用的是箭頭函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 328.966,
          "end": 332.366,
          "en": "we then have to return the JSX element",
          "zh": "我們就必須回傳那個 JSX 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 332.366,
          "end": 335.5,
          "en": "into which we want to map this expense.",
          "zh": "也就是我們想把這筆 expense 對應進去的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 335.5,
          "end": 335.8,
          "en": "into which we want to map this expense.",
          "zh": "也就是我們想把這筆 expense 對應進去的那個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 335.8,
          "end": 340.56600000000003,
          "en": "So in this case, I wanna map every expense",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子裡，我想把每一筆 expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 340.56600000000003,
          "end": 344.133,
          "en": "in my expenses array, I want to map every expense",
          "zh": "在我的 expenses 陣列裡，我想把每一筆 expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 344.133,
          "end": 346.733,
          "en": "into an expense item JSX element.",
          "zh": "對應成一個 expense item JSX 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 348.83299999999997,
          "end": 351.966,
          "en": "So I wanna transform the expense object",
          "zh": "所以我想把這個 expense 物件轉換"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 351.966,
          "end": 356.83299999999997,
          "en": "to this special kind of object, to this JSX element,",
          "zh": "成這種特別的物件，也就是這個 JSX 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 356.83299999999997,
          "end": 357.2,
          "en": "to this special kind of object, to this JSX element,",
          "zh": "成這種特別的物件，也就是這個 JSX 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 357.2,
          "end": 360,
          "en": "and then we can just configure this as we did it here.",
          "zh": "然後我們就可以像這裡一樣來設定它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 360,
          "end": 365,
          "en": "We add a title prop, but the title is now expense.title,",
          "zh": "我們加上 title 這個 prop，但 title 現在是 expense.title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 366.1,
          "end": 369.666,
          "en": "so this expense, which has passed as a parameter",
          "zh": "所以這個 expense，它被當作參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 369.666,
          "end": 372.066,
          "en": "into this function automatically,",
          "zh": "自動傳進這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 372.066,
          "end": 374.166,
          "en": "because that's how map works,",
          "zh": "因為 map 就是這樣運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 374.166,
          "end": 378.166,
          "en": "that expense is used to extract the title,",
          "zh": "那個 expense 被用來取出 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 378.166,
          "end": 378.566,
          "en": "that expense is used to extract the title,",
          "zh": "那個 expense 被用來取出 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 378.566,
          "end": 381.933,
          "en": "and we do the same for the amount with expense amount,",
          "zh": "而我們也對金額做一樣的事，用的是 expense.amount，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 381.933,
          "end": 384.033,
          "en": "and of course we do the same for the date",
          "zh": "當然，我們也對日期做一樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 384.033,
          "end": 388.466,
          "en": "by setting the date prop to expense date.",
          "zh": "把 date 這個 prop 設成 expense.date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 388.466,
          "end": 388.83299999999997,
          "en": "by setting the date prop to expense date.",
          "zh": "把 date 這個 prop 設成 expense.date。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 388.83299999999997,
          "end": 392.766,
          "en": "Let me reformat this, and this is now how that looks like.",
          "zh": "讓我重新格式化一下，現在它看起來就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 395.4,
          "end": 398.766,
          "en": "Now we can get rid of the hard coded expense items here,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以把這裡寫死的 expense items 拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 398.766,
          "end": 403.166,
          "en": "and we're only left with this map expression here,",
          "zh": "只留下這裡這個 map 運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 404.83299999999997,
          "end": 409.6,
          "en": "where we transform our array to an array full of JSX items.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡把陣列轉換成一個充滿 JSX 項目的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 411.7,
          "end": 415,
          "en": "Hence, if I now save this, and I reload,",
          "zh": "因此，如果我現在儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 415,
          "end": 416.2,
          "en": "we get a warning, which you can ignore for now,",
          "zh": "我們會看到一個警告，你現在可以先忽略它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 416.2,
          "end": 417.8,
          "en": "we get a warning, which you can ignore for now,",
          "zh": "我們會看到一個警告，你現在可以先忽略它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 417.8,
          "end": 422.6,
          "en": "but we also see that we get all these items being rendered",
          "zh": "但我們也會看到，所有這些項目都被渲染出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 422.6,
          "end": 422.9,
          "en": "but we also see that we get all these items being rendered",
          "zh": "但我們也會看到，所有這些項目都被渲染出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 422.9,
          "end": 428.333,
          "en": "just as before but now it's actually happening dynamically,",
          "zh": "就像之前一樣，但現在它實際上是動態產生的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 428.333,
          "end": 432.133,
          "en": "which simply means that now it's based on the actual array,",
          "zh": "這簡單來說就是，現在它是根據實際的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 432.133,
          "end": 434.1,
          "en": "and that of course means that we can now",
          "zh": "而這當然也表示，我們現在可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 434.1,
          "end": 436.866,
          "en": "also change that array and such changes",
          "zh": "修改那個陣列，而這樣的變更"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 436.866,
          "end": 439.866,
          "en": "will be reflected in that list,",
          "zh": "會反映在那份清單上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 439.866,
          "end": 442,
          "en": "and that's what we're going to do next therefore.",
          "zh": "所以，這就是我們接下來要做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 442,
          "end": 444.433,
          "en": "Of course, feel free to try it on your own first.",
          "zh": "當然，你可以先自己試著做做看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 444.433,
          "end": 446.933,
          "en": "We're going to do it together in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "我們會在下一個單元一起來做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25597080",
      "title": "Using Stateful Lists",
      "sourceHash": "1c39939433595e9f56b757b8d5392f2b3244276195556efd861303b7bb27e9f6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 3.966,
          "en": "- So how could we now update",
          "zh": "- 那麼我們現在要如何更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.966,
          "end": 8.233,
          "en": "this expenses array whenever a new expense is being added?",
          "zh": "這個 expenses 陣列，每當有新的支出被新增的時候？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.233,
          "end": 10.566,
          "en": "Well for this, we need to go to App.js",
          "zh": "為此，我們需要到 App.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.566,
          "end": 13.233,
          "en": "because that is where we have this expenses array.",
          "zh": "因為那個 expenses 陣列就在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.333,
          "end": 18.166,
          "en": "There, we also have this addExpenseHandler function",
          "zh": "在那裡，我們也有這個 addExpenseHandler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.166,
          "end": 18.233,
          "en": "There, we also have this addExpenseHandler function",
          "zh": "在那裡，我們也有這個 addExpenseHandler 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.233,
          "end": 20.833,
          "en": "which we added in the last course section",
          "zh": "這是我們在上一節課程區段中加入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.833,
          "end": 24.333,
          "en": "which has triggered whenever a new expenses added.",
          "zh": "每當有新的支出被新增時，它就會被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.333,
          "end": 24.833,
          "en": "which has triggered whenever a new expenses added.",
          "zh": "每當有新的支出被新增時，它就會被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.833,
          "end": 28.466,
          "en": "And we even received the expense as a parameter here.",
          "zh": "而且我們甚至在這裡把這筆支出當作參數收到了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.466,
          "end": 28.766,
          "en": "And we even received the expense as a parameter here.",
          "zh": "而且我們甚至在這裡把這筆支出當作參數收到了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.766,
          "end": 32.6,
          "en": "So all we got to do is we have to add this expense",
          "zh": "所以我們唯一要做的，就是把這筆支出加進"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.6,
          "end": 33.966,
          "en": "to this expenses array.",
          "zh": "這個 expenses 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.266,
          "end": 37.066,
          "en": "But of course, if we just edit like this",
          "zh": "但當然，如果我們只是像這樣直接改，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.066,
          "end": 39.833,
          "en": "nothing would happen because you already learned",
          "zh": "什麼都不會發生，因為你已經學過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.833,
          "end": 43.233,
          "en": "that just because you change some variable,",
          "zh": "光是改變某個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.233,
          "end": 46.333,
          "en": "React won't update the component.",
          "zh": "React 並不會更新這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.333,
          "end": 46.566,
          "en": "React won't update the component.",
          "zh": "React 並不會更新這個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.566,
          "end": 50.466,
          "en": "Instead to achieve that, you need to use state.",
          "zh": "要達到這個效果，你需要改用 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.466,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "Instead to achieve that, you need to use state.",
          "zh": "要達到這個效果，你需要改用 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 53.233,
          "en": "And therefore here in App.js,",
          "zh": "因此，在 App.js 這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.233,
          "end": 55.333,
          "en": "where we manage our expenses,",
          "zh": "也就是我們管理 expenses 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.333,
          "end": 59.333,
          "en": "we now wanna import useState from React",
          "zh": "我們現在想從 React 匯入 useState，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.333,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "so that we can register some state here.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就可以在這裡註冊一些 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 62.8,
          "en": "so that we can register some state here.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就可以在這裡註冊一些 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.8,
          "end": 65.566,
          "en": "And I will actually grab this array here,",
          "zh": "而我其實會把這裡這個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.566,
          "end": 68.366,
          "en": "this constant and extract that out",
          "zh": "這個常數，把它抽出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 68.366,
          "end": 71.8,
          "en": "of this component function and instead store it here",
          "zh": "從這個元件函式中抽出來，改放在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 71.8,
          "end": 75.93299999999999,
          "en": "and name it Initial Expenses",
          "zh": "並把它命名為 Initial Expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.93299999999999,
          "end": 76.3,
          "en": "and name it Initial Expenses",
          "zh": "並把它命名為 Initial Expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.3,
          "end": 80.133,
          "en": "or Dummy Expenses since that's what it is.",
          "zh": "或者叫 Dummy Expenses，因為它本來就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.133,
          "end": 80.43299999999999,
          "en": "or Dummy Expenses since that's what it is.",
          "zh": "或者叫 Dummy Expenses，因為它本來就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 80.43299999999999,
          "end": 83.46600000000001,
          "en": "So that this actually is just some dummy data",
          "zh": "這樣它其實就只是一些假資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 83.46600000000001,
          "end": 86.8,
          "en": "which we can use to initialize our state with.",
          "zh": "我們可以用它來初始化我們的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.8,
          "end": 87.5,
          "en": "which we can use to initialize our state with.",
          "zh": "我們可以用它來初始化我們的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 87.5,
          "end": 90.1,
          "en": "But then inside of the app component function",
          "zh": "但接著在 App 元件函式裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 90.1,
          "end": 92.333,
          "en": "we call useState and I'll pass my dummy expenses",
          "zh": "我們呼叫 useState，而我要傳入我的 dummy expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 92.333,
          "end": 94.76599999999999,
          "en": "we call useState and I'll pass my dummy expenses",
          "zh": "我們呼叫 useState，而我要傳入我的 dummy expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 94.76599999999999,
          "end": 96.93299999999999,
          "en": "so this array full of dummy data",
          "zh": "也就是這個充滿假資料的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 96.93299999999999,
          "end": 99.26599999999999,
          "en": "as an initial state value",
          "zh": "當作初始的 state 值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 99.26599999999999,
          "end": 99.3,
          "en": "as an initial state value",
          "zh": "當作初始的 state 值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 102.366,
          "en": "so that we have some initial expenses to display.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就有一些初始的支出可以顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 102.366,
          "end": 102.76599999999999,
          "en": "so that we have some initial expenses to display.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就有一些初始的支出可以顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 102.76599999999999,
          "end": 105.833,
          "en": "But then here, we can again use de-structuring",
          "zh": "不過接著在這裡，我們又可以再次使用解構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 105.833,
          "end": 108.26599999999999,
          "en": "as I showed it to you in the last section",
          "zh": "就像我在上一節示範給你看過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 108.26599999999999,
          "end": 110.066,
          "en": "to get access to our expenses",
          "zh": "來取得我們的 expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 110.066,
          "end": 113.733,
          "en": "and to the set expenses state updating function.",
          "zh": "以及 setExpenses 這個 state 更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 115.9,
          "end": 119.833,
          "en": "And now that we got this here in the addExpenseHandler",
          "zh": "現在我們在 addExpenseHandler 裡有了這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 119.833,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "where we wanna add a new expense,",
          "zh": "也就是我們想新增一筆支出的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 126.266,
          "en": "we can call setExpenses to set our expenses array",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫 setExpenses，把我們的 expenses 陣列設成"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 126.266,
          "end": 129.566,
          "en": "to a new array which includes this new expense.",
          "zh": "一個包含這筆新支出的新陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 130.933,
          "end": 132.966,
          "en": "So how should we update this?",
          "zh": "那麼我們應該怎麼更新它呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 132.966,
          "end": 135.733,
          "en": "Well, we could pass a new array here",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡傳入一個新的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 135.733,
          "end": 138.166,
          "en": "and then let's say we wanna add the new expense",
          "zh": "然後比如說，我們想把這筆新支出"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 138.166,
          "end": 140.2,
          "en": "as the first item in the array.",
          "zh": "加在陣列的第一個位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 140.2,
          "end": 143.966,
          "en": "For that we could add the expense which we're getting here",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以把這裡拿到的這筆 expense 加進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 143.966,
          "end": 146.36599999999999,
          "en": "as an item to this array and then use",
          "zh": "把它當成這個陣列的一個項目，然後使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 146.36599999999999,
          "end": 147.133,
          "en": "as an item to this array and then use",
          "zh": "把它當成這個陣列的一個項目，然後使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 147.133,
          "end": 150.733,
          "en": "the spread operator on the existing expenses",
          "zh": "把展開運算子用在現有的 expenses 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 150.733,
          "end": 154.1,
          "en": "to pull out all the existing array elements",
          "zh": "把所有現有的陣列元素取出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 154.1,
          "end": 156.633,
          "en": "and populate the rest of this new array",
          "zh": "並讓這個新陣列的其餘部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 156.633,
          "end": 159.233,
          "en": "with those existing elements.",
          "zh": "填滿那些現有的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 159.233,
          "end": 159.9,
          "en": "with those existing elements.",
          "zh": "填滿那些現有的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 159.9,
          "end": 163.8,
          "en": "We can use the spread operator not just on objects",
          "zh": "展開運算子不只可以用在物件上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 163.8,
          "end": 165.233,
          "en": "but also on arrays.",
          "zh": "也可以用在陣列上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 165.233,
          "end": 167.466,
          "en": "And again, that's not a React feature.",
          "zh": "再次強調，這不是 React 的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 167.466,
          "end": 169.53300000000002,
          "en": "That's a standard JavaScript feature.",
          "zh": "這是標準 JavaScript 的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 171.333,
          "end": 174.133,
          "en": "However, if we would update the state like this",
          "zh": "不過，如果我們像這樣更新 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 174.133,
          "end": 176.466,
          "en": "it would not really be correct,",
          "zh": "那其實並不正確，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 176.466,
          "end": 179.233,
          "en": "as you learned in the last core section.",
          "zh": "就像你在上一個核心章節學到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 179.233,
          "end": 179.633,
          "en": "as you learned in the last core section.",
          "zh": "就像你在上一個核心章節學到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 179.633,
          "end": 182.133,
          "en": "Instead, if you update your state",
          "zh": "相反地，如果你要更新的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 182.133,
          "end": 184.833,
          "en": "depending on the previous state",
          "zh": "是取決於先前的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 184.833,
          "end": 187.9,
          "en": "or to previous snapshot of this state,",
          "zh": "或是這個 state 先前的快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 187.9,
          "end": 190.9,
          "en": "you should use this special function form",
          "zh": "你就應該使用這個特別的函式形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 190.9,
          "end": 193.4,
          "en": "for this state updating function.",
          "zh": "來呼叫這個 state 更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 193.4,
          "end": 193.766,
          "en": "for this state updating function.",
          "zh": "來呼叫這個 state 更新函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 193.766,
          "end": 196.86599999999999,
          "en": "So it would be passed a function as argument",
          "zh": "也就是要傳入一個函式當作參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 196.86599999999999,
          "end": 199,
          "en": "to this state updating function",
          "zh": "給這個 state 更新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 199,
          "end": 201.833,
          "en": "and that function will automatically receive",
          "zh": "而那個函式會自動收到"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 201.833,
          "end": 204.466,
          "en": "the latest state snapshot.",
          "zh": "最新的 state 快照。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 204.466,
          "end": 205,
          "en": "the latest state snapshot.",
          "zh": "最新的 state 快照。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 205,
          "end": 207.666,
          "en": "So here we would then get our previous expenses",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們就會拿到我們先前的 expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 207.666,
          "end": 209.633,
          "en": "automatically by React.",
          "zh": "由 React 自動提供。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 209.633,
          "end": 209.86599999999999,
          "en": "automatically by React.",
          "zh": "由 React 自動提供。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 209.86599999999999,
          "end": 212.566,
          "en": "And we would return our new array",
          "zh": "而我們會回傳我們的新陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 212.566,
          "end": 215.4,
          "en": "where we add this expense which we're getting",
          "zh": "我們在裡面加入這裡拿到的這筆"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 215.4,
          "end": 217.966,
          "en": "as a parameter here and where we then add",
          "zh": "當作參數的 expense，然後我們再加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 217.966,
          "end": 220.066,
          "en": "as a parameter here and where we then add",
          "zh": "當作參數的 expense，然後我們再加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 220.066,
          "end": 223.566,
          "en": "our previous expenses with that spread operator.",
          "zh": "我們先前的 expenses，用那個展開運算子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 223.566,
          "end": 226.766,
          "en": "And that's the clean way of updating our state",
          "zh": "而這就是更新 state 的乾淨做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 226.766,
          "end": 231.566,
          "en": "when it's based on an older snapshot of that same state.",
          "zh": "當更新是根據同一個 state 較舊的快照時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 234.466,
          "end": 237.7,
          "en": "Now with that, we add our new expense.",
          "zh": "現在，這樣我們就新增了我們的支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 237.7,
          "end": 241.133,
          "en": "And now since we're using our expenses state here",
          "zh": "而現在，因為我們在這裡使用的是 expenses 這個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 241.133,
          "end": 243.366,
          "en": "to pass it to expenses,",
          "zh": "把它傳給 expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 243.366,
          "end": 243.6,
          "en": "to pass it to expenses,",
          "zh": "把它傳給 expenses，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 243.6,
          "end": 246.833,
          "en": "we should automatically have a dynamic list",
          "zh": "我們應該就會自動得到一份動態清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 246.833,
          "end": 250.033,
          "en": "which automatically updates when items are added.",
          "zh": "當項目被新增時，它會自動更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 250.033,
          "end": 250.7,
          "en": "which automatically updates when items are added.",
          "zh": "當項目被新增時，它會自動更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 250.7,
          "end": 255.7,
          "en": "So if we now add a book for $29.99 and pick some date here,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們現在新增一本 29.99 美元的書，並在這裡選個日期，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 257.4,
          "end": 261.8,
          "en": "we see that being added here as a first item.",
          "zh": "我們就會看到它被加在這裡，成為第一個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 261.8,
          "end": 262.266,
          "en": "we see that being added here as a first item.",
          "zh": "我們就會看到它被加在這裡，成為第一個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 262.266,
          "end": 266.866,
          "en": "So this is working and now this is a truly dynamic list",
          "zh": "所以這行得通了，而現在這是一份真正動態的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 266.866,
          "end": 270.83299999999997,
          "en": "by using state and by outputting these items",
          "zh": "透過使用 state，以及透過輸出這些項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 270.83299999999997,
          "end": 273.033,
          "en": "with this map method.",
          "zh": "用這個 map 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 273.033,
          "end": 273.266,
          "en": "with this map method.",
          "zh": "用這個 map 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 273.266,
          "end": 276.933,
          "en": "And that's how you output lists of data dynamically",
          "zh": "而這就是你如何動態輸出資料清單的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 276.933,
          "end": 278.733,
          "en": "with React.",
          "zh": "用 React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 278.733,
          "end": 281.533,
          "en": "Now let's have a look at this key warning",
          "zh": "現在讓我們來看看這個 key 警告，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 281.533,
          "end": 283.233,
          "en": "and what that is all about.",
          "zh": "以及它到底是怎麼一回事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25597082",
      "title": "Understanding \"Keys\"",
      "sourceHash": "18d86dc40c1f7d53288ae3a3acd66301d8c14e77688754740e18e9fc4cd257f8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 5,
          "en": "- [Narrator] So why are we getting this key warning?",
          "zh": "- [Narrator] 所以為什麼我們會收到這個 key 警告？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5,
          "end": 8.2,
          "en": "After all it looks like everything works.",
          "zh": "畢竟看起來一切都運作正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.2,
          "end": 10.833,
          "en": "Well React has a special concept when it comes",
          "zh": "其實 React 有一個特殊的概念，當它"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.833,
          "end": 13,
          "en": "to rendering lists of data",
          "zh": "要渲染資料清單時"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13,
          "end": 16.3,
          "en": "a concept which exists to ensure that React is",
          "zh": "這個概念的存在是為了確保 React"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.3,
          "end": 20.866,
          "en": "able to update and render such lists efficiently",
          "zh": "能有效率地更新與渲染這類清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.866,
          "end": 25.133,
          "en": "without performance losses, or bugs, which may occur.",
          "zh": "而不會有效能損失，或可能出現的 bug。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.133,
          "end": 25.533,
          "en": "without performance losses, or bugs, which may occur.",
          "zh": "而不會有效能損失，或可能出現的 bug。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.533,
          "end": 28.9,
          "en": "And I wanna show you which problem we have",
          "zh": "而我想讓你看看，我們目前的實作"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.9,
          "end": 30.933,
          "en": "with the current implementation.",
          "zh": "有什麼問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.133,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "If you have a look at your Developer Tools",
          "zh": "如果你看一下你的開發者工具"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 37.333,
          "en": "and you go to the Elements tab, there,",
          "zh": "然後切到 Elements 分頁，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.333,
          "end": 39.566,
          "en": "you can inspect your",
          "zh": "你可以檢視你的"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.566,
          "end": 42.7,
          "en": "your list here, which is this list of div's.",
          "zh": "你這裡的清單，也就是這串 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.7,
          "end": 42.766,
          "en": "your list here, which is this list of div's.",
          "zh": "你這裡的清單，也就是這串 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.766,
          "end": 46.133,
          "en": "We could change this to a list with list items",
          "zh": "我們可以把它改成含有 list item 的清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.133,
          "end": 49.866,
          "en": "but for the moment, I'll stick to these div's here.",
          "zh": "不過目前，我先繼續用這裡這些 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.866,
          "end": 52.466,
          "en": "And if we now have a look at this list here",
          "zh": "而如果我們現在看一下這裡這個清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.466,
          "end": 52.533,
          "en": "And if we now have a look at this list here",
          "zh": "而如果我們現在看一下這裡這個清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.533,
          "end": 54.933,
          "en": "then you should watch the part here",
          "zh": "那你就應該注意這裡這個部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.933,
          "end": 57.6,
          "en": "on the right in Developer Tools",
          "zh": "在開發者工具的右邊"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.6,
          "end": 59.966,
          "en": "as I add a new item,",
          "zh": "當我新增一筆項目時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.966,
          "end": 60.433,
          "en": "as I add a new item,",
          "zh": "當我新增一筆項目時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.433,
          "end": 62.166,
          "en": "A book 2, for example,",
          "zh": "舉例來說，A book 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.166,
          "end": 64.566,
          "en": "for 39.99",
          "zh": "價格 39.99"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.566,
          "end": 65.966,
          "en": "if I add dat,",
          "zh": "如果我把它加進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.966,
          "end": 67.966,
          "en": "watch these div's on the right.",
          "zh": "注意右邊這些 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.466,
          "end": 70.866,
          "en": "Did you see what happened?",
          "zh": "你有看到發生什麼事嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.866,
          "end": 72.5,
          "en": "This last item flashed.",
          "zh": "最後這一筆閃了一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 72.5,
          "end": 73.166,
          "en": "And if our item flashes here, it means",
          "zh": "如果我們的項目在這裡閃了一下，那就代表"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 73.166,
          "end": 75.666,
          "en": "And if our item flashes here, it means",
          "zh": "如果我們的項目在這裡閃了一下，那就代表"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.666,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "that it was edited",
          "zh": "它被修改過"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 80.566,
          "en": "or added by the browser.",
          "zh": "或是被瀏覽器新增上去的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.566,
          "end": 81.43299999999999,
          "en": "or added by the browser.",
          "zh": "或是被瀏覽器新增上去的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 81.43299999999999,
          "end": 83.93299999999999,
          "en": "Now it's strange that the last item flashed",
          "zh": "奇怪的是，閃的竟然是最後一筆"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 83.93299999999999,
          "end": 85.866,
          "en": "because actually the new item was added",
          "zh": "因為其實新項目是被加在"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 85.866,
          "end": 89.9,
          "en": "as the first item, the top most item in this list",
          "zh": "第一筆，也就是這份清單最上面的那一筆"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 91.7,
          "en": "to understand what's going on.",
          "zh": "為了了解到底發生了什麼事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.7,
          "end": 94.366,
          "en": "Let me expand this first item,",
          "zh": "讓我展開這第一筆項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.366,
          "end": 95.96600000000001,
          "en": "A book 2, which I just added.",
          "zh": "也就是我剛剛新增的 A book 2。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 95.96600000000001,
          "end": 98.333,
          "en": "And let me add a third item here,",
          "zh": "然後讓我在這裡新增第三筆項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.033,
          "end": 100.93299999999999,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 100.93299999999999,
          "end": 103.866,
          "en": "Let's add this and click Add Expense",
          "zh": "我們把它加進去，然後點擊 Add Expense"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 103.866,
          "end": 105.233,
          "en": "and you see",
          "zh": "你就會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 105.233,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "this also flashed",
          "zh": "這一筆也閃了一下"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 109.76599999999999,
          "en": "if not rewind and go back a couple of seconds.",
          "zh": "如果沒看到，就倒回去幾秒鐘。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 109.76599999999999,
          "end": 112.6,
          "en": "And you'll see that this h2 tag of the",
          "zh": "而你就會看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 112.6,
          "end": 113.96600000000001,
          "en": "first item,",
          "zh": "第一筆項目的這個 h2 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 113.96600000000001,
          "end": 117.3,
          "en": "also flashed when I added this new item.",
          "zh": "在我新增這筆新項目時也閃了一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 117.3,
          "end": 120.833,
          "en": "So what actually happens here when I add a new item",
          "zh": "所以當我新增一筆項目時，這裡實際發生的情況"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 120.833,
          "end": 124.233,
          "en": "is that React, renders this new item",
          "zh": "是 React 會把這筆新項目渲染成"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 124.233,
          "end": 127.633,
          "en": "as the last item in this list of div's",
          "zh": "這個 div 清單中的最後一筆"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 127.633,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "and updates all items and replace their content,",
          "zh": "並更新所有項目、替換掉它們的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 131.2,
          "end": 132.3,
          "en": "such that it again",
          "zh": "好讓它再次"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.666,
          "en": "matches the order of the items in my Array.",
          "zh": "符合我陣列中項目的順序。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 135.666,
          "end": 136.4,
          "en": "matches the order of the items in my Array.",
          "zh": "符合我陣列中項目的順序。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 136.4,
          "end": 139.03300000000002,
          "en": "And this is not great.",
          "zh": "而這並不太好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 139.03300000000002,
          "end": 139.3,
          "en": "And this is not great.",
          "zh": "而這並不太好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 139.3,
          "end": 140.266,
          "en": "This is happening",
          "zh": "會發生這種情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 140.266,
          "end": 143.633,
          "en": "because to React all these items look similar",
          "zh": "是因為對 React 來說，所有這些項目看起來都很相似"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 143.633,
          "end": 146.5,
          "en": "and it only sees that my Array changed",
          "zh": "它只看到我的陣列改變了"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 146.5,
          "end": 148.7,
          "en": "that it's now longer than before.",
          "zh": "現在變得比之前更長。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 148.7,
          "end": 149,
          "en": "that it's now longer than before.",
          "zh": "現在變得比之前更長。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 149,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "And hence it simply renders an additional div",
          "zh": "因此它就只是多渲染一個 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 153.7,
          "en": "and it adds that at the end.",
          "zh": "並把它加在最後面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 153.7,
          "end": 153.833,
          "en": "and it adds that at the end.",
          "zh": "並把它加在最後面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 153.833,
          "end": 156.3,
          "en": "And then it simply walks through all the items",
          "zh": "接著它就只是逐一走過所有項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 156.3,
          "end": 159.733,
          "en": "and updates the content inside of every item",
          "zh": "並更新每個項目裡的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 159.733,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "to match the Array content again.",
          "zh": "好再次符合陣列的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 163.03300000000002,
          "end": 165.9,
          "en": "The final result, therefore is correct here",
          "zh": "所以最終的結果在這裡是正確的"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 169.6,
          "en": "but from a performance perspective this is not great",
          "zh": "但從效能的角度來看，這樣並不好"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 169.6,
          "end": 173.233,
          "en": "because all items are visited and updated",
          "zh": "因為所有項目都會被走訪、被更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 173.233,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "and it can even lead to bugs.",
          "zh": "甚至還可能導致 bug。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 178.833,
          "en": "If the expense items would be state full items",
          "zh": "如果這些支出項目是帶有 state 的項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 178.833,
          "end": 181.866,
          "en": "and we would have some state managed inside of that.",
          "zh": "而我們在裡面管理了一些 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 181.866,
          "end": 182.333,
          "en": "and we would have some state managed inside of that.",
          "zh": "而我們在裡面管理了一些 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 182.333,
          "end": 185.533,
          "en": "Then if, for example, our first item,",
          "zh": "那麼舉例來說，如果我們的第一筆項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 185.533,
          "end": 188.266,
          "en": "if it has a certain state if we add a new item",
          "zh": "如果它帶有特定的 state，當我們新增一筆項目時"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 188.266,
          "end": 190.433,
          "en": "the old first item would be overwritten",
          "zh": "原本的第一筆項目就會被"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 190.433,
          "end": 192.266,
          "en": "with the new first item.",
          "zh": "新的第一筆項目覆蓋掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 192.266,
          "end": 192.5,
          "en": "with the new first item.",
          "zh": "新的第一筆項目覆蓋掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 192.5,
          "end": 195.833,
          "en": "Hence any state changes we might've had in there",
          "zh": "因此，我們在裡面可能做過的任何 state 變更"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 195.833,
          "end": 197.066,
          "en": "would be lost.",
          "zh": "都會遺失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 197.066,
          "end": 199.53300000000002,
          "en": "So besides potential performance issues",
          "zh": "所以除了潛在的效能問題之外"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 199.53300000000002,
          "end": 201.466,
          "en": "we could also run into bugs.",
          "zh": "我們也可能遇到 bug。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 202.9,
          "end": 204.7,
          "en": "So that is a problem.",
          "zh": "所以這是個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 204.7,
          "end": 206.3,
          "en": "And the question therefore is,",
          "zh": "因此問題就在於，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 206.3,
          "end": 209.433,
          "en": "why does React, behave like this?",
          "zh": "為什麼 React 會這樣運作？"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 209.433,
          "end": 212.4,
          "en": "The answer is because it has no other way.",
          "zh": "答案是，因為它沒有其他辦法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 212.4,
          "end": 212.666,
          "en": "The answer is because it has no other way.",
          "zh": "答案是，因為它沒有其他辦法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 212.666,
          "end": 214.933,
          "en": "It currently simply checks the length",
          "zh": "它目前只是檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 214.933,
          "end": 217.1,
          "en": "of the Array and then has a look",
          "zh": "陣列的長度，然後再看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 217.1,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "at the number of items that were already rendered.",
          "zh": "已經渲染過的項目數量。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 220.53300000000002,
          "end": 224.266,
          "en": "The individual items all look similar to React though",
          "zh": "不過，對 React 來說，每個項目看起來都很相似"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 224.266,
          "end": 227.666,
          "en": "so it can't know where a new item should be added",
          "zh": "所以它無法知道新項目應該加在哪裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 227.666,
          "end": 229.066,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": "或任何類似的事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 230.466,
          "end": 233.36599999999999,
          "en": "That's why we get this warning because we have a way",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們會收到這個警告，因為我們有辦法"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 233.36599999999999,
          "end": 236.86599999999999,
          "en": "of telling react where a new item it should be added.",
          "zh": "告訴 React 新項目應該被加在什麼地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 236.86599999999999,
          "end": 237.066,
          "en": "of telling react where a new item it should be added.",
          "zh": "告訴 React 新項目應該被加在什麼地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 237.066,
          "end": 239.666,
          "en": "And we do that by going to the place",
          "zh": "而我們的做法，就是前往那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 239.666,
          "end": 242.133,
          "en": "where we output our list of items.",
          "zh": "輸出項目清單的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 242.133,
          "end": 242.366,
          "en": "where we output our list of items.",
          "zh": "輸出項目清單的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 242.366,
          "end": 244.266,
          "en": "So does map method here",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的 map 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 244.266,
          "end": 248.6,
          "en": "and we then add a special prop to this item here.",
          "zh": "然後我們在這裡給這個項目加上一個特殊的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 248.6,
          "end": 248.933,
          "en": "and we then add a special prop to this item here.",
          "zh": "然後我們在這裡給這個項目加上一個特殊的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 248.933,
          "end": 251.36599999999999,
          "en": "And that's the key prop.",
          "zh": "那就是 key prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 251.36599999999999,
          "end": 251.8,
          "en": "And that's the key prop.",
          "zh": "那就是 key prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 251.8,
          "end": 255.7,
          "en": "This is not a prop we are using instead of expense item",
          "zh": "這不是只能用在 expense item 上的 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 255.7,
          "end": 259.633,
          "en": "but instead it's a prop you can add to any component",
          "zh": "而是你可以加到任何元件上的 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 259.633,
          "end": 259.83299999999997,
          "en": "but instead it's a prop you can add to any component",
          "zh": "而是你可以加到任何元件上的 prop"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 259.83299999999997,
          "end": 262.666,
          "en": "no matter if it's a custom component by you",
          "zh": "不管它是你自訂的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 262.666,
          "end": 267.733,
          "en": "or if it's a built in HTML element, you can always add this.",
          "zh": "還是內建的 HTML 元素，你都可以加上它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 267.733,
          "end": 268.033,
          "en": "or if it's a built in HTML element, you can always add this.",
          "zh": "還是內建的 HTML 元素，你都可以加上它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 268.033,
          "end": 270.733,
          "en": "And if you do add it, if you add the key",
          "zh": "而如果你真的加了，如果你把這個 key"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 270.733,
          "end": 273.7,
          "en": "to your component or HTML element,",
          "zh": "加到你的元件或 HTML 元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 273.7,
          "end": 275.433,
          "en": "then you can",
          "zh": "那麼你就能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 275.433,
          "end": 279.433,
          "en": "help React identify the individual items.",
          "zh": "幫助 React 辨識出每一個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 279.433,
          "end": 280.166,
          "en": "help React identify the individual items.",
          "zh": "幫助 React 辨識出每一個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 280.166,
          "end": 282.966,
          "en": "For dat you need to set a unique",
          "zh": "要做到這點，你需要為每一筆清單項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 282.966,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "value per list item",
          "zh": "設定一個獨一無二的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 288.033,
          "en": "and dat, for example in this case here",
          "zh": "而這個值，舉例來說，在這個情況下"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 288.033,
          "end": 289.733,
          "en": "would be the expense ID",
          "zh": "就會是 expense ID"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 291.33299999999997,
          "end": 293.433,
          "en": "because in our expenses Array,",
          "zh": "因為在我們的 expenses 陣列中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 293.433,
          "end": 295.9,
          "en": "every item has a unique ID.",
          "zh": "每一筆項目都有唯一的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 297.366,
          "end": 300.766,
          "en": "And if you wonder what you do, if you have no unique ID",
          "zh": "而如果你想知道，萬一沒有唯一 ID 該怎麼辦"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 300.766,
          "end": 304.1,
          "en": "then you could use the second argument which you get here",
          "zh": "那你就可以使用你在這裡取得的第二個參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 304.1,
          "end": 306.466,
          "en": "for the function you pass to map",
          "zh": "也就是你傳給 map 的那個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 306.466,
          "end": 309.066,
          "en": "which is an automatically managed index",
          "zh": "它是一個自動管理的索引"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 309.066,
          "end": 312.5,
          "en": "though it's discouraged to use that since with that",
          "zh": "不過並不建議這麼做，因為這樣一來"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 312.5,
          "end": 315.166,
          "en": "you can still run into bugs because the index",
          "zh": "你還是可能遇到 bug，因為這個索引"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 315.166,
          "end": 317.6,
          "en": "for a given item is always the same",
          "zh": "對某一筆項目來說永遠都一樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 317.6,
          "end": 321.8,
          "en": "and not directly attached to the content of the item.",
          "zh": "而不是直接對應到項目的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 321.8,
          "end": 322.33299999999997,
          "en": "and not directly attached to the content of the item.",
          "zh": "而不是直接對應到項目的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 322.33299999999997,
          "end": 323.933,
          "en": "For the ID that's different",
          "zh": "至於 ID，那就不一樣了"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 323.933,
          "end": 328.566,
          "en": "every item with a certain content has a clear unique ID.",
          "zh": "每一筆具有特定內容的項目，都有明確的唯一 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 328.566,
          "end": 329.033,
          "en": "every item with a certain content has a clear unique ID.",
          "zh": "每一筆具有特定內容的項目，都有明確的唯一 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 329.033,
          "end": 330.9,
          "en": "And in reality, it turns out that",
          "zh": "而實際上，事實證明"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 330.9,
          "end": 334.933,
          "en": "in most scenarios you do have some unique ID",
          "zh": "在大多數情境中，你確實都會有某個唯一 ID"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 334.933,
          "end": 338.5,
          "en": "because typically you are rendering some data which comes",
          "zh": "因為通常你渲染的資料，都是來自"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 338.5,
          "end": 340.766,
          "en": "from a database or anything like that.",
          "zh": "資料庫或之類的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 340.766,
          "end": 344.1,
          "en": "And there you work with unique IDs anyways.",
          "zh": "而在那裡，你本來就會用到唯一 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 344.1,
          "end": 348.33299999999997,
          "en": "So finding some unique identifier is no problem",
          "zh": "所以找到某個唯一識別碼並不是問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 348.33299999999997,
          "end": 348.8,
          "en": "So finding some unique identifier is no problem",
          "zh": "所以找到某個唯一識別碼並不是問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 348.8,
          "end": 353,
          "en": "and you can use any primitive value as a unique identifier",
          "zh": "而且你可以用任何基本型別的值當作唯一識別碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 353,
          "end": 357.4,
          "en": "any number or String that can be unique identifiers.",
          "zh": "任何數字或字串都可以當作唯一識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 357.4,
          "end": 357.966,
          "en": "any number or String that can be unique identifiers.",
          "zh": "任何數字或字串都可以當作唯一識別碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 357.966,
          "end": 360.1,
          "en": "So here I add this key,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我加上這個 key，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 360.1,
          "end": 361.833,
          "en": "pointing at expense ID.",
          "zh": "讓它指向 expense ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 361.833,
          "end": 363.733,
          "en": "And once we do that, if we reload",
          "zh": "一旦我們這麼做，如果我們重新載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 363.733,
          "end": 365.7,
          "en": "we no longer get that warning.",
          "zh": "就不會再收到那個警告了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 365.7,
          "end": 367.266,
          "en": "And if I now",
          "zh": "而如果我現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 367.266,
          "end": 370.166,
          "en": "inspect my, my list here again",
          "zh": "再次檢視我這裡的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 370.166,
          "end": 374.266,
          "en": "and I inspect the, the title of the currently first item",
          "zh": "然後檢視目前第一筆項目的標題"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 374.266,
          "end": 375,
          "en": "and I inspect the, the title of the currently first item",
          "zh": "然後檢視目前第一筆項目的標題"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 375,
          "end": 377.9,
          "en": "if I now add a new item again,",
          "zh": "如果我現在再次新增一筆項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 377.9,
          "end": 379.166,
          "en": "like this",
          "zh": "像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 379.166,
          "end": 380,
          "en": "book",
          "zh": "book"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 381.8,
          "end": 385.966,
          "en": "you will see that this h2 tag did now not flash instead",
          "zh": "你就會看到，這次這個 h2 標籤並沒有閃，反而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 385.966,
          "end": 389.266,
          "en": "this div flashed and this div was also now added",
          "zh": "這個 div 閃了一下，而且這個 div 現在也被"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 389.266,
          "end": 391.733,
          "en": "at the beginning of the list correctly.",
          "zh": "正確地加在清單的開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 391.733,
          "end": 394.33299999999997,
          "en": "This div here, I mean, as it should be, because",
          "zh": "這裡這個 div，我的意思是，本來就該如此，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 394.33299999999997,
          "end": 398.4,
          "en": "now React is able to uniquely identify all these items",
          "zh": "現在 React 能夠唯一辨識出所有這些項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 398.4,
          "end": 398.5,
          "en": "now React is able to uniquely identify all these items",
          "zh": "現在 React 能夠唯一辨識出所有這些項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 398.5,
          "end": 402.466,
          "en": "and it's therefore aware, not just how long the Array is",
          "zh": "因此它知道的不只是陣列有多長"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 402.466,
          "end": 405.466,
          "en": "but also aware which items should be placed.",
          "zh": "還知道哪些項目應該被放在哪個位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 405.466,
          "end": 408.933,
          "en": "And it's able to update this list more efficient way.",
          "zh": "而且它能夠用更有效率的方式來更新這份清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 410.3,
          "end": 411.6,
          "en": "So long story short.",
          "zh": "所以，長話短說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 411.6,
          "end": 414.233,
          "en": "You should always add such a key",
          "zh": "當你在 map 出項目清單時"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 414.233,
          "end": 417.33299999999997,
          "en": "when mapping out lists of items.",
          "zh": "你應該總是加上這樣的 key。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 417.33299999999997,
          "end": 417.666,
          "en": "when mapping out lists of items.",
          "zh": "你應該總是加上這樣的 key。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 417.666,
          "end": 421,
          "en": "And I hope I could explain why that matters.",
          "zh": "而我希望我解釋清楚了為什麼這很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 421,
          "end": 424.066,
          "en": "You don't need to know why it's enough if you add it.",
          "zh": "你不一定要知道原因，只要有加上它就夠了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 424.066,
          "end": 425.766,
          "en": "But I think it's always important",
          "zh": "但我認為，永遠重要的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 425.766,
          "end": 428.1,
          "en": "that you also do understand what's going on",
          "zh": "你也要了解背後實際運作的原理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 428.1,
          "end": 430.866,
          "en": "behind the scenes and why you're doing something.",
          "zh": "以及你為什麼要做某件事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25597086",
      "title": "Outputting Conditional Content",
      "sourceHash": "8a26aa6a915bf4a386b615b32c3f038083c998b30fbef4b1be219b0bca98b3d3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.966,
          "en": "- [Instructor] So our filter is now working,",
          "zh": "- [講師] 所以我們的篩選器現在已經可以運作了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.966,
          "end": 8.666,
          "en": "but we can actually select values where we have no data.",
          "zh": "但我們其實可以選到沒有資料的數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.666,
          "end": 9.133,
          "en": "but we can actually select values where we have no data.",
          "zh": "但我們其實可以選到沒有資料的數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.133,
          "end": 11.666,
          "en": "And we might wanna show an appropriate message",
          "zh": "而我們可能想顯示一則合適的訊息"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.666,
          "end": 13.2,
          "en": "in such cases,",
          "zh": "在這種情況下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.2,
          "end": 17.033,
          "en": "and that leads us to the second part of this module,",
          "zh": "這就帶我們來到這個單元的第二個部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.033,
          "end": 21.5,
          "en": "conditional content, which is also important.",
          "zh": "條件式內容，這也同樣重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.5,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "Conditional content is about rendering different output",
          "zh": "條件式內容講的是渲染不同的輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 26.766,
          "en": "under different conditions.",
          "zh": "在不同的條件下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.766,
          "end": 27.7,
          "en": "under different conditions.",
          "zh": "在不同的條件下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.7,
          "end": 29.3,
          "en": "So I'm not talking about lists,",
          "zh": "所以我不是在講清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.3,
          "end": 34.3,
          "en": "but about rendering either A or B or C, whatever you need.",
          "zh": "而是渲染 A、B 或 C，端看你的需求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.733,
          "end": 36.766,
          "en": "And that's something I wanna do here,",
          "zh": "而這正是我想在這裡做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.766,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "in Expenses.js, we render our list of expense items,",
          "zh": "在 Expenses.js 裡，我們渲染支出項目的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 45.2,
          "en": "but if our filtered expenses, array turns out to be empty,",
          "zh": "但如果我們篩選後的 expenses 陣列結果是空的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.2,
          "end": 46.733,
          "en": "we render nothing.",
          "zh": "我們就什麼都不渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48,
          "end": 50.233,
          "en": "Now, we might wanna instead",
          "zh": "現在，我們或許想改成"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.233,
          "end": 51.966,
          "en": "render a message telling the user that we have no items",
          "zh": "渲染一則訊息，告訴使用者我們沒有任何項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.966,
          "end": 54.3,
          "en": "render a message telling the user that we have no items",
          "zh": "渲染一則訊息，告訴使用者我們沒有任何項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.3,
          "end": 56.166,
          "en": "for the chosen filter.",
          "zh": "符合所選的篩選條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.166,
          "end": 56.633,
          "en": "for the chosen filter.",
          "zh": "符合所選的篩選條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.633,
          "end": 59.833,
          "en": "And for that, we wanna render content conditionally.",
          "zh": "為此，我們想要以條件方式渲染內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.833,
          "end": 60.066,
          "en": "And for that, we wanna render content conditionally.",
          "zh": "為此，我們想要以條件方式渲染內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.066,
          "end": 61.566,
          "en": "How can we do that?",
          "zh": "我們該怎麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.566,
          "end": 64.633,
          "en": "Well, we can again add a dynamic expression here",
          "zh": "嗯，我們可以再次在我們的 JSX 程式碼中"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.633,
          "end": 69.133,
          "en": "in our JSX code and simply use a condition here.",
          "zh": "加入一個動態運算式，直接在這裡使用一個條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.133,
          "end": 69.866,
          "en": "in our JSX code and simply use a condition here.",
          "zh": "加入一個動態運算式，直接在這裡使用一個條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.866,
          "end": 72.066,
          "en": "I'm not talking about an if condition",
          "zh": "我不是在說 if 條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.066,
          "end": 74.93299999999999,
          "en": "because long statements like this,",
          "zh": "因為像這樣的長陳述式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 74.93299999999999,
          "end": 76.866,
          "en": "the same is true for four loops",
          "zh": "for 迴圈也是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.866,
          "end": 80.7,
          "en": "are actually not allowed here between these curly braces,",
          "zh": "其實不能放在這些大括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 81,
          "en": "are actually not allowed here between these curly braces,",
          "zh": "其實不能放在這些大括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81,
          "end": 84.2,
          "en": "but we can use a ternary expression here.",
          "zh": "但我們可以在這裡使用三元運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.2,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "but we can use a ternary expression here.",
          "zh": "但我們可以在這裡使用三元運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 88.5,
          "en": "And we could check if our filtered expenses length",
          "zh": "我們可以檢查我們篩選後的 expenses 的 length"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.5,
          "end": 91.066,
          "en": "is equal to zero,",
          "zh": "是否等於零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 91.066,
          "end": 91.5,
          "en": "is equal to zero,",
          "zh": "是否等於零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 91.5,
          "end": 93.26599999999999,
          "en": "which means we have no items",
          "zh": "這代表我們沒有任何項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.26599999999999,
          "end": 95.366,
          "en": "in that filtered expenses array.",
          "zh": "在那個篩選後的 expenses 陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.366,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "And if that's the case, after a question mark,",
          "zh": "如果真是這樣，在問號之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 102.46600000000001,
          "en": "which is the default JavaScript ternary expression syntax",
          "zh": "也就是 JavaScript 預設的三元運算式語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.46600000000001,
          "end": 103.26599999999999,
          "en": "which is the default JavaScript ternary expression syntax",
          "zh": "也就是 JavaScript 預設的三元運算式語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.26599999999999,
          "end": 106.43299999999999,
          "en": "we render a simple message and a paragraph",
          "zh": "我們渲染一則簡單的訊息，一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.43299999999999,
          "end": 109.833,
          "en": "where we say, no expenses found.",
          "zh": "寫著：找不到任何支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112.63300000000001,
          "end": 117.366,
          "en": "Otherwise after the colon, we render our list.",
          "zh": "否則，在冒號之後，我們渲染我們的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.366,
          "end": 117.6,
          "en": "Otherwise after the colon, we render our list.",
          "zh": "否則，在冒號之後，我們渲染我們的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 121.1,
          "en": "So we grab this year, cut it",
          "zh": "所以我們把這段抓出來，剪下它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 121.1,
          "end": 124.133,
          "en": "and removed as empty pair of curly braces now,",
          "zh": "然後移除現在這對空的大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.133,
          "end": 124.466,
          "en": "and removed as empty pair of curly braces now,",
          "zh": "然後移除現在這對空的大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 124.466,
          "end": 128.733,
          "en": "and we render this mapping expression in the else case.",
          "zh": "並在 else 的情況渲染這個 mapping 運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.166,
          "end": 132,
          "en": "And again,",
          "zh": "而再次強調，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 132,
          "end": 136.233,
          "en": "that's the default JavaScript ternary expression syntax,",
          "zh": "那是 JavaScript 預設的三元運算式語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.233,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "that's the default JavaScript ternary expression syntax,",
          "zh": "那是 JavaScript 預設的三元運算式語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "condition, question mark then what we wanna do",
          "zh": "條件、問號，接著是我們想做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 142.166,
          "en": "if the condition is met, colon for the else case,",
          "zh": "如果條件成立；而冒號代表 else 的情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 142.166,
          "end": 144.36599999999999,
          "en": "if the condition is met, colon for the else case,",
          "zh": "如果條件成立；而冒號代表 else 的情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 144.36599999999999,
          "end": 146.066,
          "en": "what we wanna do, if it's not met.",
          "zh": "也就是條件不成立時我們想做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 147.4,
          "end": 150.6,
          "en": "And if you save this, you see,",
          "zh": "如果你儲存這個，你會看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 150.6,
          "end": 153.933,
          "en": "I got no expenses found here for 2022,",
          "zh": "我在 2022 年這裡得到「找不到任何支出」，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 153.933,
          "end": 156.4,
          "en": "but for 2020, I do have my expense.",
          "zh": "但在 2020 年，我確實有我的支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 156.833,
          "end": 157.633,
          "en": "but for 2020, I do have my expense.",
          "zh": "但在 2020 年，我確實有我的支出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 157.633,
          "end": 159.433,
          "en": "Of course, that's a bit hard to read,",
          "zh": "當然，這樣有點難讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 159.433,
          "end": 161.03300000000002,
          "en": "we can fine-tune this in a second,",
          "zh": "我們等一下可以微調，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 161.03300000000002,
          "end": 163.8,
          "en": "but that's how we can render content conditionally.",
          "zh": "但這就是我們如何以條件方式渲染內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 165.233,
          "end": 167.8,
          "en": "Of course, long ternary expressions like this",
          "zh": "當然，像這樣冗長的三元運算式"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 167.8,
          "end": 169.9,
          "en": "can be a bit hard to read though.",
          "zh": "可能會有點難讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.9,
          "end": 174.2,
          "en": "So we can also fine-tune this or restructure this",
          "zh": "所以我們也可以微調或重新整理它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 174.2,
          "end": 176.9,
          "en": "and reuse this condition,",
          "zh": "並重複使用這個條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.7,
          "end": 183,
          "en": "but then abuse a little trick in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "但接著利用 JavaScript 的一個小技巧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 183,
          "end": 183.433,
          "en": "but then abuse a little trick in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "但接著利用 JavaScript 的一個小技巧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 183.433,
          "end": 188.433,
          "en": "We can add the end operator and then use the content,",
          "zh": "我們可以加上 AND 運算子，然後使用內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 188.733,
          "end": 192.633,
          "en": "the JSX content we wanna render if this condition is met,",
          "zh": "也就是這個條件成立時我們想渲染的 JSX 內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 192.633,
          "end": 193.166,
          "en": "the JSX content we wanna render if this condition is met,",
          "zh": "也就是這個條件成立時我們想渲染的 JSX 內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.166,
          "end": 197.6,
          "en": "JavaScript works such that if you use the end operator,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 的運作方式是，如果你使用 AND 運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 197.6,
          "end": 197.8,
          "en": "JavaScript works such that if you use the end operator,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 的運作方式是，如果你使用 AND 運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.8,
          "end": 202.233,
          "en": "it basically will return the part after the end operator,",
          "zh": "它基本上會回傳 AND 運算子之後的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 202.233,
          "end": 205.86599999999999,
          "en": "as a result of this overall check here,",
          "zh": "作為這裡整個檢查的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 205.86599999999999,
          "end": 208.6,
          "en": "if the first condition is met.",
          "zh": "如果第一個條件成立的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.6,
          "end": 209.166,
          "en": "if the first condition is met.",
          "zh": "如果第一個條件成立的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 209.166,
          "end": 211.333,
          "en": "So if this first condition is met,",
          "zh": "所以如果這第一個條件成立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 211.333,
          "end": 214.3,
          "en": "it moves on to the part after the end operator",
          "zh": "它就會繼續到 AND 運算子之後的部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 214.3,
          "end": 216.9,
          "en": "and it then returns, that value.",
          "zh": "然後回傳那個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 216.9,
          "end": 219.133,
          "en": "And that's what we're abusing here.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這裡利用的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 219.133,
          "end": 219.5,
          "en": "And that's what we're abusing here.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這裡利用的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 219.5,
          "end": 221.86599999999999,
          "en": "And abusing sounds like a bad thing,",
          "zh": "雖然「利用」聽起來像是不好的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 221.86599999999999,
          "end": 224.466,
          "en": "this is actually something which is fine to use,",
          "zh": "這其實是完全可以使用的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 224.466,
          "end": 226.633,
          "en": "you'll see it in a lot of React projects.",
          "zh": "你會在許多 React 專案中看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 226.633,
          "end": 229.53300000000002,
          "en": "And it simply allows you to write shorter expressions,",
          "zh": "它就只是讓你寫出更簡短的運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 230.9,
          "end": 234.6,
          "en": "because now we can do the same here for our alternative.",
          "zh": "因為現在我們可以在這裡對另一種情況做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 234.6,
          "end": 238.3,
          "en": "There we wanna check if we got more than zero items,",
          "zh": "在那裡我們想檢查項目數量是否大於零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 238.3,
          "end": 243,
          "en": "and then we use && to output our list here.",
          "zh": "然後我們使用 && 來在這裡輸出我們的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 245.3,
          "end": 248.666,
          "en": "So now I basically split that long ternary expression",
          "zh": "所以現在我基本上把那個冗長的三元運算式"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 248.666,
          "end": 251.5,
          "en": "into two stand-alone expressions,",
          "zh": "拆成兩個獨立的運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 251.5,
          "end": 254.433,
          "en": "which check different conditions,",
          "zh": "它們檢查不同的條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 254.433,
          "end": 254.9,
          "en": "which check different conditions,",
          "zh": "它們檢查不同的條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 254.9,
          "end": 257.33299999999997,
          "en": "using this & trick here,",
          "zh": "在這裡使用這個 && 技巧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 257.33299999999997,
          "end": 260,
          "en": "where the part after & is rendered",
          "zh": "其中 && 後面的部分會被渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 260,
          "end": 263.066,
          "en": "if the part before & returns true.",
          "zh": "如果 && 前面的部分回傳 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 263.066,
          "end": 263.83299999999997,
          "en": "if the part before & returns true.",
          "zh": "如果 && 前面的部分回傳 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 263.83299999999997,
          "end": 266.166,
          "en": "And with that, we got the same behavior as before,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們得到和之前一樣的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 266.166,
          "end": 267.633,
          "en": "as you can tell.",
          "zh": "如你所見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 269.1,
          "end": 273,
          "en": "But even that might be too much logic in the JSX code.",
          "zh": "但即使是這樣，對 JSX 程式碼來說可能還是太多邏輯了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 273,
          "end": 276.733,
          "en": "So we also got a totally alternative way of handling this.",
          "zh": "所以我們還有一個完全不同的處理方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 276.733,
          "end": 277.33299999999997,
          "en": "So we also got a totally alternative way of handling this.",
          "zh": "所以我們還有一個完全不同的處理方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 277.33299999999997,
          "end": 279.033,
          "en": "We can add a variable,",
          "zh": "我們可以新增一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 279.033,
          "end": 284.033,
          "en": "maybe name it, expensesContent, but the name is up to you.",
          "zh": "也許命名為 expensesContent，但名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 285.033,
          "end": 287.366,
          "en": "And we assign a default value here.",
          "zh": "然後我們在這裡指定一個預設值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 287.366,
          "end": 289.4,
          "en": "And the default value could be our message",
          "zh": "而這個預設值可以是我們那則"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 289.4,
          "end": 292.466,
          "en": "that no content was found.",
          "zh": "找不到任何內容的訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 292.466,
          "end": 292.8,
          "en": "that no content was found.",
          "zh": "找不到任何內容的訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 292.8,
          "end": 296.9,
          "en": "And we can store JSX content like this in variables.",
          "zh": "而我們可以像這樣把 JSX 內容儲存在變數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 296.9,
          "end": 297.433,
          "en": "And we can store JSX content like this in variables.",
          "zh": "而我們可以像這樣把 JSX 內容儲存在變數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 297.433,
          "end": 300.733,
          "en": "We can return it and we can also use it anywhere else,",
          "zh": "我們可以回傳它，也可以在其他任何地方使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 300.733,
          "end": 303.833,
          "en": "where we work with values.",
          "zh": "只要是處理值的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 303.833,
          "end": 304.166,
          "en": "where we work with values.",
          "zh": "只要是處理值的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 304.166,
          "end": 307.966,
          "en": "So we can store JSX content in the variables,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把 JSX 內容儲存在變數裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 307.966,
          "end": 310.966,
          "en": "as I'm doing it here, this is absolutely fine.",
          "zh": "就像我在這裡做的這樣，這完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 310.966,
          "end": 311.233,
          "en": "as I'm doing it here, this is absolutely fine.",
          "zh": "就像我在這裡做的這樣，這完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 311.233,
          "end": 315.333,
          "en": "You are not limited to using JSX only if you return,",
          "zh": "你並不是只能在 return 時使用 JSX，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 315.333,
          "end": 318.33299999999997,
          "en": "you can also use it to create a value,",
          "zh": "你也可以用它來建立一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 318.33299999999997,
          "end": 320.6,
          "en": "which is stored in a variable.",
          "zh": "並將它儲存在變數中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 320.6,
          "end": 321.33299999999997,
          "en": "which is stored in a variable.",
          "zh": "並將它儲存在變數中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 321.33299999999997,
          "end": 323.466,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing that though?",
          "zh": "不過，我為什麼要這麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 323.466,
          "end": 325.4,
          "en": "Because now we can edit if check here,",
          "zh": "因為現在我們可以在這裡加入 if 檢查，"
