          "end": 339.366,
          "en": "I wanna overwrite expensesContent.",
          "zh": "我想覆寫 expensesContent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 339.366,
          "end": 342.2,
          "en": "So I will change the value of this variable",
          "zh": "所以我會改變這個變數的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 342.2,
          "end": 342.5,
          "en": "So I will change the value of this variable",
          "zh": "所以我會改變這個變數的值"
        },
        {
