          "zh": "這個 map 呼叫的結果，就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 350.433,
          "end": 352.633,
          "en": "So this list of expense items,",
          "zh": "所以這份支出項目清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 352.633,
          "end": 355.466,
          "en": "that's my value stored in expensesContent",
          "zh": "就是儲存在 expensesContent 裡的值，"
        },
        {
