          "start": 355.466,
          "end": 357.83299999999997,
          "en": "if we got a length greater than zero.",
          "zh": "如果長度大於零的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 359.666,
          "end": 363.666,
          "en": "And then down there in our returned, JSX code,",
          "zh": "然後在下面我們回傳的 JSX 程式碼中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 363.666,
          "end": 365.9,
          "en": "we can get rid of all that logic.",
          "zh": "我們可以把那些邏輯全部拿掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 365.9,
          "end": 368.833,
          "en": "And we just add a simple dynamic expression",
          "zh": "我們只要加入一個簡單的動態運算式，"
        },
        {
