          "start": 368.833,
          "end": 371.733,
          "en": "where we point at expensesContent.",
          "zh": "指向 expensesContent。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 371.733,
          "end": 373.533,
          "en": "So add this variable.",
          "zh": "也就是加入這個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 375.233,
          "end": 378.366,
          "en": "And this variable holds either this JSX code",
          "zh": "而這個變數存放的可能是這段 JSX 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 378.366,
          "end": 381.3,
          "en": "or this array of JSX elements.",
          "zh": "或是這個 JSX 元素的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 381.3,
          "end": 381.83299999999997,
          "en": "or this array of JSX elements.",
          "zh": "或是這個 JSX 元素的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 381.83299999999997,
          "end": 385.966,
          "en": "Both is a renderable and therefore both can be used here.",
          "zh": "兩者都是可渲染的，因此兩者都可以在這裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 385.966,
          "end": 386.533,
          "en": "Both is a renderable and therefore both can be used here.",
          "zh": "兩者都是可渲染的，因此兩者都可以在這裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 386.533,
          "end": 390.033,
          "en": "And now we get a lean JSX snippet which we return,",
          "zh": "現在我們得到一段精簡的 JSX 片段並將它回傳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 390.033,
          "end": 393.5,
          "en": "and we've got our logic in the component function itself.",
          "zh": "而我們的邏輯則放在元件函式本身。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 393.5,
          "end": 396.7,
          "en": "And we could argue that this is more readable.",
          "zh": "我們可以說這樣更具可讀性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 396.7,
          "end": 401.1,
          "en": "And again, if you save that, it works just as before.",
          "zh": "再次強調，如果你儲存它，效果和之前一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 401.1,
          "end": 401.533,
          "en": "And again, if you save that, it works just as before.",
          "zh": "再次強調，如果你儲存它，效果和之前一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 401.533,
          "end": 404.233,
          "en": "And it's up to you, which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": "而這取決於你偏好哪種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 404.233,
          "end": 407.166,
          "en": "It also depends on the length of the conditions",
          "zh": "這也取決於條件的長度"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 407.166,
          "end": 410.7,
          "en": "and the content which is rendered under different cases.",
          "zh": "以及在不同情況下所渲染的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 410.7,
          "end": 413.4,
          "en": "But ultimately this is probably the cleanest way,",
          "zh": "但最終來說，這可能是最簡潔的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 413.4,
          "end": 416.6,
          "en": "but again, it is up to you what you prefer.",
          "zh": "但再次強調，你偏好什麼由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 416.6,
          "end": 418.433,
          "en": "I want to show you all options",
          "zh": "我想讓你看所有的選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 418.433,
          "end": 419.933,
          "en": "so that you can go with the way",
          "zh": "這樣你就可以選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 419.933,
          "end": 422.033,
          "en": "which you personally lik the most.",
          "zh": "你自己最喜歡的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 422.033,
          "end": 423.833,
          "en": "I will go with this approach",
          "zh": "我會採用這個做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 423.833,
          "end": 427.4,
          "en": "because I'm a fan of having a lean JSX snippet here.",
          "zh": "因為我很喜歡在這裡有精簡的 JSX 片段。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25634226",
      "title": "Adding Conditional Return Statements",
      "sourceHash": "6801103642e35849022dde90e82de60a819c657342f224edb8f2dd0f28f36821",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 3.033,
          "en": "- [Maximilian SchwarzmÃ¼ller] Now with",
          "zh": "- [Maximilian Schwarzmüller] 現在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.033,
          "end": 5.066,
          "en": "the conditional content covered here,",
          "zh": "既然這裡已經涵蓋了條件式內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.066,
          "end": 6.5,
          "en": "before we continue,",
          "zh": "在我們繼續之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.5,
          "end": 10.333,
          "en": "I wanna restructure the expenses component a little bit.",
          "zh": "我想稍微重新整理一下 Expenses 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.333,
          "end": 13.7,
          "en": "And I actually wanna extract that list logic",
          "zh": "而且我其實想把那個清單邏輯抽取出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.7,
          "end": 15.5,
          "en": "into a new component",
          "zh": "放到一個新的元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.5,
          "end": 16,
          "en": "into a new component",
          "zh": "放到一個新的元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16,
          "end": 20,
          "en": "to again, make that expenses component a little bit leaner.",
          "zh": "再次讓這個 Expenses 元件稍微精簡一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.033,
          "end": 26.333,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll add a ExpensesList.js file,",
          "zh": "因此，我會新增一個 ExpensesList.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.333,
          "end": 26.433,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll add a expenses list JS file,",
          "zh": "因此，我會新增一個 ExpensesList 的 JS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.433,
          "end": 30.8,
          "en": "and also ExpensesList.css file",
          "zh": "以及一個 ExpensesList.css 檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.8,
          "end": 33.2,
          "en": "which you also find attached.",
          "zh": "你同樣可以在附件中找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.2,
          "end": 33.633,
          "en": "which you also find attached.",
          "zh": "你同樣可以在附件中找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.633,
          "end": 36.033,
          "en": "And you can already download my CSS file",
          "zh": "你可以先下載我的 CSS 檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.033,
          "end": 40.4,
          "en": "and copy the styles into your expenses list CSS file.",
          "zh": "並把樣式複製到你的 ExpensesList CSS 檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.5,
          "end": 45.7,
          "en": "In the expenses list JS file,",
          "zh": "在 ExpensesList 的 JS 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.7,
          "end": 49.7,
          "en": "I will then add a constant expenses list",
          "zh": "我接著會加入一個常數 ExpensesList"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.7,
          "end": 49.866,
          "en": "I will then add a constant expenses list",
          "zh": "我接著會加入一個常數 ExpensesList"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.866,
          "end": 52.7,
          "en": "which receives props and return something.",
          "zh": "它會接收 props 並回傳一些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.7,
          "end": 53.033,
          "en": "which receives props and return something.",
          "zh": "它會接收 props 並回傳一些內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.033,
          "end": 57.366,
          "en": "And of course, we export this expenses list",
          "zh": "當然，我們會匯出這個 ExpensesList"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.366,
          "end": 57.8,
          "en": "And of course, we export this expenses list",
          "zh": "當然，我們會匯出這個 ExpensesList"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.8,
          "end": 61.4,
          "en": "and we can if we want to also import React from react.",
          "zh": "而且如果需要，我們也可以從 react 匯入 React。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.4,
          "end": 63.333,
          "en": "But again, that is optional.",
          "zh": "不過再次強調，這是選擇性的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.5,
          "end": 67.366,
          "en": "Now you're in expenses list,",
          "zh": "現在，在 ExpensesList 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.366,
          "end": 70.6,
          "en": "I wanna output my expenses list.",
          "zh": "我想把費用清單輸出出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.6,
          "end": 72.266,
          "en": "I will not filter in there.",
          "zh": "我不會在那裡進行篩選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.266,
          "end": 75.133,
          "en": "I will keep the filtering logic in expenses",
          "zh": "我會把篩選邏輯保留在 Expenses 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.133,
          "end": 75.2,
          "en": "I will keep the filtering logic in expenses",
          "zh": "我會把篩選邏輯保留在 Expenses 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.2,
          "end": 78.7,
          "en": "since that's also where I managed the filtered year",
          "zh": "因為那裡也是我管理篩選年份的地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.7,
          "end": 79.066,
          "en": "since that's also where I managed the filtered year",
          "zh": "因為那裡也是我管理篩選年份的地方"
