        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.066,
          "end": 83.133,
          "en": "but I will take this fallback content, this if check,",
          "zh": "但我會把這個備用內容、這個 if 檢查，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 83.133,
          "end": 84.8,
          "en": "I will take all of that",
          "zh": "我會把這一切"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.8,
          "end": 87.733,
          "en": "and move that into my expenses list component.",
          "zh": "都搬進我的 ExpensesList 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.133,
          "end": 91.43299999999999,
          "en": "That means that we also, of course,",
          "zh": "這當然也代表，我們"
