        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 98.3,
          "en": "from ./ExpenseItem here",
          "zh": "也就是從 ./ExpenseItem 這裡匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.3,
          "end": 100.1,
          "en": "since I'm using that component here.",
          "zh": "因為我在這裡使用了那個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 101.9,
          "end": 105.033,
          "en": "And the filtered expenses no longer exist here.",
          "zh": "而 filteredExpenses 在這裡已經不存在了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.033,
          "end": 109.2,
          "en": "I just wanna get, let's say, my items here or expenses.",
          "zh": "我只想取得，比如說，我的 items 或 expenses。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 111.3,
          "en": "It's up to you. I'll name it items",
          "zh": "這取決於你。我會把它命名為 items"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.3,
          "end": 113.066,
          "en": "as props",
          "zh": "作為 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.066,
          "end": 113.9,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.666,
          "end": 117.233,
          "en": "Now in expenses JS,",
          "zh": "現在，在 Expenses.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.233,
          "end": 120.333,
          "en": "that, of course, means that here",
          "zh": "這當然代表，在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.333,
          "end": 124.6,
          "en": "I now wanna output my expenses list",
          "zh": "我現在想輸出 ExpensesList"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.6,
          "end": 125.533,
          "en": "down there.",
          "zh": "就在下面那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.93299999999999,
          "end": 130.133,
          "en": "And of course, we therefore also wanna import expenses list",
          "zh": "當然，我們因此也要匯入 ExpensesList"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.133,
          "end": 132.36599999999999,
          "en": "from the expenses list file",
          "zh": "從 ExpensesList 檔案匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.36599999999999,
          "end": 135,
          "en": "and we can get rid of the expense item import.",
          "zh": "而我們可以移除 ExpenseItem 的匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.833,
          "end": 139.233,
          "en": "And the filtered expenses should now",
          "zh": "而 filteredExpenses 現在應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.233,
          "end": 143.066,
          "en": "be passed to expenses list through the items prop,",
          "zh": "透過 items prop 傳遞給 ExpensesList，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.066,
          "end": 145.3,
          "en": "which I'm using inside of expenses list.",
          "zh": "也就是我在 ExpensesList 內部使用的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.3,
          "end": 146.133,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.433,
          "end": 152.36599999999999,
          "en": "Now inside of the expenses list JS file,",
          "zh": "現在，在 ExpensesList 的 JS 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.36599999999999,
          "end": 154.9,
          "en": "I also want to make a couple of changes now.",
          "zh": "我現在也想做幾個調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.9,
          "end": 155.233,
          "en": "I also want to make a couple of changes now.",
          "zh": "我現在也想做幾個調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 155.233,
          "end": 157.53300000000002,
          "en": "Of course, we need to return some JSX",
          "zh": "當然，我們需要回傳一些 JSX"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.53300000000002,
          "end": 160.9,
          "en": "but I want to return an unordered list here",
          "zh": "但我想在這裡回傳一個無序清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 160.9,
          "end": 161.066,
          "en": "but I want to return an unordered list here",
          "zh": "但我想在這裡回傳一個無序清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.066,
          "end": 163.36599999999999,
          "en": "and actually give that list a class name",
          "zh": "而且實際上要給這個清單一個 class name"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 163.36599999999999,
          "end": 165.633,
          "en": "of expenses-list.",
          "zh": "也就是 expenses-list。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 167.066,
          "end": 170.53300000000002,
          "en": "This is a class to find here in my CSS file",
          "zh": "這個 class 可以在我的 CSS 檔案中找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 170.53300000000002,
          "end": 172.7,
          "en": "and therefore, we also wanna import",
          "zh": "因此，我們也要匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 172.7,
          "end": 177.7,
          "en": "this expenses list CSS file into the expenses list JS file.",
          "zh": "把這個 ExpensesList 的 CSS 檔案匯入 ExpensesList 的 JS 檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 179.86599999999999,
          "end": 181.666,
          "en": "And instead of this unordered list,",
          "zh": "而現在，不用這個無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 181.666,
          "end": 183.766,
          "en": "I now wanna output",
          "zh": "我想要輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 184.6,
          "end": 185.433,
          "en": "my map here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡的 map，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 185.433,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "my expense item array.",
          "zh": "我的 expense item 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.4,
          "end": 192.5,
          "en": "So we'll again, grab that",
          "zh": "所以我們會再次取用那段"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 192.5,
          "end": 197.066,
          "en": "and render this dynamically here like this.",
          "zh": "並像這樣在這裡動態渲染出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.066,
          "end": 197.4,
          "en": "and render this dynamically here like this.",
          "zh": "並像這樣在這裡動態渲染出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 197.4,
          "end": 201.566,
          "en": "And I will handle this if case a little bit differently now.",
          "zh": "而我現在會稍微用不同的方式處理這個 if 情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 201.566,
          "end": 203.766,
          "en": "I will add a if check",
          "zh": "我會加入一個 if 檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 203.766,
          "end": 209,
          "en": "but I'll check if props items length is equal to zero.",
          "zh": "但我會檢查 props.items 的長度是否等於零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 209,
          "end": 209.066,
          "en": "but I'll check if props items length is equal to zero.",
          "zh": "但我會檢查 props.items 的長度是否等於零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 209.066,
          "end": 212.36599999999999,
          "en": "So if we have no items and if that's the case,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們沒有 items，而如果是這種情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.36599999999999,
          "end": 216.9,
          "en": "I will simply return a totally different JSX snippet",
          "zh": "我就會直接回傳一段完全不同的 JSX"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.9,
          "end": 217.36599999999999,
          "en": "I will simply return a totally different JSX snippet",
          "zh": "我就會直接回傳一段完全不同的 JSX"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.36599999999999,
          "end": 219.133,
          "en": "because that's yet another way",
          "zh": "因為那是另一種"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 219.133,
          "end": 221.566,
          "en": "of handling conditional content.",
          "zh": "處理條件式內容的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 221.566,
          "end": 222.333,
          "en": "of handling conditional content.",
          "zh": "處理條件式內容的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 222.333,
          "end": 225.733,
          "en": "If what your component returns changes entirely",
          "zh": "如果你的元件所回傳的內容完全改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.733,
          "end": 229.9,
          "en": "based on different conditions, you can use this approach.",
          "zh": "會根據不同條件而變化，你就可以使用這種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 229.9,
          "end": 232.3,
          "en": "It would have not been appropriate here",
          "zh": "這在之前並不適合"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 232.3,
          "end": 234.233,
          "en": "in expenses JS before,",
          "zh": "用在 Expenses.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 234.233,
          "end": 237.733,
          "en": "because only a part of the JSX snippet,",
          "zh": "因為我們回傳的 JSX 片段中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 237.733,
          "end": 239.8,
          "en": "which we returned changed.",
          "zh": "只有一部分發生了改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 239.8,
          "end": 240.1,
          "en": "which we returned changed.",
          "zh": "只有一部分發生了改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 240.1,
          "end": 241.6,
          "en": "So there, the approach I showed",
          "zh": "所以在那裡，我上一堂課"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 241.6,
          "end": 243.966,
          "en": "in the last lecture was better,",
          "zh": "示範的做法比較好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 243.966,
          "end": 246.766,
          "en": "but if your entire JSX content changes,",
          "zh": "但如果你的整個 JSX 內容都會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 246.766,
          "end": 248.166,
          "en": "when data is missing,",
          "zh": "當資料缺少時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 248.166,
          "end": 250.933,
          "en": "you can always add a if check where you return",
          "zh": "你隨時可以加入一個 if 檢查，在裡面回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 250.933,
          "end": 254.833,
          "en": "a different JSX block if some condition is met.",
          "zh": "不同的 JSX 區塊，如果某個條件成立的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 254.833,
          "end": 255.4,
          "en": "a different JSX block if some condition is met.",
          "zh": "不同的 JSX 區塊，如果某個條件成立的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 255.4,
          "end": 258.9,
          "en": "And here, I simply want to return an h2 tag",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我只想回傳一個 h2 標籤"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 258.9,
          "end": 263.866,
          "en": "with a class name of expenses-list__ fallback",
          "zh": "它的 class name 是 expenses-list__fallback"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 263.866,
          "end": 267.166,
          "en": "with a text of found no expenses.",
          "zh": "文字則是 Found no expenses。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 268.733,
          "end": 272.633,
          "en": "So that's what this component, expenses list, will render",
          "zh": "所以這就是這個 ExpensesList 元件會渲染的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 272.633,
          "end": 275.033,
          "en": "if we got no expenses.",
          "zh": "如果我們沒有任何費用的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 275.033,
          "end": 277.83299999999997,
          "en": "Hence, we can also get rid of that variable here.",
          "zh": "因此，我們也可以移除這裡的那個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 280.466,
          "end": 281.766,
          "en": "And then with that,",
          "zh": "然後，有了這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 283.3,
          "end": 285.733,
          "en": "we see there's found no expenses text",
          "zh": "我們會看到「Found no expenses」這段文字"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 285.733,
          "end": 289.06600000000003,
          "en": "or the filtered list if we switch.",
          "zh": "或者切換之後看到篩選後的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 289.06600000000003,
          "end": 291.733,
          "en": "But now, with help of this extra component,",
          "zh": "但現在，藉著這個額外元件的幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 291.733,
          "end": 294.8,
          "en": "which uses a different logic for rendering",
          "zh": "它使用了不同的渲染邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 294.8,
          "end": 298.2,
          "en": "or for returning different JSX code,",
          "zh": "或者說是回傳不同 JSX 程式碼的邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 298.2,
          "end": 300.466,
          "en": "and we now also got a little bit",
          "zh": "而我們現在也再次有了稍微"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 300.466,
          "end": 303.6,
          "en": "of a leaner Expenses.js file again.",
          "zh": "更精簡一點的 Expenses.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 303.6,
          "end": 305.833,
          "en": "Now one additional tweak, which I want to make here",
          "zh": "那麼，我還想在這裡做一個額外的小調整"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 305.833,
          "end": 308.333,
          "en": "which I almost forgot is that",
          "zh": "這點我差點忘了，那就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 308.333,
          "end": 310.566,
          "en": "since I'm using unordered list here now",
          "zh": "既然我現在在這裡使用了無序清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 310.566,
          "end": 313.8,
          "en": "for semantic reasons in the expense item component,",
          "zh": "基於語意上的理由，在 ExpenseItem 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 313.8,
          "end": 316.633,
          "en": "I actually wanna switch away",
          "zh": "我其實想要改掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 316.633,
          "end": 321.166,
          "en": "from having a div being rendered to a list item instead.",
          "zh": "原本渲染 div 的做法，改成渲染 list item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 321.166,
          "end": 324.4,
          "en": "So I will just wrap this entire card here",
          "zh": "所以我會直接在這裡把整張卡片"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 324.4,
          "end": 325.966,
          "en": "with a list item",
          "zh": "用 list item 包起來"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 328.466,
          "end": 330.966,
          "en": "and visually this doesn't change anything",
          "zh": "而在視覺上這不會改變任何東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 330.966,
          "end": 333.56600000000003,
          "en": "but semantically this is a little bit better.",
          "zh": "但在語意上這樣稍微好一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 333.56600000000003,
          "end": 333.9,
          "en": "but semantically this is a little bit better.",
          "zh": "但在語意上這樣稍微好一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 333.9,
          "end": 335.733,
          "en": "So that's just another tiny tweak",
